msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/inherited/mm8/Spells.txt|table=SpellsTxt|id=14|field=Description"
msgid ""
"Increases all your characters’ resistance to air damage by an amount equal "
"to your skill in Air. The protection lasts one hour per point of skill."
msgstr "모든 캐릭터의 공기 피해 저항력을 공기 마법 기술 점수만큼 증가시킵니다. 보호 효과는 기술 점수당 1시간 동안 지속됩니다."

#. EN: source/en/mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_SpellsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/inherited/mm8/Spells.txt|table=SpellsTxt|id=14|field=Expert"
msgid "2 points resistance per point of skill"
msgstr "기술 포인트당 저항력 2 증가"

#. EN: source/en/mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_SpellsTxt.txt
