#. EN: source/en/mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_SpellsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/inherited/mm8/Spells.txt|table=SpellsTxt|id=23|field=Description"
msgid ""
"Automatically awakens all of your characters from a normal sleep and will "
"awaken them from a magical sleep if they haven't had the sleep condition for"
" too long.  The greater your skill in Water Magic, the longer the sleep "
"condition could have been present before this spell becomes ineffective."
msgstr ""
"모든 캐릭터를 일반적인 잠에서 즉시 깨우며, 마법으로 인한 수면 상태인 경우에도 수면 상태가 너무 오래 지속되지 않았다면 깨울 수 "
"있습니다. 워터 매직 기술이 높을수록 더 오랫동안 지속된 수면 상태도 해제할 수 있습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_SpellsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/inherited/mm8/Spells.txt|table=SpellsTxt|id=23|field=Expert"
msgid "Works if asleep less than 1 hour per point of skill"
msgstr "기술 포인트당 1시간 미만의 수면 상태에 효과적"

#. EN: source/en/mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_SpellsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/inherited/mm8/Spells.txt|table=SpellsTxt|id=23|field=GrandMaster"
msgid "Fast recovery rate"
msgstr "빠른 회복 속도"

#. EN: source/en/mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_SpellsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/inherited/mm8/Spells.txt|table=SpellsTxt|id=23|field=Master"
msgid "Works if asleep less than 1 day per point of skill"
msgstr "스킬 포인트당 1일 미만으로 잠든 상태일 때 효과가 있습니다"

#. EN: source/en/mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_SpellsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/inherited/mm8/Spells.txt|table=SpellsTxt|id=23|field=Name"
msgid "Awaken"
msgstr "각성"

#. EN: source/en/mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_SpellsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/inherited/mm8/Spells.txt|table=SpellsTxt|id=23|field=Normal"
msgid "Works if asleep less than 3 minutes per point of skill"
msgstr "기술 포인트당 3분 미만의 수면 상태에 효과적"

#. EN: source/en/mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt
