msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/inherited/mm8/Spells.txt|table=SpellsTxt|id=23|field=ShortName"
msgid "Awaken"
msgstr "각성"

#. EN: source/en/mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_SpellsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/inherited/mm8/Spells.txt|table=SpellsTxt|id=24|field=Description"
msgid ""
"Sprays poison at monsters directly in front of your characters.  Damage is "
"low, but few monsters have resistance to Water Magic, so it usually works.  "
"Each shot does 2 points of damage plus 1-2 per point of skill."
msgstr ""
"캐릭터 바로 앞의 몬스터에게 독을 분사합니다. 피해량은 낮지만 물 마법에 저항력을 가진 몬스터가 거의 없어 대부분 효과가 있습니다. "
"발사당 2의 피해를 입히며, 스킬 포인트당 1-2의 추가 피해를 줍니다."

#. EN: source/en/mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_SpellsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/inherited/mm8/Spells.txt|table=SpellsTxt|id=24|field=Expert"
msgid "Faster recovery rate, 3 shots"
msgstr "빠른 회복 속도, 3발 발사"

#. EN: source/en/mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_SpellsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/inherited/mm8/Spells.txt|table=SpellsTxt|id=24|field=GrandMaster"
msgid "Fastest recovery rate, 7 shots"
msgstr "가장 빠른 회복 속도, 7발 발사"

#. EN: source/en/mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_SpellsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/inherited/mm8/Spells.txt|table=SpellsTxt|id=24|field=Master"
msgid "Faster recovery rate, 5 shots"
msgstr "더 빠른 회복 속도, 5발 발사"

#. EN: source/en/mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_SpellsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/inherited/mm8/Spells.txt|table=SpellsTxt|id=24|field=Name"
msgid "Poison Spray"
msgstr "독 분사"

#. EN: source/en/mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_SpellsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/inherited/mm8/Spells.txt|table=SpellsTxt|id=24|field=Normal"
msgid "Slow rate of recovery, 1 shot"
msgstr "느린 회복 속도, 1발 발사"

#. EN: source/en/mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_SpellsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/inherited/mm8/Spells.txt|table=SpellsTxt|id=24|field=ShortName"
msgid "Poison Spr"
msgstr "독 분사"

#. EN: source/en/mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_SpellsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/inherited/mm8/Spells.txt|table=SpellsTxt|id=25|field=Description"
msgid ""
"Increases all your characters’ resistance to water damage by an amount equal"
" to your skill in Water Magic. The protection lasts one hour per point of "
"skill."
msgstr ""
"모든 캐릭터의 물 속성 피해 저항력을 물 마법 스킬 수치만큼 증가시킵니다. 보호 효과는 스킬 포인트당 1시간 동안 지속됩니다."

