msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/inherited/mm8/Spells.txt|table=SpellsTxt|id=46|field=Description"
msgid ""
"Blessed characters have an increased chance to hit monsters in hand to hand "
"combat and with missiles.  A character’s bonus to hit is increased by 5 + 1 "
"per point of skill in Spirit Magic."
msgstr ""
"축복받은 캐릭터는 근접 전투 및 원거리 공격 시 몬스터를 명중시킬 확률이 증가합니다. 캐릭터의 명중 보너스는 5 + 정신 마법 기술 "
"포인트당 1만큼 증가합니다."

#. EN: source/en/mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt
