msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/inherited/mm8/Spells.txt|table=SpellsTxt|id=95|field=Description"
msgid ""
"When a monster hits a character with Pain Reflection active, the monster "
"takes damage equal to what it inflicted on the character."
msgstr "고통 반사가 활성화된 캐릭터가 몬스터에게 공격받으면, 몬스터는 캐릭터에게 입힌 피해량만큼의 피해를 되돌려 받습니다."

