msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=11|field=Name"
msgid "Iron Broadsword"
msgstr "철제 브로드소드"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=11|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"Some swordsmen swear that the soft metal of an iron sword gives them certain"
" combat advantages. Those swordsmen never seem to be very old."
msgstr ""
"일부 검객들은 철검의 부드러운 금속 재질이 전투에서 특정한 이점을 준다고 굳게 믿는다. 그런데 그런 검객들은 대체로 나이가 많지 않아 "
"보인다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
