"  This case appears to be full."
msgstr "퀘스트 아이템: 리치 항아리 세트를 담기 위해 정성스럽게 제작된 장미목 케이스. 케이스는 가득 차 있는 것으로 보입니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1404|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Case of Jars"
msgstr "항아리 상자"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1405|field=Name"
msgid "Parson's Quill"
msgstr "파슨의 깃펜"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1405|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"Quest Item:  King Parson's hand employed this quill to sign the treaty "
"ending the first Timber War."
msgstr "퀘스트 아이템: 파슨 왕은 이 깃펜으로 제1차 목재 전쟁을 종식시키는 조약에 서명했습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1405|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Quill"
msgstr "깃펜"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1406|field=Name"
msgid "Wetsuit"
msgstr "잠수복"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1406|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"Quest Item:  This environmental suit handles not only respiration, but "
"protection from the extreme pressure of deep sea diving.  It does not look "
"like any other items may be worn while wearing the suit.  You must remove "
"ALL equipment to wear the suit."
msgstr ""
"퀘스트 아이템: 이 환경 보호복은 호흡뿐만 아니라 심해 잠수의 극한 압력으로부터 몸을 보호해줍니다. 보호복 착용 시에는 다른 장비를 "
"착용할 수 없어 보입니다. 보호복을 착용하려면 모든 장비를 벗어야 합니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1406|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Strange Suit"
msgstr "기묘한 의복"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1407|field=Name"
msgid "Oscillation Overthruster"
msgstr "오실레이션 오버스러스터"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1407|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"Quest Item:  This device has no visible symbols or parts.  Why it is so "
"valuable is beyond your comprehension."
msgstr "퀘스트 아이템: 이 장치에는 눈에 보이는 기호나 부품이 없습니다. 왜 이것이 그토록 귀중한지는 당신이 이해할 수 없습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1407|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Ancient Part"
msgstr "고대 부품"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1408|field=Name"
msgid "Signet Ring"
msgstr "인장 반지"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1408|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"Quest Item:  A highly stylized 'D' and 'P' intertwined by a snake with a "
"crown above its head are engraved into the face of this ring.  This must "
"certainly be Davrick's."
msgstr ""
"퀘스트 아이템: 왕관을 쓴 뱀이 얽혀 있는 매우 양식화된 'D'와 'P'가 이 반지 표면에 새겨져 있습니다. 이것은 분명 데이브릭의 것일"
" 겁니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
