msgid "Letter from Johann Kerrid to the Faerie King"
msgstr "요한 케리드가 요정 왕에게 보낸 편지"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1409|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"Quest Item:  A letter from Johann Kerrid to the Faerie King.  Opening a "
"sealed letter is in the poorest of taste, and would be frowned upon by both "
"parties."
msgstr ""
"퀘스트 아이템: 요한 케리드가 요정 왕에게 보낸 편지. 봉인된 편지를 여는 것은 예의에 어긋나는 행동이며, 양측 모두에게 좋지 않은 "
"인상을 줄 것이다."

