msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1418|field=Name"
msgid "Genie Lamp"
msgstr "지니의 램프"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1418|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"The genies captured in these lamps will usually reward those who set them "
"free, though sometimes they take cruel delight in punishing the first living"
" beings they encounter.  To use the genie lamp, pick the lamp up and left-"
"click over the picture of your character in the inventory screen."
msgstr ""
"이 램프에 갇힌 지니들은 보통 자신들을 풀어준 사람에게 보상을 주지만, 때로는 처음 마주친 생명체를 잔인하게 벌주는 것을 즐기기도 "
"합니다. 지니 램프를 사용하려면 램프를 집어 들고 인벤토리 화면에서 캐릭터 그림을 왼쪽 클릭하십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
