msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1424|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"Quest Item:  A painting of Archibald Ironfist just prior to his War of "
"Succession in Enroth."
msgstr "퀘스트 아이템: 엔로스에서 왕위 계승 전쟁 직전의 아치볼드 아이언피스트의 초상화."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1424|field=NotIdentifiedName"
