#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1428|field=Name"
msgid "Zokarr IV's Skull"
msgstr "조카르 4세의 두개골"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1428|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"Quest Item:  The skull of the old Dwarf King, Zokarr IV.  It doesn't look "
"particularly impressive."
msgstr "퀘스트 아이템: 옛 드워프 왕 조카르 4세의 해골. 그다지 위풍당당해 보이지는 않는다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1428|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Skull"
msgstr "두개골"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1429|field=Name"
msgid "Thigh Bone"
msgstr "대퇴골"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1429|field=Notes"
msgid "A human(?) thigh bone."
msgstr "사람의 허벅지 뼈(?)."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1429|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Bone"
msgstr "뼈"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=142|field=Name"
msgid "Necromatic Ring"
msgstr "강령술 반지"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=142|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"Though made of semi-precious silver, this ring is highly valuable because it"
" is well suited to holding enchantments of medium power."
msgstr ""
"이 반지는 준보석인 은으로 만들어졌지만, 중간 정도의 위력을 가진 마법을 담기에 적합하기 때문에 매우 귀중한 가치를 지닙니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=142|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Ring"
msgstr "반지"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1430|field=Name"
msgid "Haldar's Remains"
msgstr "할다르의 유해"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1430|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"Quest Item:  This strangely shaped jar resists all attempts to open or "
"break.  Haldar apparently doesn't like to be disturbed. "
msgstr ""
"퀘스트 아이템: 이 기묘한 모양의 항아리는 열거나 깨뜨리려는 모든 시도에 저항합니다. 할다르는 방해받는 것을 싫어하는 것 같습니다. "

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1430|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Jar"
msgstr "항아리"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1431|field=Name"
msgid "Elixir"
msgstr "영약"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1431|field=Notes"
msgid "Quest Item:  A glowing elixir of obviously magical properties."
msgstr "퀘스트 아이템: 명백히 마법적인 효능을 지닌 빛나는 영약."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1431|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Bottle"
msgstr "병"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1432|field=Name"
msgid "Red Apple"
msgstr "빨간 사과"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1432|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"Apples like these are produced by trees saturated by magic-- usually in the "
"elven lands of Avlee and the Tularean Forest, though not restricted to these"
" areas.  To use the apple, pick the apple up and left-click over the picture"
" of your character in the inventory screen."
msgstr ""
"이런 사과는 마법으로 가득 찬 나무에서 열립니다. 주로 엘프의 땅인 아블리와 툴라레안 숲에서 자라지만, 꼭 이 지역에만 국한된 것은 "
"아닙니다. 사과를 사용하려면 사과를 주운 다음 인벤토리 화면에서 캐릭터 사진을 왼쪽 클릭하십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1432|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Apple"
msgstr "사과"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1433|field=Name"
msgid "Wealthy Hat"
msgstr "부자의 모자"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1433|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"Quest Item: This hat appears to belong to a more affluent member of society,"
" the feather is genuine and the construction is solid.  Unfortunately, it "
"doesn't seem to fit."
msgstr ""
"퀘스트 아이템: 이 모자는 부유한 집안 사람의 것으로 보이며, 깃털은 진짜이고 만듦새도 튼튼해 보입니다. 하지만 아쉽게도 제게는 맞지 "
"않는 것 같습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1433|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Hat"
msgstr "모자"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1434|field=Name"
msgid "Lute"
msgstr "류트"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1434|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"Quest Item: This lute has been masterfully crafted and lovingly maintained."
"  This instrument clearly belongs to a Bard."
msgstr "퀘스트 아이템: 이 류트는 장인의 솜씨로 제작되었고 정성스럽게 관리되어 왔습니다. 이 악기는 분명 음유시인의 것입니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1434|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Instrument"
msgstr "악기"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1435|field=Name"
msgid "Faerie Pipes"
msgstr "요정의 피리"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1435|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"Quest Item:  Though finely crafted and deceptively simple-looking, these "
"Pipes are quite difficult to play; they seem to have a mind of their own."
msgstr ""
"퀘스트 아이템: 정교하게 만들어졌고 겉보기엔 단순해 보이지만, 이 파이프는 연주하기가 상당히 어렵습니다. 마치 스스로 생각하는 듯한 "
"느낌을 줍니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1435|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Instrument"
msgstr "악기"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1436|field=Name"
msgid "Gryphonheart's Trumpet"
msgstr "그리폰하트의 나팔"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1436|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"Quest Item:  An artifact from a previous Elf/Human dispute, lost by Terrance"
" Gryphonheart in a daring night-time raid by Elvish forces.  Rumor has it "
"that no army that has fought on the side of this trumpet's music has ever "
"been defeated.  Even if the rumor is false, it will certainly boost morale "
"on either side."
msgstr ""
"퀘스트 아이템: 과거 엘프와 인간 사이의 분쟁에서 나온 유물로, 테런스 그리폰하트가 엘프 군대의 대담한 야간 습격 중에 잃어버린 "
"것입니다. 전해지는 이야기에 따르면 이 나팔 소리에 이끌려 싸운 군대는 결코 패배하지 않았다고 합니다. 설령 그 소문이 사실이라 "
"할지라도, 분명 양측의 사기를 북돋아 줄 것입니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1436|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Instrument"
msgstr "악기"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1437|field=Name"
msgid "Seashell"
msgstr "조개껍데기"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1437|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"Quest Item: Seashells this large are only found on the beaches of Emerald "
"Island.  One of these might make a nice souvenir of your time here."
msgstr ""
"퀘스트 아이템: 이렇게 큰 조개껍데기는 에메랄드 섬의 해변에서만 찾을 수 있습니다. 이 조개껍데기 하나를 기념품으로 간직하면 좋을 "
"거예요."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1437|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Seashell"
msgstr "조개껍데기"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1438|field=Name"
msgid "Floor Tile (w/ moon insignia)"
msgstr "바닥 타일(달 문양)"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1438|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"Quest Item: This tile was apparently part of the library in a Temple of the "
"Moon."
msgstr "퀘스트 아이템: 이 타일은 달의 신전에 있는 도서관의 일부였던 것으로 보입니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1438|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Tile"
msgstr "타일"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1439|field=Name"
msgid "Winged Sandals"
msgstr "날개 달린 샌들"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1439|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"(+100 Speed, +50 Accuracy, +50 Air Resistance, Regenerate SP and HP over "
"time, and Feather Falling) Rumored to be the footwear of a god, the winged "
"sandals confer enormous power on the wearer."
msgstr ""
"(+100 속도, +50 정확도, +50 공기 저항, 시간에 따른 주문력과 생명력 회복, 깃털 낙하) 신의 신발이라는 소문이 있는 이 "
"날개 달린 샌들은 착용자에게 엄청난 힘을 부여합니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1439|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Sandals"
msgstr "샌들"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=143|field=Name"
msgid "Ruby Ring"
msgstr "루비 반지"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=143|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"This simply elegant ring is set with a single, oval ruby of high quality - "
"pigeon blood red, perfectly cut and clear of imperfections."
msgstr ""
"이 심플하면서도 우아한 반지는 최고급 품질의 타원형 루비 한 개가 세팅되어 있습니다. 비둘기 피처럼 붉은색을 띠는 이 루비는 완벽하게 "
"커팅되었으며 흠집이 전혀 없습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=143|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Ring"
msgstr "반지"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1440|field=Name"
msgid "Season's Stole"
msgstr "계절의 스톨"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1440|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"Quest Item: The Seasons' Stole is worn by priests during seasonal "
"festivities.  Though it doesn't have any direct power, most commonfolk "
"believe it grants luck in the planting or harvest."
msgstr ""
"퀘스트 아이템: 계절의 스톨은 사제들이 계절 축제 기간 동안 착용하는 장신구입니다. 직접적인 효능은 없지만, 일반 사람들은 이 장신구가 "
"파종이나 수확에 행운을 가져다준다고 믿습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1440|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Scarf"
msgstr "스카프"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1441|field=Name"
msgid "Golem chest"
msgstr "골렘 몸통"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1441|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"Quest Item:  The broad torso of a mighty golem.  It appears to require a bit"
" of assembly before being fully functional."
