msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1488|field=Name"
msgid "Iron-laced ore"
msgstr "철 함유 광석"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1488|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"A small chunk of iron-laced ore.  In the hands of a skilled craftsman, this "
"could make a weapon, an amulet, a ring, armor, or almost any other useful "
"item."
msgstr ""
"철이 함유된 작은 광석 덩어리. 숙련된 장인의 손에 들어가면 이것으로 무기, 부적, 반지, 갑옷 또는 거의 모든 유용한 물건을 만들 수 "
"있다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1488|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Lump of Ore"
msgstr "광석 덩어리"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1489|field=Name"
msgid "Siertal-laced ore"
msgstr "시에르탈 함유 광석"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1489|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"A small chunk of siertal-laced ore.  Stronger and lighter than steel, in the"
" hands of a skilled craftsman siertal could make an exceptional weapon, an "
"amulet, a ring, armor, or almost any other useful item."
msgstr ""
"시에르탈이 함유된 작은 광석 조각. 강철보다 강하고 가벼운 시에르탈은 숙련된 장인의 손에서 뛰어난 무기, 부적, 반지, 갑옷 또는 거의 "
"모든 유용한 물건을 만들 수 있습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1489|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Lump of Ore"
msgstr "광석 덩어리"

