msgstr "마법봉"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=15|field=Name"
msgid "Archangel Broadsword"
msgstr "대천사 브로드소드"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=15|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"This blade of pure erudine steel can cut armor like butter and gleams with a"
" starlight glow. There are finer swords available, but their numbers can be "
"counted on a single hand."
msgstr ""
"순수한 에루딘 강철로 만들어진 이 검은 갑옷을 버터처럼 쉽게 베어낼 수 있으며 별빛처럼 찬란하게 빛납니다. 이보다 더 훌륭한 검도 "
"있겠지만, 그 수는 손가락으로 꼽을 수 있을 정도입니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=15|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Broadsword"
msgstr "브로드소드"

