msgid "Longsword"
msgstr "장검"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1603|field=Notes"
msgid "Of simple make and design, this longsword is deadly nonetheless."
msgstr "단순한 구조와 디자인을 가졌지만, 이 장검은 그 자체로 치명적입니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1603|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Longsword"
msgstr "장검"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1604|field=Name"
msgid "Warrior Sword"
msgstr "전사의 검"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1604|field=Notes"
msgid "A longsword of superior strength and edge."
msgstr "뛰어난 강도와 날카로움을 지닌 장검."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1604|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Longsword"
msgstr "장검"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1605|field=Name"
msgid "Crusader Sword"
msgstr "십자군의 검"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1605|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"Hammered metal patterns on the blade of this longsword suggest high quality "
"Dwarven manufacture."
msgstr "이 장검의 칼날에 새겨진 두드린 듯한 금속 무늬는 드워프 장인의 뛰어난 솜씨를 보여줍니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1605|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Longsword"
msgstr "장검"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1606|field=Name"
msgid "Conqueror Sword"
msgstr "정복자의 검"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1606|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"An extremely high quality longsword, this weapon is one of no more than one "
"thousand of its kind forged by master weaponsmith Mekorig the Blind circa "
"780-800."
msgstr ""
"이 검은 최고급 품질의 장검으로, 780년에서 800년경에 명장 무기 제작자 장님 메코리그가 만든 1,000점 미만의 희귀한 작품 중 "
"하나입니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1606|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Longsword"
msgstr "장검"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1607|field=Name"
msgid "Lionheart Sword"
msgstr "라이온하트 검"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1607|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"A weapon as rare as it is ancient, this longsword was forged during the Time"
" of Wonders.  The process used to forge steel of this quality was lost "
"sometime just after the Silence."
msgstr ""
"이 장검은 희귀할 뿐만 아니라 매우 오래된 무기로, 경이의 시대에 만들어졌습니다. 이처럼 뛰어난 품질의 강철을 만드는 데 사용된 제조법은"
" 침묵의 시대 직후에 사라졌습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1607|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Longsword"
msgstr "장검"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1608|field=Name"
msgid "Claymore"
msgstr "클레이모어"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1608|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"A basic two-handed sword.  Thousands of these low quality weapons can be "
"found throughout Enroth."
msgstr "기본적인 양손검. 엔로스 전역에서 이처럼 질이 낮은 무기를 수천 개나 찾아볼 수 있다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1608|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Two-Handed Sword"
msgstr "양손검"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1609|field=Name"
msgid "Barbarian Flamberge"
msgstr "야만인의 플랑베르주"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1609|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"Yet another simple two-handed sword, this barbarian's weapon sports a wavy "
"blade and an extra cross piece.  Its construction is sturdy and the blade is"
" sharp."
msgstr ""
"이 야만인의 무기는 또 다른 단순한 양손검으로, 물결 모양의 날과 추가적인 가로대가 특징입니다. 견고한 구조와 날카로운 날을 자랑합니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1609|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Two-Handed Sword"
msgstr "양손검"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=160|field=Name"
msgid "Shaman's Wand of Mind"
msgstr "주술사의 정신 마법봉"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=160|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"Something rattles ominously within the gog skull topping this wand - product"
" of Ogre mage magic. To use it, you must equip it like a weapon."
msgstr ""
"이 지팡이 꼭대기에 있는 고그 해골 안에서 무언가가 불길하게 덜그럭거린다. 오우거 마법사의 마법으로 만들어진 이 지팡이를 사용하려면 "
"무기처럼 장착해야 한다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=160|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Wand"
msgstr "마법봉"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1610|field=Name"
msgid "Vanquisher Sword"
msgstr "정복자의 검"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1610|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"An unusually high quality two-handed sword, this blade is both strong and "
"reliable."
msgstr "이 검은 매우 뛰어난 품질의 양손검으로, 강하고 믿음직스럽습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1610|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Two-Handed Sword"
msgstr "양손검"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1611|field=Name"
msgid "Fine Broadsword"
msgstr "고급 브로드소드"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1611|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"A common broadsword.  These blades can be found throughout the land in the "
"hands of both heroes and villains."
msgstr "흔히 볼 수 있는 브로드소드. 이 검은 영웅과 악당 모두의 손에서 이 땅 곳곳에서 찾아볼 수 있다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1611|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Broadsword"
msgstr "브로드소드"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1612|field=Name"
msgid "Massive Steel Broadsword"
msgstr "거대한 강철 브로드소드"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1612|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"A larger variety of the Erathian steel broadsword, not a bit inferior in "
"quality to its smaller counterpart. The increased size requires more "
"strength to wield, but it's guaranteed to leave a mark."
msgstr ""
"에라티아 강철 브로드소드의 대형 버전으로, 소형 버전과 비교해도 품질은 전혀 떨어지지 않습니다. 크기가 커진 만큼 휘두르려면 더 많은 "
"힘이 필요하지만, 그만큼 강력한 위력을 자랑합니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1612|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Broadsword"
msgstr "브로드소드"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1613|field=Name"
msgid "Mighty Broadsword"
msgstr "강력한 브로드소드"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1613|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"This broadsword's edge and beauty are enchanted and untouched by time.  The "
"blade looks as though it was forged yesterday."
msgstr "이 대검의 날카로움과 아름다움은 세월의 흐름에도 변함없이 그대로입니다. 마치 어제 벼려낸 듯한 모습입니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1613|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Broadsword"
msgstr "브로드소드"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1614|field=Name"
msgid "Cutlass"
msgstr "커틀러스"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1614|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"A cutlass of Goblin manufacture, this blade is as deadly as it is ugly."
msgstr "고블린이 만든 이 커틀러스는 흉측한 외모만큼이나 치명적이다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1614|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Cutlass"
msgstr "커틀러스"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1615|field=Name"
msgid "Pirate Cutlass"
msgstr "해적 단검"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1615|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"The traditional back-up weapon of the Regnan pirates living on the countless"
" islands east of the island of Mist.  These cutlasses were forged by one of "
"a long line of smiths native to those islands."
msgstr ""
"안개의 섬 동쪽에 있는 수많은 섬들에 거주하는 레그나 해적들의 전통적인 보조 무기입니다. 이 커틀러스는 그 섬들에 뿌리를 둔 오랜 "
"대장장이 가문의 일원이 제작했습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1615|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Cutlass"
msgstr "커틀러스"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1616|field=Name"
msgid "Master Cutlass"
msgstr "마스터 커틀러스"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1616|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"These splendid cutlasses were created in limited numbers by Alec Teling, "
"master armorer to Hareck IX, and were issued only to admirals of Regnan "
"fleets as a symbol of station. You are not likely to set your eyes upon a "
"finer cutlass in your lifetime."
msgstr ""
"이 훌륭한 커틀러스는 하렉 9세의 수석 무기 제작자인 알렉 텔링이 한정된 수량으로 제작했으며, 레그나 함대의 제독들에게만 지위의 상징으로"
" 지급되었습니다. 당신은 평생 이보다 더 훌륭한 커틀러스를 다시 보기 어려울 것입니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1616|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Cutlass"
msgstr "커틀러스"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1617|field=Name"
msgid "Dagger"
msgstr "단검"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1617|field=Notes"
msgid "A common dagger, favorite of thieves and assassins the world over."
msgstr "흔한 단검으로, 전 세계 도둑과 암살자들이 즐겨 찾는 무기입니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1617|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Dagger"
msgstr "단검"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1618|field=Name"
msgid "Blood Dagger"
msgstr "피의 단검"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1618|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"Blood Daggers are ceremonial weapons worn by the nobility of Regna.  Their "
"popularity has spread in recent years to the nobility of Enroth, and now "
"they can be found throughout the land.  Though ceremonial, they are sharp "
"and reliable blades."
msgstr ""
"블러드 대거는 레그나 귀족들이 착용하는 의식용 무기입니다. 최근 몇 년 동안 엔로스 귀족들 사이에서도 인기가 높아져 이제는 엔로스 "
"전역에서 찾아볼 수 있습니다. 의식용 무기이긴 하지만, 날카롭고 믿음직한 칼날이기도 합니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1618|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Dagger"
msgstr "단검"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1619|field=Name"
msgid "Shadow Dagger"
msgstr "그림자 단검"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1619|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"Commissioned by Ethric the Mad while still a human, it is said these daggers"
" have a link to the Land of the Dead.  They are used in certain magical "
"rituals designed to extend life to unnatural lengths."
msgstr ""
"미치광이 에스릭이 인간 시절에 의뢰하여 제작된 이 단검들은 저승과 연관이 있다고 전해집니다. 이 단검들은 수명을 비정상적으로 연장하는 "
"특정 마법 의식에 사용됩니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1619|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Dagger"
msgstr "단검"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=161|field=Name"
msgid "Shaman's Wand of Swarms"
msgstr "주술사의 벌떼 마법봉"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=161|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"Something rattles ominously within the gog skull topping this wand - product"
" of Ogre mage magic. To use it, you must equip it like a weapon."
msgstr ""
"이 지팡이 꼭대기에 있는 고그 해골 안에서 무언가가 불길하게 덜그럭거린다. 오우거 마법사의 마법으로 만들어진 이 지팡이를 사용하려면 "
"무기처럼 장착해야 한다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=161|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Wand"
msgstr "마법봉"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1620|field=Name"
msgid "Mage Dagger"
msgstr "마법사의 단검"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1620|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"One of less than a hundred such blades, Mage daggers were carried and forged"
" by members of the Alchemical Alliance roughly 300 years ago in the fires "
"beneath Castle Alamos.  It is no longer possible to make a finer blade than "
"a Mage dagger."
msgstr ""
"백 자루도 채 되지 않는 마법사 단검은 약 300년 전, 알라모스 성 지하의 불길 속에서 연금술 동맹의 일원들이 직접 제작하고 휴대했던 "
"검입니다. 이제는 마법사 단검보다 더 정교한 검을 만들 수 있는 기술은 없습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1620|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Dagger"
msgstr "단검"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1621|field=Name"
msgid "Jeweled Dagger"
msgstr "보석 박힌 단검"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1621|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"A weapon from the Time of Wonders, this blade is of both extreme age and "
"quality."
msgstr "경이의 시대의 무기인 이 검은 매우 오래되었고 품질 또한 뛰어납니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1621|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Dagger"
msgstr "단검"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1622|field=Name"
msgid "Fine Long Dagger"
msgstr "고급 장단검"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1622|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"The common long dagger.  Bordering on swords, these long daggers are favored"
" by assassins who want a weapon that is both concealable yet has a longer "
"reach than the traditional dagger."
msgstr ""
"흔히 볼 수 있는 긴 단검. 검에 가까운 이 긴 단검은 휴대하기 편리하면서도 전통적인 단검보다 사거리가 긴 무기를 원하는 암살자들에게 "
"인기가 많다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1622|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Long Dagger"
msgstr "장단검"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1623|field=Name"
msgid "Piercing Dagger"
msgstr "관통 단검"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1623|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"Really more of a short sword than a dagger, the narrow blade belies an "
"unusual strength and a possibly enchanted edge."
msgstr ""
"단검이라기보다는 짧은 검에 더 가까운 이 무기는 좁은 날 속에 비범한 강도와 어쩌면 마법이 깃든 듯한 날카로움을 숨기고 있다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1623|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Long Dagger"
msgstr "장단검"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1624|field=Name"
msgid "Divine Dagger"
msgstr "신성한 단검"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1624|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"A 'Weapon of the Gods', this weapon was one of the last created before the "
"great forges fell to the Silence in the year 113 A.S (After the Silence)."
msgstr ""
"'신들의 무기'라 불리는 이 무기는 서기 113년(침묵의 시대 이후)에 거대한 대장간들이 대침묵에 잠식되기 직전에 만들어진 마지막 무기 "
"중 하나입니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1624|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Long Dagger"
msgstr "장단검"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1625|field=Name"
msgid "Hand Axe"
msgstr "손도끼"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1625|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"More of a tool than a weapon, this simple axe will work in a pinch.  But "
"don't expect much."
msgstr "무기라기보다는 도구에 가까운 이 단순한 도끼는 급할 때 쓸만합니다. 하지만 큰 기대는 하지 마세요."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1625|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Axe"
msgstr "도끼"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1626|field=Name"
msgid "Barbarian Axe"
msgstr "야만인의 도끼"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1626|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"Made as a weapon of war instead of a tool, this  battle axe is usually "
"employed by barbarians and undisciplined armies."
msgstr "이 전투 도끼는 도구가 아닌 전쟁 무기로 만들어졌으며, 주로 야만인이나 규율이 없는 군대에서 사용되었습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1626|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Axe"
msgstr "도끼"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1627|field=Name"
msgid "War Axe"
msgstr "전투 도끼"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1627|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"This War Axe appears to be one of a large shipment of such axes seized by "
"Roland during the Succession War.  It was manufactured in Karigor by order "
"of Archibald Ironfist to be used against his brother in their struggle for "
"the throne of Enroth."
msgstr ""
"이 전투 도끼는 계승 전쟁 중 롤랜드가 압수한 대량의 전투 도끼 중 하나인 것으로 보인다. 이 도끼는 아치볼드 아이언피스트의 명령으로 "
"카리고르에서 제작되었으며, 엔로스 왕좌를 놓고 벌이는 그의 형제와의 싸움에서 사용하기 위한 것이었다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1627|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Axe"
msgstr "도끼"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1628|field=Name"
msgid "Dwarven Noble Axe"
msgstr "드워프 귀족의 도끼"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1628|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"An example of the high quality work done by the dwarves of the Red "
"Mountains, the blade is sharp and the balance perfect."
msgstr "붉은 산맥 드워프들이 만들어낸 뛰어난 품질의 한 예로, 칼날은 날카롭고 균형은 완벽합니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1628|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Axe"
msgstr "도끼"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1629|field=Name"
msgid "Supreme Axe"
msgstr "최상급 도끼"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1629|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"This weapon surely has a dark history.  An axe of this quality is only "
"forged as the personal weapon of a noble Dwarf, and it is never sold or "
"traded away…"
msgstr ""
"이 무기는 분명 어두운 역사를 지니고 있을 것이다. 이처럼 뛰어난 품질의 도끼는 오직 고귀한 드워프의 개인 무기로만 제작되며, 절대 "
"팔거나 교환해서는 안 된다…"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1629|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Axe"
msgstr "도끼"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=162|field=Name"
msgid "Wizard Wand of Fireballs"
msgstr "마법사의 화염구 마법봉"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=162|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"A wand of highly polished thornbark wrapped with platinum wire. To use it, "
"you must equip it like a weapon."
msgstr "매끄럽게 광택 처리된 가시나무 껍질에 백금선을 감싼 지팡이. 사용하려면 무기처럼 장착해야 한다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=162|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Wand"
msgstr "마법봉"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1630|field=Name"
msgid "Light Poleaxe"
msgstr "경량 장대도끼"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1630|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"This style of long hafted axe is typically used to deadly effect by Eastern "
"tribes and the elite guard of some members of the nobility."
msgstr "이처럼 자루가 긴 도끼는 동양 부족이나 일부 귀족의 정예 경호대가 치명적인 효과를 내는 데 주로 사용합니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1630|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Two-Handed Axe"
msgstr "양손 도끼"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1631|field=Name"
msgid "Heavy Poleaxe"
msgstr "중량 장대도끼"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1631|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"A stronger version of the basic Poleaxe, this weapon is frequently used by "
"city guards and other fighters who don't expect to do battle in large, "
"coordinated groups (like armies)."
msgstr ""
"기본 폴액스보다 강화된 버전인 이 무기는 대규모의 조직적인 전투(예: 군대)를 예상하지 않는 도시 경비대나 기타 전투원들이 자주 "
"사용합니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1631|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Two-Handed Axe"
msgstr "양손 도끼"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1632|field=Name"
msgid "Grand Poleaxe"
msgstr "대형 장대도끼"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1632|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"The blade head of this weapon was obviously created with the aid of magic.  "
"It is both unusually sharp and light at the same time."
msgstr "이 무기의 칼날 끝은 분명 마법의 도움을 받아 만들어진 것이다. 놀라울 정도로 날카로우면서도 동시에 가볍다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1632|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Two-Handed Axe"
msgstr "양손 도끼"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1633|field=Name"
msgid "Spear"
msgstr "창"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1633|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"Barely more than a sharpened stick, this spear is still quite deadly.  Like "
"all spears, it can be used in one or both hands (+1D9 if used two-handed)."
msgstr ""
"날카롭게 다듬은 막대기에 불과하지만, 이 창은 상당히 치명적입니다. 모든 창과 마찬가지로 한 손 또는 양손으로 사용할 수 있으며, "
"양손으로 사용할 경우 +1D9의 추가 피해를 입힙니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1633|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Spear"
msgstr "창"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1634|field=Name"
msgid "Stout Spear"
msgstr "튼튼한 창"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1634|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"This spear has a reinforced steel tip to help it penetrate tough armor and "
"hides.  Like all spears, it can be used in one or both hands (+1D9 if used "
"two-handed)."
msgstr ""
"이 창은 단단한 갑옷과 가죽을 뚫을 수 있도록 강화된 강철 끝을 가지고 있습니다. 모든 창과 마찬가지로 한 손 또는 양손으로 사용할 수 "
"있으며, 양손으로 사용할 경우 +1D9의 추가 피해를 입힙니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1634|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Spear"
msgstr "창"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1635|field=Name"
msgid "Serpent Spear"
msgstr "뱀 창"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1635|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"Decorated with carved serpents running along the shaft, this spear comes "
"equipped with a cross piece designed to prevent impaled foes from sliding "
"along the shaft of the spear and striking a blow at you as they die.  Like "
"all spears, it can be used in one or both hands (+1D9 if used two-handed)."
msgstr ""
"자루를 따라 뱀이 조각되어 장식된 이 창에는 적이 꽂히면 자루를 따라 미끄러져 내려가면서 죽어가는 동안 당신을 공격하는 것을 방지하는 "
"가로대가 달려 있습니다. 모든 창과 마찬가지로 한 손 또는 양손으로 사용할 수 있으며, 양손으로 사용할 경우 +1D9의 추가 피해를 "
"입힙니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1635|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Spear"
msgstr "창"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1636|field=Name"
msgid "Savage Spear"
msgstr "야만적인 창"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1636|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"Composed entirely of a rare, bluish metal, the lower half of this spear is "
"wrapped in an expensive leather.  A collector's item!  Like all spears, it "
"can be used in one or both hands (+1D9 if used two-handed)."
msgstr ""
"희귀한 푸른빛 금속으로 전체가 만들어진 이 창의 아랫부분은 값비싼 가죽으로 감싸져 있습니다. 소장 가치가 있는 물건입니다! 모든 창과 "
"마찬가지로 한 손 또는 양손으로 사용할 수 있습니다(+1D9, 양손 사용 시)."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1636|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Spear"
msgstr "창"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1637|field=Name"
msgid "Sacred Spear"
msgstr "신성한 창"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1637|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"This spear bears characteristics of equipment from the Time of Wonders - "
"beautiful, in perfect condition and lethal. This model was already produced "
"centuries before the Silence and remained in production almost towards the "
"end of the Heavenly Forges, in that period serving ceremonial and "
"representative purposes. Later combat models are the only mass-produced "
"spears that surpass these in any capacity (+1D9 if used two-handed)."
msgstr ""
"이 창은 경이의 시대의 장비가 지닌 특징, 즉 아름다움과 완벽한 상태, 그리고 치명적인 위력을 지니고 있습니다. 이 모델은 침묵의 "
"시대보다 수 세기 전에 이미 제작되었으며, 천상의 대장간이 거의 끝날 무렵까지 생산되어 의식용 및 상징적인 용도로 사용되었습니다. 이후에"
" 생산된 전투용 모델만이 모든 면에서 이 창을 능가합니다(+1D9, 양손 사용 시)."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1637|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Spear"
msgstr "창"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1638|field=Name"
msgid "Common Halberd"
msgstr "일반 미늘창"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1638|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"Combination poleax and spear, the halberd can inflict terrible wounds, but "
"recovers slowly from swings.  This one is of average quality and workmanship"
" (+1D6 if used two-handed)."
msgstr ""
"도끼와 창이 결합된 형태의 할버드는 끔찍한 상처를 입힐 수 있지만, 휘두른 후에는 회복 속도가 느립니다. 이 할버드는 평균적인 품질과 "
"솜씨를 지니고 있습니다(+1D6, 양손으로 사용 시)."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1638|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Halberd"
msgstr "미늘창"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1639|field=Name"
msgid "Massive Halberd"
msgstr "거대한 미늘창"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1639|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"Of solid construction, this halberd has a particularly heavy blade.  Wielded"
" by a mighty warrior, it could surely be used to slay the toughest of "
"monsters (+1D6 if used two-handed)."
msgstr ""
"견고한 구조로 만들어진 이 할버드는 특히 무거운 날을 가지고 있습니다. 용맹한 전사가 휘두른다면, 가장 강력한 괴물도 쓰러뜨릴 수 있을 "
"것입니다(+1D6, 양손으로 사용 시)."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1639|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Halberd"
msgstr "미늘창"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=163|field=Name"
msgid "Wizard Wand of Acid"
msgstr "마법사의 산성 마법봉"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=163|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"A wand of highly polished thornbark wrapped with platinum wire. To use it, "
"you must equip it like a weapon."
msgstr "매끄럽게 광택 처리된 가시나무 껍질에 백금선을 감싼 지팡이. 사용하려면 무기처럼 장착해야 한다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=163|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Wand"
msgstr "마법봉"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1640|field=Name"
msgid "Elite Halberd"
msgstr "정예 미늘창"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1640|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"That this magnificent halberd is a product of the Mekorig Foundry comes as "
"no surprise to you. From the intricate shape of the head to the sturdiness "
"of the construction -- everything about this weapon screams quality (+1D6 if"
" used two-handed)."
msgstr ""
"이 웅장한 할버드가 메코리그 주조소의 산물이라는 사실은 당신에게 전혀 놀라운 일이 아닙니다. 정교한 날끝 모양부터 견고한 구조까지, 이 "
"무기의 모든 면은 최고급 품질을 자랑합니다(+1D6, 양손 사용 시)."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1640|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Halberd"
msgstr "미늘창"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1641|field=Name"
msgid "Trident"
msgstr "삼지창"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1641|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"Common war tridents, like this one, are good quality weapons issued by the "
"Imperial Regnan Navy to facilitate the collection of Imperial tariffs on the"
" high seas.  Most merchants and other governments refer to this activity as "
"piracy…(+1D6 if used two-handed)."
msgstr ""
"이와 같은 일반적인 전쟁용 삼지창은 제국 해군이 공해상에서 제국 관세를 징수하기 위해 지급하는 품질 좋은 무기입니다. 대부분의 상인과 "
"다른 정부들은 이러한 행위를 해적 행위로 간주합니다…(+1D6, 양손으로 사용 시)."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1641|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Trident"
msgstr "삼지창"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1642|field=Name"
msgid "Ornate Trident"
msgstr "화려한 삼지창"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1642|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"A high quality war trident of the style given to officers of the Imperial "
"Regnan Navy.  This one was probably taken from the officer during an "
"Imperial Taxation battle that went poorly for the Navy (+1D6 if used two-"
"handed)."
msgstr ""
"제국 해군 장교들에게 지급되던 양식의 고급 전투 삼지창입니다. 이 삼지창은 아마도 해군에게 불리하게 돌아간 제국 세금 징수 전투 중에 "
"장교에게서 빼앗은 것으로 추정됩니다(+1D6 보너스, 양손으로 사용 시)."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1642|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Trident"
msgstr "삼지창"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1643|field=Name"
msgid "Titanic Trident"
msgstr "거대한 삼지창"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1643|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"This beautiful trident is mostly made of Kergar, a rare, bluish metal that "
"does not rust or lose its edge over time (+1D6 if used two-handed)."
msgstr ""
"이 아름다운 삼지창은 대부분 케르가르라는 희귀한 푸른빛 금속으로 만들어졌으며, 녹슬거나 시간이 지나도 날이 무뎌지지 않습니다(+1D6, "
"양손으로 사용 시)."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1643|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Trident"
msgstr "삼지창"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1644|field=Name"
msgid "Crude Longbow"
msgstr "조잡한 장궁"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1644|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"A simple longbow constructed of common materials and uninspired design."
msgstr "흔한 재료로 만들어졌고 디자인이 평범한 단순한 장궁."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1644|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Longbow"
msgstr "장궁"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1645|field=Name"
msgid "Elven Bow"
msgstr "엘프 활"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1645|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"A weapon only made by the Elves of the great Erathian forests.  This one "
"reflects the same high quality workmanship found in all Elvish artifacts."
msgstr ""
"이 무기는 에라티아의 광활한 숲에 사는 엘프들만이 만들 수 있는 것입니다. 모든 엘프 유물에서 볼 수 있는 뛰어난 장인 정신이 고스란히 "
"담겨 있습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1645|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Longbow"
msgstr "장궁"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1646|field=Name"
msgid "Precision Bow"
msgstr "정밀 활"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1646|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"Etched initials at the base of the bow indicate this bow was made by master "
"bowyer Ivan Selving's workshop during the Timber Wars against the Elves of "
"Erathia in the late 600's."
msgstr ""
"활 밑부분에 새겨진 이니셜은 이 활이 600년대 후반 에라시아의 엘프족과의 목재 전쟁 당시 명장 활 제작자 이반 셀빙의 작업장에서 "
"만들어졌음을 나타냅니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1646|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Longbow"
msgstr "장궁"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1647|field=Name"
msgid "Magic Bow"
msgstr "마법 활"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1647|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"This bow is composed of strange materials and bound together by subtle "
"enchantments.  It is extremely light and accurate."
msgstr "이 활은 기묘한 재료들로 만들어졌고, 미묘한 마법으로 결속되어 있다. 매우 가볍고 정확하다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1647|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Longbow"
msgstr "장궁"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1648|field=Name"
msgid "Stellar Bow"
msgstr "별빛 활"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1648|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"Created by stripping the Heavenly Forges of their enchanted parts when they "
"became useless some years after the Silence, very few of these bows have "
"survived the passage of time.  What few remain are hoarded by the Elves and "
"individual collectors."
msgstr ""
"침묵의 시대가 끝난 후 수년이 지나 천상의 대장간에서 마법이 걸린 부품들이 쓸모없게 되자, 그것들을 제거하여 만들어진 이 활들은 세월의 "
"흐름 속에서 극소수만이 살아남았습니다. 현재 남아 있는 몇 안 되는 활들은 엘프들과 개인 수집가들에 의해 보관되고 있습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1648|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Longbow"
msgstr "장궁"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1649|field=Name"
msgid "Crossbow"
msgstr "석궁"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1649|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"Crossbows are the deadliest ranged weapons made since the Time of Wonders.  "
"This crossbow is made of stout Yew wood and metal fixtures, but is otherwise"
" rather ordinary."
msgstr ""
"석궁은 경이의 시대 이후로 만들어진 가장 치명적인 원거리 무기입니다. 이 석궁은 튼튼한 주목나무와 금속 부품으로 만들어졌지만, 그 외에는"
" 꽤 평범합니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1649|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Crossbow"
msgstr "석궁"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=164|field=Name"
msgid "Wizard Wand of Lightning"
msgstr "마법사의 번개 마법봉"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=164|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"A wand of highly polished thornbark wrapped with platinum wire. To use it, "
"you must equip it like a weapon."
msgstr "매끄럽게 광택 처리된 가시나무 껍질에 백금선을 감싼 지팡이. 사용하려면 무기처럼 장착해야 한다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=164|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Wand"
msgstr "마법봉"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1650|field=Name"
msgid "Accurate Crossbow"
msgstr "정확한 석궁"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1650|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"These crossbows feature a section of curved wood next to the bowstaves, "
"which helps prevent recoil, increasing their accuracy. It comes at the cost "
"of a greater weight than that of lighter crossbows."
msgstr ""
"이 석궁들은 활대 옆에 곡선형 나무 부분이 있어 반동을 줄여 정확도를 높여줍니다. 하지만 이로 인해 가벼운 석궁보다 무게가 더 나갑니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1650|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Crossbow"
msgstr "석궁"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1651|field=Name"
msgid "True Crossbow"
msgstr "정교한 석궁"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1651|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"Equipped with a hand crank and shaft sights, these exceptional crossbows are"
" superior to all that have come before.  Just where they are coming from is "
"a mystery at this time…"
msgstr ""
"수동 크랭크와 샤프트 조준기를 장착한 이 탁월한 석궁은 이전의 어떤 석궁보다 뛰어납니다. 하지만 이 석궁이 어디에서 왔는지는 현재로서는 "
"미스터리입니다…"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1651|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Crossbow"
msgstr "석궁"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1652|field=Name"
msgid "Simple Mace"
msgstr "간소한 철퇴"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1652|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"Little more than a glorified club, this common mace is made of ordinary "
"materials and unexceptional craftsmanship."
msgstr "이 흔한 철퇴는 그저 좀 더 고급스러운 곤봉에 불과하며, 평범한 재료와 특별할 것 없는 솜씨로 만들어졌습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1652|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Mace"
msgstr "철퇴"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1653|field=Name"
msgid "Wicked Mace"
msgstr "사악한 철퇴"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1653|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"Solidly designed to inflict fatal injuries, even through armor.  The balance"
" is a little top heavy, but the craftsmanship is good."
msgstr ""
"갑옷을 뚫고도 치명적인 부상을 입힐 수 있도록 견고하게 설계되었습니다. 무게 중심이 약간 위쪽에 쏠려 있지만, 만듦새는 훌륭합니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1653|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Mace"
msgstr "철퇴"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1654|field=Name"
msgid "Thunder Mace"
msgstr "천둥 철퇴"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1654|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"This mace is one of thousands turned out by the Heavenly Forges before the "
"Silence.  But that was more than a thousand years ago, and not many remain."
msgstr ""
"이 철퇴는 침묵의 시대 이전에 천상의 대장간에서 만들어진 수천 개의 철퇴 중 하나입니다. 하지만 그것은 천 년도 더 전의 일이고, 지금은"
" 얼마 남지 않았습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1654|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Mace"
msgstr "철퇴"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1655|field=Name"
msgid "Wonder Mace"
msgstr "경이로운 철퇴"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1655|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"Only magic could make such an ungainly weapon so light and yet hit so hard."
msgstr "마법만이 이처럼 투박한 무기를 그토록 가볍게 만들면서도 강력한 타격을 가할 수 있을 것이다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1655|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Mace"
msgstr "철퇴"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1656|field=Name"
msgid "Death Mace"
msgstr "죽음의 철퇴"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1656|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"Constructed by the Necromancer's guild just prior to their fall during the "
"Succession War, these unusual weapons are almost always enchanted with "
"powerful magics."
msgstr ""
"계승 전쟁 중 네크로맨서 길드가 몰락하기 직전에 제작된 이 특이한 무기들은 거의 예외 없이 강력한 마법으로 강화되어 있습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1656|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Mace"
msgstr "철퇴"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1657|field=Name"
msgid "Massive Hammer"
msgstr "거대한 망치"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1657|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"A graceless and unimaginative weapon, hammers are slow, but hit very hard.  "
"This one is of common construction and materials."
msgstr ""
"투박하고 상상력이 부족한 무기인 망치는 속도는 느리지만 매우 강력한 타격을 가할 수 있습니다. 이 망치는 흔한 구조와 재료로 "
"만들어졌습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1657|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Hammer"
msgstr "망치"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1658|field=Name"
msgid "Dark Hammer"
msgstr "어둠의 망치"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1658|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"A step up in construction quality, these hammers are commonly wielded by "
"humanoid monsters.  Since everyone knows most monsters don't make weapons, "
"the question 'from where are they getting them?' arises…"
msgstr ""
"제작 품질이 한 단계 향상된 이 망치는 주로 인간형 괴물들이 휘두릅니다. 대부분의 괴물들이 무기를 만들지 않는다는 것은 누구나 아는 "
"사실이기에, '도대체 저 망치들은 어디서 구하는 걸까?'라는 의문이 생깁니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1658|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Hammer"
msgstr "망치"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1659|field=Name"
msgid "Holy Hammer"
msgstr "성스러운 망치"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1659|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"Magically constructed, these hammers are the property of the Church of the "
"Moon in Karigor."
msgstr "마법으로 만들어진 이 망치들은 카리고르에 있는 달의 교회의 소유물입니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1659|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Hammer"
msgstr "망치"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=165|field=Name"
msgid "Wizard Wand of Blades"
msgstr "마법사의 칼날 마법봉"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=165|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"A wand of highly polished thornbark wrapped with platinum wire. To use it, "
"you must equip it like a weapon."
msgstr "매끄럽게 광택 처리된 가시나무 껍질에 백금선을 감싼 지팡이. 사용하려면 무기처럼 장착해야 한다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=165|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Wand"
msgstr "마법봉"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1660|field=Name"
msgid "Root Club"
msgstr "뿌리 곤봉"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1660|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"A primitive weapon usable by even the stupidest of monsters.  You're not "
"thinking of using this, are you?"
msgstr "가장 멍청한 괴물조차도 사용할 수 있는 원시적인 무기군. 설마 이걸 쓰려는 건 아니겠지?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1660|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Club"
msgstr "곤봉"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1661|field=Name"
msgid "Spiked Club"
msgstr "가시 박힌 곤봉"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1661|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"An improvement over the simple club, this spiked club will inflict nastier "
"wounds."
msgstr "단순한 곤봉보다 훨씬 강력한 이 뾰족한 곤봉은 더 심한 상처를 입힐 것입니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1661|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Club"
msgstr "곤봉"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1662|field=Name"
msgid "Killer Club"
msgstr "살상용 곤봉"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1662|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"King of the club family.  If this weapon had a knob or ball on the end, it "
"would be a mace.  There is evidence of real craftsmanship in this club, but "
"you can see no true identifying marks that would indicate who created it."
msgstr ""
"곤봉류의 왕이라 할 수 있는 무기입니다. 만약 끝에 손잡이나 공 모양의 장식이 있었다면 철퇴였을 것입니다. 이 곤봉에는 뛰어난 장인 "
"정신이 깃들어 있지만, 누가 만들었는지 알 수 있는 확실한 표식은 없습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1662|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Club"
msgstr "곤봉"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1663|field=Name"
msgid "Staff"
msgstr "지팡이"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1663|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"The staff is the traditional weapon of the oppressed.  This one is "
"unremarkable, and the ruby at the end of it is actually just colored glass."
msgstr ""
"지팡이는 억압받는 자들의 전통적인 무기입니다. 이 지팡이는 특별할 것 없고, 끝에 달린 루비는 사실 색깔 있는 유리 조각일 뿐입니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1663|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Staff"
msgstr "지팡이"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1664|field=Name"
msgid "Emerald Staff"
msgstr "에메랄드 지팡이"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1664|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"Magically light and hard, this staff is made of a rare wood stripped from "
"the Elves during the Timber War in 600 A.S.  The emerald at the end of it is"
" real, and probably serves as a magical reservoir from which the staff draws"
" its strength."
msgstr ""
"마법처럼 가볍고 단단한 이 지팡이는 서기 600년 목재 전쟁 당시 엘프들에게서 빼앗은 희귀한 나무로 만들어졌습니다. 지팡이 끝에 박힌 "
"에메랄드는 진짜이며, 아마도 지팡이가 힘을 끌어내는 마법의 저장소 역할을 하는 것으로 추정됩니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1664|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Staff"
msgstr "지팡이"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1665|field=Name"
msgid "Power Staff"
msgstr "힘의 지팡이"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1665|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"This staff, along with others of its kind, was found in the treasure room of"
" the Necromancer's guild after their disastrous defeat by Roland at the end "
"of the Succession War."
msgstr "이 지팡이는 다른 유사한 지팡이들과 함께 계승 전쟁 말기에 롤랜드에게 참패한 네크로맨서 길드의 보물창고에서 발견되었습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1665|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Staff"
msgstr "지팡이"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1666|field=Name"
msgid "Blaster"
msgstr "블래스터"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1666|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"A weapon of awesome power, clearly created during the Time of Wonders.  "
msgstr "엄청난 위력을 지닌 무기로, 틀림없이 경이의 시대에 만들어졌을 것이다.  "

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1666|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Ancient Weapon"
msgstr "고대 무기"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1667|field=Name"
msgid "Blaster Rifle"
msgstr "블래스터 소총"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1667|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"The finest of personal weapons made during the Time of Wonders, this Blaster"
" Rifle can deal death faster than any weapon you have ever seen."
msgstr ""
"경이의 시대에 만들어진 최고의 개인 화기인 이 블래스터 소총은 당신이 지금까지 본 어떤 무기보다도 빠르게 적을 처치할 수 있습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1667|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Ancient Weapon"
msgstr "고대 무기"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1668|field=Name"
msgid "Leather Armor"
msgstr "가죽 갑옷"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1668|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"Lightest and most easily made among the armors, leather armor offers the "
"least protection.  This particular suit is of average quality."
msgstr "가죽 갑옷은 갑옷 중에서 가장 가볍고 제작하기 쉽지만, 보호력은 가장 떨어집니다. 이 갑옷은 평균적인 품질입니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1668|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Leather Armor"
msgstr "가죽 갑옷"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1669|field=Name"
msgid "Reinforced Leather"
msgstr "강화 가죽 갑옷"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1669|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"Studded leather offers more protection than regular leather armor at the "
"expense of being stiffer and weighing more.  This particular suit is well "
"made."
msgstr "징이 박힌 가죽은 일반 가죽 갑옷보다 보호력이 뛰어나지만, 더 뻣뻣하고 무겁습니다. 이 갑옷은 특히 잘 만들어졌습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1669|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Leather Armor"
msgstr "가죽 갑옷"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=166|field=Name"
msgid "Wizard Wand of Berzerking"
msgstr "마법사의 광폭화 마법봉"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=166|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"A wand of highly polished thornbark wrapped with platinum wire. To use it, "
"you must equip it like a weapon."
msgstr "매끄럽게 광택 처리된 가시나무 껍질에 백금선을 감싼 지팡이. 사용하려면 무기처럼 장착해야 한다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=166|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Wand"
msgstr "마법봉"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1670|field=Name"
msgid "Enchanted Leather"
msgstr "마법의 가죽 갑옷"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1670|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"A subtly enchanted suit of armor that is much stronger than its weight would"
" suggest. Shoulder and waist pads offer added protection with no cost to "
"freedom of movement."
msgstr ""
"은은한 마법이 깃든 갑옷으로, 무게에 비해 훨씬 강력한 내구성을 자랑합니다. 어깨와 허리 보호대는 움직임의 자유를 제한하지 않으면서도 "
"추가적인 보호 기능을 제공합니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1670|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Leather Armor"
msgstr "가죽 갑옷"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1671|field=Name"
msgid "Dragon Leather"
msgstr "드래곤 가죽 갑옷"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1671|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"Standard issue leather armor for officers in the Regnan Navy.  All such "
"leather armor receives enchantments to strengthen and lighten it during its "
"creation in the Regnan Armories. This particular suit is a somewhat heavier "
"than usual variation with a bit more body coverage."
msgstr ""
"레그나 해군 장교용 표준 가죽 갑옷입니다. 모든 가죽 갑옷은 레그나 무기고에서 제작될 때 강화 및 경량화 마법이 부여됩니다. 이 갑옷은 "
"일반적인 갑옷보다 약간 더 무겁고 신체를 더 많이 덮는 형태입니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1671|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Leather Armor"
msgstr "가죽 갑옷"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1672|field=Name"
msgid "Imperial Leather"
msgstr "제국 가죽 갑옷"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1672|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"An extremely rare suit of leather armor created during the conflicts between"
" the Church of the Moon and the Church of the Sun roughly 80 years ago.  "
"These suits provide the finest protection available with leather armor."
msgstr ""
"약 80년 전 달의 교단과 태양의 교단 간의 분쟁 중에 제작된 극히 희귀한 가죽 갑옷입니다. 이 갑옷은 가죽 갑옷으로서 최고의 보호력을 "
"제공합니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1672|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Leather Armor"
msgstr "가죽 갑옷"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1673|field=Name"
msgid "Chain Mail"
msgstr "사슬 갑옷"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1673|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"Chain mail is an armor formed of small, interlocking loops of metal.  This "
"suit is low quality:  the metal used is plain iron, there are only two "
"layers of rings, and it is heavy and stiff for its size. Despite beginning "
"to corrode, it has so far remained intact."
msgstr ""
"사슬 갑옷은 작은 금속 고리들을 서로 맞물려 만든 갑옷입니다. 이 갑옷은 질이 좋지 않습니다. 사용된 금속은 평범한 철이고, 고리는 두 "
"겹으로만 되어 있으며, 크기에 비해 무겁고 뻣뻣합니다. 부식이 시작되었음에도 불구하고 아직까지는 온전한 상태를 유지하고 있습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1673|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Chain Mail"
msgstr "사슬 갑옷"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1674|field=Name"
msgid "Basic Steel Chain Mail"
msgstr "기본 강철 사슬 갑옷"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1674|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"A superior suit of chain mail, the metal used in this suit is steel, and the"
" former owner was careful to keep the suit well oiled and free of rust. Its "
"coverage of areas below the waist could have been better, though."
msgstr ""
"최고급 사슬 갑옷인 이 갑옷은 강철로 만들어졌으며, 이전 소유자는 갑옷에 기름칠을 잘 하고 녹이 슬지 않도록 세심하게 관리했습니다. 다만"
" 허리 아래 부분을 덮는 부분이 좀 더 촘촘했으면 좋았을 것입니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1674|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Chain Mail"
msgstr "사슬 갑옷"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1675|field=Name"
msgid "Noble Chain Mail"
msgstr "귀족의 사슬 갑옷"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1675|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"Cavalry officer's chain mail from the reign of Taledon V of Karigor, Divine "
"High Priest and High Holy Conduit of the Church of the Sun, circa 870 A.S.  "
"The armor is high quality chain, enchanted to lighten and strengthen the "
"metal."
msgstr ""
"태양 교회의 최고 사제이자 대성스러운 통로였던 카리고르의 탈레돈 5세 통치 시대(서기 870년경)의 기병 장교용 사슬 갑옷입니다. 이 "
"갑옷은 고급 사슬로 만들어졌으며, 금속을 가볍고 강하게 만드는 마법이 걸려 있습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1675|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Chain Mail"
msgstr "사슬 갑옷"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1676|field=Name"
msgid "Royal Chain Mail"
msgstr "왕실 사슬 갑옷"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1676|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"Highly enchanted armor worn by elvish nobility and royalty during the Timber"
" Wars of the seventh and eighth centuries."
msgstr "7세기와 8세기 목재 전쟁 당시 엘프 귀족과 왕족이 착용했던 강력한 마법이 걸린 갑옷."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1676|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Chain Mail"
msgstr "사슬 갑옷"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1677|field=Name"
msgid "Majestic Chain Mail"
msgstr "장엄한 사슬 갑옷"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1677|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"A model of armor from before the Silence -- one could see it worn by the "
"Governor and his closest associates as a badge of office. The formula for "
"creating these suits is quite old, in fact it was adjusted not long before "
"the Forges broke down. As such, this chain mail is superior to most other "
"such armors in the world today -- though still surpassed by suits created in"
" the years just before the Silence."
msgstr ""
"침묵의 시대 이전 시대의 갑옷 모형입니다. 총독과 그의 측근들이 직위를 상징하는 표식으로 착용했던 것입니다. 이 갑옷을 만드는 제조법은 "
"아주 오래되었으며, 실제로 대장간이 붕괴되기 직전에 수정되었습니다. 따라서 이 사슬 갑옷은 오늘날 세계의 다른 갑옷들보다 우수하지만, "
"침묵의 시대 직전에 만들어진 갑옷보다는 여전히 떨어집니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1677|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Chain Mail"
msgstr "사슬 갑옷"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1678|field=Name"
msgid "Plate Mail"
msgstr "판금 갑옷"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1678|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"Composed of interlocking plates and joints, plate armor is the best "
"unenchanted armor available.  It is, however, heavy and slows the movements "
"of the wearer.  This particular suit is of average quality and the smith "
"unknown."
msgstr ""
"서로 맞물리는 판금으로 구성된 판금 갑옷은 마법이 부여되지 않은 갑옷 중 최고의 성능을 자랑합니다. 하지만 무거워 착용자의 움직임을 "
"둔화시킵니다. 이 갑옷은 평균적인 품질이며 제작자는 알려지지 않았습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1678|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Plate Armor"
msgstr "판금 갑옷"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1679|field=Name"
msgid "Steel Plate Mail"
msgstr "강철 판금 갑옷"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1679|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"Well constructed plates of steel work together to form an overall excellent "
"suit of armor.  A foundry stamp under the right arm indicates it was forged "
"recently in Kelebrim."
msgstr ""
"정교하게 제작된 강철판들이 서로 맞물려 훌륭한 갑옷을 이룬다. 오른쪽 팔 아래에 찍힌 주조 공장 도장은 이 갑옷이 최근 켈레브림에서 "
"제작되었음을 나타낸다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1679|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Plate Armor"
msgstr "판금 갑옷"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=167|field=Name"
msgid "Serpent Wand of Blasting"
msgstr "뱀 폭발 마법봉"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=167|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"Made from the braided bodies of three snakes, this wand pulses like a slow "
"heartbeat. To use it you must equip it like a weapon."
msgstr "세 마리 뱀의 몸을 엮어 만든 이 지팡이는 마치 느린 심장 박동처럼 맥동합니다. 사용하려면 무기처럼 장착해야 합니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=167|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Wand"
msgstr "마법봉"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1680|field=Name"
msgid "Golden Plate Mail"
msgstr "황금 판금 갑옷"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1680|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"This suit of plate armor was forged in the Mekorig foundry eighteen years "
"after the death of Mekorig the Blind.  A masterwork, the armor is almost as "
"easy to wear as ordinary clothes, and is probably the best armor available "
"in the world."
msgstr ""
"이 판금 갑옷은 장님 메코리그가 죽은 지 18년 후에 메코리그 주조소에서 제작되었습니다. 걸작인 이 갑옷은 일반 옷처럼 입기 편하며, "
"아마도 세상에서 가장 뛰어난 갑옷일 것입니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1680|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Plate Armor"
msgstr "판금 갑옷"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1681|field=Name"
msgid "Kite Shield"
msgstr "연꼴 방패"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1681|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"Formed of stretched hides over a wooden frame, this simple shield provides "
"basic protection against physical attacks."
msgstr "나무 틀에 가죽을 씌워 만든 이 단순한 방패는 물리적 공격으로부터 기본적인 보호를 제공합니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1681|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Large Shield"
msgstr "대형 방패"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1682|field=Name"
msgid "Tower Shield"
msgstr "대형 방패"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1682|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"The simplicity of the heraldic design on this shield leads one to believe it"
" was created either by barbarians or goblins.  It is made of sturdy "
"materials and should stand up reasonably well in combat."
msgstr ""
"이 방패에 새겨진 문장의 단순함을 보면 야만인이나 고블린이 만들었을 것이라고 짐작할 수 있다. 튼튼한 재질로 만들어져 전투에서 꽤 잘 "
"견딜 것으로 보인다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1682|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Large Shield"
msgstr "대형 방패"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1683|field=Name"
msgid "Castle Shield"
msgstr "성채 방패"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1683|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"This shield is made of wood framed by iron.  It is somewhat heavy for its "
"size, but it should see you through a battle safely--as long as  you're not "
"backstabbed."
msgstr ""
"이 방패는 철제 틀에 나무를 덧댄 구조입니다. 크기에 비해 다소 무겁지만, 뒤에서 칼에 찔리지 않는 한 전투에서 안전하게 지켜줄 "
"것입니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1683|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Large Shield"
msgstr "대형 방패"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1684|field=Name"
msgid "Celestial Shield"
msgstr "천상의 방패"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1684|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"Made of a lightweight metal, this shield has a foundry stamp from the "
"Kelebrim armory.  Though light, the material is very strong, and the metal "
"is welded almost seamlessly.  "
msgstr ""
"이 방패는 가벼운 금속으로 만들어졌으며, 켈레브림 무기고의 주조 도장이 찍혀 있습니다. 가볍지만 재질은 매우 견고하며, 금속은 거의 "
"이음새 없이 용접되어 있습니다.  "

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1684|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Large Shield"
msgstr "대형 방패"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1685|field=Name"
msgid "Olympian Shield"
msgstr "올림포스의 방패"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1685|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"This round shield is a design of the long gone Phynaxian empire that once "
"ruled southern Erathia. Forged of stalt, it is extremely sturdy and "
"susceptible to enchantments. It's so well-made that its only downside seems "
"to be its rather compact size for a large shield, which somewhat limits its "
"coverage."
msgstr ""
"이 원형 방패는 한때 에라시아 남부를 지배했던 오래전에 사라진 피낙시아 제국의 디자인입니다. 강철로 만들어져 매우 견고하며 마법 부여에 "
"취약합니다. 워낙 잘 만들어진 방패라 단점이라면 크기가 다소 작아 방어 범위가 제한적이라는 점입니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1685|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Large Shield"
msgstr "대형 방패"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1686|field=Name"
msgid "Splintery Buckler"
msgstr "가시투성이 소형 방패"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1686|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"A small wooden shield designed to protect mostly against arrows. The wood it"
" is made of was never properly planed, making its surface full of splinters "
"and chips. Its remaining lifetime in combat is likely much shorter than "
"you'd like."
msgstr ""
"화살을 막기 위해 만들어진 작은 나무 방패입니다. 나무를 제대로 다듬지 않아 표면에 가시와 부스러기가 가득합니다. 전투에서 이 방패의 "
"수명은 당신이 바라는 것보다 훨씬 짧을 가능성이 큽니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1686|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Small Shield"
msgstr "소형 방패"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1687|field=Name"
msgid "Rusty Bronze Shield"
msgstr "녹슨 청동 방패"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1687|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"Bronze shields are lighter than iron shields of the same size, but aren't "
"nearly as strong."
msgstr "청동 방패는 같은 크기의 철 방패보다 가볍지만, 강도는 훨씬 떨어집니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1687|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Small Shield"
msgstr "소형 방패"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1688|field=Name"
msgid "Steel Shield"
msgstr "강철 방패"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1688|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"Since this shield is made of tempered steel, it should resist all but the "
"most unusual of enchanted weapons."
msgstr "이 방패는 강화강철로 만들어졌으므로, 아주 특이한 마법 무기를 제외하고는 모든 공격에 견딜 수 있을 것입니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1688|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Small Shield"
msgstr "소형 방패"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1689|field=Name"
msgid "Spirit Shield"
msgstr "영혼 방패"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1689|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"Spirit shields are ordinary steel shields enchanted through a ritualistic "
"process that can have powerful, albeit unpredictable results.  The process "
"is time consuming and requires the undivided attention of at least three "
"masters of Spirit magic."
msgstr ""
"영혼 방패는 일반 강철 방패에 의식적인 과정을 통해 마법을 부여한 것으로, 강력하지만 예측 불가능한 효과를 지닙니다. 이 과정은 시간이 "
"오래 걸리고 최소 세 명의 영혼 마법사의 전적인 집중이 필요합니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1689|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Small Shield"
msgstr "소형 방패"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=168|field=Name"
msgid "Serpent Wand of the Fist"
msgstr "뱀 주먹 마법봉"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=168|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"Made from the braided bodies of three snakes, this wand pulses like a slow "
"heartbeat. To use it you must equip it like a weapon."
msgstr "세 마리 뱀의 몸을 엮어 만든 이 지팡이는 마치 느린 심장 박동처럼 맥동합니다. 사용하려면 무기처럼 장착해야 합니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=168|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Wand"
msgstr "마법봉"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1690|field=Name"
msgid "Astral Shield"
msgstr "아스트랄 방패"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1690|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"These rare shields were turned out by the hundreds with the aid of the "
"Heavenly Forges to combat rebel forces in the endless string of skirmishes "
"and supply raids that tested (and finally overcame) the Governor's forces in"
" the first century A.S.  As with all such equipment, it is light, tough, and"
" is capable of holding the most powerful enchantments."
msgstr ""
"이 희귀한 방패는 천상의 대장간의 도움으로 수백 개씩 생산되어, 기원후 1세기 동안 총독의 군대가 끊임없이 겪었던 소규모 전투와 보급품 "
"약탈에서 반란군에 맞서 싸우는 데 사용되었습니다. 이러한 장비들이 그러하듯, 이 방패는 가볍고 튼튼하며 가장 강력한 마법을 담을 수 "
"있습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1690|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Small Shield"
msgstr "소형 방패"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1691|field=Name"
msgid "Wooden Helm"
msgstr "나무 투구"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1691|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"An ordinary helm.  This one is made of hides stretched over wood.  There's "
"no fur or padding on the inside, so your head will probably ring like a bell"
" when struck a solid blow."
msgstr ""
"평범한 투구입니다. 나무 위에 가죽을 씌워 만들었죠. 안쪽에는 털이나 솜이 없어서 세게 치면 머리가 종처럼 쨍쨍 울릴 겁니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1691|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Helm"
msgstr "투구"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1692|field=Name"
msgid "Steel Helm"
msgstr "강철 투구"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1692|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"This is a common steel helm.  The design is a good one and has been used for"
" centuries by warriors all around the world.  Best guess is this helm is "
"50-75 years old."
msgstr ""
"이것은 흔히 볼 수 있는 강철 투구입니다. 디자인이 훌륭해서 수 세기 동안 전 세계 전사들이 사용해 왔습니다. 이 투구는 대략 50년에서"
" 75년 정도 된 것으로 추정됩니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1692|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Helm"
msgstr "투구"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1693|field=Name"
msgid "Guardian Helm"
msgstr "수호자의 투구"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1693|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"This helm design has been used by the Elves of Erathia since before the "
"Silence. Its wing ornaments belie superior strength and add a sense of "
"distinction for the Elven leaders who got to go into battle wearing these "
"helms."
msgstr ""
"이 투구 디자인은 에라시아의 엘프들이 침묵의 시대 이전부터 사용해 온 것입니다. 날개 장식은 뛰어난 힘을 암시하며, 이 투구를 쓰고 "
"전투에 나서는 엘프 지도자들에게 특별한 위엄을 더해줍니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1693|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Helm"
msgstr "투구"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1694|field=Name"
msgid "Defender Helm"
msgstr "방어자의 투구"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1694|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"Half made from the skull of the ferocious Mogred beast in Karigor, these "
"helms grow more uncommon every year as the Mogreds approach extinction.  The"
" red stripes around the horns of the helm are highly receptive to "
"enchantment."
msgstr ""
"카리고르에 서식하는 흉포한 모그레드 괴물의 두개골로 반쯤 만들어진 이 투구는 모그레드 종족이 멸종 위기에 처함에 따라 해마다 점점 더 "
"희귀해지고 있습니다. 투구 뿔 주변의 붉은 줄무늬는 마법 부여에 매우 효과적입니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1694|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Helm"
msgstr "투구"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1695|field=Name"
msgid "Angelic Helm"
msgstr "천사의 투구"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1695|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"These helms are extremely rare and no one knows where they originate, but "
"they almost certainly come from the Time of Wonders.  An extremely fine "
"inscription inside the helm says  'Property of Ship's Store, VARN MCMIV'."
msgstr ""
"이 투구는 극히 희귀하며 그 기원은 알려지지 않았지만, 거의 확실히 경이의 시대의 유물일 것입니다. 투구 안쪽에는 '선박창 소유, "
"VARN MCMIV'라는 매우 정교한 명문이 새겨져 있습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1695|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Helm"
msgstr "투구"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1696|field=Name"
msgid "Cloth Hat"
msgstr "천 모자"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1696|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"A common hat.  The material is a blend of cotton and wool, and the feather "
"is from a duck."
msgstr "흔히 볼 수 있는 모자입니다. 소재는 면과 양모 혼방이며, 깃털은 오리털입니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1696|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Hat"
msgstr "모자"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1697|field=Name"
msgid "Dandy Hat"
msgstr "멋쟁이 모자"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1697|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"Quite fashionable and stylish, these hats are in vogue amongst the upper "
"classes and those seeking to emulate them."
msgstr "세련되고 스타일리시한 이 모자들은 상류층과 그들을 따라하고 싶어하는 사람들 사이에서 유행하고 있습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1697|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Hat"
msgstr "모자"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1698|field=Name"
msgid "Wizard Cap"
msgstr "마법사의 모자"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1698|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"Don't laugh--while silly--even ridiculous--in appearance, many sorcerers "
"spend quite a bit of time enchanting hats like this with powerful magics.  "
"The conical shape and 'eyes' in the front of the hat are peculiarly "
"attractive to creatures of the spirit world, and that property makes the hat"
" easier to enchant."
msgstr ""
"웃지 마세요. 겉보기엔 우스꽝스럽고 심지어는 우스꽝스러워 보일지 몰라도, 많은 마법사들이 이런 모자에 강력한 마법을 걸어 마법을 부여하는"
" 데 상당한 시간을 투자합니다. 원뿔 모양과 모자 앞쪽의 '눈'은 정령들에게 특히 매력적이며, 이러한 특성 덕분에 마법을 걸기가 더 "
"쉽습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1698|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Hat"
msgstr "모자"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1699|field=Name"
msgid "Wreath Crown"
msgstr "화환 왕관"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1699|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"This is a poorly wrought crown, the kind that goblins or low budget actors "
"might create to mock royalty.  It offers no real head protection, although "
"it may carry some small enchantment."
msgstr ""
"이것은 조잡하게 만들어진 왕관으로, 고블린이나 저예산 배우들이 왕족을 조롱하기 위해 만들어낸 것과 같은 종류입니다. 머리를 제대로 "
"보호해주지는 못하지만, 약간의 마법이 깃들어 있을지도 모릅니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1699|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Crown"
msgstr "왕관"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=169|field=Name"
msgid "Serpent Wand of Rocks"
msgstr "뱀 바위 마법봉"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=169|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"Made from the braided bodies of three snakes, this wand pulses like a slow "
"heartbeat. To use it you must equip it like a weapon."
msgstr "세 마리 뱀의 몸을 엮어 만든 이 지팡이는 마치 느린 심장 박동처럼 맥동합니다. 사용하려면 무기처럼 장착해야 합니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=169|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Wand"
msgstr "마법봉"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=16|field=Name"
msgid "Rusty Cutlass"
msgstr "녹슨 커틀러스"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=16|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"This weapon may once have been of some quality, though it would be hard to "
"tell through the apparent years of corrosion."
msgstr "이 무기는 한때 꽤 품질이 좋았을지도 모르지만, 오랜 세월 동안 심하게 부식된 모습 때문에 이를 알아내기는 어려울 것이다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=16|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Cutlass"
msgstr "커틀러스"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1700|field=Name"
msgid "Regal Crown"
msgstr "왕의 왕관"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1700|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"A large, imperfect sapphire is inset in the center of this delicate silver "
"crown.  Extremely fine hammer marks suggest this crown was made by dwarven "
"hands."
msgstr ""
"이 섬세한 은제 왕관 중앙에는 크고 흠집이 있는 사파이어가 박혀 있습니다. 매우 정교한 망치 자국은 이 왕관이 드워프의 손으로 "
"만들어졌음을 암시합니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1700|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Crown"
msgstr "왕관"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1701|field=Name"
msgid "Almighty Crown"
msgstr "전능의 왕관"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1701|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"Crowns of this sort are typically created with the use of magic to enhance "
"their susceptibility to magic.  If found with no enchantments whatsoever, "
"the crown was probably left unfinished for some reason. "
msgstr ""
"이런 종류의 왕관은 일반적으로 마법을 사용하여 마법에 대한 저항력을 높이도록 만들어집니다. 만약 아무런 마법도 걸려 있지 않다면, 어떤 "
"이유로든 미완성 상태로 남겨진 것일 가능성이 높습니다. "

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1701|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Crown"
msgstr "왕관"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1702|field=Name"
msgid "Crude Leather Belt"
msgstr "조잡한 가죽 허리띠"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1702|field=Notes"
msgid "A common strip of leather used to hold up your pants."
msgstr "바지를 고정하는 데 흔히 사용되는 가죽 끈."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1702|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Belt"
msgstr "허리띠"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1703|field=Name"
msgid "Mercenary Belt"
msgstr "용병의 허리띠"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1703|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"A wide leather belt with a big, flashy buckle of a kind favored by bandits "
"and mercenaries.  Both mercenaries and bandits like to have charms or minor "
"enchantments placed on them as battle aids."
msgstr ""
"도적이나 용병들이 선호하는 크고 화려한 버클이 달린 넓은 가죽 벨트. 용병과 도적들은 전투에 도움이 되도록 벨트에 부적이나 작은 마법을 "
"거는 것을 좋아한다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1703|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Belt"
msgstr "허리띠"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1704|field=Name"
msgid "Vanguard Belt"
msgstr "선봉대의 허리띠"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1704|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"Cured dragonhide and polished bronze are fastened together to form a belt of"
" unusual strength and resistance to magic.  Although difficult to work with,"
" these belts can offer excellent protection against magic once an "
"enchantment is successfully laid upon them."
msgstr ""
"가공된 용가죽과 광택이 나는 청동을 엮어 만든 이 벨트는 비범한 강도와 마법 저항력을 지니고 있습니다. 다루기는 어렵지만, 일단 마법을 "
"성공적으로 걸면 마법으로부터 탁월한 보호력을 제공합니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1704|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Belt"
msgstr "허리띠"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1705|field=Name"
msgid "Warlord Belt"
msgstr "군벌의 허리띠"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1705|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"Made of silver and the hide of some unknown creature, this belt is studded "
"with vertical strips of a golden alloy.  The buckle is a single, large opal "
"inset in a platinum base."
msgstr ""
"은과 정체를 알 수 없는 생물의 가죽으로 만들어진 이 벨트는 금 합금으로 된 세로 줄무늬가 박혀 있다. 버클은 백금 바탕에 커다란 오팔 "
"하나가 박혀 있다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1705|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Belt"
msgstr "허리띠"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1706|field=Name"
msgid "Sovereign Belt"
msgstr "군주의 허리띠"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1706|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"Though soft and flexible, the material of this belt is made up of extremely "
"fine strands of white gold.  The white gold is braided together by a process"
" too exacting for human hands, and the ruby set into the buckle was "
"perfectly cut by a process long lost in time."
msgstr ""
"부드럽고 유연한 이 벨트는 매우 가는 백금 가닥으로 만들어졌습니다. 백금은 인간의 손으로는 도저히 엮을 수 없는 정교한 공정을 거쳐 "
"엮였으며, 버클에 박힌 루비는 오래전에 사라진 전통적인 세공 기법으로 완벽하게 가공되었습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1706|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Belt"
msgstr "허리띠"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1707|field=Name"
msgid "Leather Cloak"
msgstr "가죽 망토"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1707|field=Notes"
msgid "A used leather cloak.  It smells faintly of mothballs and dust."
msgstr "낡은 가죽 망토. 희미하게 나프탈렌과 먼지 냄새가 난다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1707|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Cloak"
msgstr "망토"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1708|field=Name"
msgid "Phantom Cloak"
msgstr "유령 망토"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1708|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"Indigo dye from the Regnan Archipelago was used to stain this wool cloak the"
" color of a summer night's sky."
msgstr "레그나 군도에서 생산된 인디고 염료를 사용하여 이 양모 망토를 여름밤 하늘색으로 물들였습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1708|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Cloak"
msgstr "망토"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1709|field=Name"
msgid "Elven Cloak"
msgstr "엘프 망토"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1709|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"Woven from plant fibers found in the forests of Erathia, these cloaks are "
"the traditional garb of the Elven Rangers."
msgstr "에라시아 숲에서 발견되는 식물 섬유로 짜여진 이 망토는 엘프 레인저들의 전통 복장입니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1709|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Cloak"
msgstr "망토"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=170|field=Name"
msgid "Serpent Wand of Paralysis"
msgstr "뱀 마비 마법봉"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=170|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"Made from the braided bodies of three snakes, this wand pulses like a slow "
"heartbeat. To use it you must equip it like a weapon."
msgstr "세 마리 뱀의 몸을 엮어 만든 이 지팡이는 마치 느린 심장 박동처럼 맥동합니다. 사용하려면 무기처럼 장착해야 합니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=170|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Wand"
msgstr "마법봉"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1710|field=Name"
msgid "Cardinal Cloak"
msgstr "추기경의 망토"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1710|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"A cloak formerly worn by high officials of the Church of the Sun of Karigor "
"prior to the dissolution of the Church in 1083 A.S.  Nearly all these cloaks"
" were enchanted in one way or another."
msgstr ""
"이 망토는 기원전 1083년 카리고르 태양교회가 해산되기 전까지 교회 고위 관리들이 착용했던 것입니다. 이 망토들은 거의 모두 어떤 "
"식으로든 마법이 걸려 있었습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1710|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Cloak"
msgstr "망토"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1711|field=Name"
msgid "Doom's Day Cloak"
msgstr "종말의 망토"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1711|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"A cloak formerly worn by high officials of the Church of the Moon of Karigor"
" prior to the dissolution of the Church in 1083 A.S.  Nearly all these "
"cloaks were enchanted in one way or another."
msgstr ""
"이 망토는 기원전 1083년 카리고르 달의 교회가 해산되기 전까지 교회의 고위 관리들이 착용했던 것입니다. 이 망토들은 거의 모두 어떤 "
"식으로든 마법이 걸려 있었습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1711|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Cloak"
msgstr "망토"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1712|field=Name"
msgid "Gauntlets"
msgstr "건틀릿"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1712|field=Notes"
msgid "A steel plated gauntlet of simple make and design."
msgstr "단순한 구조와 디자인의 강철판 장갑."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1712|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Gauntlets"
msgstr "건틀릿"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1713|field=Name"
msgid "Knight Gauntlets"
msgstr "기사의 건틀릿"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1713|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"This gauntlet is an improvement over the simple, inflexible steel gauntlets "
"commonly worn by goblins and brigands.  The back of the hand and wrist are "
"solid, while the jointing around the fingers is made of chain links to "
"improve dexterity."
msgstr ""
"이 건틀릿은 고블린과 산적들이 흔히 착용하는 단순하고 뻣뻣한 강철 건틀릿을 개선한 것입니다. 손등과 손목 부분은 단단하게 제작되었고, "
"손가락 관절 부분은 사슬 고리로 만들어져 손놀림을 향상시켰습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1713|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Gauntlets"
msgstr "건틀릿"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1714|field=Name"
msgid "Paladin Gauntlets"
msgstr "성기사 건틀릿"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1714|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"While lacking in flexibility, this gauntlet has reinforced joints over the "
"knuckles and at the base of the wrist."
msgstr "유연성은 부족하지만, 이 장갑은 손가락 관절과 손목 아랫부분에 강화된 관절이 있습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1714|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Gauntlets"
msgstr "건틀릿"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1715|field=Name"
msgid "Cavalier Gauntlets"
msgstr "중기병의 건틀릿"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1715|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"A high quality gauntlet, it offers both flexibility and protection.  The "
"joints are reinforced, yet are 'soft' enough to permit nearly normal hand "
"motion."
msgstr ""
"고품질 장갑으로 유연성과 보호 기능을 모두 제공합니다. 관절 부분은 강화되었지만, 거의 정상적인 손 움직임을 허용할 만큼 충분히 "
"부드럽습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1715|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Gauntlets"
msgstr "건틀릿"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1716|field=Name"
msgid "Ultimate Gauntlets"
msgstr "궁극의 건틀릿"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1716|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"Dwarven smiths created this masterpiece of gauntlet design.  Except for the "
"extra bulk, there seems little difference between this gauntlet and a velvet"
" glove.  Clever sliding and rotating plates at the joints and wrist permit "
"full normal hand motion while providing continuous protection at all times."
msgstr ""
"드워프 대장장이들이 만들어낸 이 걸작 건틀릿은 두께가 다소 두껍다는 점을 제외하면 벨벳 장갑과 거의 차이가 없어 보입니다. 관절과 손목 "
"부분에 정교하게 설계된 슬라이딩 및 회전식 판 덕분에 손의 움직임은 자유로우면서도 항상 완벽한 보호 기능을 제공합니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1716|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Gauntlets"
msgstr "건틀릿"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1717|field=Name"
msgid "Old Leather Boots"
msgstr "낡은 가죽 장화"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1717|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"Common traveler's boots made with leather and hobnailed. Their previous "
"owner didn't maintain them very well, and the leather appears discolored and"
" warped in places."
msgstr ""
"가죽으로 만들어지고 징이 박힌 흔한 여행자용 부츠입니다. 이전 주인이 관리를 잘 하지 않아 가죽이 부분적으로 변색되고 변형되었습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1717|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Boots"
msgstr "장화"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1718|field=Name"
msgid "Steel Boots"
msgstr "강철 장화"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1718|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"Heavy steel boots made for solid foot protection in battle.  They are "
"uncomfortable to walk in and have a tendency to rust on the inside."
msgstr "전투에서 발을 단단히 보호하기 위해 제작된 무거운 강철 부츠. 착용감이 불편하고 안쪽이 녹슬기 쉽다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1718|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Boots"
msgstr "장화"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1719|field=Name"
msgid "Armored Boots"
msgstr "장갑 장화"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1719|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"The interior of these steel plated boots is made of leather and cloth to "
"soften the sharp edges on the metal plates.  They are a bit heavy and "
"exhausting to wear for extended periods."
msgstr ""
"이 철판 부츠의 내부는 날카로운 금속판 모서리를 부드럽게 하기 위해 가죽과 천으로 만들어졌습니다. 하지만 다소 무겁고 장시간 착용하면 "
"피로감을 줄 수 있습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1719|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Boots"
msgstr "장화"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=171|field=Name"
msgid "Serpent Wand of Clouds"
msgstr "뱀 구름 마법봉"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=171|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"Made from the braided bodies of three snakes, this wand pulses like a slow "
"heartbeat. To use it you must equip it like a weapon."
msgstr "세 마리 뱀의 몸을 엮어 만든 이 지팡이는 마치 느린 심장 박동처럼 맥동합니다. 사용하려면 무기처럼 장착해야 합니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=171|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Wand"
msgstr "마법봉"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1720|field=Name"
msgid "Sterling Boots"
msgstr "순은 장화"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1720|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"Polished silver boots with velvet interiors, these boots are lighter than "
"steel boots and far more comfortable.  They look pretty snappy, too."
msgstr ""
"광택이 나는 은색 부츠에 벨벳 안감이 더해진 이 부츠는 안전화보다 가볍고 훨씬 편안합니다. 게다가 꽤 멋스러워 보이기도 합니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1720|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Boots"
msgstr "장화"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1721|field=Name"
msgid "Ultimate Boots"
msgstr "궁극의 장화"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1721|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"Dragonhide boots reinforced with molded horn strips and stalt metal rivets."
"  Soft and light, they provide unparalleled foot protection."
msgstr ""
"드래곤가죽 부츠는 몰딩 처리된 뿔띠와 견고한 금속 리벳으로 보강되었습니다. 부드럽고 가벼우면서도 탁월한 발 보호 기능을 제공합니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1721|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Boots"
msgstr "장화"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1722|field=Name"
msgid "Fine Ring"
msgstr "고급 반지"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1722|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"A small golden ring with a quarter carat diamond.  The style is simple and "
"elegant."
msgstr "0.25캐럿 다이아몬드가 세팅된 작은 금반지입니다. 심플하면서도 우아한 디자인입니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1722|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Ring"
msgstr "반지"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1723|field=Name"
msgid "Sparkling Ring"
msgstr "반짝이는 반지"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1723|field=Notes"
msgid "Two amethysts adorn this plain platinum ring."
msgstr "심플한 플래티넘 반지 위에 자수정 두 개가 장식되어 있습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1723|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Ring"
msgstr "반지"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1724|field=Name"
msgid "Lunar Ring"
msgstr "달빛 반지"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1724|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"A gold ring with a large moonstone set in the center.  These rings typically"
" carry an enchantment."
msgstr "중앙에 커다란 월장석이 박힌 금반지. 이러한 반지에는 보통 마법이 깃들어 있다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1724|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Ring"
msgstr "반지"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1725|field=Name"
msgid "Witch Ring"
msgstr "마녀의 반지"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1725|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"Rings such as this one were worn by the Witch's guild to signify membership "
"during their heyday between 550-800 A.S."
msgstr "이와 같은 반지는 마녀 길드가 전성기를 누리던 서기 550년에서 800년 사이에 길드 회원임을 나타내기 위해 착용했습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1725|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Ring"
msgstr "반지"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1726|field=Name"
msgid "Blessed Ring"
msgstr "축복받은 반지"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1726|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"The three pearls mounted on a gold base glimmer a faint blue when held out "
"in the sun, offering insight as to the source of their magic."
msgstr ""
"금빛 받침대에 박힌 세 개의 진주는 햇빛에 비추면 은은한 푸른빛을 띠는데, 이는 진주에 담긴 신비로움의 근원을 짐작하게 해준다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1726|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Ring"
msgstr "반지"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1727|field=Name"
msgid "Valuable Ring"
msgstr "값진 반지"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1727|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"A large star sapphire flanked by two smaller rubies decorate an otherwise "
"plain gold band."
msgstr "커다란 스타 사파이어 양쪽에 작은 루비 두 개가 자리 잡고 있는 심플한 금반지입니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1727|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Ring"
msgstr "반지"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1728|field=Name"
msgid "Precious Ring"
msgstr "귀중한 반지"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1728|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"Three gems, symmetrically equal in size and quality adorn a hammered gold "
"band.  The center gem is a ruby, and the two flanking gems are purple "
"topazes."
msgstr ""
"크기와 품질이 대칭을 이루는 세 개의 보석이 망치로 두드려 만든 금띠를 장식하고 있습니다. 가운데 보석은 루비이고, 양쪽의 두 보석은 "
"보라색 토파즈입니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1728|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Ring"
msgstr "반지"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1729|field=Name"
msgid "Ethereal Ring"
msgstr "에테르 반지"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1729|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"A hammered white gold ring with a large central diamond and two small "
"pearls, light doesn't fall upon it normally.  The ring glitters and fades "
"unpredictably, as though it were lit by an invisible sun shining in an "
"unseen, yet parallel world.  "
msgstr ""
"커다란 다이아몬드와 두 개의 작은 진주가 박힌, 망치로 두드려 만든 백금 반지. 빛이 반지 위로 비추면 마치 보이지 않는 태양이 비추는 "
"듯 불규칙적으로 반짝였다가 사라지기를 반복한다.  "

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
