msgid "Ring"
msgstr "반지"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=172|field=Name"
msgid "Necrotic Wand of Implosion"
msgstr "사령 내파 마법봉"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=172|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"A unicorn horn capped with a gold set ruby and crowned with a sculpted "
"skull, this wand could only be the creation of the Necromancers' Guild. To "
"use it you must equip it like a weapon."
msgstr ""
"금으로 장식된 루비가 박힌 유니콘 뿔과 조각된 해골 장식이 얹힌 이 지팡이는 오직 네크로맨서 길드만이 만들 수 있는 것이다. 사용하려면 "
"무기처럼 장착해야 한다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=172|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Wand"
msgstr "마법봉"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1730|field=Name"
msgid "Exquisite Ring"
msgstr "정교한 반지"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1730|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"Three opals rimmed with a strange red metal are set in a perfect ring of "
"stalt--a very rare metal found only in southern Erathia."
msgstr ""
"특이한 붉은 금속으로 테두리가 둘러진 세 개의 오팔이 강철로 만든 완벽한 고리에 박혀 있는데, 이 강철은 에라시아 남부에서만 발견되는 "
"매우 희귀한 금속입니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1730|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Ring"
msgstr "반지"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1731|field=Name"
msgid "Scarab Ring"
msgstr "스카라베 반지"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1731|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"A gold band adorned with the shell of a rare beetle found only in the "
"deserts of Enroth.  Treated properly by an alchemist, these shells can be "
"made to hold the mightiest of enchantments."
msgstr ""
"엔로스 사막에서만 발견되는 희귀한 딱정벌레의 껍데기로 장식된 금띠. 연금술사가 제대로 처리하면 이 껍데기에는 가장 강력한 마법을 담을 수"
" 있다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1731|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Ring"
msgstr "반지"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1732|field=Name"
msgid "Turquoise Amulet"
msgstr "터키석 부적"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1732|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"A turquoise stone bracketed by a bronze chain and clasp makes for an "
"inexpensive, yet charming amulet."
msgstr "청동 사슬과 잠금장치로 둘러싸인 터키석은 저렴하면서도 매력적인 부적입니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1732|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Amulet"
msgstr "부적"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1733|field=Name"
msgid "Gothic Amulet"
msgstr "고딕 부적"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1733|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"This bizarre amulet was probably created by some alchemist with a distorted "
"understanding of magic.  The shape and symmetry help to maintain whatever "
"enchantment he put in it."
msgstr ""
"이 기묘한 부적은 아마도 마법에 대한 왜곡된 이해를 가진 연금술사가 만들었을 것이다. 그 모양과 대칭은 그가 걸어놓은 마법을 유지하는 데"
" 도움이 된다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1733|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Amulet"
msgstr "부적"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1734|field=Name"
msgid "Claw Amulet"
msgstr "발톱 부적"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1734|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"The ossified foot of some unknown beast or monster has been inset with a "
"huge, imperfect purple topaz.  It's not pretty, but it's certainly magical."
msgstr ""
"정체를 알 수 없는 짐승이나 괴물의 뼈로 굳어진 발에 크고 불완전한 보라색 토파즈가 박혀 있다. 보기에는 예쁘지 않지만, 분명 마법적인 "
"의미를 지니고 있다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1734|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Amulet"
msgstr "부적"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1735|field=Name"
msgid "Ancient Amulet"
msgstr "고대 부적"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1735|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"This amulet is composed of two pieces:  the front piece is an ancient, "
"perfectly cut rectangle of a strong, stainless metal.  The backing is a much"
" more recent gold chain and clasp.  Careful inspection of the front piece "
"reveals it to be a plaque displaying the name of some long dead soldier or "
"worker.  Symbols on the front probably indicate status and rank."
msgstr ""
"이 부적은 두 부분으로 구성되어 있습니다. 앞면은 단단하고 녹슬지 않는 금속으로 만들어진, 완벽하게 조각된 고대의 직사각형 조각입니다. "
"뒷면은 훨씬 최근에 만들어진 금 사슬과 걸쇠입니다. 앞면을 자세히 살펴보면 오래전에 사망한 군인이나 노동자의 이름이 새겨진 명판임을 알 "
"수 있습니다. 앞면에 새겨진 문양은 아마도 신분과 계급을 나타내는 것으로 보입니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1735|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Amulet"
msgstr "부적"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1736|field=Name"
msgid "Ruby Star Amulet"
msgstr "루비 별 부적"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1736|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"A perfect ruby cut in a star shape and bracketed by a golden clasp give this"
" amulet its name.  When viewed in dim light, a fiery spark can be seen "
"dancing in the center of the gem."
msgstr ""
"별 모양으로 완벽하게 커팅된 루비와 금색 걸쇠가 이 부적에 이름을 붙여주었습니다. 어두운 곳에서 보면 보석 중앙에서 불꽃 같은 광채가 "
"춤추는 것을 볼 수 있습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=1736|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Amulet"
msgstr "부적"

