msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=2017|field=Name"
msgid "Armageddon"
msgstr "아마겟돈"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=2017|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"A spell book.  To learn this spell, pick the book up and left-click over the"
" picture of your character in the inventory screen.  Your character must "
"know the Dark magic skill to learn this spell."
msgstr ""
"마법서입니다. 이 주문을 배우려면 책을 집어 든 뒤 인벤토리 화면에서 캐릭터 그림을 왼쪽 클릭하십시오. 이 주문을 배우려면 어둠 마법 "
"기술을 알아야 합니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=2017|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Book of Learning"
msgstr "마법서"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=2018|field=Name"
msgid "Souldrinker"
msgstr "영혼 흡수"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=2018|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"A spell book.  To learn this spell, pick the book up and left-click over the"
" picture of your character in the inventory screen.  Your character must "
"know the Dark magic skill to learn this spell."
msgstr ""
"마법서입니다. 이 주문을 배우려면 책을 집어 든 뒤 인벤토리 화면에서 캐릭터 그림을 왼쪽 클릭하십시오. 이 주문을 배우려면 어둠 마법 "
"기술을 알아야 합니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
