msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=2018|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Book of Learning"
msgstr "마법서"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=201|field=Name"
msgid "Wolf's Eye"
msgstr "늑대의 눈"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=201|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"An ingredient with alchemical properties, wolf eyes can be used to mix red "
"potions. (To use, pick it up and right-click over an empty potion bottle.)"
msgstr ""
"연금술적 성질을 지닌 재료인 늑대의 눈은 붉은 물약을 만드는 데 사용할 수 있습니다. (사용하려면 시약을 집어 빈 물약 병 위에서 마우스"
" 오른쪽 버튼을 클릭하세요.)"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=201|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Reagent"
msgstr "시약"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=2020|field=Name"
msgid "Mordred"
msgstr "모르드레드"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=2020|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"One of nine such blades in the world, Mordred was made by the Brotherhood in"
" 428 A.S. as part of their first experiments in the development of Dark "
"Magic.  Their hope was to find a way to extend one person's life at the "
"expense of another's, but instead of reversing ages, they merely found a way"
" to steal health.  (Special Powers:  Vampiric)"
msgstr ""
"세상에 단 아홉 자루밖에 없는 모르드레드는 서기 428년, 어둠 마법 개발을 위한 첫 실험의 일환으로 형제단이 제작했습니다. 그들의 "
"목표는 한 사람의 수명을 다른 사람의 수명을 희생시켜 연장하는 것이었지만, 나이를 되돌리는 대신 단순히 건강을 빼앗는 방법만을 "
"발견했습니다. (특수 능력: 흡혈)"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=2020|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Artifact"
msgstr "아티팩트"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=2021|field=Name"
msgid "Thor"
msgstr "토르"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=2021|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"The origins of Thor are lost in time, but this mighty barbarian weapon is "
"well remembered by military historians.  The weapon has been used in battles"
" by many owners for centuries, although its last appearance was at the "
"battle of Shimengard in 902 A.S..  The force of a blow from this hammer is "
"so powerful that it can knock foes several feet back away from the wielder."
"  (Special Powers:  Force)"
msgstr ""
"토르의 기원은 시간의 흐름 속에 묻혀버렸지만, 이 강력한 야만족의 무기는 군사 역사가들에게는 잘 알려져 있습니다. 이 무기는 수 세기 "
"동안 여러 주인의 손에 의해 전투에서 사용되었으며, 마지막으로 등장한 것은 서기 902년 시멘가르드 전투였습니다. 이 망치의 위력은 "
"너무나 강력해서 적을 사용자로부터 수 미터 뒤로 날려버릴 수 있습니다. (특수 능력: 명중한 적을 밀쳐냄)"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=2021|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Artifact"
msgstr "아티팩트"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=2022|field=Name"
msgid "Conan"
msgstr "코난"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=2022|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"This mighty axe is enchanted to destroy dragons and devils.  It has a way of"
" finding an owner who is both likely to come across such monsters and is "
"strong enough to fight them.  (Special Powers:  Devil and Dragon Slaying)"
msgstr ""
"이 강력한 도끼는 드래곤과 악마를 물리칠 수 있도록 마법이 걸려 있습니다. 이 도끼는 드래곤과 악마를 마주칠 가능성이 높고, 그들과 싸울"
" 만큼 강한 주인을 찾아내는 특별한 능력을 지니고 있습니다. (특수 능력: 악마 및 드래곤 사냥)"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=2022|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Artifact"
msgstr "아티팩트"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=2023|field=Name"
msgid "Excalibur"
msgstr "엑스칼리버"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=2023|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"Heavy, yet seemingly light as a feather in skilled hands, Excalibur confers "
"great might upon its wielder.  Opponents do not easily walk away from blows "
"struck by this legendary weapon.  (Special Powers:  +30 Might)"
msgstr ""
"무겁지만 숙련된 손에서는 깃털처럼 가볍게 느껴지는 엑스칼리버는 사용자에게 엄청난 힘을 부여합니다. 이 전설적인 무기에 맞은 적은 쉽게 "
"살아남지 못합니다. (특수 능력: 힘 +30)"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=2023|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Artifact"
msgstr "아티팩트"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=2024|field=Name"
msgid "Merlin"
msgstr "멀린"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=2024|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"Traditionally carried by the High Druid, but lost during struggles over "
"religious doctrine, Merlin acts as a reservoir of spell power the wielder "
"can draw upon at any time.  Merlin is enchanted with swiftness, and rains "
"blows upon enemies much faster than an ordinary staff. (Special Powers:  "
"Swiftness and +40 Spell Points)"
msgstr ""
"전통적으로 최고 드루이드가 휴대하던 멀린은 종교 교리 분쟁 중에 분실되었지만, 사용자가 언제든 끌어낼 수 있는 마법력의 저장소 역할을 "
"합니다. 멀린은 공격 회복 속도를 높이는 마법이 걸려 있어 일반 지팡이보다 훨씬 빠르게 적에게 공격을 퍼붓습니다. (특수 능력: 공격 "
"회복 속도 증가, 주문력 +40)"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=2024|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Artifact"
msgstr "아티팩트"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=2025|field=Name"
msgid "Percival"
msgstr "퍼시벌"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=2025|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"Percival was enchanted by the Archer's Guild in 912 A.S. as the prototype in"
" an enchantment process they were developing at the time.  Unfortunately, a "
"suspicious fire broke out at the guild hall, ruining the development plans "
"and destroying the exotic materials needed to create more Percivals.  The "
"guild never recovered from their losses, and sold Percival to the Elves in "
"918 A.S..  It has since changed hands many times.  (Special Powers:  "
"Swiftness and Carnage)"
msgstr ""
"퍼시벌은 912년 궁수 길드에서 당시 개발 중이던 마법 부여 과정의 시제품으로 제작되었습니다. 하지만 길드 회관에서 의문의 화재가 "
"발생하여 개발 계획이 무산되고, 더 많은 퍼시벌을 만드는 데 필요한 희귀 재료들이 모두 소실되었습니다. 길드는 이 손실에서 회복하지 "
"못하고 918년에 퍼시벌을 엘프족에게 팔았습니다. 이후 퍼시벌은 여러 차례 주인이 바뀌었습니다. (특수 능력: 공격 회복 속도 증가, "
"명중 시 폭발)"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=2025|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Artifact"
msgstr "아티팩트"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=2026|field=Name"
msgid "Galahad"
msgstr "갈라하드"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=2026|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"Perhaps the finest chain mail created since the Silence, Galahad's material "
"strength enchantments are so strong they are somewhat conferred upon the "
"wearer's body, making it capable of withstanding much more abuse than "
"normal.  (Special Powers:  Protection and +25 Hit Points)  "
msgstr ""
"침묵의 시대 이후 만들어진 최고의 사슬 갑옷이라고 할 수 있는 갈라하드의 갑옷은 재질 강도 마법이 매우 강력하여 착용자의 몸에 어느 정도"
" 부여되는 듯한 효과를 발휘하며, 일반적인 갑옷보다 훨씬 더 많은 충격을 견딜 수 있게 해줍니다. (특수 능력: 모든 저항력 +10, "
"생명력 +25)  "

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=2026|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Artifact"
msgstr "아티팩트"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=2027|field=Name"
msgid "Pellinore"
msgstr "펠리노어"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=2027|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"Named after an ancient knight, Pellinore fortifies the wearer with an "
"unnatural health so strong that the wearer heals from serious injuries in a "
"matter of hours.  The armor is quite heavy, and protects the wearer from "
"being knocked about during combat.  (Special Powers:  +30 Endurance, Hit "
"Recovery, and Hit Point Regeneration)"
msgstr ""
"고대 기사의 이름을 딴 펠리노어는 착용자에게 비정상적으로 강력한 체력을 부여하여 심각한 부상도 몇 시간 만에 회복할 수 있게 합니다. 이"
" 갑옷은 상당히 무겁지만, 전투 중 공격을 받아 휘청이는 시간을 줄여줍니다. (특수 능력: 인내력 +30, 피격 회복 속도 증가, 생명력"
" 재생)"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=2027|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Artifact"
msgstr "아티팩트"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=2028|field=Name"
msgid "Valeria"
msgstr "발레리아"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=2028|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"Commissioned by King David IV of Erathia during the Timber Wars, Valeria not"
" only shields the user from normal blows, but helps intercept many incoming "
"arrows by magically focusing the wielder's attention on the flight of the "
"missile.  The same enchantment that makes the shielding effect possible also"
" increases the wielder's accuracy enormously.  (Special Powers:  Shielding "
"and +30 Accuracy)"
msgstr ""
"목재 전쟁 당시 에라시아의 다비드 4세 국왕의 의뢰로 제작된 발레리아는 사용자를 일반적인 공격으로부터 보호할 뿐만 아니라, 마법으로 "
"사용자의 주의를 화살의 궤적에 집중시켜 날아오는 화살을 막아내는 데에도 도움을 줍니다. 보호 효과를 가능하게 하는 동일한 마법은 사용자의"
" 정확도를 크게 향상시켜 줍니다. (특수 능력: 원거리 공격 피해 절반, 정확도 +30)"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=2028|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Artifact"
msgstr "아티팩트"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=2029|field=Name"
msgid "Arthur"
msgstr "아서"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=2029|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"In their endless quest to create the perfect Priest-King, the priests of the"
" Church of the Sun created Arthur and imbued it with the power to heighten "
"the wearer's personal abilities, as well as confer more magical energy.  It "
"worked, heightening their King's natural abilities--and his pride.  In 1073,"
" Leopold VII started a holy war against the rival Church of the Moon, "
"grinding both organizations into poverty and ultimately resulting in their "
"demise.  (Special Powers:  'of the Gods' and +25 Spell Points)"
msgstr ""
"완벽한 사제왕을 만들기 위한 끝없는 탐구 끝에, 태양 교회의 사제들은 아서에게 착용자의 개인적인 능력을 향상시키고 더 많은 마법 에너지를"
" 부여하는 힘을 불어넣었습니다. 이는 효과를 발휘하여 왕의 타고난 능력을 증폭시켰지만, 동시에 그의 교만 또한 키웠습니다. 1073년, "
"레오폴드 7세는 라이벌인 달 교회를 상대로 성전을 일으켰고, 두 교단 모두 극심한 빈곤에 시달리다 결국 멸망에 이르렀습니다. (특수 "
"능력: 모든 능력치 +10, 주문력 +25)"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=2029|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Artifact"
msgstr "아티팩트"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=202|field=Name"
msgid "Phial of Gog Blood"
msgstr "고그의 피 약병"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=202|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"An ingredient with alchemical properties, gog blood can be used to mix red "
"potions. (To use, pick it up and right-click over an empty potion bottle.)"
msgstr ""
"연금술적 성질을 지닌 고그의 피는 붉은 물약을 만드는 데 사용할 수 있습니다. (사용하려면 시약을 집어 빈 물약 병 위에서 마우스 오른쪽"
" 버튼을 클릭하세요.)"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=202|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Reagent"
msgstr "시약"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=2030|field=Name"
msgid "Pendragon"
msgstr "펜드래곤"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=2030|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"This cape originally belonged to Alastair Blane, Master thief of the Shadow "
"Guild.  The cape increased his luck and certain thieving skills "
"tremendously, enabling him to pursue a long and prosperous career.  Blane "
"was never brought to justice for his crimes--he was instead killed over a "
"card game for cheating while wearing the cloak to better his chances.  "
"(Special Powers:  +30 Luck, Thievery, Immunity to Poison)"
msgstr ""
"이 망토는 원래 그림자 길드의 대도둑 알래스테어 블레인의 소유였습니다. 이 망토는 그의 행운과 특정 도둑질 기술을 엄청나게 향상시켜 "
"오랫동안 번창하는 도둑 생활을 할 수 있게 해주었습니다. 블레인은 자신의 범죄에 대한 책임을 지지 않았습니다. 오히려 그는 카드 게임에서"
" 속임수를 쓰다가 이 망토를 착용한 채로 살해당했습니다. (특수 능력: 운 +30, 함정 해제/훔치기 성공 확률 2배, 독 면역)"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=2030|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Artifact"
msgstr "아티팩트"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=2031|field=Name"
msgid "Lucius"
msgstr "루시우스"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=2031|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"No one knows where or when these magical boots were made, but many tales "
"refer to them turning up in the most unusual places.  They grant their "
"wearer superhuman quickness and grace of motion.  (Special Powers:  +30 "
"Speed)"
msgstr ""
"이 마법의 부츠가 어디서 언제 만들어졌는지는 아무도 모르지만, 많은 이야기에서 이 부츠가 아주 특이한 장소에서 발견되었다고 합니다. 이 "
"부츠는 착용자에게 초인적인 민첩성과 우아한 움직임을 부여합니다. (특수 능력: 민첩성 +30)"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=2031|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Artifact"
msgstr "아티팩트"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=2032|field=Name"
msgid "Guinevere"
msgstr "기네비어"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=2032|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"Guinevere was created by the Alchemist Guild under the stones of Castle "
"Kriegspire many years ago.  It boosts the magical resources available to its"
" wearer, and eases the use of spells of the Mirrored Path.  (Special Powers:"
"  +30 Spell Points, 'of Light Magic' and 'of Dark Magic')"
msgstr ""
"기네비어는 오래 전 크리그스파이어 성의 돌 아래에서 연금술사 길드에 의해 만들어졌습니다. 착용자의 마법 자원을 증강시키고 거울의 길 "
"주문을 더 쉽게 사용할 수 있도록 도와줍니다. (특수 능력: 주문력 +30, '빛 마법' 및 '어둠 마법')"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=2032|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Artifact"
msgstr "아티팩트"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=2033|field=Name"
msgid "Igraine"
msgstr "이그레인"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=2033|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"Lord Solomon Stone had this ring commissioned during his tenure as High "
"Priest of the Path in 1018.  It gives a huge boost to a user's ability in "
"clerical magic, as well as access to a good deal of magical energy.  "
"(Special Powers:  +25 Spell Points and 'of Body, Mind, and Spirit Magic')"
msgstr ""
"솔로몬 스톤 경은 1018년, 자신이 길의 대제사장으로 재임하던 시절에 이 반지를 제작하도록 의뢰했습니다. 이 반지는 사용자의 사제 마법"
" 능력을 크게 향상시켜 줄 뿐만 아니라 상당한 양의 마법 에너지를 사용할 수 있게 해줍니다. (특수 능력: 주문력 +25 및 '육체, "
"정신, 영혼 마법')"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=2033|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Artifact"
msgstr "아티팩트"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=2034|field=Name"
msgid "Morgan"
msgstr "모건"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=2034|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"Though Morgan's origins are unknown, Morgan has had many owners in the last "
"hundred years, all of them unknown before finding the amulet.  The amulet is"
" so mighty, as a matter of fact, that any peasant or child that lays hands "
"on it is sure to become a legend in his own time.  (Special Powers:  +20 "
"Spell Points and 'of Fire, Air, Water, and Earth Magic')"
msgstr ""
"모건의 기원은 알려지지 않았지만, 지난 백 년 동안 수많은 주인을 거쳤으며, 그 누구도 부적을 발견하기 전까지는 알려지지 않았습니다. "
"사실 이 부적은 너무나 강력해서, 누구든 손에 넣는 순간 그 시대의 전설이 될 것이 확실합니다. (특수 능력: 주문력 +20, '화염, "
"공기, 물, 대지 마법')"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=2034|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Artifact"
msgstr "아티팩트"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=2035|field=Name"
msgid "Hades"
msgstr "하데스"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=2035|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"A powerful weapon said to have been delivered up from the Netherworld in "
"response to the wish of a prolific mass murderer.  The weapon inflicts "
"terrible wounds with its razor sharp edge and drips acid constantly.  Not "
"only a terrible weapon, the sword bestows the cunning of a master thief for "
"disarming traps and the luck of the devil in escaping the damage they do.  "
"Hades draws its power from its wielder slowly and constantly.  (Special "
"Powers:  +20 Poison Damage, +20 Luck, Thievery, and Negative Regeneration)"
msgstr ""
"연쇄살인범의 소원에 따라 저승에서 내려왔다고 전해지는 강력한 무기입니다. 면도날처럼 날카로운 칼날은 끔찍한 상처를 입히고, 끊임없이 산성"
" 액체를 흘립니다. 무시무시한 무기일 뿐만 아니라, 이 검은 함정을 해제하는 데 탁월한 도둑의 지혜와 함정에서 벗어나는 데 악마의 행운을"
" 부여합니다. 하데스는 사용자의 힘을 천천히, 그리고 끊임없이 흡수합니다. (특수 능력: 독 피해 +20, 운 +20, 함정 해제/훔치기"
" 성공 확률 2배, 생명력 지속 감소)"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=2035|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Relic"
msgstr "성유물"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=2036|field=Name"
msgid "Ares"
msgstr "아레스"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=2036|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"A powerful war-mace, Ares burns with fires from the heart of the mountain it"
" was made from.  The same magic that causes it to burn with a terrible fire "
"bestows resistance to fire upon its wielder.  (Special Powers:  +30 Fire "
"Damage, +25 Fire Resistance)"
msgstr ""
"강력한 전투 철퇴인 아레스는 그것이 만들어진 산의 심장부에서 뿜어져 나오는 불꽃으로 타오릅니다. 무시무시한 불꽃을 일으키는 마법은 동시에"
" 사용자에게 화염 저항력을 부여합니다. (특수 능력: 화염 피해 +30, 화염 저항 +25)"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=2036|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Relic"
msgstr "성유물"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=2037|field=Name"
msgid "Poseidon"
msgstr "포세이돈"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=2037|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"This trident is probably what inspired the Regnan navy to adopt the trident "
"as their favorite weapon of war.  Poseidon fills its wielder with a "
"frightening battle rage, increasing the wielder's might, endurance and "
"accuracy at the cost of personal safety.  So consuming is the wielder's "
"desire to smite his enemies while using Poseidon that he neglects to dodge "
"blows he might otherwise have avoided.  On the other hand, dead enemies "
"(usually) don't fight back.  (Special Powers:  +20 Might, +20 Endurance, +20"
" Accuracy, -10 Armor Class, and -10 Speed)"
msgstr ""
"이 삼지창은 아마도 레그나 해군이 삼지창을 가장 선호하는 전쟁 무기로 채택하게 된 계기가 되었을 것입니다. 포세이돈은 사용자에게 "
"무시무시한 전투 광기를 불어넣어 사용자의 힘, 인내력, 정확도를 증가시키지만, 그 대가로 사용자의 안전은 위협받습니다. 포세이돈을 "
"사용하는 동안 적을 섬멸하려는 욕망에 사로잡힌 사용자는 평소라면 피할 수 있었을 공격조차 회피하지 못합니다. 하지만 죽은 적은 (대개) "
"반격하지 않습니다. (특수 능력: 힘 +20, 인내력 +20, 정확도 +20, 방어력 -10, 민첩성 -10)"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=2037|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Relic"
msgstr "성유물"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=2038|field=Name"
msgid "Cronos"
msgstr "크로노스"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=2038|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"More a magical curiosity than a truly useful weapon, Cronos increases the "
"wielder's vitality fantastically, and decreases his luck by half as much.  "
"(Special Powers:  +100 Hit Points and -50 Luck)"
msgstr ""
"실용적인 무기라기보다는 마법적인 호기심에 가까운 크로노스는 사용자의 생명력을 엄청나게 증가시키는 반면, 행운은 절반만큼 감소시킵니다. "
"(특수 능력: 생명력 +100, 운 -50)"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=2038|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Relic"
msgstr "성유물"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=2039|field=Name"
msgid "Hercules"
msgstr "헤라클레스"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=2039|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"A huge sword meant for the unsubtle, Hercules fills its wielder with the "
"strength of a hundred men.  In keeping with its 'big and stupid' theme, the "
"sword reduces the intelligence of its wielder while held.  (Special Powers:"
"  +50 Might, +20 Endurance, and -30 Intellect)"
msgstr ""
"무식한 자를 위한 거대한 검, 헤라클레스는 소유자에게 백 명의 힘을 부여합니다. '크고 멍청한'이라는 이름에 걸맞게, 이 검은 소유자가 "
"휘두르는 동안 지능을 저하시킵니다. (특수 능력: 힘 +50, 인내력 +20, 지능 -30)"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=2039|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Relic"
msgstr "성유물"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=203|field=Name"
msgid "Ruby"
msgstr "루비"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=203|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"An ingredient with alchemical properties, rubies can be used to mix red "
"potions. (To use, pick it up and right-click over an empty potion bottle.)"
msgstr ""
"연금술적 성질을 지닌 루비는 붉은 물약을 만드는 데 사용할 수 있습니다. (사용하려면 시약을 집어 빈 물약 병 위에서 마우스 오른쪽 "
"버튼을 클릭하세요.)"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=203|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Reagent"
msgstr "시약"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=2040|field=Name"
msgid "Artemis"
msgstr "아르테미스"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=2040|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"Graced with the might of thunder, Artemus fires bolts magically charged with"
" electricity.  While powerful, the user of the bow should be careful--"
"elemental magics seem drawn to the bow, and do more damage when they hit the"
" wielder.  (Special Powers:  +20 Electricity damage, -10 to Elemental "
"Resistances)"
msgstr ""
"천둥의 위력을 지닌 아르테미스는 마법으로 충전된 전기 화살을 발사합니다. 강력한 활이지만, 사용자는 주의해야 합니다. 원소 마법이 활에 "
"끌리는 듯하며, 활에 맞으면 더욱 큰 피해를 입힙니다. (특수 능력: 전기 피해 +20, 원소 저항력 -10)"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=2040|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Relic"
msgstr "성유물"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=2041|field=Name"
msgid "Apollo"
msgstr "아폴로"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=2041|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"This unique armor graces its owner with luck, helping him to escape the "
"brunt of most elemental attacks.  It draws its energy, however, from the "
"constitution of its wearer, making the wearing of this armor a risky "
"proposition.  (Special Powers:  +20 to Resistances, +20 Luck, and -30 "
"Endurance)"
msgstr ""
"이 특별한 갑옷은 착용자에게 행운을 가져다주어 대부분의 원소 공격을 막아낼 수 있도록 도와줍니다. 하지만 착용자의 체력에서 에너지를 "
"흡수하기 때문에 이 갑옷을 착용하는 것은 위험할 수 있습니다. (특수 능력: 모든 저항력 +20, 운 +20, 인내력 -30)"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=2041|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Relic"
msgstr "성유물"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=2042|field=Name"
msgid "Zeus"
msgstr "제우스"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=2042|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"Perhaps this suit of armor was meant only for the Gods.  Worn at times by "
"barbarian chieftains, the armor will increase the physical vitality and "
"magical energy the wearer has at his disposal, but at a terrible cost.  "
"House plants have been known to score higher on intelligence tests than "
"wearers of this armor.  One would think that accidental death would surely "
"follow such a precipitous loss of thought, yet the luck the armor bestows "
"seems to prevent disaster.  Often the wearer of the armor becomes so stupid "
"he forgets to remove it.  (Special Powers:  +50 Hit Points, +50 Spell "
"Points,  +50 Luck, and -50 Intellect)"
msgstr ""
"어쩌면 이 갑옷은 오직 신들만을 위한 것이었을지도 모릅니다. 때때로 야만족 족장들이 착용하기도 하는 이 갑옷은 착용자의 육체적 활력과 "
"마법 에너지를 증가시키지만, 그 대가는 끔찍합니다. 이 갑옷을 입은 사람보다 화분 속 식물이 지능 테스트에서 더 높은 점수를 받는 것으로"
" 알려져 있습니다. 이처럼 급격한 사고력 상실은 불의의 사고로 이어질 것 같지만, 이 갑옷이 부여하는 행운 덕분에 재앙은 일어나지 않는 "
"듯합니다. 종종 갑옷을 입은 사람은 너무 멍청해져서 벗는 것조차 잊어버리기도 합니다. (특수 능력: 생명력 +50, 주문력 +50, 운 "
"+50, 지능 -50)"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=2042|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Relic"
msgstr "성유물"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=2043|field=Name"
msgid "Aegis"
msgstr "아이기스"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=2043|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"Legend has it this shield was given as a gift from the Gods to a man wishing"
" to fight the terrible medusas in their stronghold.  The shield is "
"reflective and prevents the wielder from being frozen by the stoning gaze of"
" the medusa.  It also carries an enchantment that helps protect against "
"arrows, but the shield is very heavy and will slow the user down a bit.  "
"(Special Powers:  Immune to Flesh to Stone effects, Shielding +20 Luck, and "
"-20 Speed)"
msgstr ""
"전설에 따르면 이 방패는 무시무시한 메두사들의 요새에서 싸우고자 하는 한 남자에게 신들이 선물한 것이라고 합니다. 방패는 반사 재질로 "
"되어 있어 메두사의 돌로 변하는 시선으로부터 사용자를 보호합니다. 또한 화살을 막아주는 마법이 걸려 있지만, 방패가 매우 무거워 사용자의"
" 움직임을 다소 느리게 합니다. (특수 능력: 석화 면역, 방패 주문 효과 상시 유지, 운 +20, 민첩성 -20)"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=2043|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Relic"
msgstr "성유물"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=2044|field=Name"
msgid "Odin"
msgstr "오딘"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=2044|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"This crown is a mighty relic that protects against elemental magic attacks "
"of all kinds, but has a flaw that slows the wearer down tremendously.  "
"(Special Powers:  +50 to Elemental Resistances and -40 Speed)"
msgstr ""
"이 왕관은 모든 종류의 원소 마법 공격으로부터 보호해주는 강력한 유물이지만, 착용자의 속도를 현저히 느리게 하는 단점이 있습니다. (특수"
" 능력: 원소 저항력 +50, 민첩성 -40)"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=2044|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Relic"
msgstr "성유물"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=2045|field=Name"
msgid "Atlas"
msgstr "아틀라스"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=2045|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"Legends say this cape was discarded by a God who became annoyed with the "
"cape's magical slowing of his actions.  It confers an incomparable might to "
"its wearer, at a large cost to speed.  (Special Powers:  +100 Might and -40 "
"Speed)"
msgstr ""
"전설에 따르면 이 망토는 신이 자신의 행동을 느리게 만드는 마법에 짜증이 나서 버린 것이라고 합니다. 착용자에게는 비할 데 없는 힘이 "
"부여되지만, 속도는 크게 저하됩니다. (특수 능력: 힘 +100, 민첩성 -40)"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=2045|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Relic"
msgstr "성유물"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=2046|field=Name"
msgid "Hermes"
msgstr "헤르메스"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=2046|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"A relic from before the Silence, these boots must conceal some hidden magic "
"as they are very heavy, yet light once worn.  They act upon the nerves and "
"muscles of their wearer, heightening his speed and reflexes to inhuman "
"levels, but simultaneously causing inaccuracy and over-compensation.  The "
"boots have been owned by many through the ages, all of whom have died from "
"some speed related accident, like running up a hill at blazing speeds and "
"then falling down the cliff at the top.  (Special Powers:  +100 Speed and "
"-40 Accuracy)"
msgstr ""
"침묵의 시대 이전부터 존재했던 이 부츠는 무거운 무게에도 불구하고 신으면 가벼워지는 것으로 보아 숨겨진 마법이 있는 듯하다. 이 부츠는 "
"착용자의 신경과 근육에 작용하여 속도와 반사 신경을 비인간적인 수준으로 끌어올리지만, 동시에 정확도를 떨어뜨리고 과도한 보정을 유발한다."
" 오랜 세월 동안 많은 이들이 이 부츠를 소유했지만, 모두 속도와 관련된 사고로 목숨을 잃었다. 예를 들어, 언덕을 엄청난 속도로 "
"뛰어오르다가 정상 절벽에서 떨어지는 경우처럼 말이다. (특수 능력: 민첩성 +100, 정확도 -40)"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=2046|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Relic"
msgstr "성유물"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=2047|field=Name"
msgid "Aphrodite"
msgstr "아프로디테"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=2047|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"Desired and sought after by the foolish for ages, this beautiful ring "
"smoothes the skin, clears the voice, and dramatically improves the physical "
"beauty of its wearer, as well as enhancing the personality.  The ring also "
"carries a curse of ill luck, and the wearer usually dies of some tragic "
"accident soon after finding the ring.  (Special Powers:  +100 Personality "
"and -40 Luck)"
msgstr ""
"오랜 세월 동안 어리석은 자들의 욕망과 갈망을 불러일으켰던 이 아름다운 반지는 피부를 매끄럽게 하고 목소리를 맑게 하며 착용자의 외모를 "
"극적으로 개선할 뿐만 아니라 인격까지 향상시켜 줍니다. 하지만 이 반지는 불운의 저주를 품고 있어, 착용자는 반지를 발견한 직후 비극적인"
" 사고로 죽음을 맞이하는 경우가 많습니다. (특수 능력: 인격 +100, 운 -40)"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=2047|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Relic"
msgstr "성유물"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=2048|field=Name"
msgid "Athena"
msgstr "아테나"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=2048|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"Also known as the Scholar's Ring, Athena vastly sharpens and improves the "
"intellect of its wearer at the cost physical might.  Though the effect upon "
"the physical body is nearly crippling, most sorcerers find the temptation to"
" wear the ring too great to resist.  (Special Powers:  +100 Intellect and "
"-40 Might)"
msgstr ""
"학자의 반지로도 알려진 아테나 반지는 착용자의 지능을 크게 향상시키지만, 그 대가로 육체적인 힘을 약화시킵니다. 신체에 미치는 영향은 "
"거의 치명적이지만, 대부분의 마법사들은 이 반지를 착용하고 싶은 유혹을 떨쳐내기 어렵습니다. (특수 능력: 지능 +100, 힘 -40)"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=2048|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Relic"
msgstr "성유물"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=2049|field=Name"
msgid "Hera"
msgstr "헤라"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=2049|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"Sometimes referred to as the Amulet of the Fool, this curious relic from "
"before the Silence dramatically increases the personal vitality, magical "
"energy, and luck of the wearer at the expense of personality.  While the "
"armor is worn, the face goes slack, the eyes vacant, and the voice subsides "
"to a monotone.  (Special Powers:  +50 Hit Points, +50 Spell Points, +50 "
"Luck, and -50 Personality)"
msgstr ""
"때때로 '바보의 부적'이라고도 불리는 이 기묘한 유물은 침묵의 시대 이전부터 존재해 왔으며, 착용자의 활력, 마법 에너지, 행운을 "
"극적으로 증가시키지만, 그 대가로 인격이 저하됩니다. 이 목걸이를 착용하는 동안 얼굴은 무표정해지고, 눈빛은 공허해지며, 목소리는 "
"단조로워집니다. (특수 능력: 생명력 +50, 주문력 +50, 운 +50, 인격 -50)"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=2049|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Relic"
msgstr "성유물"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=204|field=Name"
msgid "Phoenix Feather"
msgstr "불사조 깃털"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=204|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"An ingredient with alchemical properties, phoenix feathers can be used to "
"mix red potions. (To use, pick it up and right-click over an empty potion "
"bottle.)"
msgstr ""
"연금술적 성질을 지닌 불사조 깃털은 붉은 물약을 만드는 데 사용할 수 있습니다. (사용하려면 시약을 집어 빈 물약 병 위에서 마우스 "
"오른쪽 버튼을 클릭하세요.)"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=204|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Reagent"
