msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=2053|field=Name"
msgid "Hourglass of Time"
msgstr "시간의 모래시계"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=2053|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"Quest Item: A fine hourglass made of crystal, framed with teak wood and "
"filled with crushed pearl dust.  It is obviously enchanted."
msgstr "퀘스트 아이템: 티크 나무 테두리에 진주 가루가 가득 담긴 아름다운 수정 모래시계. 마법이 걸려 있는 것이 분명하다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=2053|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Hourglass"
msgstr "모래시계"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=2054|field=Name"
msgid "Sacred Chalice"
msgstr "성배"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=2054|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"Quest Item: A chalice of silver with white gold tracery work detailing the "
"sides and base.  A faint, steady humming sound can be heard coming from the "
"cup of the chalice."
msgstr ""
"퀘스트 아이템: 은으로 만들어졌으며 측면과 바닥 부분에는 백금 세공이 되어 있습니다. 성배에서는 희미하고 꾸준한 윙윙거리는 소리가 "
"들립니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=2054|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Chalice"
msgstr "성배"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=2055|field=Name"
msgid "Horn of Ros"
msgstr "로스의 뿔"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=2055|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"A horn from the dragon Ros, killed during the Night of Shooting Stars.  This"
" horn enables its owner to more accurately sense the wounds of his opponent."
msgstr "별똥별의 밤에 죽은 용 로스의 뿔. 이 뿔을 가진 자는 상대방의 상처를 더욱 정확하게 감지할 수 있다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=2055|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Horn"
msgstr "뿔"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=2056|field=Name"
msgid "Diamond"
msgstr "다이아몬드"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=2056|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"A large Enrothian diamond, flawless and brilliant. As a gem quality stone it"
" has no magical properties, so you might as well sell it."
msgstr ""
"흠집 하나 없이 광채가 뛰어난 대형 엔로스산 다이아몬드입니다. 보석으로서의 품질은 좋지만 마법적인 효능은 없으니, 파시는 게 나을지도 "
"모르겠습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=2056|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Gem"
msgstr "보석"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=2057|field=Name"
msgid "Moonstone"
