msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=22|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"These daggers are often carried by members of the Necromancers' Guild. The "
"crystals used for the blades are found in the Shadowspire mountains. They "
"are incredibly sharp, but have a tendency to shatter."
