msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=258|field=Name"
msgid "Water Resistance"
msgstr "물 저항"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=258|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"Increases temporary Water Resistance by three times the strength of the "
"potion for 30 minutes per point of strength of the potion.  (To drink, pick "
"the potion up and right-click over a character's portrait.  To mix, pick the"
" potion up and right-click over another potion.)"
msgstr ""
"물약의 효능 1포인트당 30분 동안 물 저항을 물약 효능의 3배만큼 증가시킵니다. (마시려면 물약을 집어 들고 캐릭터 초상화를 오른쪽 "
"클릭하십시오. 두 개의 물약을 섞으려면 물약 하나를 집어 들고 다른 물약 위에 오른쪽 클릭하십시오.)"

