msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=49|field=Name"
msgid "Minotaur Campaign Pole-axe"
msgstr "미노타우로스 원정용 장대도끼"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=49|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"When the Minotaurs went to war with the Frost Giants of faraway Vori, their "
"king Balthazar commissioned this polearm to arm his troops. He reportedly "
"said, \"Since they will be gone so long, arm them with something "
"versatile.\""
msgstr ""
"미노타우로스가 멀리 떨어진 보리의 서리 거인들과 전쟁을 벌일 때, 미노타우로스의 왕 발타자르는 병사들을 무장시키기 위해 이 창을 "
"제작하도록 명했다. 그는 \"오랜 시간 동안 전쟁터에 나가 있어야 하니, 다용도로 쓸 수 있는 무기를 주어라\"라고 말했다고 전해진다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=49|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Halberd"
msgstr "미늘창"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=4|field=Name"
msgid "Templar's Sword"
msgstr "템플러의 검"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=4|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"A sword for a true swordsman. Its lack of ornamentation bespeaks of the "
"singular purpose of its design."
msgstr "진정한 검객을 위한 검. 장식이 없는 것은 오직 검의 목적만을 위해 만들어졌음을 보여준다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=4|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Longsword"
msgstr "장검"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=500|field=Name"
msgid "Elsenrail"
msgstr "엘센레일"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=500|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"(Accuracy +40, 10-20 points of Light damage) The Forge of Chaos was "
"destroyed in the making of the Swords of Balance. Legend says the Blade of "
"Light, Elsenrail, and the Blade of Dark, Glomenthal, will play major roles "
"in the last act of the universe."
msgstr ""
"(정확도 +40, 빛 속성 피해 10-20) 혼돈의 대장간은 균형의 검을 만드는 과정에서 파괴되었습니다. 전설에 따르면 빛의 검 "
"엘센레일과 어둠의 검 글로멘탈은 우주의 마지막 장에서 중요한 역할을 할 것이라고 합니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=500|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Artifact Longsword"
msgstr "아티팩트 장검"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=501|field=Name"
msgid "Glomenthal"
msgstr "글로멘탈"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=501|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"(Might +40, 10-20 points of Dark damage) The Forge of Chaos was destroyed in"
" the making of the Swords of Balance. Legend says the Blade of Light, "
"Elsenrail, and the Blade of Dark, Glomenthal, will play major roles in the "
"last act of the universe."
msgstr ""
"(힘 +40, 어둠 속성 피해 10-20) 혼돈의 대장간은 균형의 검을 만드는 과정에서 파괴되었습니다. 전설에 따르면 빛의 검 엘센레일과"
" 어둠의 검 글로멘탈은 우주의 마지막 장에서 중요한 역할을 할 것이라고 합니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=501|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Artifact Longsword"
msgstr "아티팩트 장검"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=502|field=Name"
msgid "Terminus"
msgstr "터미너스"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=502|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"(Armsmaster skill +7, Air Resistance +30) As a child, before he carved his "
"barbarian kingdom in Vori, Lars Eilief found this sword deep in an ice cave."
" When he died, it was set adrift with him on his funeral barge. How it ended"
" up in Jadame is a mystery."
msgstr ""
"(무기 전문가 기술 +7, 공기 저항 +30) 어린 시절, 보리에서 야만족 왕국을 세우기 전, 라스 에일리프는 얼음 동굴 깊은 곳에서 이"
" 검을 발견했습니다. 그가 죽었을 때, 이 검은 그의 장례용 배에 실려 함께 표류했습니다. 이 검이 어떻게 제이덤에 오게 되었는지는 "
"미스터리입니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=502|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Artifact Broadsword"
msgstr "아티팩트 브로드소드"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=503|field=Name"
msgid "Judicious Measure"
msgstr "신중한 척도"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=503|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"(Endurance +40, Luck +40, Ogre Slaying) Before there was a Regnan Empire, "
"the ancestors of the Trolls of Ironsand lived on Regna Island. With this "
"blade and a horde of sea raiders, Hareck I ousted the Trolls and formed his "
"pirate nation."
msgstr ""
"(인내력 +40, 운 +40, 오우거 사냥) 레그나 제국이 세워지기 전, 아이언샌드 트롤의 후손들은 레그나 섬에 살았습니다. 하렉 1세는"
" 이 검과 해적 무리를 이끌고 트롤들을 몰아내고 해적 국가를 세웠습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=503|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Artifact Cutlass"
msgstr "아티팩트 커틀러스"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=504|field=Name"
msgid "Elderaxe"
msgstr "엘더액스"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=504|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"(Might +20, Swift, 6-12 points of Cold damage, Minotaur) When the Dark "
"Dwarves carved the first Minotaur labyrinth into the heart of Mt. Ashenbane "
"they forged this axe for Xaxius, the first herdmaster."
msgstr ""
"(힘 +20, 공격 회복 속도 증가, 냉기 피해 6-12점, 미노타우로스) 어둠의 드워프들이 재의 산 심장부에 최초의 미노타우로스 미궁을"
" 파냈을 때, 그들은 초대 목동인 자시우스를 위해 이 도끼를 만들었습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=504|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Artifact Axe"
msgstr "아티팩트 도끼"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=505|field=Name"
msgid "Volcano"
msgstr "화산"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=505|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"(10-20 points of Fire damage, Fire Resistance +40) The mad artificer, "
"Cornelius of Blackshire, built this axe for the purpose of clearing the "
"trees around his country estate. \"A single blow will both fell a tree and "
"render it into firewood!\" he was heard to exclaim. That he was soon found "
"slain and the axe gone missing is proof that someone saw a better use for "
"the tool."
msgstr ""
"(화염 피해 10-20점, 화염 저항 +40) 블랙샤이어의 미치광이 장인 코넬리우스는 자신의 영지 주변 나무들을 베어내기 위해 이 도끼를"
" 만들었다. \"한 번 휘두르면 나무를 쓰러뜨리고 장작으로 만들 수 있다!\"라고 그는 외치곤 했다. 하지만 그가 곧 살해당하고 도끼가 "
"사라진 것은 누군가가 그 도끼를 더 유용하게 사용했음을 증명한다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=505|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Artifact Two-Handed Axe"
msgstr "아티팩트 양손 도끼"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=506|field=Name"
msgid "Wyrm Spitter"
msgstr "웜 스피터"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=506|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"(Endurance +20, Dragon Slaying, Swift) Arguably the best dragon hunter of "
"all times, Sir Ryan Smedly carried this mighty spear with him on all his "
"expeditions, claiming that with it in hand, he could best any dragon in "
"single combat. This proved true, but nevertheless he was slain by no less "
"than a dozen dragons who ambushed him at Shadowmarsh Pass."
msgstr ""
"(인내력 +20, 드래곤 사냥, 공격 회복 속도 증가) 역대 최고의 드래곤 사냥꾼으로 손꼽히는 라이언 스메들리 경은 모든 원정에서 이 "
"강력한 창을 휴대하며, 이 창만 있으면 어떤 드래곤과도 일대일로 싸워 이길 수 있다고 자부했습니다. 그의 주장은 사실이었지만, 결국 그는"
" 섀도우매시 고개에서 매복 공격을 가한 12마리가 넘는 드래곤들에게 목숨을 잃었습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=506|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Artifact Spear"
msgstr "아티팩트 창"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=507|field=Name"
msgid "Guardian"
msgstr "수호자"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=507|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"(+10 to all attributes, 10-20 points of Body damage) The great Vampire, "
"Korbu was known to use living men to guard his crypt during daylight hours. "
"Compelled by a spell of enslavement, these sorry souls would walk their "
"rounds carrying these mighty halberds. When Korbu mysteriously vanished, and"
" the slave spell failed, a few of these weapons appeared in the larger "
"world."
msgstr ""
"(모든 능력치 +10, 육체 피해 10-20) 위대한 뱀파이어 코르부는 낮 시간 동안 자신의 무덤을 지키기 위해 산 인간들을 이용했다고 "
"전해진다. 노예 주문에 묶인 이 불쌍한 영혼들은 이 강력한 미늘창을 들고 순찰을 돌았다. 코르부가 불가사의하게 사라지고 노예 주문이 "
"풀리자, 이 무기들 중 일부가 세상에 나타났다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=507|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Artifact Halberd"
msgstr "아티팩트 미늘창"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=508|field=Name"
msgid "Foulfang"
msgstr "파울팡"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=508|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"(Vampiric, 10 points of Poison damage, Vampire) At the conclusion of the "
"Vampires' War of the Chalice, Korbu exacted horrific retribution on his "
"defeated enemy, Calden Fain. It is better for the world that knowledge of "
"the necromantic arts which rendered Fain--body and soul--into this living "
"blade, is lost."
msgstr ""
"(흡혈, 독 피해 10점, 뱀파이어) 성배 전쟁의 종결 후, 코르부는 패배한 적 칼덴 페인에게 끔찍한 복수를 가했습니다. 페인의 육신과 "
"영혼을 이 살아있는 검으로 만든 강령술에 대한 지식이 사라진 것이 세상에 더 나은 일입니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=508|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Artifact Long Dagger"
msgstr "아티팩트 장단검"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=509|field=Name"
msgid "Scepter of Kings"
msgstr "왕의 홀"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=509|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"(Personality + 40, Regenerate Hit Points) Uri Hossana, King of the Western "
"Elves, also called \"The Drunken King,\" was deposed the day he carelessly "
"misplaced his scepter of office while on a hunting trip. This proved to be "
"the last blunder of an incapable ruler. His advisors relieved him of his "
"crown and left him to fend for himself in the Howling Marsh. He was never "
"seen again."
msgstr ""
"(인격 +40, 생명력 회복) 서부 엘프의 왕이자 \"술주정뱅이 왕\"으로도 불렸던 우리 호사나는 사냥 여행 중 부주의하게 왕권을 "
"상징하는 홀을 잃어버린 날 폐위되었습니다. 이는 무능한 통치자의 마지막 실책이었습니다. 그의 고문들은 왕관을 빼앗고 그를 울부짖는 늪에 "
"홀로 남겨두었습니다. 그 후 그는 다시는 나타나지 않았습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=509|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Artifact Mace"
msgstr "아티팩트 철퇴"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=50|field=Name"
msgid "Labyrinth Grapple"
msgstr "미궁 갈고리"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=50|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"Minotaurs have very little tolerance for intruders in their hallowed mazes. "
"This fact is well evidenced in the attention paid to weapons constructed for"
" the labyrinth guards."
msgstr ""
"미노타우로스는 신성한 미궁에 침입자가 들어오는 것을 극도로 꺼린다. 이는 미궁 경비병들을 위해 제작된 무기에 쏟은 정성에서 잘 드러난다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=50|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Halberd"
msgstr "미늘창"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=510|field=Name"
msgid "Breaker"
msgstr "파쇄자"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=510|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"(Might +20, Endurance +20, 10-20 points of Body damage) Trollish folklore is"
" full of the fables of Sevenstrong Burlfist who with Biter, his faithful "
"wolf companion, and his mighty club, Breaker, endlessly quested for the "
"Silver Rose. Fables? One must wonder, if Breaker exists, then why not too, "
"the Silver Rose?"
msgstr ""
"(힘 +20, 인내력 +20, 육체 피해 10-20) 트롤족의 전설에는 충실한 늑대 동반자 바이터와 강력한 곤봉 브레이커와 함께 은빛 "
"장미를 찾아 끊임없이 모험을 떠난 세븐스트롱 벌피스트에 대한 이야기가 가득합니다. 전설일 뿐이라고요? 브레이커가 실존한다면 은빛 장미도 "
"존재하지 않을 이유가 없지 않을까요?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=510|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Artifact Club"
msgstr "아티팩트 곤봉"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=511|field=Name"
msgid "Staff of the Swamp"
msgstr "늪의 지팡이"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=511|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"(of Shielding; Immune to disease, paralysis, and poison) Nemerit, an "
"otherwise unremarkable witch of the last era, was renown for her staff "
"artificing skill. She created a staff for every conceivable use. It is said "
"she carried this staff on reagent collecting trips into the swamplands."
msgstr ""
"(원거리 공격 피해 절반; 질병, 마비, 독 면역) 지난 시대의 평범한 마녀였던 네메릿은 지팡이 제작 기술로 유명했습니다. 그녀는 상상할"
" 수 있는 모든 용도의 지팡이를 만들었습니다. 전해지는 이야기에 따르면 그녀는 늪지대로 시약 채집 여행을 갈 때 이 지팡이를 항상 가지고"
" 다녔다고 합니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=511|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Artifact Staff"
msgstr "아티팩트 지팡이"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=512|field=Name"
msgid "Longseeker"
msgstr "롱시커"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=512|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"(Accuracy +50, Swift, Bow skill +4) Legends tell of many great archer "
"heroes, but none greater than Brennan Morland of whom it was said once "
"pierced a gold sovereign at 300 paces in an archery tournament. Now, holding"
" his bow you must wonder if the legend owes more to the bow than the man."
msgstr ""
"(정확도 +50, 공격 회복 속도 증가, 활 기술 +4) 수많은 위대한 궁수 영웅들의 이야기가 전해지지만, 그중에서도 브레넌 모랜드만큼 "
"뛰어난 영웅은 없었다. 그는 양궁 대회에서 300보 거리에서 금화를 꿰뚫었다는 전설이 있다. 이제 그의 활을 들고 있는 그를 보면, 그 "
"전설이 과연 그 사람 덕분이었을지, 아니면 활 덕분이었을지 궁금해진다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=512|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Artifact Bow"
msgstr "아티팩트 활"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=513|field=Name"
msgid "Serendine's Preservation"
msgstr "세렌딘의 보존"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=513|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"(Regenerates Spell Points, Endurance +30) A mage known as much for frailty "
"of body as for magical prowess, Serendine of Freehaven built this armor to "
"make the most of his strengths and the least of his weaknesses."
msgstr ""
"(주문력 회복, 인내력 +30) 마법 실력만큼이나 허약한 체질로 유명한 프리헤이븐의 세렌딘은 자신의 강점을 극대화하고 약점을 최소화하기 "
"위해 이 갑옷을 제작했습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=513|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Artifact Leather Armor"
msgstr "아티팩트 가죽 갑옷"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=514|field=Name"
msgid "Glomenmail"
msgstr "글로멘메일"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=514|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"(+10 to all statistics, +10 to all resistances, Dark Elf) Dark and Light "
"Elven dealings have been peaceable, if uneasy, for centuries. Before that "
"there was nothing but war. Few suits of this Dark Elven war armor have "
"survived the ravages of time. Those that have are understandably, coveted."
msgstr ""
"(모든 능력치 +10, 모든 저항력 +10, 다크 엘프) 다크 엘프와 라이트 엘프는 수 세기 동안 불안정하긴 했지만 평화로운 관계를 "
"유지해 왔습니다. 그 이전에는 전쟁밖에 없었습니다. 이 다크 엘프 전투 갑옷은 세월의 흐름 속에서 살아남은 것이 거의 없습니다. 살아남은"
" 갑옷들은 당연히 귀하게 여겨집니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=514|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Artifact Chainmail"
msgstr "아티팩트 사슬 갑옷"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=515|field=Name"
msgid "Supreme Plate"
msgstr "최상급 판금 갑옷"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=515|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"(Swift, +15 Speed, +15 Accuracy, Knight) Each grandmaster of the Blackshire "
"Armorers' Guild creates a masterpiece suit of plate as proof of his right to"
" hold his station. It is not unusual for a guild member to spend ten to "
"twenty years in the creation of one of these suits."
msgstr ""
"(공격 회복 속도 증가, 민첩성 +15, 정확도 +15, 기사) 블랙샤이어 갑옷 제작자 길드의 각 대장장은 자신의 지위를 증명하기 위해 "
"걸작 판금 갑옷 한 벌을 제작합니다. 길드원이 이러한 갑옷 한 벌을 제작하는 데 10년에서 20년이 걸리는 것은 드문 일이 아닙니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=515|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Artifact Plate Armor"
msgstr "아티팩트 판금 갑옷"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=516|field=Name"
msgid "Eclipse"
msgstr "일식"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=516|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"Quest Item: (of Spirit, of Body, of Mind, Cleric) When the First Temple of "
"the Sun was burned in the War of Dove and Crow fought between the Sun and "
"Moon temples, the holy altar was melted. The altar's metal was later "
"collected and incorporated into this shield carried by Sun Priest Derico "
"during his final deciding campaign of the war."
msgstr ""
"퀘스트 아이템: (영혼 마법, 육체 마법, 정신 마법, 성직자) 태양 신전과 달 신전 사이에서 벌어진 비둘기와 까마귀의 전쟁에서 태양 "
"신전이 불타 없어졌을 때, 성스러운 제단은 녹아버렸습니다. 그 제단의 금속은 나중에 수습되어 태양 사제 데리코가 전쟁의 마지막 결정적인 "
"전투에서 사용했던 이 방패에 사용되었습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=516|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Artifact Large Shield"
msgstr "아티팩트 대형 방패"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=517|field=Name"
msgid "Fleetfingers"
msgstr "날랜손가락"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=517|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"(+8 to Disarm Trap, Bow, and Armsmaster skills) That she would actually have"
" a name for her gloves, is evidence of the flamboyant, if deserved, conceit "
"of Darcie Darby--most widely known for her theft of the bejeweled Rod of "
"Right, part of the royal regalia of Enroth."
msgstr ""
"(함정 해제 기술 +8, 활 기술 +8, 무기 전문가 기술 +8) 그녀가 장갑에 이름을 붙였다는 사실은, 엔로스 왕실 보물 중 하나인 "
"보석 박힌 정의의 지팡이를 훔친 것으로 가장 널리 알려진 다아시 다비의 화려하고도 당연한 자만심을 보여주는 증거이다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=517|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Artifact Gauntlets"
msgstr "아티팩트 건틀릿"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=518|field=Name"
msgid "Herald's Boots"
msgstr "전령의 장화"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=518|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"(Speed + 30, Swift, Immunity to Sleep) When Jerico Ironfist secured the "
"throne in the First War of Enrothian Succession, he sent forth heralds to "
"spread the news. They were given pairs of these boots so the news would be "
"spread quickly and thus soonest end widespread civil unrest."
msgstr ""
"(민첩성 +30, 공격 회복 속도 증가, 수면 면역) 제1차 엔로스 왕위 계승 전쟁에서 제리코 아이언피스트가 왕위를 차지했을 때, 그는 "
"소식을 전하기 위해 전령들을 보냈습니다. 전령들에게는 이 부츠가 지급되었는데, 이는 소식이 신속하게 퍼져나가 광범위한 내란을 조속히 "
"종식시키기 위한 것이었습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=518|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Artifact Boots"
msgstr "아티팩트 장화"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=519|field=Name"
msgid "Ring of Planes"
msgstr "차원의 반지"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=519|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"(+40 to Fire, Earth, Water and Air resistances) When the cartographer Alvia "
"Morrania went to chart the terrain of the elemental planes she went well "
"prepared. This ring of general protection was among the many special items "
"commissioned by the Enrothian courts in support of her expedition."
msgstr ""
"(화염, 대지, 물, 공기 저항 +40) 지도 제작자 알비아 모라니아는 정령계의 지형을 탐사하기 위해 만반의 준비를 갖추고 떠났습니다. "
"이 보호 반지는 엔로스 궁정에서 그녀의 탐험을 지원하기 위해 특별히 제작한 여러 물품 중 하나였습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=519|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Artifact Ring"
msgstr "아티팩트 반지"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=51|field=Name"
msgid "Hayfork"
msgstr "건초용 쇠스랑"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=51|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"Though a common farming implement, this hayfork is of sturdy construction "
"and could be an excellent, if improvised, weapon."
msgstr "이 건초 포크는 흔한 농기구이지만, 견고한 구조로 되어 있어 즉석에서 무기로 사용하기에도 훌륭한 도구가 될 수 있습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=51|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Trident"
msgstr "삼지창"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=520|field=Name"
msgid "Drogg's Helm"
msgstr "드로그의 투구"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=520|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"(Personality +15, Intellect +15, Regenerates Hit Points) In the history of "
"the barbarian tribes of Vori, it is rare to find a long reigning chieftain. "
"Rarer still is one who held his position through magic rather than might. "
"Drogg was such--a warrior mage who survived many years of rival challenges. "
"It is said that he wore his helmet, even in sleep. Now that you possess it, "
"you understand why."
msgstr ""
"(인격 +15, 지능 +15, 생명력 회복) 보리 야만족의 역사에서 오랫동안 통치한 족장은 드물다. 더욱 드문 것은 무력이 아닌 마법으로"
" 그 자리를 지킨 족장이다. 드로그는 바로 그런 인물이었다. 수많은 경쟁자들의 도전을 이겨낸 전사 마법사. 전해지는 이야기에 따르면 그는"
" 잠잘 때조차 투구를 쓰고 있었다. 이제 당신이 그 투구를 손에 넣었으니, 그 이유를 알게 될 것이다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=520|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Artifact Helm"
msgstr "아티팩트 투구"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=521|field=Name"
msgid "Crown of Final Dominion"
msgstr "최종 지배의 왕관"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=521|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"(Intellect +50, of Dark Magic, Lich) So named by its creator and only "
"sovereign wearer, Mederon, the first and last Lich Emperor of Nighon. The "
"everlasting dynasty he hoped to found lasted barely a dozen years. Mederon "
"escaped the fate of his kingdom. It is said he still lives as a madman and "
"searches the world for his lost crown."
msgstr ""
"(지능 +50, 어둠 마법, 리치) 이 왕관은 창조자이자 유일한 착용자였던 나이곤의 초대이자 마지막 리치 황제 메데론의 이름을 따서 "
"지어졌습니다. 그가 세우고자 했던 영원한 왕조는 겨우 10여 년밖에 지속되지 못했습니다. 메데론은 왕국의 운명에서 벗어났고, 지금도 "
"미치광이로 살아가며 잃어버린 왕관을 찾아 세상을 떠돌아다닌다고 전해집니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=521|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Artifact Crown"
msgstr "아티팩트 왕관"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=522|field=Name"
msgid "Archangel Wings"
msgstr "대천사의 날개"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=522|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"(Feather Falling, Intellect + 30, All magic resistances + 10) When Angels "
"fall from grace, they lose their wings. Since this is an event of extreme "
"infrequency, angel wings are a very rare commodity. Archangel wings are "
"almost never seen. When used as a material, they imbue the resulting item "
"with fantastic powers."
msgstr ""
"(깃털 낙하, 지능 +30, 모든 마법 저항력 +10) 천사가 타락하면 날개를 잃습니다. 이러한 일이 극히 드물게 발생하기 때문에 천사의"
" 날개는 매우 희귀한 것입니다. 대천사의 날개는 거의 찾아볼 수 없습니다. 재료로 사용될 경우, 만들어진 아이템에 놀라운 힘을 "
"부여합니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=522|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Artifact Cloak"
msgstr "아티팩트 망토"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=523|field=Name"
msgid "Snake"
msgstr "뱀"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=523|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"(Slows target, Water Resistance -50, Personality -15) The pommel of this "
"sword is gruesomely butted by a shrunken medusa's head. Though greatly "
"diminished, the medusa's power flows along Snake's blade and into its "
"targets--a good design, but poorly implemented, for some of the negative "
"energies flow into the sword's wielder as well."
msgstr ""
"(대상 공격 회복 속도 감소, 물 저항 -50, 인격 -15) 이 검의 손잡이 끝에는 끔찍하게 축소된 메두사의 머리가 박혀 있다. 비록 "
"크게 약해졌지만, 메두사의 힘은 뱀의 검날을 따라 흘러 대상에게 전달된다. 디자인은 훌륭하지만, 일부 부정적인 에너지가 검을 휘두르는 "
"자에게도 흘러들어가는 것은 구현상의 문제다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=523|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Relic Longsword"
msgstr "성유물 장검"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=524|field=Name"
msgid "Havoc"
msgstr "대혼란"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=524|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"(Speed +70, Accuracy +70, Armor Class -20) Havoc's enchantment makes it able"
" to readily defeat any target's defenses. Unfortunately, its aggressive "
"spirit makes it indifferent to parrying movements."
msgstr ""
"(민첩성 +70, 정확도 +70, 방어력 -20) 대혼란은 특수 능력 덕분에 어떤 대상의 방어도 손쉽게 무너뜨릴 수 있습니다. 하지만 "
"공격적인 성격 탓에 패링 동작에는 전혀 반응하지 않습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=524|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Relic Longsword"
msgstr "성유물 장검"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=525|field=Name"
msgid "Finality"
msgstr "종결"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=525|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"(10-20 points of Fire damage, Slow, Speed -20) When the arch assassin, "
"Demetri Razen was finally brought to justice, it was found that his skin was"
" granted unusual hardness by a permanent enchantment. Normal blades would "
"not cut him, so Finality was forged to deliver the death blow sentenced by "
"the Enrothian courts. "
msgstr ""
"(화염 피해 10-20, 공격 회복 속도 감소, 민첩성 -20) 대암살자 데메트리 라젠이 마침내 재판정에 섰을 때, 그의 피부는 영구적인"
" 마법으로 인해 비정상적으로 단단해진 것으로 밝혀졌습니다. 일반 칼로는 그를 베지 못했기에, 엔로스 법원이 선고한 사형을 집행하기 위해 "
"'종결'이라는 검이 만들어졌습니다. "

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=525|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Relic Two-Handed Sword"
msgstr "성유물 양손검"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=526|field=Name"
msgid "Hell's Cleaver"
msgstr "지옥의 도끼"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=526|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"(Might + 70, Accuracy +70, Personality -50, Intellect -50) So called because"
" of its power to demonize its wielder, nevertheless, there are many who "
"would willingly pay the price for the power offered by \"Hell's Cleaver.\""
msgstr ""
"(힘 +70, 정확도 +70, 인격 -50, 지능 -50) 사용자를 악마화시키는 힘 때문에 '지옥의 도끼'라고 불리지만, 그 힘을 얻기 "
"위해 기꺼이 대가를 치르려는 자들이 많다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=526|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Relic Axe"
msgstr "성유물 도끼"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=527|field=Name"
msgid "Spiritslayer"
msgstr "영혼 학살자"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=527|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"(Vampiric, Might +50, Luck -40) Many under the rule of Luthiner the Severe "
"saw the existence of his spear Spiritslayer as proof of the existence of "
"evil. The injuries caused by the spear go beyond the physical as "
"Spiritslayer takes a strike as an opportunity to drink its target's very "
"essence."
msgstr ""
"(흡혈, 힘 +50, 운 -40) 엄격한 루시너의 지배 아래 있던 많은 이들은 그의 창 '영혼 학살자'의 존재를 악의 증거로 여겼다. 이"
" 창에 의한 부상은 단순한 육체적 고통을 넘어, '영혼 학살자'는 공격을 통해 대상의 정수를 빨아들이는 능력을 지니고 있다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=527|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Relic Spear"
msgstr "성유물 창"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=528|field=Name"
msgid "Trident of Rulership"
msgstr "통치의 삼지창"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=528|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"(Water Breathing, +70 Water Resistance, -70 Fire Resistance) The Trident of "
"Rulership was never meant to be on dry land, yet when the once mighty, ocean"
" to ocean, Triton empire collapsed, many of its greatest artifacts including"
" those of its royal treasure were looted and made their way to the surface."
msgstr ""
"(수중 호흡, 물 저항 +70, 화염 저항 -70) 통치의 삼지창은 원래 육지에 놓을 용도로 만들어진 것이 아니었지만, 한때 대양에서 "
"대양까지 뻗어 있던 강력한 트리톤 제국이 멸망했을 때, 왕실 보물을 비롯한 수많은 귀중한 유물들이 약탈당해 육지로 올라왔습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=528|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Relic Spear"
msgstr "성유물 창"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=529|field=Name"
msgid "Blade of Mercy"
msgstr "자비의 칼날"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=529|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"(Might +40, 4-10 points Electrical damage, Accuracy -40, Necromancer) Though"
" generally considered unfashionable among current necromantic customs, live "
"sacrifice was once widely practiced. To reduce the cruelty inflicted on his "
"victims, the Necromancer Ferredine the Merciful created a blade capable of "
"bringing about a quicker and less suffered end."
msgstr ""
"(힘 +40, 전기 피해 4-10점, 정확도 -40, 네크로맨서) 오늘날의 네크로맨서 관습에서는 일반적으로 금기시되지만, 과거에는 산 "
"제물이 널리 행해졌습니다. 희생자들에게 가해지는 잔혹함을 줄이기 위해, 자비로운 네크로맨서 페레딘은 더 빠르고 고통 없는 최후를 선사할 "
"수 있는 검을 만들었습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=529|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Relic Dagger"
msgstr "성유물 단검"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=52|field=Name"
msgid "Infantry Fork"
msgstr "보병용 쇠스랑"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=52|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"A highly specialized piece of equipment intended to equalize contests "
"between foot soldiers and mounted, armored opponents, these modified spears "
"are effective if slightly clumsy weapons."
msgstr ""
"보병과 기마병, 갑옷을 입은 적 사이의 전투력을 균형 있게 조절하기 위해 고안된 이 개량형 창은 다소 투박하지만 효과적인 무기입니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=52|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Trident"
msgstr "삼지창"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=530|field=Name"
msgid "Staff of Elements"
msgstr "원소의 지팡이"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=530|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"(of Air Magic, of Fire Magic, of Water Magic, of Earth Magic, -40 Armor "
"Class) By imposing upon its wielder a deepened state of concentration, the "
"Staff of Elements increases his or her affinity with elemental magic to a "
"profound degree. Of course, it is not always a good thing to have one's "
"attention taken away from one's immediate concerns."
msgstr ""
"(공기 마법, 화염 마법, 물 마법, 대지 마법, 방어력 -40) 원소의 지팡이는 사용자에게 깊은 집중 상태를 강요함으로써 원소 마법에 "
"대한 친화력을 심오하게 증가시킵니다. 물론, 당면한 문제에서 주의가 분산되는 것이 항상 좋은 것만은 아닙니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=530|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Relic Staff"
msgstr "성유물 지팡이"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=531|field=Name"
msgid "Tournament Bow"
msgstr "토너먼트 활"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=531|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"(Accuracy +100, Bow skill + 5, Armor Class -20) This bow was built to the "
"specifications of the great Elven tournament archer, Terin Tourfeather. More"
" concerned with fancy shooting than with the realities of the battlefield, "
"the bow's detrimental effects were of no concern to Tourfeather--more "
"workaday wielders should pay more heed."
msgstr ""
"(정확도 +100, 활 기술 +5, 방어력 -20) 이 활은 위대한 엘프 토너먼트 궁수 테린 투르페더의 사양에 맞춰 제작되었습니다. "
"화려한 활쏘기에 더 열중했던 투르페더는 전장의 현실보다는 활의 불리한 점에 신경 쓰지 않았지만, 일반 궁수들은 그 점에 더 주의를 "
"기울여야 할 것입니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=531|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Relic Bow"
msgstr "성유물 활"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=532|field=Name"
msgid "Lightning Crossbow"
msgstr "번개 석궁"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=532|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"(Swift, Accuracy -50, Dark Elf) An ingenious combination of the mechanical "
"and magical went into the creation of this self-cocking crossbow which "
"launches its quarrels with incredible force. That the same launching force "
"causes it to kick like a mule means only the most skilled can use it to any "
"good effect."
msgstr ""
"(공격 회복 속도 증가, 정확도 -50, 다크 엘프) 기계와 마법의 기발한 조합으로 탄생한 이 자동 장전식 석궁은 엄청난 위력으로 화살을"
" 발사합니다. 하지만 그 강력한 발사력 때문에 마치 노새처럼 강한 반동을 일으키므로, 고도로 숙련된 사용자만이 효과적으로 사용할 수 "
"있습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=532|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Relic Crossbow"
msgstr "성유물 석궁"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=533|field=Name"
msgid "Last Stage Cuirass"
msgstr "최종 단계 흉갑"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=533|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"(Personality +80, Intellect +70, -30 Mind and Spirit resistances) The final "
"stage of degeneration from their human form leaves a Lich completely "
"soulless and thus immune to certain magics. Such liches often curse their "
"personal items with vulnerabilities to these magics to dissuade others from "
"using them."
msgstr ""
"(인격 +80, 지능 +70, 정신 및 영혼 저항 -30) 인간 형태에서 완전히 퇴화한 리치는 영혼을 완전히 잃어 특정 마법에 면역이 "
"됩니다. 이러한 리치들은 다른 이들이 자신의 소지품을 사용하지 못하도록 해당 마법에 취약하게 저주를 거는 경우가 많습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=533|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Relic Leather Armor"
msgstr "성유물 가죽 갑옷"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=534|field=Name"
msgid "Herondale's Lost Shield"
msgstr "헤론데일의 잃어버린 방패"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=534|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"(Immune to Fear, Stone, Paralysis, and Sleep; Personality -15, Luck -15) The"
" great knight Gerrald Herondale abandoned this shield after it took the "
"brunt of a dark and deadly curse. Though it still retained its great powers,"
" the shield was also weighed down with malevolent energies."
msgstr ""
"(공포, 석화, 마비, 수면에 면역; 인격 -15, 운 -15) 위대한 기사 제럴드 헤론데일은 이 방패가 어둡고 치명적인 저주에 심하게 "
"시달린 후 버렸습니다. 비록 여전히 강력한 힘을 간직하고 있었지만, 이 방패는 악의적인 기운으로 무겁게 짓눌려 있었습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=534|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Relic Small Shield"
msgstr "성유물 소형 방패"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=535|field=Name"
msgid "Ring of Fusion"
msgstr "융합의 반지"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=535|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"(of Water, Alchemy skill + 5, Intellect +40, Endurance -20) A lost relic of "
"the Freehaven Alchemists' Guild, until its disappearance, this ring was the "
"signet of the guildmaster. It was meant to be worn only during the mixing of"
" the most powerful potions for it drew much energy from the user."
msgstr ""
"(물 마법, 연금술 기술 +5, 지능 +40, 인내력 -20) 프리헤이븐 연금술사 길드의 잃어버린 유물인 이 반지는 사라지기 전까지 "
"길드장의 인장이었습니다. 착용자의 에너지를 많이 소모하기 때문에 가장 강력한 물약을 제조할 때만 착용해야 했습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=535|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Relic Ring"
msgstr "성유물 반지"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=536|field=Name"
msgid "Lucky Hat"
msgstr "행운의 모자"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=536|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"(Luck + 90, Personality -50) The only reason someone would wear this hat is "
"for the luck it conveys. It is the farthest thing from flattering!"
msgstr ""
"(운 +90, 인격 -50) 이 모자를 쓰는 유일한 이유는 행운을 가져다준다는 믿음 때문일 것이다. 전혀 어울리지 않는 모자다!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=536|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Relic Hat"
msgstr "성유물 모자"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=537|field=Name"
msgid "Berserker Belt"
msgstr "광전사의 허리띠"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=537|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"(Might +100, Immune to Fear, Accuracy -30, Armor Class -15) An experiment of"
" the Blackshire Artificers' Guild, this belt was designed to turn its wearer"
" into the perfect warrior--mighty and fearless. No more were made when in "
"field tests it became apparent that \"foolhardy\" and \"careless\" were not "
"virtues of the perfect warrior."
msgstr ""
"(힘 +100, 공포 면역, 정확도 -30, 방어력 -15) 블랙샤이어 장인 길드의 실험적인 발명품인 이 허리띠는 착용자를 완벽한 전사,"
" 즉 강력하고 공포 없는 전사로 만들어주도록 설계되었습니다. 그러나 현장 시험에서 \"무모함\"과 \"부주의함\"이 완벽한 전사의 미덕이"
" 아니라는 것이 명백해지자 더 이상 제작되지 않았습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=537|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Relic Belt"
msgstr "성유물 허리띠"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=538|field=Name"
msgid "Mace of the Sun"
msgstr "태양의 철퇴"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=538|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"Though at first it appears to be the same type of mace carried by Sun Temple"
" clerics everywhere, this item seems to thrum with conflicting energies."
msgstr ""
"언뜻 보기에는 태양 사원의 성직자들이 어디에서나 들고 다니는 것과 같은 철퇴처럼 보이지만, 이 물건은 상반된 에너지로 가득 차 있는 "
"듯하다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=538|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Special Mace"
msgstr "특수 철퇴"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=539|field=Name"
msgid "Ebonest"
msgstr "에보네스트"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=539|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"Quest Item: Charles Quixote's personal spear of Dragon slaying, Ebonest is a"
" fine weapon indeed. When used against a Dragon, it seems to aim unerringly "
"for the chinks between its target's tough scales."
msgstr ""
"퀘스트 아이템: 찰스 퀴호테가 애용하던 드래곤 사냥용 창인 에보네스트는 참으로 훌륭한 무기입니다. 드래곤을 상대할 때, 이 창은 드래곤의"
" 단단한 비늘 사이의 틈을 정확하게 조준하는 듯합니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=539|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Special Spear"
msgstr "특수 창"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=53|field=Name"
msgid "Lizardman Trident"
msgstr "리자드맨 삼지창"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=53|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"The blacksmiths on the Dagger Wound Islands craft a wide variety of "
"spearheads. This trident is one of their most unusual designs. The barbed "
"tines cause extra damage during straight thrusting attacks."
msgstr ""
"단검상섬의 대장장이들은 다양한 종류의 창날을 제작합니다. 이 삼지창은 그중에서도 가장 특이한 디자인 중 하나입니다. 뾰족한 가시가 직선 "
"찌르기 공격 시 추가적인 피해를 입힙니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=53|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Trident"
msgstr "삼지창"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=540|field=Name"
msgid "Sword of Whistlebone"
msgstr "휘슬본의 검"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=540|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"Quest Item: That the Whistlebones would settle upon such a fierce weapon for"
" their heirloom speaks much of their commitment to the family business of "
"Dragon hunting."
msgstr ""
"퀘스트 아이템: 휘슬본즈 가문이 가문의 가보로 이처럼 사나운 무기를 선택했다는 것은 드래곤 사냥이라는 가업에 대한 그들의 헌신을 잘 "
"보여줍니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=540|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Special Two-Handed Sword"
msgstr "특수 양손검"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=541|field=Name"
msgid "Axe of Balthazar"
msgstr "발타자르의 도끼"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=541|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"Quest Item: No Minotaur kings wear a crown. Instead as their badge of office"
" they carry great axes of the finest workmanship. This axe was lost when "
"Balthazar was betrayed by the Vori Frost Giants. That it is strongly "
"enchanted is clear; when used in battle its blows deliver both normal damage"
" and impart a numbing bite of freezing cold."
msgstr ""
"퀘스트 아이템: 미노타우로스 왕들은 왕관을 쓰지 않습니다. 대신 그들의 권위를 나타내는 상징으로 최고급 장인의 손길이 닿은 거대한 도끼를"
" 휘두릅니다. 이 도끼는 발타자르가 보리 서리 거인들에게 배신당했을 때 잃어버린 것입니다. 강력한 마법이 걸려 있다는 것은 분명하며, "
"전투에서 사용하면 일반적인 피해와 함께 얼어붙을 듯한 냉기를 가합니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=541|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Special Two-Handed Axe"
msgstr "특수 양손 도끼"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=542|field=Name"
msgid "Noblebone Bow"
msgstr "노블본 활"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=542|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"Bows of Kreegan bone are highly sought after; the material is strong and "
"takes enchantments easily. The most sought after bone comes from Kreegans of"
" the devil race's former ruling class."
msgstr ""
"크리건 뼈로 만든 활은 매우 귀하게 여겨집니다. 재질이 튼튼하고 마법 부여도 잘 되기 때문입니다. 특히 악마 종족의 옛 지배 계급이었던 "
"크리건의 뼈가 가장 귀하게 평가받습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=542|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Special Bow"
msgstr "특수 활"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=543|field=Name"
msgid "Cycle of Life"
msgstr "생명의 순환"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=543|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"(Shared life, Endurance + 20) A ring of simple metal (copper or brass?), "
"warm on touch."
msgstr "(공유된 삶, 인내력 + 20) 단순한 금속(구리 또는 황동?)으로 만들어진 반지로, 만지면 따뜻하다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=543|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Special Ring"
msgstr "특수 반지"

