msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=54|field=Name"
msgid "Regnan Trident"
msgstr "레그나 삼지창"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=54|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"No Regnan ship leaves port without a cache of tridents. Boarding attacks "
"against their galleys seldom succeed against massed walls of their erudine "
"tines."
msgstr ""
"레그나의 어떤 배도 삼지창을 가득 싣지 않고는 항구를 떠나지 않는다. 그들의 갤리선에 대한 승선 공격은 삼지창으로 이루어진 견고한 "
"방어벽을 뚫고 성공하기 어렵다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
