msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=5|field=Name"
msgid "Champion's Sword"
msgstr "챔피언의 검"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=5|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"These are made exclusively for members of the Erathian Order of the Blade. "
"Since by tradition they are buried with their fallen wielders on hallowed "
"and guarded grounds, they are rare articles indeed."
msgstr ""
"이 검들은 에라시아 검기 기사단의 단원들만을 위해 제작됩니다. 전통에 따라 전사한 단원들과 함께 신성하고 삼엄하게 경비되는 땅에 묻히기 "
"때문에 매우 희귀한 물건입니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
