#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=603|field=Name"
msgid "Urn of Ashes"
msgstr "유골 항아리"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=603|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"Quest Item: A funerary urn entrusted to your care by the Troll, Overdune "
"Snapfinger. It contains the ashes of his brother, Vilebite."
msgstr ""
"퀘스트 아이템: 트롤 오버듄 스냅핑거가 당신에게 맡긴 장례용 항아리. 그 안에는 그의 형제인 바일바이트의 유골이 들어 있습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=603|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Urn"
msgstr "유골함"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=604|field=Name"
msgid "Nightshade Brazier"
msgstr "나이트셰이드 화로"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=604|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"Quest Item: This brazier emanates the unsettling vibrancy of dark magic. It "
"smells strongly of pitch and sulfur."
msgstr "퀘스트 아이템: 이 화로는 어둠의 마법이 지닌 섬뜩한 기운을 내뿜고 있다. 역청과 유황 냄새가 강하게 난다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=604|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Brazier"
msgstr "화로"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=605|field=Name"
msgid "Dragon Leader's Egg"
msgstr "드래곤 우두머리의 알"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=605|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"Quest Item: This Dragon egg is nearly ready to hatch. The small life inside "
"makes its presence known with an occasional rustle."
msgstr "퀘스트 아이템: 이 드래곤의 알은 곧 부화할 것 같습니다. 알 속의 작은 생명체가 가끔 바스락거리는 소리로 존재를 알립니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=605|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Egg"
msgstr "알"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=606|field=Name"
msgid "Heart of Fire"
msgstr "불의 심장"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=606|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"Quest Item: The Heart of Fire is a gem of pure elemental force clear of "
"imperfections and weighing at least a hundred carets. No doubt, a magic item"
" made from it would be incredibly potent."
msgstr ""
"퀘스트 아이템: 불의 심장은 순수한 원소의 힘으로 이루어진 보석으로, 흠집 하나 없이 깨끗하며 무게는 최소 100캐럿에 달합니다. 이 "
"보석으로 만든 마법 아이템은 틀림없이 엄청난 위력을 지닐 것입니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=606|field=NotIdentifiedName"
