"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=619|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Key"
msgstr "열쇠"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=61|field=Name"
msgid "Light Crossbow"
msgstr "경량 석궁"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=61|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"Because of their ease of use, crossbows like these are stockpiled in militia"
" armories everywhere. Their low pull strength and mediocre workmanship "
"however, make them only moderately effective."
msgstr ""
"사용이 간편하기 때문에 이러한 석궁은 전국의 민병대 무기고에 비축되어 있습니다. 하지만 당기는 힘이 약하고 제작 기술이 조악하여 효율성은"
" 그다지 높지 않습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=61|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Crossbow"
msgstr "석궁"

