#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=626|field=Name"
msgid "Prophecies of the Sun"
msgstr "태양의 예언"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=626|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"Quest Item: The writing inside this book reads like the ranting of a madman."
" Still, someone must have thought highly of it. The text is entirely hand "
"scribed in a florid style. Inset illuminations bring to life scenes from the"
" story which are, in turn, disturbing, outlandish or seemingly drawn from "
"nightmare."
msgstr ""
"퀘스트 아이템: 이 책 속의 글은 마치 미치광이의 횡설수설처럼 읽힌다. 하지만 누군가는 이 책을 높이 평가했던 것이 분명하다. 모든 "
"글자는 화려한 필체로 손으로 직접 쓰여 있다. 삽입된 삽화들은 이야기 속 장면들을 생생하게 묘사하는데, 그 장면들은 섬뜩하거나, "
"기괴하거나, 혹은 악몽에서 튀어나온 듯하다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=626|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Book"
msgstr "책"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=627|field=Name"
msgid "Remains of Korbu"
msgstr "코르부의 유해"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=627|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"Quest Item: The remains of Korbu who some claim was the most powerful "
"vampire of all times. He's not much to look at now, however. His skeleton "
"has been almost completely dismantled--either by design or the ravages of "
"time, and a wooden stake is nestled entirely within the ribcage."
msgstr ""
"퀘스트 아이템: 역사상 가장 강력한 뱀파이어였다고 전해지는 코르부의 유해. 하지만 그의 모습은 이제 볼품없습니다. 그의 해골은 거의 "
"완전히 해체되었는데, 의도적인 것인지 아니면 세월의 흐름 때문인지는 알 수 없지만, 갈비뼈 안에는 나무 말뚝이 박혀 있습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=627|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Remains"
msgstr "유해"

