#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=629|field=Name"
msgid "Ring of Keys"
msgstr "열쇠고리"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=629|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"Quest Item: Both the keys and ring are made of a metal you've never "
"encountered before. The gemstones inset in the key heads are familiar to "
"you. They are elemental heartstones like those incorporated in the conflux "
"key Xanthor made for you."
msgstr ""
"퀘스트 아이템: 열쇠와 반지는 모두 당신이 전에 본 적 없는 금속으로 만들어졌습니다. 열쇠 머리에 박힌 보석은 당신에게 익숙합니다. "
"그것들은 크산토르가 당신을 위해 만든 융합 열쇠에 박힌 것과 같은 원소 심장석입니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
