msgid "Heartwood of Jadame"
msgstr "제이덤의 심재"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=646|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"The cooler climate of the Murmurwood forest causes the trees there to grow "
"with a tight grain. These lumbered planks are of the clear grained "
"heartwood."
msgstr ""
"머머우드 숲의 서늘한 기후 덕분에 그곳의 나무들은 촘촘한 나뭇결을 가지며 자랍니다. 이 목재 판재는 나뭇결이 선명한 심재로 "
"만들어졌습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=646|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Wood"
msgstr "목재"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=647|field=Name"
msgid "Flawed Amulets"
msgstr "결함 있는 부적"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=647|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"A crate of from the Shadowspire artificers. Small flaws in workmanship have "
"made them incapable of holding enchantments."
msgstr "섀도스파이어 장인들이 만든 상자입니다. 제작상의 작은 결함 때문에 마법을 걸 수 없습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=647|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Crate"
msgstr "나무 상자"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=648|field=Name"
msgid "Dried Sunfish"
msgstr "말린 개복치"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=648|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"A crate of dried sunfish harvested from the Ifarine Sea. Some find the "
"chewy, salty fish a delicacy."
msgstr "이파린 해에서 잡은 말린 붕어 한 상자. 어떤 사람들은 쫄깃하고 짭짤한 이 생선을 진미로 여긴다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=648|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Crate"
msgstr "나무 상자"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=649|field=Name"
msgid "Silver Dust of the Sea"
msgstr "바다의 은가루"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=649|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"A crate full of bagged Silver Dust. Made by the Necromancers' Guild, it is "
"said to have value to some sea travelers."
msgstr "은가루가 자루에 담겨 가득 담긴 상자. 강령술사 길드에서 만든 이 은가루는 일부 해상 여행자들에게 가치가 있다고 전해진다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=649|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Crate"
msgstr "나무 상자"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=64|field=Name"
msgid "Caravaner's Crossbow"
msgstr "대상단원의 석궁"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=64|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"The Merchants of Alvar like to see their caravan guards well armed. This "
"well-crafted heavy crossbow has a cranked drawing mechanism."
msgstr ""
"알바르의 상인들은 대상 호위병들이 잘 무장되어 있는 것을 선호합니다. 이 정교하게 제작된 중형 석궁은 크랭크식 장전 장치를 갖추고 "
"있습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=64|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Crossbow"
msgstr "석궁"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=650|field=Name"
msgid "Forged Vouchers"
msgstr "위조 전표"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=650|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"Forged credit documents used by the ogre mage Zog to embezzle gold from "
"Alvarian merchant customers."
msgstr "오우거 마법사 조그가 알바르 상인 고객들의 금화를 횡령하기 위해 사용한 위조 신용 서류."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=650|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Vouchers"
msgstr "상품권"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
