msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=652|field=Name"
msgid "Prophecies of the Snake"
msgstr "뱀의 예언"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=652|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"Quest Item: One of many books of prophecy circulating recently, the "
"Prophecies of the Snake may indeed tell the future of Jadame."
msgstr "퀘스트 아이템: 최근 유포되고 있는 여러 예언서 중 하나인 '뱀의 예언'은 제이덤의 미래를 예언하고 있을지도 모릅니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=652|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Book"
msgstr "책"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=653|field=Name"
msgid "Ogre Ear"
msgstr "오우거 귀"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=653|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"Used to keep track of kills, some bounty hunters collect these gruesome "
"reminders of battles past."
msgstr "일부 현상금 사냥꾼들은 사살 횟수를 기록하기 위해 과거 전투의 끔찍한 흔적들을 수집하기도 합니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=653|field=NotIdentifiedName"
