#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=655|field=Name"
msgid "Green Apple"
msgstr "녹색 사과"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=655|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"Jadamean green apples are crunchy, slightly tart and a good source of "
"nutrition.  (To use the apple, pick it up and left-click over a character's "
"portrait in the inventory screen.)"
msgstr ""
"제이덤산 녹색 사과는 아삭하고 약간 새콤하며 영양이 풍부합니다. (사과를 사용하려면 사과를 집어 인벤토리 화면에서 캐릭터 초상화를 왼쪽 "
"클릭하십시오.)"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=655|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Apple"
msgstr "사과"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=656|field=Name"
msgid "Horseshoe"
msgstr "편자"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=656|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"This flawless horseshoe is made of silver. To use, pick the horseshoe up and"
" right-click over a character's portrait."
msgstr ""
"이 흠잡을 데 없는 말굽은 은으로 만들어졌습니다. 사용하려면 말굽을 집어 들고 캐릭터 초상화 위에서 마우스 오른쪽 버튼을 클릭하세요."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=656|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Horseshoe"
msgstr "편자"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=657|field=Name"
msgid "Enchanted Amulet"
msgstr "마법의 부적"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=657|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"A pretty bauble favored by the Pirates of Regna for it appearance, not for "
"any magical enchantment it may have."
msgstr "레그나 해적들이 좋아하는 예쁜 장신구로, 마법적인 효능 때문이 아니라 외형적인 아름다움 때문입니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=657|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Amulet"
msgstr "부적"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=658|field=Name"
msgid "Wheel of Frelandeau"
msgstr "프렐랑도 치즈 한 덩이"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=658|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"Quest Item: A wheel of prized unicorn's-milk frelandeau cheese. Sliced onto "
"crackers, it is the perfect compliment to a snifter of fine tobersk brandy."
msgstr ""
"퀘스트 아이템: 귀한 유니콘 젖으로 만든 프렐란도 치즈 한 덩어리. 크래커 위에 얇게 썰어 얹으면 고급 토베르스크 브랜디 한 잔과 완벽한"
" 조화를 이룹니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=658|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Cheese"
msgstr "치즈"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=659|field=Name"
msgid "Log of Eldenbrie"
msgstr "엘덴브리 치즈 덩어리"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=659|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"Quest Item: A log of Vori eldenbrie cheese. Though many have tried to "
"duplicate its subtle, smoky flavor, only the master Frost Giant cheese "
"masters of the frozen Vori wastes know the secrets of its formulation."
msgstr ""
"퀘스트 아이템: 보리 엘덴브리 치즈 한 덩어리. 수많은 이들이 은은한 훈연향을 가진 이 치즈를 흉내 내려 했지만, 얼어붙은 보리 황무지의"
" 서리 거인 치즈 장인들만이 그 제조법을 알고 있다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=659|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Cheese"
msgstr "치즈"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=65|field=Name"
msgid "Regnan Crossbow"
msgstr "레그나 석궁"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=65|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"The pirates of Regna Island have spent centuries perfecting their crossbow "
"design. The resulting weapon has a crystal lensed sight and bowstaves of "
"pure stalt - which would make the bow impossible to cock if not for the "
"crank draw of erudine alloy."
msgstr ""
"레그나 섬의 해적들은 수 세기 동안 석궁 설계를 완성하는 데 매진해 왔습니다. 그 결과 탄생한 무기는 수정 렌즈 조준경과 순수 강철로 "
"만들어진 활대를 갖추고 있는데, 만약 에루딘 합금으로 만든 크랭크식 활시위가 없었다면 활을 당기는 것 자체가 불가능했을 것입니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=65|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Crossbow"
msgstr "석궁"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=660|field=Name"
msgid "Ball of Dunduck"
msgstr "던덕 치즈 덩이"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=660|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"Quest Item: A ball of dunduck cheese. Made in small batches by the goblins "
"of Erathia, most consider it an acquired taste."
msgstr ""
"퀘스트 아이템: 던덕 치즈 한 덩어리. 에라시아의 고블린들이 소량씩 만드는 이 치즈는 호불호가 갈리는 맛으로 알려져 있습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=660|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Cheese"
msgstr "치즈"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=661|field=Name"
msgid "Emperor Thorn's Key"
msgstr "쏜 황제의 열쇠"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=661|field=Notes"
msgid "Quest Item: The key you took from the Unicorn King's body."
msgstr "퀘스트 아이템: 유니콘 왕의 시체에서 가져온 열쇠."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=661|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Key"
msgstr "열쇠"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=662|field=Name"
msgid "Cannonball of Dominion"
msgstr "도미니언의 포탄"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=662|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"Quest Item: The strange cannonball you took from the Regnan fortress. It is "
