msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=688|field=Name"
msgid "Phylt-laced ore"
msgstr "필트 함유 광석"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=688|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"A small chunk of phylt-laced ore.  Phylt is often used in steel alloys to "
"increase the durability and enchantability of steel.  In the hands of a "
"skilled craftsman phylt could make a weapon, an amulet, a ring, armor, or "
"almost any other useful item."
msgstr ""
"필트가 함유된 작은 광석 조각입니다. 필트는 강철 합금에 자주 사용되어 강철의 내구성과 마법 부여 가능성을 높입니다. 숙련된 장인의 "
"손에서 필트는 무기, 부적, 반지, 갑옷 또는 거의 모든 유용한 물건을 만들 수 있습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=688|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Lump of Ore"
msgstr "광석 덩어리"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=689|field=Name"
msgid "Kergar-laced ore"
msgstr "케르가르 함유 광석"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=689|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"A small chunk of kergar-laced ore.  Kergar shares many properties of steel, "
"but is much easier to enchant.  In the hands of a skilled craftsman kergar "
"could easily make a magical weapon, an amulet, a ring, armor, or almost any "
"other item."
msgstr ""
"케르가르가 함유된 작은 광석 조각입니다. 케르가르는 강철과 많은 특성을 공유하지만, 마법을 부여하기가 훨씬 쉽습니다. 숙련된 장인의 "
"손에서 케르가르는 마법 무기, 부적, 반지, 갑옷 또는 거의 모든 다른 아이템을 쉽게 만들 수 있습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=689|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Lump of Ore"
msgstr "광석 덩어리"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=68|field=Name"
msgid "Temple Mace"
msgstr "신전 철퇴"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=68|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"The sunray corona circling the head of this well made mace serves as a "
"devotional declaration for Temple of the Sun clerics; it also greatly "
"increases the damage of its blows. "
msgstr ""
"정교하게 제작된 이 철퇴의 머리 부분을 둘러싼 햇살 모양의 코로나는 태양 신전 성직자들의 헌신적인 신앙심을 상징하며, 동시에 철퇴의 "
"공격력을 크게 증가시킵니다. "

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=68|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Mace"
msgstr "철퇴"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=690|field=Name"
msgid "Erudine-laced ore"
msgstr "에루딘 함유 광석"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=690|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"A small chunk of erudine-laced ore.  A rare magical ore found in few regions"
" of Erathia, in the hands of a skilled craftsman erudine could make a "
"powerful weapon, an amulet, a ring, armor, or almost any other item."
msgstr ""
"에루딘이 함유된 작은 광석 조각. 에라시아의 몇몇 지역에서만 발견되는 희귀한 마법 광석인 에루딘은 숙련된 장인의 손에서 강력한 무기, "
"부적, 반지, 갑옷 또는 거의 모든 다른 물건을 만들 수 있습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
