#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=78|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"Troll tribal chieftains must win their position through trial by combat. The"
" winner keeps his club as a symbol of office. The losers' clubs often find "
"their way into the weapon marketplace."
msgstr ""
"트롤 부족의 족장은 결투를 통해 자리를 쟁취해야 합니다. 승자는 자신의 곤봉을 권력의 상징으로 간직하게 되며, 패자의 곤봉은 종종 무기 "
"시장으로 흘러들어갑니다."

