msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=942|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"A wooden wand painted green and banded with brass.  The wand is capped with "
"a large, flawed emerald.  To use this wand, you must equip it as though you "
"were equipping a weapon."
