msgid "Blue Quartz"
msgstr "청색 석영"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=988|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"An Antagarichan mountain crystal. As a gem quality stone it has no magical "
"properties, so you might as well sell it."
msgstr "안타개릭산에서 채취한 수정입니다. 보석으로서의 품질은 좋지만 마법적인 효능은 없으니 팔아도 괜찮을 것 같습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=988|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Gemstone"
msgstr "보석"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=989|field=Name"
msgid "Topaz"
msgstr "황옥"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=989|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"An Antagarichan small topaz. As a gem quality stone it has no magical "
"properties, so you might as well sell it."
msgstr "안타개릭산 소형 토파즈입니다. 보석으로서의 품질은 좋지만 마법적인 효능은 없으니 팔아버리는 게 나을지도 모르겠습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=989|field=NotIdentifiedName"
msgid "Gemstone"
msgstr "보석"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=98|field=Name"
msgid "Dragoning Plate"
msgstr "드래곤 판금 갑옷"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_ItemsTxt.txt
msgctxt "mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt|id=98|field=Notes"
msgid ""
"The technique for making plate armor of erudine sheets is not known on "
"Jadame. In fact, it is only produced by the master armorer, Derrick Goreth "
"of Erathia who spent a lifetime constructing his famed White Light "
"Forgeworks."
msgstr ""
"제이덤에서는 에루딘 판금 갑옷 제작 기술이 알려져 있지 않습니다. 사실, 이 갑옷은 평생을 바쳐 유명한 화이트 라이트 제련소를 건설한 "
"에라시아 출신의 명장 갑옷 제작자 데릭 고레스만이 만들 수 있습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt
