msgstr "누락된 두루마리 텍스트 727"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_MessageScrolls.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_MessageScrolls.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_MessageScrolls.txt|table=MessageScrolls|id=10|field=<default>"
msgid ""
" The White Potion of Might Boost temporarily boosts your strength just when "
"you need it. To mix this potion you need the correct combination of three of"
" any red reagent type and two of any blue reagents."
msgstr ""
" 흰 힘 증폭 물약은 필요할 때 힘을 일시적으로 높여줍니다. 이 물약을 조합하려면 빨간색 시약 세 개와 파란색 시약 두 개를 올바르게 "
"조합해야 합니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_MessageScrolls.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_MessageScrolls.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_MessageScrolls.txt|table=MessageScrolls|id=110|field=<default>"
msgid ""
" Bill of Sale To:  Schmendrick From:  ACME Golem's  We have made the golem "
"parts per your request.  Unfortunately our delivery service has, misplaced "
"these parts for you.  We are not responsible for any errors by the delivery "
"service.  We do however know where your parts were delivered and you can go "
"about recovering them at your leisure.  1 part was delivered to The Barrow "
"Downs 1 part was delivered to Tatalia 1 part was delivered to Avlee 2 parts "
"were delivered to Deyja 2 heads were delivered to Bracada (as we did not "
"know which model you prefered)"
msgstr ""
" 매매 명세서 수신: 슈멘드릭 발신: ACME 골렘사 요청하신 골렘 부품을 제작했습니다. 안타깝게도 배송 업체가 부품들을 잘못 "
"배달했습니다. 당사는 배송 업체의 어떠한 실수에도 책임지지 않습니다. 다만 부품이 배송된 장소는 알고 있으므로, 편하실 때 직접 회수하실"
" 수 있습니다. 부품 1개: 고분 지대 부품 1개: 타탈리아 부품 1개: 아블리 부품 2개: 데이자 머리 2개: 브라카다 (어느 모델을 "
"선호하시는지 알 수 없어 두 종류를 보냈습니다.)"

