msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_MessageScrolls.txt|table=MessageScrolls|id=143|field=<default>"
msgid ""
" The White Potion of Cure Paralysis eliminates the Paralysis condition. To "
"mix this potion you need the correct combination of one of any red reagent "
"type plus one of any blue reagent type and  three of the yellow reagents."
msgstr ""
" 흰 마비 치료 물약은 마비 상태를 제거합니다. 이 물약을 조합하려면 빨간색 시약 한 개, 파란색 시약 한 개, 노란색 시약 세 개가 "
"필요합니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_MessageScrolls.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_MessageScrolls.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_MessageScrolls.txt|table=MessageScrolls|id=144|field=<default>"
msgid ""
" The White Potion of Divine Restoration eliminates all conditions except "
"stoned, dead or eradicated. To mix this potion you need the correct "
"combination of one of any red reagent type plus one of any blue reagent type"
" and  three of the yellow reagents."
msgstr ""
" 흰 신성한 회복 물약은 석화, 사망, 소멸을 제외한 모든 상태 이상을 제거합니다. 이 물약을 조합하려면 빨간색 시약 한 개, 파란색 "
"시약 한 개, 노란색 시약 세 개가 필요합니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_MessageScrolls.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_MessageScrolls.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_MessageScrolls.txt|table=MessageScrolls|id=145|field=<default>"
msgid ""
" The White Potion of Divine Cure is more powerful than the Potion of Cure "
"Wounds. To mix this potion you need the correct combination of three of any "
"red reagent type and any three of the yellow reagents."
msgstr ""
" 흰 신성한 치유 물약은 상처 치료 물약보다 강력합니다. 이 물약을 조합하려면 빨간색 시약 세 개와 노란색 시약 세 개가 필요합니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_MessageScrolls.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_MessageScrolls.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_MessageScrolls.txt|table=MessageScrolls|id=146|field=<default>"
msgid ""
" The White Potion of Divine Power is more powerful than the Magic Potion. To"
" mix this potion you need the correct combination of three of any blue "
"reagent type and any three of the yellow reagents."
msgstr ""
" 흰 신성한 마력 물약은 마법 물약보다 강력합니다. 이 물약을 조합하려면 파란색 시약 세 개와 노란색 시약 세 개가 필요합니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_MessageScrolls.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_MessageScrolls.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_MessageScrolls.txt|table=MessageScrolls|id=147|field=<default>"
msgid ""
" The White Potion of Luck Boost temporarily boosts your luck just when you "
"need it. To mix this potion you need the correct combination of three of any"
" red reagent type and three of any blue reagents."
msgstr ""
" 흰 행운 증폭 물약은 필요할 때 행운을 일시적으로 높여줍니다. 이 물약을 조합하려면 빨간색 시약 세 개와 파란색 시약 세 개가 "
"필요합니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_MessageScrolls.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_MessageScrolls.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_MessageScrolls.txt|table=MessageScrolls|id=148|field=<default>"
