"노란색 시약 두 개가 필요합니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_MessageScrolls.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_MessageScrolls.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_MessageScrolls.txt|table=MessageScrolls|id=151|field=<default>"
msgid ""
" The White Potion of Earth Resistance temporarily raises your resistance to "
