#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=100|field=0"
msgid "What do you want?"
msgstr "무슨 용건이오?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=101|field=0"
msgid ""
"Are you the new recruits? Of course you are! Why else would you be seeking "
"me out? I'm ex-Captain Terrence, here to help you on your way to becoming "
"proper Regnan sailors."
msgstr ""
"새로 온 신병들이오? 물론 그렇겠지! 다른 이유로 나를 찾아왔을 리가 없으니까. 나는 전직 선장 테런스요. 그대들이 제대로 된 레그나 "
"선원이 되도록 도와주러 왔소."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=102|field=0"
msgid "How are you? What can a simple fisherwoman do for you today?"
msgstr "어떻게 지내세요? 오늘은 평범한 어부 여인이 무엇을 도와드릴까요?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=103|field=0"
msgid ""
"Hello?\n"
"Ah, someone else who seeks a way off this accursed island!\n"
"My name is Simon Templar!\n"
"I found my way into this temple as I was told it was the way out!\n"
"Let's travel together!"
msgstr ""
"여보세요?\n"
"아, 이 저주받은 섬을 빠져나갈 길을 찾는 사람이 또 있군요!\n"
"제 이름은 사이먼 템플러입니다!\n"
"이 신전이 탈출구라는 말을 듣고 들어왔습니다!\n"
"함께 갑시다!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=104|field=0"
msgid "Greetings, do you seek guidance from the Light?"
msgstr "안녕하시오. 빛의 인도를 구하러 왔습니까?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=105|field=0"
msgid ""
"Nooo!\n"
"What…where am I? You rescued me?\n"
"My thanks!!"
msgstr ""
"으아아!\n"
"뭐지…여기가 어디죠? 당신이 저를 구해 주셨습니까?\n"
"감사합니다!!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=106|field=0"
msgid ""
"Welcome!\n"
"I can make many wondrous things from the various ores that are indigenous to Jadame."
msgstr ""
"어서 오세요!\n"
"제이덤에서 나는 여러 광석으로 온갖 놀라운 물건을 만들 수 있습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=107|field=0"
msgid "Halt! These areas are off limits to guests! Guild members only!"
msgstr "멈추시오! 이 구역은 방문객 출입 금지입니다! 길드 회원만 들어갈 수 있습니다!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=108|field=0"
msgid "You may not enter here, puny ones! Stand back or become our prey!"
msgstr "하찮은 것들아, 이곳에는 들어올 수 없다! 물러서지 않으면 우리의 먹잇감이 될 것이다!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=109|field=0"
msgid ""
"Halt! Only members of our knightly brotherhood may pass this point. Others "
"who attempt to pass will face our wrath!"
msgstr "멈추시오! 우리 기사단의 형제들만 이 지점을 통과할 수 있소. 억지로 지나가려는 자는 우리의 분노를 마주할 것이오!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=10|field=0"
msgid ""
"Welcome to the Ravenshore guildhouse of the Merchants of Alvar. I am Elgar "
"Fellmoon. How may I help you?"
msgstr "레이븐쇼어의 알바르 상인회관에 오신 것을 환영합니다. 저는 엘가 펠문입니다. 무엇을 도와드릴까요?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=110|field=0"
msgid "Stop! You may not enter the storeroom!"
msgstr "멈추시오! 창고에는 들어갈 수 없습니다!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=111|field=0"
msgid ""
"Hail! I'm Jeric Whistlebone. Welcome to my camp. We're on a hunting safari. "
"You're welcome to look around, but don't interfere with our operation. This "
"is no place for amateur fumbling about!"
msgstr ""
"반갑소! 나는 제릭 휘슬본이오. 내 야영지에 온 것을 환영하오. 우리는 사냥 여행 중이오. 둘러보는 것은 좋지만 우리 작업을 방해하지 "
"마시오. 이곳은 아마추어가 어설프게 굴 곳이 아니오!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=112|field=0"
msgid ""
"You are back? Have you need of advice? Or are you finding the task at hand "
"too difficult?"
msgstr "돌아왔군요? 조언이 필요합니까? 아니면 맡은 일이 너무 어렵습니까?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=113|field=0"
msgid ""
"Greetings. I am the Oracle of Jadame. The mysteries of the Hidden World are "
"open to me. Through long years of training, I have gained a small measure of"
" control over time and space. I can reach my hand through the void and bring"
" things to me--both items and knowledge."
msgstr ""
"안녕하시오. 나는 제이덤의 예언자요. 숨겨진 세계의 신비가 내게 열려 있소. 오랜 세월 훈련한 끝에 시간과 공간을 조금이나마 통제하게 "
"되었소. 허공 너머로 손을 뻗어 물건과 지식을 모두 내게 가져올 수 있소."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=114|field=0"
msgid ""
"Halt! Only guild members and their guests can pass this point. Further, any "
"guild members with you must be at least, conscious. You have old Leland with"
" you, but he's in no condition to oversee you."
msgstr ""
"멈추시오! 길드 회원과 그 손님만 이곳을 통과할 수 있소. 게다가 동행한 길드 회원은 적어도 의식이 있어야 하오. 늙은 릴런드가 함께 "
"있기는 하지만, 지금 상태로는 당신들을 감독할 수 없소."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=115|field=0"
msgid "Help me!"
msgstr "도와주세요!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=116|field=0"
msgid ""
"I am Lord Markham, the benefactor providing the castle that is the prize of "
"the this contest."
msgstr "나는 이 대회의 상품인 성을 제공한 후원자 마크햄 경이오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=117|field=0"
msgid ""
"Greetings, my name is Thomas.\n"
"I am the judge of the contest."
msgstr ""
"안녕하시오, 내 이름은 토머스요.\n"
"나는 대회의 심판이오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=118|field=0"
msgid ""
"Welcome to Emerald Island, my name is Margaret and I'll be your docent for "
"your stay here."
msgstr "에메랄드 섬에 온 것을 환영합니다. 제 이름은 마거릿이며, 머무는 동안 안내를 맡겠습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=119|field=0"
msgid ""
"Hello, my name is Ailyssa.\n"
"I'm the Bard in charge of overseeing the entertainment on Emerald Island for the duration of the Scavenger Hunt."
msgstr ""
"안녕하세요, 제 이름은 알리사예요.\n"
"보물찾기가 진행되는 동안 에메랄드 섬의 여흥을 감독하는 음유시인이에요."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=11|field=0"
msgid "Have you done as I've asked of you?"
msgstr "내가 부탁한 일을 해냈소?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=120|field=0"
msgid ""
"Hi there!\n"
"I'm Sally.\n"
"I don't usually see people this far from town, are you lost?"
msgstr ""
"안녕하세요!\n"
"저는 샐리예요.\n"
"보통 마을에서 이렇게 먼 곳까지 나온 사람은 보지 못하는데, 길을 잃으셨나요?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=121|field=0"
msgid ""
"Pssst…\n"
"Come here, I have an offer for you."
msgstr ""
"쉿…\n"
"이리 와요. 제안할 것이 있어요."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=122|field=0"
msgid ""
"Hello there, stranger <wink>.\n"
"Fine weather we're having, no?"
msgstr ""
"안녕하세요, 낯선 분 <wink>.\n"
"날씨가 참 좋지요, 그렇죠?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=123|field=0"
msgid ""
"Hello there, friend.\n"
"May I have a word with you?"
msgstr ""
"안녕하세요, 친구.\n"
"잠깐 이야기해도 될까요?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=124|field=0"
msgid "I don't believe we have anything to talk about."
msgstr "우리가 나눌 이야기는 없는 것 같군요."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=125|field=0"
msgid ""
"Hail and well met.\n"
"I'm Brent Filiant, a contestant in Lord Markham's scavenger hunt."
msgstr ""
"반갑습니다.\n"
"저는 마크햄 경의 보물찾기 대회 참가자 브렌트 필리언트입니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=126|field=0"
msgid ""
"Hello, I'm Carolyn.\n"
"I handle the guild memberships for the Fire and Air Guilds here on the island."
msgstr ""
"안녕하세요, 저는 캐럴린입니다.\n"
"이 섬의 불과 공기 길드 가입 업무를 맡고 있습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=127|field=0"
msgid ""
"I'm Roger and I sell guild memberships for the Body and Spirit Guilds on "
"Emerald Island."
msgstr "나는 로저요. 에메랄드 섬에서 육체와 영혼 길드 회원권을 팔고 있소."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=128|field=0"
msgid ""
"Ahoy matey!\n"
"I be William Darvees, captain of this vessel."
msgstr ""
"어이, 선원!\n"
"나는 이 배의 선장 윌리엄 다비스요."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=129|field=0"
msgid "Hello, my name is Donna, I live here with my daughter Sally."
msgstr "안녕하세요, 제 이름은 도나예요. 딸 샐리와 함께 이곳에 살고 있습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=12|field=0"
msgid ""
"Okay…you've beaten my guards. Truce.I'm Arion Hunter. I suppose you could "
"call this all my operation. What do you want?"
msgstr "좋소…내 경비병들을 쓰러뜨렸군. 휴전이오. 나는 아리온 헌터요. 이 모든 일을 내가 운영한다고 보면 되오. 원하는 게 뭐요?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=130|field=0"
msgid ""
"Hi, I'm Grant.\n"
"Tor allows me to live in the back of his shop as long as I stay his apprentice."
msgstr ""
"안녕하세요, 저는 그랜트예요.\n"
"토르는 제가 계속 그의 제자로 있는 동안 상점 뒤편에서 살게 해 주고 있어요."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=131|field=0"
msgid ""
"Greetings, I'm Mia.\n"
"Do you need something?"
msgstr ""
"안녕하시오, 나는 미아라고 하오.\n"
"필요한 것이 있소?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=132|field=0"
msgid ""
"Halt!\n"
"You do not have authorization to proceed.\n"
"We request that you refrain from disturbing the students while they work."
msgstr ""
"멈추시오!\n"
"당신에게는 이곳을 통과할 권한이 없습니다.\n"
"학생들이 작업하는 동안 방해하지 말아 주십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=133|field=0"
msgid ""
"Welcome to Emerald Island.\n"
"I will be your guide during your stay here.\n"
"From time to time I will appear to tell you about something you're about to see to help you understand your New World.\n"
"If you tire of my messages (I won't be offended if you do), just click on my portrait to talk to me then click on 'Tour Off' to silence me."
msgstr ""
"에메랄드 섬에 오신 것을 환영합니다.\n"
"머무시는 동안 제가 안내를 맡겠습니다.\n"
"때때로 제가 나타나 곧 보게 될 것들을 설명하여 새로운 세계를 이해하도록 도와드리겠습니다.\n"
"제 안내가 지겨워져도 상심하지 않으니, 제 초상화를 눌러 말을 건 뒤 '안내 끄기'를 선택하면 안내를 중단할 수 있습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=134|field=0"
msgid ""
"The shop you are near is the Blacksmith shop.\n"
"The blacksmith only sells weapons, but this one sells many different kinds of weapons, and some of them have magical properties.\n"
"You can also sell weapons here, but you won't get a good deal until you have a higher merchant skill.\n"
"To enter, just click on the front door."
msgstr ""
"가까이에 있는 상점은 대장간입니다.\n"
"대장장이는 무기만 팔지만, 이곳에서는 여러 종류의 무기를 판매하며 일부는 마법 속성도 지니고 있습니다.\n"
"무기를 이곳에 팔 수도 있지만, 상술 기술이 높아지기 전에는 좋은 값을 받기 어렵습니다.\n"
"들어가려면 정문을 누르기만 하십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=135|field=0"
msgid ""
"The door to the west leads to the local Tavern.\n"
"The tavern is a safe place to sleep at night, and to buy food so you can sleep outdoors.\n"
"You can often meet interesting people in taverns, or catch the local gossip if you're looking for something to do.\n"
"To enter the tavern, just click on the front door."
msgstr ""
"서쪽 문은 현지 선술집으로 이어집니다.\n"
"선술집은 밤에 안전하게 잠을 자고, 야외에서 숙영할 때 필요한 식량을 살 수 있는 곳입니다.\n"
"선술집에서는 흥미로운 사람을 만나거나, 할 일을 찾고 있다면 현지 소문을 들을 수도 있습니다.\n"
"들어가려면 정문을 누르기만 하십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=136|field=0"
msgid ""
"This shop is the armor shop.\n"
"The armorer only sells helms, shields, and armor, but will buy nearly anything you can wear, if you don't want to make a separate stop at the magic shop.\n"
"Remember that a character needs skill in leather, chain or plate armor to be able to wear that kind of armor, or shield skill to use a shield."
msgstr ""
"이곳은 갑옷 상점입니다.\n"
"갑옷 상인은 투구, 방패, 갑옷만 팔지만, 마법 상점에 따로 들르고 싶지 않다면 착용 가능한 물건 대부분을 사 줍니다.\n"
"가죽, 사슬, 판금 갑옷을 착용하려면 해당 갑옷 기술이 필요하며, 방패를 사용하려면 방패 기술이 필요하다는 점을 기억하십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=137|field=0"
msgid ""
"This building is Carolyn Weather's private residence.\n"
"Carolyn makes a living by brokering magic guild memberships to aspiring wizards and other spell casters.\n"
"She will be happy to sell membership in the local Air and Fire guilds for a small fee.\n"
"You don't have to buy membership in a guild if you don't want to, but remember that you must be a guild member to buy spells and learn skills at a magic guild."
msgstr ""
"이 건물은 캐럴린 웨더스의 개인 주택입니다.\n"
"캐럴린은 마법사가 되려는 이들과 주문 시전자들에게 마법 길드 회원권을 중개하며 생계를 꾸립니다.\n"
"적은 비용으로 현지 공기와 불 길드의 회원권을 기꺼이 판매할 것입니다.\n"
"원하지 않는다면 길드에 가입할 필요는 없지만, 마법 길드에서 주문을 사고 기술을 배우려면 반드시 길드 회원이어야 합니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=138|field=0"
msgid ""
"This building is another private residence.\n"
"Roger, the owner of the house, sells membership in the Spirit and Body magic guilds here.\n"
"The price is low, but you must pay if you intend to take advantage of the guild services, including spell purchases and skill teaching.\n"
"By the way, if you're getting tired of my messages, you can stop them by clicking on my portrait to talk to me then clicking on the 'Tour Off' topic."
msgstr ""
"이 건물도 개인 주택입니다.\n"
"집주인 로저는 이곳에서 영혼과 육체 마법 길드 회원권을 판매합니다.\n"
"가격은 저렴하지만, 주문 구매와 기술 교육을 포함한 길드 서비스를 이용하려면 비용을 내야 합니다.\n"
"그런데 제 안내가 지겨워졌다면, 제 초상화를 눌러 말을 건 뒤 '안내 끄기' 항목을 선택하여 중단할 수 있습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=139|field=0"
msgid ""
"This door leads to the training center of Emerald Island.\n"
"If you have enough experience points (gained from killing monsters and completing quests) you can come here to increase your characters' levels.\n"
"When you gain a level, you'll also get some skill points to spend on improving your skills.\n"
"You can only spend skill points on skills that your character knows--to learn new skills, try visiting the businesses around town and see if they offer lessons in anything you're interested in."
msgstr ""
"이 문은 에메랄드 섬의 훈련소로 이어집니다.\n"
"몬스터를 처치하고 퀘스트를 완료해 충분한 경험치를 얻었다면 이곳에서 캐릭터의 레벨을 올릴 수 있습니다.\n"
"레벨이 오르면 기술 향상에 쓸 수 있는 기술 점수도 받습니다.\n"
"기술 점수는 캐릭터가 아는 기술에만 쓸 수 있습니다. 새 기술을 배우려면 마을의 여러 시설을 찾아가 관심 있는 분야를 가르치는지 확인하십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=13|field=0"
msgid ""
"Halt! None may pass into the inner chambers unless accompanied by a guild "
"member."
msgstr "멈추시오! 길드 회원과 동행하지 않으면 안쪽 방으로 들어갈 수 없소."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=140|field=0"
msgid ""
"This tent is where the town's healer is located.\n"
"You can pay for any healing your characters may need here--even raise them from the dead.\n"
"You can tell if your characters are injured by looking at the green bar to the left of their portrait--the lower it is, the more injured they are.\n"
"Note that it isn't necessary to get healed at the healer--any ordinary damage and all spell points will be healed merely for resting overnight."
msgstr ""
"이 천막에는 마을의 치료사가 있습니다.\n"
"이곳에서 비용을 내고 캐릭터의 부상을 치료할 수 있으며, 죽은 자를 되살릴 수도 있습니다.\n"
"캐릭터 초상화 왼쪽의 녹색 막대를 보면 부상 정도를 알 수 있습니다. 막대가 낮을수록 더 크게 다친 상태입니다.\n"
"반드시 치료사에게 치료받을 필요는 없습니다. 평범한 피해와 모든 주문 점수는 하룻밤 쉬기만 해도 회복됩니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=141|field=0"
msgid ""
"This well has a magical benefit--it bestows a powerful fire resistance spell on the drinker.\n"
"To have a character drink from the well, just select the character you want to have drink, then click on the well. There are many wells like this one in the game--you can look in your autonotes book under the \"\"Fountains\"\" tab for a list of all wells you've tried drinking from during the course of the game.The effects of this particular well last until you rest, but remember that different wells may have completely different effects."
msgstr ""
"이 우물에는 마법의 효능이 있어, 마신 사람에게 강력한 화염 저항 주문을 부여합니다.\n"
"캐릭터에게 우물물을 마시게 하려면 원하는 캐릭터를 선택한 뒤 우물을 누르십시오. 게임에는 이와 같은 우물이 많습니다. 자동 기록책의 분수 탭에서 게임 중 마셔 본 모든 우물의 목록을 확인할 수 있습니다.이 우물의 효과는 휴식할 때까지 지속되지만, 다른 우물은 전혀 다른 효과를 낼 수 있다는 점을 기억하십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=142|field=0"
msgid ""
"You are standing in front of the house in which Lord Markham has set up his temporary headquarters on Emerald Island. Lord Markham is the benefactor behind the scavenger hunt you are no doubt eager to win.\n"
"The contest judge is also inside, and he is the one you need to talk to in order to turn in hunt items you have found."
msgstr ""
"지금 서 있는 곳은 마크햄 경이 에메랄드 섬의 임시 본부로 삼은 집 앞입니다. 마크햄 경은 여러분이 틀림없이 우승하고 싶어 할 보물찾기 대회의 후원자입니다.\n"
"대회 심판도 안에 있으며, 찾아낸 대회 물품을 제출하려면 그와 이야기해야 합니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=143|field=0"
msgid ""
"The Spirit Guild can be found through the door to the east.\n"
"You must have a membership to use the services of the Guild, which include spell purchase and skill teaching.\n"
"To become a Spirit Guild member, you must first visit Roger in his house a little way southeast of here and purchase a membership.\n"
"Also remember, a character who wishes to learn a Spirit spell must have the Spirit magic skill!"
msgstr ""
"동쪽 문 너머에 영혼 길드가 있습니다.\n"
"주문 구매와 기술 교육을 포함한 길드 서비스를 이용하려면 회원권이 필요합니다.\n"
"영혼 길드에 가입하려면 먼저 여기서 남동쪽으로 조금 떨어진 집에 있는 로저를 찾아가 회원권을 구입해야 합니다.\n"
"또한 영혼 주문을 배우려는 캐릭터는 영혼 마법 기술을 익혀야 한다는 점을 기억하십시오!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=144|field=0"
msgid ""
"The Air Guild is on the other side of this door.\n"
"You must have a membership to use the services of the Guild, which include spell purchase and skill teaching.\n"
"To become an Air Guild member, you must first visit Carolyn in her house a little way southeast of here and purchase a membership.\n"
"Also remember, a character who wishes to learn an Air spell must have the Air magic skill!"
msgstr ""
"이 문 반대편에는 공기 길드가 있습니다.\n"
"주문 구매와 기술 교육을 포함한 길드 서비스를 이용하려면 회원권이 필요합니다.\n"
"공기 길드에 가입하려면 먼저 여기서 남동쪽으로 조금 떨어진 집에 있는 캐럴린을 찾아가 회원권을 구입해야 합니다.\n"
"또한 공기 주문을 배우려는 캐릭터는 공기 마법 기술을 익혀야 한다는 점을 기억하십시오!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=145|field=0"
msgid ""
"This building is where you will find the town Alchemist.\n"
"The alchemist sells potions and potions ingredients, and is also a place where your characters may learn the Alchemy skill.\n"
"You must have alchemy skill to make even the most basic of potions, and you can do that by opening your character's inventory, picking up a potion ingredient, and right clicking it on an empty potion bottle.\n"
"You can use a similar procedure to mix two potions together.\n"
"Alchemists know that certain mixtures produce certain results, but it's a trade secret.\n"
"You'll have to figure it out for yourself.\n"
"Be warned that some mixtures are explosive!"
msgstr ""
"이 건물에는 마을의 연금술사가 있습니다.\n"
"연금술사는 물약과 물약 재료를 판매하며, 캐릭터가 연금술 기술을 배울 수도 있습니다.\n"
"가장 기본적인 물약을 만들 때도 연금술 기술이 필요합니다. 캐릭터의 소지품을 열고 물약 재료를 집어 빈 물약병 위에서 오른쪽 클릭하면 됩니다.\n"
"비슷한 방법으로 두 물약을 섞을 수도 있습니다.\n"
"연금술사들은 어떤 조합이 어떤 결과를 내는지 알고 있지만, 그것은 영업 비밀입니다.\n"
"직접 알아내야 합니다.\n"
"일부 혼합물은 폭발하니 주의하십시오!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=146|field=0"
msgid ""
"This door leads to the Body Guild.\n"
"You must have a membership to use the services of the Guild, which include spell purchase and skill teaching.\n"
"To become a Body Guild member, you must first visit Roger in his house a little way southeast of here and purchase a membership.\n"
"Also remember, a character who wishes to learn a Body spell must have the Body magic skill!"
msgstr ""
"이 문은 육체 길드로 이어집니다.\n"
"주문 구매와 기술 교육을 포함한 길드 서비스를 이용하려면 회원권이 필요합니다.\n"
"육체 길드에 가입하려면 먼저 여기서 남동쪽으로 조금 떨어진 집에 있는 로저를 찾아가 회원권을 구입해야 합니다.\n"
"또한 육체 주문을 배우려는 캐릭터는 육체 마법 기술을 익혀야 한다는 점을 기억하십시오!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=147|field=0"
msgid ""
"You have found the Magic shop.\n"
"The magic shop is every true adventurer's favorite store.\n"
"Here you can buy and sell all magic items except for magic weapons and armor."
msgstr ""
"마법 상점을 찾으셨습니다.\n"
"마법 상점은 진정한 모험가라면 누구나 좋아하는 곳입니다.\n"
"이곳에서는 마법 무기와 갑옷을 제외한 모든 마법 아이템을 사고팔 수 있습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=148|field=0"
msgid ""
"This building is where you may find the Fire Guild.\n"
"You must have a membership to use the services of the Guild, which include spell purchase and skill teaching.\n"
"To become a Fire Guild member, you must first visit Carolyn in her house a little way southeast of here and purchase a membership.\n"
"Also remember, a character who wishes to learn a Fire spell must have the Fire magic skill!"
msgstr ""
"이 건물에는 불 길드가 있습니다.\n"
"주문 구매와 기술 교육을 포함한 길드 서비스를 이용하려면 회원권이 필요합니다.\n"
"불 길드에 가입하려면 먼저 여기서 남동쪽으로 조금 떨어진 집에 있는 캐럴린을 찾아가 회원권을 구입해야 합니다.\n"
"또한 불 주문을 배우려는 캐릭터는 불 마법 기술을 익혀야 한다는 점을 기억하십시오!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=149|field=0"
msgid ""
"Be careful!\n"
"You are about to enter an area of the island that is infested with Dragonflies.\n"
"They are quite dangerous!\n"
"Lord Markham is NOT responsible if you are injured or even killed venturing into this part of the island.\n"
"You have been warned!"
msgstr ""
"조심하십시오!\n"
"이제 잠자리 떼가 들끓는 섬 지역으로 들어가려 하고 있습니다.\n"
"놈들은 상당히 위험합니다!\n"
"마크햄 경은 이곳에 들어갔다가 다치거나 목숨을 잃더라도 책임지지 않습니다.\n"
"분명히 경고했습니다!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=14|field=0"
msgid ""
"Welcome to the Guildhouse of the Merchants of Alvar. I am Bastian Loudrin, "
"the high guildmaster. From here we run the Alvarian trade empire."
msgstr ""
"알바르 상인회관에 오신 것을 환영합니다. 나는 수석 길드장 바스티안 라우드린이오. 이곳에서 알바르의 무역 제국을 운영하고 있소."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=150|field=0"
msgid ""
"Um…It isn't wise to enter this cave.\n"
"A terrible dragon lives within, and few who enter leave alive.\n"
"If you really want to enter, just click on the back wall of the cave…"
msgstr ""
"음…이 동굴에는 들어가지 않는 편이 좋습니다.\n"
"안에는 무시무시한 드래곤이 살며, 들어간 사람 중 살아서 나온 이는 거의 없습니다.\n"
"정말 들어가고 싶다면 동굴 뒤쪽 벽을 누르십시오…"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=151|field=0"
msgid ""
"This is the entrance to the old Temple of the Moon.\n"
"It is infested with small vermin that can give a nasty bite, but it's not too dangerous.\n"
"It's possible there are items for the scavenger hunt within, so you should consider searching here at some point.\n"
"To enter, just click on the back wall of this cave."
msgstr ""
"이곳은 오래된 달의 신전 입구입니다.\n"
"안에는 심하게 물어뜯는 작은 해충들이 들끓지만, 그리 위험한 곳은 아닙니다.\n"
"보물찾기 대회 물품이 있을 수도 있으니 언젠가는 수색해 보는 편이 좋습니다.\n"
"들어가려면 이 동굴 뒤쪽 벽을 누르기만 하십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=152|field=0"
msgid ""
"I’m Bill Lasker, and I am the Master Thief.\n"
"[Bill makes a sweeping gesture with one arm, taking in the whole of the sewers.] I am undisputed ruler of all I survey, and I hear of everything that happens in my mighty kingdom.\n"
"I am at your service."
msgstr ""
"나는 대도둑 빌 래스커요.\n"
"[빌이 한 팔을 크게 휘둘러 하수도 전체를 가리킨다.] 내 눈에 보이는 모든 곳의 명실상부한 지배자이며, 이 위대한 왕국에서 벌어지는 일은 무엇이든 듣고 있소.\n"
"무엇이든 맡겨 주시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=153|field=0"
msgid ""
"I’m Bill Lasker, and I am the Master Thief.\n"
"I rule this underground kingdom, and am responsible for the welfare of the thieves who live down here.\n"
"You have been killing my subjects.\n"
"I would strike against you, but I fear your allies would destroy me.\n"
"So I will deal with you, but my prices will be higher.\n"
"What do you want?"
msgstr ""
"나는 대도둑 빌 래스커요.\n"
"이 지하 왕국을 다스리며, 이 아래에 사는 도둑들의 안위를 책임지고 있소.\n"
"그대들은 내 백성들을 죽여 왔소.\n"
"당장 공격하고 싶지만, 그대들의 동료들이 나를 파괴할까 두렵군.\n"
"그러니 거래는 하겠지만, 가격은 더 비쌀 것이오.\n"
"무슨 용건이오?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=154|field=0"
msgid "Greetings Rogues, how may I be of service?"
msgstr "안녕하시오, 로그들이여. 무엇을 도와드릴까요?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=155|field=0"
msgid ""
"Greetings.\n"
"I am Seknit Undershadow, Master Assassin for the Enforcement Arm of the Necromancer’s Guild.\n"
"I am pleased to meet you.\n"
"Would you like a cup of tea?"
msgstr ""
"안녕하시오.\n"
"나는 강령술사 길드 집행부의 암살 대가 세크닛 언더섀도요.\n"
"만나서 반갑소.\n"
"차 한 잔 하시겠소?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=156|field=0"
msgid ""
"Ah, welcome my friends.\n"
"I hope you are doing well.\n"
"How about a spot of tea today?"
msgstr ""
"아, 어서 오십시오, 친구들.\n"
"잘 지내고 계시길 바랍니다.\n"
"오늘은 차 한잔 어떻습니까?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=157|field=0"
msgid ""
"Hello again, fellow Assassins.\n"
"My tea and company are always yours."
msgstr ""
"또 오셨군요, 암살자 동료들이여.\n"
"제 차와 말벗은 언제든 여러분을 위해 준비되어 있습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=158|field=0"
msgid ""
"Hail.\n"
"I am Sir Charles Quixote.\n"
"I am the humble champion of the people, and I am at thy service."
msgstr ""
"반갑소.\n"
"나는 찰스 키호테 경이오.\n"
"백성들의 보잘것없는 수호자이며, 그대를 섬기겠소."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=159|field=0"
msgid ""
"Why do we dally?\n"
"Even now that monster could be laying waste to the countryside!\n"
"Tally Ho!"
msgstr ""
"왜 꾸물거리는 거요?\n"
"바로 지금도 그 괴물이 온 나라를 쑥대밭으로 만들고 있을지 모르오!\n"
"자, 출발합시다!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=15|field=0"
msgid ""
"We have identified those we believe would join an alliance to stand against "
"the crisis. These are: the Minotaurs of Ravage Roaming, the Clerics of the "
"Temple of the Sun in Murmurwoods, the Dragons of Garrote Gorge, the "
"Necromancers' Guild in Shadowspire, and Charles Quixote's Dragon hunting "
"camp in Garrote Gorge.Now none of us believe that you can get all of them to"
" work together, but with us and the Trolls already with the alliance, it "
"should suffice if three of the five join us.Perhaps you should begin by "
"speaking with Sahil Ittalle who lives at the north end of the town. He is "
"our guild's historian and the best person to brief you on our potential "
"allies' various dispositions."
msgstr ""
"이번 위기에 맞서 동맹에 합류할 만한 세력들을 확인했소. 라비지 로밍의 미노타우로스, 머머우즈 태양의 신전의 성직자, 가로트 협곡의 "
"드래곤, 섀도스파이어의 강령술사 길드, 그리고 가로트 협곡에 있는 찰스 키호테 경의 드래곤 사냥꾼 야영지요.우리 중 누구도 그들 모두를 "
"협력시킬 수 있으리라 믿지는 않소. 하지만 우리와 트롤들이 이미 동맹에 합류했으니, 다섯 세력 중 셋만 동참해도 충분할 것이오.우선 마을"
" 북쪽 끝에 사는 사힐 이탈레와 이야기해 보시오. 그는 우리 길드의 역사가이며, 잠재적 동맹들의 성향을 설명해 줄 가장 적합한 사람이오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=160|field=0"
msgid ""
"Why do we delay rescuing Alice?\n"
"Who knows what plans the fiend has for this innocent girl?\n"
"Let us replace talk with action and rescue the poor girl at once!"
msgstr ""
"왜 앨리스를 구하러 가는 일을 미루는 거요?\n"
"그 악당이 이 순진한 소녀에게 무슨 짓을 꾸미는지 누가 알겠소?\n"
"말은 그만하고 당장 불쌍한 소녀를 구하러 갑시다!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=161|field=0"
msgid ""
"Salutations Heroes!\n"
"I am certain thou hast much to accomplish before we dally about."
msgstr ""
"안녕하시오, 영웅들이여!\n"
"그대들은 한가로이 지체하기 전에 해야 할 일이 많을 것이오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=162|field=0"
msgid ""
"Hello?\n"
"You don't look like William's normal people."
msgstr ""
"누구요?\n"
"당신들은 윌리엄이 평소 데려오는 사람들처럼 보이지 않는군요."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=163|field=0"
msgid ""
"Hello?\n"
"I don't think I've seen you before."
msgstr ""
"누구요?\n"
"전에 본 적은 없는 것 같군."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=164|field=0"
msgid ""
"Good day.\n"
"William Setag, Villain Extraordinare, at your service.\n"
"Good to make your acquaintance."
msgstr ""
"좋은 하루요.\n"
"비범한 악당 윌리엄 세탁이 모시겠소.\n"
"만나서 반갑소."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=165|field=0"
msgid ""
"Villains!\n"
"Welcome!\n"
"Too rarely do my villainous friends pay me visits."
msgstr ""
"악당들이여!\n"
"어서 오시오!\n"
"내 악당 친구들은 너무 드물게 찾아오는군."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=166|field=0"
msgid ""
"Hello.\n"
"I am Bartholomew Hume, Master of this monastery.\n"
"Is there something I can help you with?"
msgstr ""
"안녕하시오.\n"
"나는 이 수도원의 원장 바솔로뮤 흄이오.\n"
"무엇을 도와드릴까요?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=167|field=0"
msgid ""
"Fellow Masters!\n"
"It is good to see you, how may I do you service?"
msgstr ""
"동료 달인들이여!\n"
"다시 만나 기쁘오. 무엇을 도와드릴까요?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=168|field=0"
msgid ""
"Hello, my pupils.\n"
"I see you have found the proper tomb."
msgstr ""
"안녕하구나, 제자들아.\n"
"제대로 된 무덤을 찾아냈군."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=169|field=0"
msgid ""
"I am Stephan Sand, Master of the…aggressive side of the disciplined life.\n"
"Once I was a monk, now I am something greater."
msgstr ""
"나는 규율 잡힌 삶의…공격적인 면을 가르치는 대가 스테판 샌드요.\n"
"한때는 수도사였지만, 이제는 그보다 더 위대한 존재가 되었소."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=16|field=0"
msgid ""
"I am Overdune, I hunt meat for the village of Rust. Or I did so before the "
"lake of fire came to destroy our homes."
msgstr "나는 오버듄이오. 러스트 마을을 위해 고기를 사냥했소. 불의 호수가 생겨 우리 집을 파괴하기 전까지는 말이오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=170|field=0"
msgid ""
"Now that you've achieved the exhalted status of Ninja, I have nothing further to give you.\n"
"I hope my teachings take you far."
msgstr ""
"이제 닌자라는 숭고한 지위에 올랐으니, 더는 내가 줄 것이 없소.\n"
"내 가르침이 그대를 멀리 이끌어 주길 바라오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=171|field=0"
msgid ""
"How are you doing?\n"
"[Lawrence bows deeply) I am Master Mark, champion bowman.\n"
"I've won the Annual Avlee Tourney for the past 4 years!\n"
"But enough of me, how about yourselves?"
msgstr ""
"어떻게 지내시오?\n"
"[로런스가 깊이 절한다) 나는 최고의 궁수인 마크 대가요.\n"
"지난 4년 동안 매년 아블리 대회에서 우승했소!\n"
"내 이야기는 그만하고, 그대들은 어떻소?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=172|field=0"
msgid ""
"Welcome my friends!\n"
"That's a fine weapon you have there, but don't think for a moment you'll best me in this year's Tourney--I'm still the Master!"
msgstr ""
"어서 오시오, 친구들!\n"
"훌륭한 무기를 지녔지만, 올해 대회에서 나를 이길 수 있다고는 잠시도 생각하지 마시오. 여전히 내가 달인이니까!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=173|field=0"
msgid ""
"Welcome.\n"
"[Mr. Snick barely speaks above a whisper.\n"
"There is a small, white scar at the base of his throat] Are you here to be trained?"
msgstr ""
"어서 오시오.\n"
"[스닉 씨는 속삭임보다 조금 큰 목소리로 말한다.\n"
"목 아래에는 작고 하얀 흉터가 있다] 훈련받으러 왔소?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=174|field=0"
msgid ""
"Students…[Mr. Snick rasps the word, then smiles] no longer.\n"
"I am proud to have helped you on your way.\n"
"Use your new weapon…[wheeze] wisely."
msgstr ""
"학생들…[스닉 씨가 쉰 목소리로 그 말을 내뱉고 미소 짓는다] 이제는 아니군.\n"
"그대들이 나아가는 길에 도움을 주었다니 자랑스럽소.\n"
"새 무기를…[쌕쌕거림] 현명하게 사용하시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=175|field=0"
msgid ""
"Well met!\n"
"[Leda draws her blade and chops smartly at the wind] Are you here to fight, or here to learn?\n"
"Either way [her flourish ends in a knight's salute] I'm happy to oblige!"
msgstr ""
"잘 만났소!\n"
"[레다가 검을 뽑아 날렵하게 허공을 벤다] 싸우러 왔소, 아니면 배우러 왔소?\n"
"어느 쪽이든 [그녀의 검무가 기사의 경례로 끝난다] 기꺼이 상대해 주겠소!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=176|field=0"
msgid ""
"Hail, champions!\n"
"Your courage and skill has all the tongues in the Kingdom wagging!\n"
"I am very proud of you!"
msgstr ""
"만세, 챔피언들이여!\n"
"그대들의 용기와 솜씨가 왕국의 모든 사람 입에 오르내리고 있소!\n"
"정말 자랑스럽소!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=177|field=0"
msgid ""
"So!\n"
"You wish to learn to fight?\n"
"Well, you've found the right man.\n"
"For those of you who are Knights, anyway.\n"
"If you're not a knight, you still benefit from my teachings, but not as much."
msgstr ""
"그래!\n"
"싸우는 법을 배우고 싶다고?\n"
"제대로 된 사람을 찾아왔군.\n"
"적어도 기사인 자들에게는 말이지.\n"
"기사가 아니더라도 내 가르침에서 도움은 얻겠지만, 그리 크지는 않을 것이오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=178|field=0"
msgid ""
"[Frederick rises hastily to his feet] None shall pass! [he blinks and rubs his eyes] Oh.\n"
"It's you.\n"
"Sorry, I thought you were someone else.\n"
"How goes the villainy?"
msgstr ""
"[프레더릭이 황급히 자리에서 일어난다] 아무도 지나갈 수 없다! [그가 눈을 깜박이고 비빈다] 아.\n"
"자네들이었군.\n"
"미안하네, 다른 사람인 줄 알았어.\n"
"악행은 잘되어 가나?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=179|field=0"
msgid ""
"[Lysander doffs his hat and bows deeply] Salutations!\n"
"I am Lysander Sweet, and I am in charge of promoting Hunters to Rangers.\n"
"I have a task in mind if I think you're up to it.\n"
"It should prove quite educational!"
msgstr ""
"[라이샌더가 모자를 벗고 깊이 절한다] 안녕하시오!\n"
"나는 라이샌더 스위트이며, 사냥꾼을 레인저로 승급시키는 일을 맡고 있소.\n"
"그대들이 감당할 수 있다고 판단하면 맡길 일이 하나 있소.\n"
"아주 교육적인 경험이 될 것이오!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=17|field=0"
msgid "Leave me be. I morn the death of Vilebite, my son."
msgstr "날 내버려 두시오. 아들 바일바이트의 죽음을 애도하고 있소."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=180|field=0"
msgid ""
"Your good works have served the forest well.\n"
"And, I can see, the experience has served you well in turn.\n"
"May you continue to reap the rewards of your good deeds, my friends!"
msgstr ""
"여러분의 선행은 숲에 큰 도움이 되었습니다.\n"
"그리고 보아하니, 그 경험은 여러분에게도 도움이 되었군요.\n"
"앞으로도 선행의 보답을 거두시기를 바랍니다, 친구들!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=181|field=0"
msgid ""
"Hmmm. Make it quick!\n"
"You look like time wasters to me.\n"
"There's nothing worse.\n"
"You know, when I was a boy, my elders didn't tolerate no one lolligaggin around.\n"
"No slackers, neither.\n"
"[Ebednezer squints and leans closer to you] You're not one of them, are you?\n"
"Slackers? 'Cause I don't talk to slackers."
msgstr ""
"흐음. 빨리 말해!\n"
"너희는 시간을 낭비하는 자들처럼 보이는군.\n"
"그보다 나쁜 건 없지.\n"
"내가 어렸을 때는 어른들이 빈둥거리는 자를 절대 봐주지 않았어.\n"
"게으름뱅이도 마찬가지였고.\n"
"[에베드네저가 눈을 가늘게 뜨고 가까이 몸을 기울인다] 너희는 그런 자들이 아니겠지?\n"
"게으름뱅이 말이야. 나는 게으름뱅이와는 말하지 않거든."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=182|field=0"
msgid ""
"Bounty Hunters.\n"
"[Ebednezer smiles slowly and evilly]\n"
"Now THERE'S a job!\n"
"Yes sir.\n"
"Get things done righteo quick, I'll venture. Heh."
msgstr ""
"현상금 사냥꾼들이라.\n"
"[에베드네저가 천천히 사악하게 미소 짓는다]\n"
"그거야말로 제대로 된 직업이지!\n"
"그래, 그렇고말고.\n"
"일을 아주 빠릿빠릿하게 처리하니까. 흐흐."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=183|field=0"
msgid ""
"[The little king bows] Welcome to my realm, mortals!\n"
"Few attain the door, and for that, I commend thee.\n"
"But now that you stand at the threshold of Faerie, know that few return that dare to enter."
msgstr ""
"[작은 왕이 절한다] 내 왕국에 온 것을 환영한다, 필멸자들이여!\n"
"이 문에 도달하는 자는 드물다. 그 점은 칭찬해 주마.\n"
"하지만 이제 요정 세계의 문턱에 섰으니, 감히 들어간 자 중 돌아오는 이는 거의 없다는 것을 명심해라."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=184|field=0"
msgid ""
"Ah, travellers. [the tree speaks VERY slowly] How.\n"
"Are.\n"
"You.\n"
"Today?\n"
" The trees are quite disturbed.\n"
"Angry.\n"
"The Heart of the Wood has been stolen by Walkers.\n"
"The Walkers will pay in blood until the Heart is returned."
msgstr ""
"아, 여행자들이군. [나무가 아주 천천히 말한다] 오늘.\n"
"기분이.\n"
"어떠.\n"
"하냐?\n"
" 나무들이 몹시 동요하고 있다.\n"
"화가 났다.\n"
"걷는 자들이 숲의 심장을 훔쳐 갔다.\n"
"심장이 돌아올 때까지 걷는 자들은 피로 대가를 치를 것이다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=185|field=0"
msgid ""
"The trees speak of Walkers who want to return our Heart.\n"
"I hope they do.\n"
"Walkers take so much."
msgstr ""
"나무들이 우리의 심장을 돌려주려는 걷는 자들에 대해 말한다.\n"
"정말 돌려주면 좋겠다.\n"
"걷는 자들은 너무 많은 것을 가져간다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=186|field=0"
msgid ""
"Ohhhhh…It's the Walkers from the South.\n"
"I remember you!\n"
"You returned the Heart.\n"
"The trees are very happy, and promise not to kill any more walkers.\n"
"Come and talk to me any time."
msgstr ""
"오오오…남쪽에서 온 걷는 자들이구나.\n"
"너희를 기억한다!\n"
"심장을 돌려주었지.\n"
"나무들이 아주 기뻐하며, 앞으로는 걷는 자를 죽이지 않겠다고 약속했다.\n"
"언제든 와서 이야기하거라."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=187|field=0"
msgid ""
"[High Priest Devine smiles and inclines her head] Sunlight Reveal, my lords.\n"
"How may I help you?"
msgstr ""
"[대사제 디바인이 미소 지으며 고개를 숙인다] 태양빛이 드러내기를, 영주님들.\n"
"무엇을 도와드릴까요?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=188|field=0"
msgid ""
"Sunlight Reveal, my fellow Priests.\n"
"I am so proud to have you as members of our faith!"
msgstr ""
"태양빛이 드러내기를, 사제 동료들이여.\n"
"여러분이 우리 신앙의 일원이 되어 정말 자랑스럽습니다!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=189|field=0"
msgid ""
"[High Priest Falk bows and clasps his hands together] Shadow Conceal, Lords.\n"
"How may I be of service?"
msgstr ""
"[대사제 포크가 절하며 두 손을 모은다] 그림자가 감추기를, 영주님들.\n"
"무엇을 도와드릴까요?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=18|field=0"
msgid "Th-thank you for giving my son Vilebite his rest."
msgstr "아-아들 바일바이트에게 안식을 주어 고맙소."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=190|field=0"
msgid ""
"Shadow Conceal, Brethren.\n"
"Congratulations on your promotion to Priests of the Dark."
msgstr ""
"그림자가 감추기를, 형제들이여.\n"
"어둠의 사제로 승급한 것을 축하합니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=191|field=0"
msgid ""
"Thomas Grey, at your service!\n"
"[The Wizard bows quickly and spreads his palms, smiling] "
msgstr ""
"토머스 그레이가 모시겠습니다!\n"
"[마법사가 재빨리 절하고 미소 지으며 양손을 펼친다] "

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=192|field=0"
msgid ""
"My fellow Archmages.\n"
"Rare is the individual who can achieve this status.\n"
"Congratulations!"
msgstr ""
"대마법사 동료들이여.\n"
"이 지위에 오를 수 있는 사람은 드뭅니다.\n"
"축하합니다!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=193|field=0"
msgid ""
"[The Lich stares at you awhile before speaking] Who dares disturb me?\n"
"Earthly Lords?\n"
"Hmmph.\n"
"Your status matters not, once death's door has been passed."
msgstr ""
"[리치가 한동안 그대들을 바라보다가 말한다] 감히 누가 나를 방해하는가?\n"
"지상의 영주들이라고?\n"
"흥.\n"
"죽음의 문을 지나고 나면 너희의 지위는 아무 의미도 없다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=194|field=0"
msgid ""
"Death…[The Lich's voice is hoarse and quavery] isn't so bad when you've been through it once or twice.\n"
"Life was always more painful to me.\n"
"Are you pleased with your new status?"
msgstr ""
"죽음이란…[리치의 목소리는 쉬고 떨린다] 한두 번 겪고 나면 그리 나쁘지 않다.\n"
"삶은 언제나 나에게 더 고통스러웠지.\n"
"새로운 지위가 마음에 드느냐?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=195|field=0"
msgid ""
"Pleasant weather we're having, isn't it?\n"
"We are blessed to live in this climate, and have such mild Gods to appease.\n"
"Have you offered recently?"
msgstr ""
"날씨가 참 좋지 않습니까?\n"
"이런 기후에서 살며 온화한 신들을 달랠 수 있으니 우리는 축복받았습니다.\n"
"최근에 제물을 바치셨습니까?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=196|field=0"
msgid ""
"I was pleased to offer the Ceremony of Ascension to you after your brave efforts to lay the dead to rest.\n"
"The world breathes easier from your help."
msgstr ""
"죽은 이들을 안식시키기 위해 용감히 노력한 뒤 그대들에게 승천 의식을 치러 줄 수 있어 기뻤습니다.\n"
"그대들의 도움으로 세상이 한결 편히 숨 쉬는군요."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=197|field=0"
msgid ""
"Foreign Lords!\n"
"How interesting!\n"
"My familiar said she could smell the earth of the lands across the sea on you.\n"
"My name is Tor Anwyn, leader of the Warlocks of Nighon, though not King of Nighon.\n"
"That title belongs to another.\n"
"Pleased to meet you."
msgstr ""
"외국의 영주들이군!\n"
"흥미롭군요!\n"
"내 사역마가 그대들에게서 바다 건너 땅의 흙냄새를 맡을 수 있다고 했습니다.\n"
"내 이름은 토르 앤윈이며, 나이혼의 왕은 아니지만 나이혼 흑마법사들의 지도자입니다.\n"
"왕의 칭호는 다른 이의 것이지요.\n"
"만나서 반갑습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=198|field=0"
msgid ""
"Congratulations on your promotions to Warlock!\n"
"Few can pass the test and find themselves an appropriate familiar.\n"
"I'm pleased you were successful."
msgstr ""
"흑마법사로 승급한 것을 축하합니다!\n"
"시험을 통과하고 자신에게 맞는 사역마를 찾는 이는 드뭅니다.\n"
"성공해서 기쁩니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=199|field=0"
msgid "I am yours to command, master."
msgstr "명령만 내리십시오, 주인님."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=19|field=0"
msgid ""
"It is only because you are under Bastian Loudrin's protection that I have "
"allowed you this audience. Know you stand before Deftclaw Redreaver, "
"Ultimate Flightleader of the Dragons of Jadame. I am not to be tarried with."
" Speak your business!"
msgstr ""
"바스티안 라우드린의 보호를 받고 있기 때문에 그대들에게 알현을 허락한 것이오. 그대들은 제이덤 드래곤들의 최고 편대장 데프트클로 레드리버"
" 앞에 서 있다는 것을 명심하시오. 나는 한가하게 지체할 사람이 아니오. 용건을 말하시오!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=1|field=0"
msgid ""
"I'm glad I found you! Of all the other guards, you are the only one I've "
"seen! Regnan Pirates attack the island. We must inform the caravan master, "
"Dadeross. He's visiting the village chieftain. Find him! I'll return to the "
"wagons to guard them."
msgstr ""
"당신을 찾아서 다행입니다! 다른 경비병들은 하나도 보이지 않았는데, 당신만은 찾았습니다! 레그나 해적들이 섬을 공격하고 있습니다. "
"대상단장 다데로스에게 알려야 합니다. 그는 마을 족장을 만나고 있습니다. 그를 찾으십시오! 나는 마차로 돌아가 지키겠습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=200|field=0"
msgid ""
"Ah, the new lords! Please excuse the condition of the castle--it's been awhile since anyone has taken proper care of it.\n"
"I would have greeted you indoors, but for the Goblins.\n"
"A small tribe of them has moved inside.\n"
"I've asked them to leave, but they won't listen to me.\n"
"They were quite rude, as a matter of fact.\n"
"Perhaps you could...talk to them?\n"
"I'll be in the On the House Tavern here in Harmondale should you manage to 'convince' them to leave."
msgstr ""
"아, 새로운 영주님들이군요! 성의 상태는 양해해 주십시오. 제대로 관리한 사람이 없은 지 오래됐습니다.\n"
"고블린들만 아니었다면 안에서 맞이했을 것입니다.\n"
"그들의 작은 부족 하나가 안으로 들어와 살고 있습니다.\n"
"떠나 달라고 했지만 제 말은 듣지 않더군요.\n"
"사실 아주 무례했습니다.\n"
"혹시 그들과…이야기해 주시겠습니까?\n"
"그들을 떠나도록 '설득'하신다면, 저는 하몬데일의 공짜 술집에 있겠습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=201|field=0"
msgid "You rang, my lords?"
msgstr "부르셨습니까, 영주님들?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=202|field=0"
msgid ""
"So.\n"
"Lords of Harmondale, eh?\n"
"I am King Hothfarr IX, Lord of Stone City.\n"
"What do you want?"
msgstr ""
"그래.\n"
"하몬데일의 영주들이라고?\n"
"나는 스톤 시티의 군주, 호스파르 9세 왕이오.\n"
"무슨 용건이오?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=203|field=0"
msgid ""
"Welcome, Harmondale!\n"
"Stone city is at your disposal."
msgstr ""
"어서 오시오, 하몬데일!\n"
"스톤 시티는 그대들의 뜻에 따르겠소."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=204|field=0"
msgid ""
"Everybody run!\n"
"The Stonesnakes are upon… uh… what?"
msgstr ""
"모두 도망쳐!\n"
"스톤스네이크들이 쳐들어… 어… 뭐지?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=205|field=0"
msgid ""
"Ahhhhh!\n"
"Help!\n"
"They're coming\n"
"fo… me?\n"
"What happened?\n"
"Who are you?"
msgstr ""
"아아아악!\n"
"도와줘!\n"
"놈들이 오고 있어\n"
"나를… 잡으러?\n"
"무슨 일이 일어난 거지?\n"
"당신들은 누구요?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=206|field=0"
msgid ""
"[Lady Ellen curtsies gracefully]\n"
"I am Ellen Rockway.\n"
"I speak for Erathia on matters of state.\n"
"I will be staying here in your court for the duration of your reign."
msgstr ""
"[엘런 부인이 우아하게 절한다]\n"
"저는 엘런 록웨이입니다.\n"
"국정에 관해 에라시아를 대표합니다.\n"
"영주님들이 통치하는 동안 이 궁정에 머물겠습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=207|field=0"
msgid ""
"Greetings.\n"
"I am Alain Hani, Ambassador from Avlee.\n"
"I speak for my country, and my word is Avlee's bond.\n"
"I will always be available for any business you wish to conduct."
msgstr ""
"안녕하시오.\n"
"나는 아블리의 대사 알랭 하니요.\n"
"내가 조국을 대변하며, 내 말은 곧 아블리의 약속이오.\n"
"그대들이 처리하고 싶은 일이 있다면 언제든 나를 찾으시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=208|field=0"
msgid ""
"Lord Markham tells me you are the new lords of Harmondale.\n"
"Welcome to the peerage.\n"
"Now, why do you request an audience of me?"
msgstr ""
"마크햄 경에게 그대들이 하몬데일의 새 영주라고 들었소.\n"
"귀족이 된 것을 환영하오.\n"
"그런데 왜 내게 알현을 요청했소?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=209|field=0"
msgid ""
"Ah, Harmondale.\n"
"Before we conduct business, I would like to say I recently noticed you returned the wrong prisoner from Avlee.\n"
"Such a remarkable likeness!\n"
"I should execute you, but the war is over, and that would be bad form.\n"
"Just remember that your treachery has been...noted."
msgstr ""
"아, 하몬데일이군.\n"
"용건을 처리하기 전에, 최근 그대들이 아블리에서 잘못된 죄수를 돌려보냈다는 사실을 알게 되었다고 말하고 싶소.\n"
"정말 놀라울 정도로 닮았더군!\n"
"그대들을 처형해야 마땅하지만 전쟁이 끝났고, 그건 품위 없는 행동이겠지.\n"
"그대들의 배신은…기록되었다는 것만 기억하시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=20|field=0"
msgid "What do you want?"
msgstr "무슨 용건이오?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=210|field=0"
msgid ""
"So, Harmondale has new lords.\n"
"Again.\n"
"Well, [King Parson looks at his scribe] we better write their names down lest history blinks and misses them, eh?\n"
"Haw haw ha!\n"
"[Ahem] Yes.\n"
"Well, you had a reason for visiting me, right?"
msgstr ""
"그래, 하몬데일에 새 영주들이 생겼군.\n"
"또다시.\n"
"좋아, [파슨 왕이 서기를 바라본다] 역사가 눈을 깜빡이는 사이 그들을 놓치지 않도록 이름을 적어 두는 게 좋겠군, 그렇지?\n"
"하하하!\n"
"[헛기침] 그래.\n"
"그런데 나를 찾아온 이유가 있었겠지?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=211|field=0"
msgid ""
"You again?\n"
"You know, I was just asking my generals why the attack on Fort Riverstride was such a disaster when someone on my staff noticed the traps on the map YOU gave us were in the wrong places!\n"
"[the King chuckles, smiling] Imagine my generals' relief when we all realized that it wasn't incompetence that killed 74 elves, but treachery! Hahahahaha! [King Parson slaps his knee, then abruptly stops laughing and stares at you.]I would execute the lot of you, but the war is over. In the interests of harmony, you can live.\n"
"For now."
msgstr ""
"또 그대들인가?\n"
"마침 장군들에게 리버스트라이드 요새 공격이 왜 그렇게 처참히 실패했는지 묻고 있었는데, 참모 중 하나가 그대들이 준 지도에 함정 위치가 잘못 표시되어 있다는 걸 발견했소!\n"
"[왕이 미소 지으며 낄낄 웃는다] 무능해서 엘프 74명이 죽은 게 아니라 배신 때문이었다는 걸 깨달았을 때 장군들이 얼마나 안도했을지 상상해 보시오! 하하하하! [파슨 왕이 무릎을 치다가 갑자기 웃음을 멈추고 그대들을 노려본다.]그대들을 모조리 처형해야 하지만 전쟁은 끝났소. 화합을 위해 살려 주겠소.\n"
"당장은."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=212|field=0"
msgid ""
"My lords, I have an urgent message from the Erathian Ambassador for you.\n"
"I am told it has details of an important event that is happening RIGHT NOW, and that you should read it immediately.\n"
"Here is the letter."
msgstr ""
"영주님들, 에라시아 대사가 보낸 긴급 서신을 가져왔습니다.\n"
"바로 지금 벌어지고 있는 중대한 사건의 자세한 내용이 담겼으니 즉시 읽으셔야 한다고 합니다.\n"
"여기 편지입니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=213|field=0"
msgid ""
"How are you doing, my lords?\n"
"I am Judge Grey.\n"
"I have the unusual job of arbitrating disputes between warring nations.\n"
"The position has it's rewards, but you'll never hear the people you're helping thank you.\n"
"I always know I'm doing the right thing when both sides are angry with me at once."
msgstr ""
"어떻게 지내십니까, 영주님들?\n"
"저는 그레이 판사입니다.\n"
"전쟁 중인 국가들의 분쟁을 중재하는 특이한 일을 맡고 있습니다.\n"
"보람은 있지만, 도와주는 사람들에게서 감사 인사를 들을 일은 없지요.\n"
"양쪽이 동시에 제게 화를 낼 때면 제가 옳은 일을 하고 있다는 걸 알 수 있습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=214|field=0"
msgid ""
"Ah, greetings!\n"
"My lords, I am Ambassador Wright from Bracada.\n"
"You know, the wizards on Erathia's southern border.\n"
"You've become very important persons!\n"
"Since Judge Grey died in your lands, you must choose another Arbiter to help settle the dispute between Erathia and Avlee.\n"
"I formally invite you to visit Bracada and meet Judge Fairweather, who we strongly recommend for the post.\n"
"I don't mean to be pushy, but I'm sure you understand your choice will affect future relations between our two governments..."
msgstr ""
"아, 안녕하십니까!\n"
"영주님들, 저는 브라카다에서 온 라이트 대사입니다.\n"
"아시다시피 에라시아 남쪽 국경의 마법사들이지요.\n"
"이제 영주님들은 매우 중요한 분들이 되셨습니다!\n"
"그레이 판사가 영주님들의 땅에서 사망했으므로, 에라시아와 아블리의 분쟁을 해결할 새로운 중재자를 선택해야 합니다.\n"
"브라카다를 방문해 이 자리에 강력히 추천하는 페어웨더 판사를 만나시도록 정식으로 초대합니다.\n"
"억지로 몰아붙이려는 뜻은 아니지만, 그 선택이 두 정부의 향후 관계에 영향을 미친다는 점은 이해하시리라 믿습니다…"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=215|field=0"
msgid ""
"A pleasure to meet you, my lords.\n"
"My name is Ambassador Scale, and I represent Deyja, the land of the Necromancers northwest of Erathia.\n"
"Now, I know what you're thinking--Necromancy!\n"
"Yuck!\n"
"Isn't that death magic?\n"
"Well, it IS, but we merely pursue knowledge for it's own sake; rather noble if you ask me.\n"
"We're not so bad.\n"
"You should speak with some of the fellows--they really know how to party.\n"
"[The Ambassador forces a smile] Ha ha ha!I invite you to visit Deyja.\n"
"When Judge Grey died, you became the ones who must choose his successor.\n"
"We have someone in mind who will encourage our enemies to...um...bring this terrible war to an end.\n"
"Yes.\n"
"I urge you to choose Judge Sleen.\n"
"It would mean so much to us, and we could do so much for you!\n"
"Think about it, but don't think too long!"
msgstr ""
"만나 뵙게 되어 기쁩니다, 영주님들.\n"
"저는 스케일 대사이며, 에라시아 북서쪽에 있는 강령술사들의 땅 데이자를 대표합니다.\n"
"무슨 생각을 하시는지 압니다. 강령술이라고!\n"
"으웩!\n"
"그거 죽음의 마법 아닙니까?\n"
"그렇기는 하지만, 우리는 그저 지식 자체를 위해 탐구할 뿐입니다. 제게 묻는다면 꽤 고귀한 일이지요.\n"
"우리는 그렇게 나쁘지 않습니다.\n"
"우리 동료들과 이야기해 보십시오. 잔치를 벌일 줄 아는 자들입니다.\n"
"[대사가 억지로 미소 짓는다] 하하하!데이자를 방문하시도록 초대합니다.\n"
"그레이 판사가 죽은 뒤, 영주님들이 그의 후임을 선택하게 되었습니다.\n"
"우리에게는 적들이 이 끔찍한 전쟁을…음…끝내도록 권할 적임자가 있습니다.\n"
"그렇습니다.\n"
"슬린 판사를 선택하시길 촉구합니다.\n"
"우리에게는 정말 중요한 일이며, 우리도 영주님들을 위해 많은 일을 해 드릴 수 있습니다!\n"
"생각해 보십시오. 하지만 너무 오래 생각하지는 마십시오!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=216|field=0"
msgid ""
"The new lords of Harmondale, I presume.\n"
"I am Judge Sleen.\n"
"Let me be frank--my sympathies lie with Deyja and the Necromancers.\n"
"We want you to choose me for the job of Arbiter for the war between Erathia and Avlee.\n"
"Since both of those countries are the enemies of Deyja, I will be a fair judge.\n"
"However, choosing to be the ally of Deyja means CHOOSING WHAT OTHERS CALL \"\"DARKNESS\"\".This darkness business is pure rot.\n"
"Necromancy is nothing but the study death and what happens with the spirit after death.\n"
"Sure, the results can be a little grisly, but so is making sausage and the practice of law.\n"
"And nobody would say those jobs don't have their value.Choose me and be our ally.\n"
"Because if you cannot prove your friendship through this simple act, what else can you be but our enemy?\n"
"Remember, though, that once you choose me, you cannot later change your mind.\n"
"Your choice is permanent."
msgstr ""
"하몬데일의 새 영주들이겠군요.\n"
"저는 슬린 판사입니다.\n"
"솔직히 말하겠습니다. 저는 데이자와 강령술사들에게 호의적입니다.\n"
"에라시아와 아블리의 전쟁을 중재할 사람으로 저를 선택해 주길 바랍니다.\n"
"두 나라 모두 데이자의 적이므로 저는 공정한 판사가 될 것입니다.\n"
"하지만 데이자의 동맹이 된다는 것은 다른 이들이 '어둠'이라 부르는 것을 선택한다는 뜻입니다.이 어둠 운운하는 말은 완전히 터무니없습니다.\n"
"강령술은 죽음과 죽은 뒤 영혼에 일어나는 일을 연구하는 학문일 뿐입니다.\n"
"물론 결과가 조금 끔찍할 수는 있지만, 소시지를 만들거나 법을 다루는 일도 마찬가지입니다.\n"
"그렇다고 그 직업들이 가치 없다고 말할 사람은 없을 것입니다.저를 선택하고 우리의 동맹이 되십시오.\n"
"이 간단한 행동으로 우정을 증명하지 못한다면, 우리의 적이 아니고 무엇이겠습니까?\n"
"다만 한 번 저를 선택하면 나중에 마음을 바꿀 수 없다는 점을 기억하십시오.\n"
"선택은 영구적입니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=217|field=0"
msgid ""
"Thank you for choosing me.\n"
"You will not regret your choice, I assure you.\n"
"The only thing that remains is for you to return to Harmondale with me, and bring me to the Judge Grey's old house.\n"
"I'll take it from there."
msgstr ""
"저를 선택해 주셔서 감사합니다.\n"
"그 선택을 후회하지 않을 것이라고 장담합니다.\n"
"이제 저와 함께 하몬데일로 돌아가 그레이 판사의 옛집으로 데려가기만 하면 됩니다.\n"
"그다음은 제가 맡겠습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=218|field=0"
msgid ""
"You have made the right choice, my lords.\n"
"The leader of Deyja, Archibald Ironfist, would like to speak with you.\n"
"From the Deyja Moors, enter the Hall of the Pit and make your way to the Pit.\n"
"Archibald awaits you in Castle Gloaming in the Pit.\n"
"Try not to keep him waiting."
msgstr ""
"현명한 선택을 하셨습니다, 영주님들.\n"
"데이자의 지도자 아치볼드 아이언피스트가 영주님들과 이야기하고 싶어 합니다.\n"
"데이자 황무지에서 구덩이의 전당으로 들어가 구덩이까지 가십시오.\n"
"아치볼드는 구덩이의 글로밍 성에서 기다리고 있습니다.\n"
"너무 오래 기다리게 하지 마십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=219|field=0"
msgid ""
"Hello.\n"
"I've been expecting you.\n"
"I am Judge Fairweather.\n"
"I think it's important you understand that I DO work for Bracada, but I am neutral on the Erathia - Avlee war.\n"
"Obviously, we want you to hire me as the Arbiter over this conflict, and I will be a fair judge.\n"
"We need you to understand, however, that choosing me as the Arbiter will be CHOOSING THE PATH OF LIGHT.It is the right choice.\n"
"I will put an end to this destructive war as quickly as possible, and minimize deaths.\n"
"All you have to do is make a decision.Please choose the path of light, and reject evil.\n"
"Be our ally.\n"
"Just remember that whatever choice you make will be a permanent one."
msgstr ""
"안녕하십니까.\n"
"기다리고 있었습니다.\n"
"저는 페어웨더 판사입니다.\n"
"제가 브라카다를 위해 일하기는 하지만 에라시아와 아블리의 전쟁에서는 중립이라는 점을 이해하셔야 합니다.\n"
"물론 우리는 이 분쟁의 중재자로 저를 고용하길 바라며, 저는 공정한 판사가 될 것입니다.\n"
"하지만 저를 중재자로 선택한다는 것은 빛의 길을 선택한다는 뜻임을 이해하셔야 합니다.그것이 옳은 선택입니다.\n"
"이 파괴적인 전쟁을 최대한 빨리 끝내고 희생을 줄이겠습니다.\n"
"해야 할 일은 결정을 내리는 것뿐입니다.빛의 길을 선택하고 악을 거부해 주십시오.\n"
"우리의 동맹이 되어 주십시오.\n"
"어떤 선택을 하든 영구적이라는 점만 기억하십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=21|field=0"
msgid ""
"Sir Charles Quixote at your service. Welcome to my camp headquarters. From "
"here I oversee this hunting expedition.Are you here to trade? Most of what "
"my goods are committed to orders already. I do, however, have some baby "
"dragons for sale. And I suppose I could part with some of the lower grade "
"adult hides."
msgstr ""
"찰스 키호테 경이 그대들을 맞이하오. 내 야영지 본부에 온 것을 환영하오. 이곳에서 사냥 원정을 지휘하고 있소.거래하러 왔소? 내 물품 "
"대부분은 이미 주문이 잡혀 있소. 하지만 새끼 드래곤 몇 마리는 팔 수 있고, 낮은 등급의 성체 가죽도 조금은 내줄 수 있소."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=220|field=0"
msgid ""
"Thank the heavens for guiding you right!\n"
"This is the best decision you have ever made, even if you don't believe it now.\n"
"The only thing left to do is for you to return to Harmondale with me, and bring me to Judge Grey's old house.\n"
"I'll see that matters are handled correctly."
msgstr ""
"하늘이 영주님들을 올바르게 인도했음에 감사드립니다!\n"
"지금은 믿지 못하더라도, 지금껏 내린 결정 중 최고의 선택입니다.\n"
"이제 저와 함께 하몬데일로 돌아가 그레이 판사의 옛집으로 데려가기만 하면 됩니다.\n"
"제가 모든 일을 올바르게 처리하겠습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=221|field=0"
msgid ""
"You have made the wise choice, my lords.\n"
"Gavin Magnus, leader of the Wizards, would like to speak with you.\n"
"Go to the Bracada Desert-- the teleporter to Celeste will function now, and use it to enter Celeste.\n"
"Gavin awaits you in Castle Lambent.\n"
"Time is precious; don't waste it dallying around."
msgstr ""
"현명한 선택을 하셨습니다, 영주님들.\n"
"마법사들의 지도자 개빈 매그너스가 영주님들과 이야기하고 싶어 합니다.\n"
"브라카다 사막으로 가십시오. 이제 셀레스트로 가는 순간이동 장치가 작동할 것이니 그것을 이용해 셀레스트에 들어가십시오.\n"
"개빈은 램번트 성에서 기다리고 있습니다.\n"
"시간은 소중합니다. 빈둥거리며 낭비하지 마십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=222|field=0"
msgid ""
"New Lords from Harmondale, I see.\n"
"Well, I am pleased to meet you at last.\n"
"I am sure the relationship between our two governments will be a long and mutually beneficial one.\n"
"You've made the right choice in allying with us.\n"
"There is much we need to talk about, but my advisors first insist that you walk the Wizards' Path before our relationship can progress.I know this test seems silly, but I assure its purpose is not.\n"
"You can take the test whenever you feel ready.\n"
"And if you fail today, you can always come back and try it another day."
msgstr ""
"하몬데일의 새 영주들이군요.\n"
"드디어 만나게 되어 기쁩니다.\n"
"두 정부의 관계가 오래도록 이어지고 서로에게 이익이 되리라 확신합니다.\n"
"우리와 동맹을 맺은 것은 올바른 선택이었습니다.\n"
"논의할 일이 많지만, 관계가 더 진전되기 전에 먼저 마법사의 길을 걸어야 한다고 내 조언자들이 주장합니다.이 시험이 어리석어 보인다는 것은 알지만, 목적은 결코 그렇지 않습니다.\n"
"준비가 되었다고 느끼면 언제든 시험을 치를 수 있습니다.\n"
"오늘 실패해도 다른 날 돌아와 다시 도전하면 됩니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=223|field=0"
msgid ""
"Welcome back, my friends.\n"
"My advisors are anxious to speak with you."
msgstr ""
"돌아오신 것을 환영합니다, 친구들.\n"
"제 조언자들이 여러분과 이야기하고 싶어 합니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=224|field=0"
msgid ""
"I am very lucky to have friends such as you.\n"
"We've come far, and only have a little further to go.\n"
"My most unusual advisors have great plans…plans that require the aid of you, my steadfast allies.\n"
"I'm confident you're up to it."
msgstr ""
"여러분 같은 친구가 있어 나는 정말 행운이오.\n"
"우리는 먼 길을 왔고, 이제 조금만 더 가면 됩니다.\n"
"내 비범한 조언자들에게 원대한 계획이 있소…나의 굳건한 동맹인 여러분의 도움이 필요한 계획이지.\n"
"여러분이라면 충분히 해낼 것이라 믿소."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=225|field=0"
msgid ""
"[Resurectra smiles, and curtseys] Lords.\n"
"I am Resurectra, chief advisor to King Magnus.\n"
"We are pleased you chose Judge Fairweather as the arbiter in the Erathia-Avlee conflict.\n"
"It's a sign of your good intentions.\n"
"However, if we are to have further dealings, you must first complete the King's test.\n"
"We do not have time for the the uncommitted or the faint of heart.After you are done with his test, return to me, and we will talk.\n"
"Rest assured you will find your alliance with us profitable."
msgstr ""
"[레저렉트라가 미소 지으며 절한다] 영주님들.\n"
"저는 매그너스 왕의 수석 조언자 레저렉트라입니다.\n"
"에라시아와 아블리의 분쟁에서 페어웨더 판사를 중재자로 선택하신 것을 기쁘게 생각합니다.\n"
"선의를 보여 주는 선택입니다.\n"
"하지만 앞으로 더 거래하려면 먼저 왕의 시험을 마쳐야 합니다.\n"
"우리는 결의가 없거나 겁이 많은 자들에게 낭비할 시간이 없습니다.시험을 끝내면 제게 돌아오십시오. 그러면 이야기하겠습니다.\n"
"우리와 맺은 동맹이 이익이 될 것이라는 점은 믿으셔도 좋습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=226|field=0"
msgid ""
"I am glad you passed the King's test.\n"
"It shows you are dedicated to the Path of Light.\n"
"Now we should get down to business.\n"
"My fellow advisors and I have some work for you if you're willing.\n"
"You will, of course, be rewarded.\n"
"And always remember, that whatever we ask of you, we are always moving toward a noble goal, one you will be proud to have been a part of."
msgstr ""
"왕의 시험을 통과해서 기쁩니다.\n"
"빛의 길에 헌신하고 있다는 증거입니다.\n"
"이제 본론으로 들어갑시다.\n"
"원하신다면 제 동료 조언자들과 제가 맡길 일이 있습니다.\n"
"물론 보상도 받으실 것입니다.\n"
"그리고 우리가 무엇을 부탁하든 언제나 고귀한 목표를 향해 나아가는 일이며, 영주님들도 그 일에 함께했다는 것을 자랑스러워하게 되리라는 점을 기억하십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=227|field=0"
msgid ""
"Once again, thanks for completing the key for us.\n"
"We are in your debt for that act alone.\n"
"I'm sure we will be even more in your debt in the near future."
msgstr ""
"다시 한번 우리를 위해 열쇠를 완성해 주셔서 감사합니다.\n"
"그 일 하나만으로도 우리는 영주님들께 빚을 졌습니다.\n"
"가까운 미래에는 더 큰 빚을 지게 되리라 확신합니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=228|field=0"
msgid ""
"Dark ones!\n"
"You have no idea what dreams you've discarded in favor of petty power.\n"
"Begone from here, and trouble us no more."
msgstr ""
"어둠의 추종자들!\n"
"하찮은 힘을 택하는 대신 어떤 꿈을 내버렸는지 전혀 모르는군.\n"
"여기서 사라지고 다시는 우리를 괴롭히지 마시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=229|field=0"
msgid ""
"Now that you have completed the Test, I too, have a request of you.\n"
"Unlike my friends, mine has little to do with advancing toward the Goal, but it is important nonetheless."
msgstr ""
"이제 시험을 끝냈으니 나도 부탁할 일이 있습니다.\n"
"내 친구들의 부탁과 달리 목표를 향해 나아가는 일과는 별 관계가 없지만, 그래도 중요한 일입니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=22|field=0"
msgid ""
"You just caught me. I'm almost ready to leave for Ravenshore, but how may I "
"help you?"
msgstr "마침 잘 오셨군요. 레이븐쇼어로 떠날 준비가 거의 끝났지만, 무엇을 도와드릴까요?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=230|field=0"
msgid ""
"I just want to say again that you've done a good thing.\n"
"Not only have we kept our promise to Queen Catherine, but we have rid the world of another monster.\n"
"Thank you."
msgstr ""
"다시 한번 좋은 일을 해냈다고 말하고 싶습니다.\n"
"우리는 캐서린 여왕과의 약속을 지켰을 뿐 아니라 세상에서 또 하나의 괴물을 없앴습니다.\n"
"감사합니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=231|field=0"
msgid ""
"What do you want, evil ones?\n"
"My axe itches for a chance at your throats."
msgstr ""
"무슨 용건이냐, 사악한 자들아?\n"
"내 도끼가 너희 목을 노릴 기회를 기다리고 있다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=232|field=0"
msgid ""
"I'm pleased to hear you passed the test.\n"
"We must attack our enemies before they get too strong.\n"
"I have a plan I think will do lasting damage to their noxious brotherhood.\n"
"It's dangerous but bold, and cowards such as they will never expect it."
msgstr ""
"시험을 통과했다니 기쁘군요.\n"
"적들이 너무 강해지기 전에 공격해야 합니다.\n"
"그 해로운 무리에게 오래가는 피해를 줄 계획이 하나 있습니다.\n"
"위험하지만 대담한 계획이며, 그들 같은 겁쟁이들은 결코 예상하지 못할 것입니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=233|field=0"
msgid ""
"Glad you're here.\n"
"You'll be happy to know we've ordered a golem to bury the empty soul jars somewhere and forget where it put them.\n"
"They'll never be seen again."
msgstr ""
"와 주어 반갑습니다.\n"
"빈 영혼 항아리들을 골렘에게 어딘가에 묻게 한 뒤 어디에 묻었는지 잊으라고 명령했습니다.\n"
"다시는 발견되지 않을 것입니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=234|field=0"
msgid ""
"Oh, good, a visit from our enemies.\n"
"That always makes me so happy!\n"
"Come back anytime, so our guards can have another try at your lives, knaves!"
msgstr ""
"아, 좋군요. 적들이 찾아왔습니다.\n"
"언제나 정말 기쁜 일이죠!\n"
"언제든 다시 오십시오. 우리 경비병들이 그대들의 목숨을 노려 볼 기회를 또 얻도록 말입니다, 악당들!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=235|field=0"
msgid ""
"Like my friends, I have a task for you as well, but now is not the time.\n"
"Finish their work first, then I will tell you about my mission."
msgstr ""
"내 친구들처럼 나도 맡길 일이 있지만 지금은 때가 아닙니다.\n"
"먼저 그들의 일을 끝내십시오. 그러면 내 임무에 대해 말해 주겠습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=236|field=0"
msgid ""
"You've finished their missions.\n"
"Good.\n"
"Our conflict with the Necromancers is rapidly coming to a conclusion.\n"
"I have a dangerous, but critical mission for you.\n"
"The future of your…er, our world depends on your success."
msgstr ""
"그들의 임무를 끝냈군요.\n"
"좋습니다.\n"
"강령술사들과의 갈등이 빠르게 결말로 향하고 있습니다.\n"
"위험하지만 매우 중요한 임무를 맡기겠습니다.\n"
"그대들의…아니, 우리 세계의 미래가 성공에 달렸습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=237|field=0"
msgid ""
"Pleased to make your acquaintance.\n"
"My name is Kastore, chief advisor to Lord Ironfist.\n"
"[Kastore makes a sweeping gesture toward the other advisors] My associates and I agree that you've shown excellent taste so far over your choice of Judge Sleen in the Erathia affair.\n"
"I think future relations between Deyja and Harmondale will be quite rosy and profitable for all involved.However, I never trust someone I just met.\n"
"Before we can do business, you'll have to prove that you're...our kind of people.\n"
"Lord Ironfist has a test he likes to put new Necromancer recruits through.\n"
"If you can pass it, return to me and we'll talk more."
msgstr ""
"만나서 반갑소.\n"
"나는 아이언피스트 경의 수석 조언자 카스토어요.\n"
"[카스토어가 다른 조언자들을 향해 팔을 크게 휘두른다] 내 동료들과 나는 에라시아 문제에서 슬린 판사를 선택한 것을 보니 그대들의 안목이 훌륭하다는 데 동의했소.\n"
"앞으로 데이자와 하몬데일의 관계는 아주 밝고, 관련된 모두에게 이익이 될 것이라 생각하오.하지만 나는 방금 만난 사람을 절대 믿지 않소.\n"
"거래하기 전에 그대들이…우리와 같은 부류라는 것을 증명해야 하오.\n"
"아이언피스트 경은 새 강령술사 신입들에게 치르게 하기를 좋아하는 시험이 있소.\n"
"그 시험을 통과하면 돌아오시오. 더 이야기합시다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=238|field=0"
msgid ""
"So you passed the test!\n"
"Good!\n"
"Now we can get down to business.\n"
"You'll find that working for us…[Kastore shakes his head, and starts over] No.\n"
"You'll find that working with us will advance our mutual goals and interests very quickly.\n"
"We have big plans--plans big enough to include aggressive people like yourselves.\n"
"As time passes, we will reveal our biggest plans to you."
msgstr ""
"시험을 통과했군!\n"
"좋소!\n"
"이제 본론으로 들어갈 수 있겠군.\n"
"우리를 위해 일하면…[카스토어가 고개를 젓고 말을 고쳐 시작한다] 아니.\n"
"우리와 함께 일하면 서로의 목표와 이익을 아주 빠르게 앞당길 수 있을 것이오.\n"
"우리에게는 큰 계획이 있소. 그대들처럼 공격적인 자들까지 포함할 만큼 큰 계획이지.\n"
"시간이 지나면 가장 거대한 계획도 밝히겠소."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=239|field=0"
msgid ""
"I would like to take this moment to thank you, again, for all the work you have done for us.\n"
"The time fast approaches that our greatest plans will come to fruition, and we will all be elevated to the highest status!\n"
"Stick by us awhile longer, and your rewards will be greater that you have ever dreamed!"
msgstr ""
"이 기회에 다시 한번 우리를 위해 해 준 모든 일에 감사하고 싶소.\n"
"우리의 위대한 계획이 결실을 맺고 모두가 최고의 지위에 오를 때가 빠르게 다가오고 있소!\n"
"조금만 더 우리 곁에 남으시오. 그러면 꿈꿔 본 것보다 더 큰 보상을 받게 될 것이오!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=23|field=0"
msgid "It was a long journey, but here I am. Good to see you again."
msgstr "긴 여정이었지만 드디어 도착했군요. 다시 만나 반갑습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=240|field=0"
msgid ""
"Lords of Harmondale, is it? [Kastore spits on the ground] What are you doing here?\n"
"Better return home and watch your border!\n"
"Something dark may cross it during the night…"
msgstr ""
"하몬데일의 영주들이라고? [카스토어가 바닥에 침을 뱉는다] 여기서 뭐 하는 거요?\n"
"고향으로 돌아가 국경이나 지키는 게 좋을 것이오!\n"
"밤사이 어둠의 무언가가 국경을 넘을지도 모르니까…"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=241|field=0"
msgid ""
"Hello!\n"
"I am Maximus.\n"
"Good to have you on our side.\n"
"I'm glad you survived the Test.\n"
"I'm against wasting good talent on that test, but my associates insist.\n"
"[sigh]\n"
"What can you do?"
msgstr ""
"안녕하시오!\n"
"나는 막시무스요.\n"
"우리 편이 되어 주어 좋군.\n"
"시험에서 살아남아 기쁘오.\n"
"나는 그 시험으로 훌륭한 인재를 낭비하는 것에 반대하지만, 동료들이 고집하오.\n"
"[한숨]\n"
"어쩌겠소?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=242|field=0"
msgid ""
"I really can't thank you enough for bringing those jars back to us.\n"
"The Necromancers have been clamoring for their delivery for months!\n"
"This will improve morale around here 100%!\n"
"Once again, thanks!"
msgstr ""
"그 항아리들을 우리에게 가져다준 데 대해 아무리 감사해도 부족하오.\n"
"강령술사들은 몇 달 동안 그것들이 도착하기만을 기다렸소!\n"
"이곳의 사기가 100% 오를 것이오!\n"
"다시 한번 감사하오!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=243|field=0"
msgid ""
"I have nothing to say to you, cowards!\n"
"One day, you and your entire town will be working in the mines for us!"
msgstr ""
"당신들에게 할 말은 없소, 겁쟁이들!\n"
"언젠가는 당신들과 온 마을이 우리를 위해 광산에서 일하게 될 거요!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=244|field=0"
msgid ""
"I knew you would pass that Test!\n"
"It really isn't that hard, if you are properly determined.\n"
"You just have to harden your heart and do what must be done.\n"
"The mission I have in mind for you will require that same resolve.\n"
"After you passed that test, I'm sure you're up to it!"
msgstr ""
"그 시험을 통과할 줄 알았소!\n"
"제대로 결심하기만 하면 사실 그리 어렵지도 않소.\n"
"마음을 굳게 먹고 해야 할 일을 하면 되오.\n"
"내가 맡길 임무에도 같은 결의가 필요하오.\n"
"그 시험을 통과했으니 충분히 해낼 수 있으리라 확신하오!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=245|field=0"
msgid ""
"Excellent work at Clanker's Laboratory!\n"
"I know I already congratulated you on a job well done, but I just can't get over how well executed that entire plan was!\n"
"The boys in the lab tell me they've already got most of old Clanker's body back together again, and they've animated the reassembled corpse.\n"
"They've got him on Soul Jar research, but he's not quite as clever as he used to be, I'm told.\n"
"Oh well, at least we don't need to fear him turning on us, eh?"
msgstr ""
"클랭커의 연구소에서 훌륭하게 해냈소!\n"
"이미 일을 잘했다고 축하했지만, 그 계획 전체가 얼마나 완벽하게 실행되었는지 감탄을 멈출 수가 없군!\n"
"연구소의 녀석들 말로는 늙은 클랭커의 몸을 대부분 다시 조립했고, 재조립한 시체도 움직이게 만들었다고 하오.\n"
"그를 영혼 항아리 연구에 투입했는데, 전만큼 영리하지는 않다고 하더군.\n"
"뭐, 적어도 그가 우리를 배신할까 두려워할 필요는 없지 않겠소?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=246|field=0"
msgid ""
"Honestly, didn't you people get the hint when all our minions were attacking you?\n"
"We don't want you down here!\n"
"And it doesn't do you any good blowing up our zombies--we just reanimate them!"
msgstr ""
"솔직히 우리 부하들이 모두 공격했을 때 눈치채지 못했소?\n"
"우리는 당신들이 여기 내려오는 걸 원치 않소!\n"
"우리 좀비들을 날려 버려도 소용없소. 다시 되살리면 그만이니까!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=247|field=0"
msgid ""
"I, too, have a task for you in mind, but it will have to wait until you are done with my associates' missions.\n"
"Return to me once you have finished their tasks."
msgstr ""
"나도 맡길 일이 있지만, 내 동료들의 임무를 끝낼 때까지 기다려야 하오.\n"
"그들의 일을 마치면 내게 돌아오시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=248|field=0"
msgid ""
"Now that you've finished my associate's tasks, I am ready to give you a much more dangerous, but very critical mission.\n"
"Our plans hinge on your success.\n"
"I know I can count on you.Oh, I almost forgot to mention!\n"
"Archibald is no longer in charge.\n"
"He left in a huff after we disagreed with how we should proceed with our plans.\n"
"He's moved into Clanker's laboratory now, and taken some of the less...motivated necromancers with him.\n"
"No loss there.\n"
"Kastore is King of the Pit, now."
msgstr ""
"이제 내 동료들의 임무를 끝냈으니 훨씬 더 위험하지만 매우 중요한 임무를 맡길 준비가 되었소.\n"
"우리 계획의 성패가 그대들의 성공에 달렸소.\n"
"믿고 맡길 수 있다는 것을 알고 있소.아, 말하는 걸 거의 잊을 뻔했군!\n"
"아치볼드는 더는 책임자가 아니오.\n"
"계획을 어떻게 추진할지 의견이 맞지 않아 화를 내며 떠났소.\n"
"지금은 클랭커의 연구소로 옮겼고, 의욕이 덜한…강령술사 몇 명도 데려갔소.\n"
"손해 볼 것은 없지.\n"
"이제 카스토어가 구덩이의 왕이오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=249|field=0"
msgid ""
"[Archibald smiles and rubs his hands together slowly] Our new allies from Harmondale!\n"
"Good to meet you in person at last.\n"
"I want to say right now that you chose the right side.\n"
"Anyone who has ever dealt with me knows I am a fair man to work for, and I reward loyalty well.\n"
"Stand by me, and you will go farther than you ever dreamed! While I am grateful that you chose us, and have complete confidence in your abilities and loyalties, my advisors do not.\n"
"That's ok, because they're here to question my judgement.\n"
"They believe that you don't have the stomach to work for us, and have devised a little test of your...determination.\n"
"I know it's annoying, but until you pass the test, they refuse to have anything to do with you.\n"
"I'm sure you understand."
msgstr ""
"[아치볼드가 미소 지으며 천천히 두 손을 비빈다] 하몬데일에서 온 우리의 새 동맹들이군!\n"
"드디어 직접 만나게 되어 반갑습니다.\n"
"지금 바로 말해 두지만, 그대들은 올바른 편을 선택했습니다.\n"
"나와 거래해 본 사람이라면 내가 함께 일하기에 공정한 사람이며 충성에는 후하게 보답한다는 것을 압니다.\n"
"내 곁에 서십시오. 그러면 상상한 것보다 더 멀리 나아갈 것입니다! 우리를 선택한 것은 감사하며 그대들의 능력과 충성도 완전히 믿지만, 내 조언자들은 그렇지 않습니다.\n"
"괜찮습니다. 내 판단에 의문을 제기하는 것이 그들의 역할이니까요.\n"
"그대들이 우리를 위해 일할 배짱이 없다고 생각해…결의를 시험할 작은 시험을 고안했습니다.\n"
"성가신 일이라는 건 알지만, 시험을 통과하기 전에는 그들이 그대들과 아무 일도 하려 하지 않습니다.\n"
"이해하리라 믿습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=24|field=0"
msgid "Hail the alliance! How goes it with you?"
msgstr "동맹 만세! 그동안 잘 지냈습니까?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=250|field=0"
msgid ""
"Hello, my friends…you are still my friends, aren't you?\n"
"My \"\"advisors\"\", my \"\"lieutenants\"\" [Archibald spits out the words], have the Pit, and their dreams of conquest.\n"
"I have come to realize they did not need me, nor did they want to study our art.\n"
"They want a world where there are no Kings, no loyalty, and no honor.\n"
"Just them and their slaves.\n"
"Well, they can have it!\n"
"After the soul jars were stolen, my lieutenants just shrugged, as though it was wagon wheels, or chickens that went missing, not the keys to immortality!\n"
"We were so close to devising a way to keep the body from decay after the Ritual was performed!\n"
"Now this--a setback that will cost decades.So, we have moved here--thanks to you--to continue our studies.\n"
"For what it's worth, I have renounced my claim to the throne of Enroth.\n"
"I don't think anyone believes me, but that shouldn't matter.\n"
"This island is quite secure, and we have fixed the breech that let you infiltrate it in the first place. "
msgstr ""
"안녕하시오, 친구들…아직도 내 친구들이지요?\n"
"내 '조언자들', 내 '부관들'은 [아치볼드가 그 말을 내뱉듯 말한다] 구덩이와 정복의 꿈을 차지했습니다.\n"
"그들이 나를 필요로 하지도 않았고, 우리의 학문을 연구하고 싶어 하지도 않았다는 것을 깨달았습니다.\n"
"그들은 왕도, 충성도, 명예도 없는 세상을 원합니다.\n"
"오직 그들과 노예들만 있는 세상이지요.\n"
"좋습니다, 마음대로 가지라지!\n"
"영혼 항아리들을 도둑맞은 뒤 내 부관들은 불멸의 열쇠가 아니라 마차 바퀴나 닭 몇 마리가 사라진 것처럼 어깨만 으쓱했습니다!\n"
"의식을 치른 뒤에도 육체가 부패하지 않게 하는 방법을 거의 알아냈는데!\n"
"이제 이런 일이 생겼으니 수십 년을 잃게 될 차질입니다.그래서 우리는 그대들 덕분에 이곳으로 옮겨 연구를 계속하고 있습니다.\n"
"이제 와 무슨 의미가 있겠냐마는 엔로스 왕좌에 대한 권리를 포기했습니다.\n"
"아무도 믿지 않는 것 같지만 상관없습니다.\n"
"이 섬은 상당히 안전하며, 처음 그대들이 침입할 수 있게 했던 틈도 고쳤습니다. "

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=251|field=0"
msgid ""
"Find what you're looking for?\n"
"Don't worry--I'm not too angry that you invaded.\n"
"Most of my minions will regenerate, one way or the other.\n"
"There's not even much treasure left.[Sigh] Well, if you're here to fight us in the name of the Light, don't bother.\n"
"I've given up the conquest business.\n"
"My former allies [Archibald spits on the ground] have abandoned our great achievements in the arts of Necromancy, and now seek merely to conquer the world.\n"
"I have little doubt they will succeed.\n"
"It won't go well for you and your masters if they do.[Archibald looks at you more closely, now] Then again, perhaps they won't.\n"
"You have the smell of fate about you, as though you are destined for great things.\n"
"Perhaps you will stop them.\n"
"But smart money still bets against you."
msgstr ""
"찾던 것을 발견했습니까?\n"
"걱정하지 마십시오. 침입한 것에 그리 화나지는 않았습니다.\n"
"내 부하들 대부분은 어떤 방식으로든 재생할 테니까요.\n"
"남은 보물도 별로 없습니다.[한숨] 빛의 이름으로 우리와 싸우러 왔다면 그럴 필요 없습니다.\n"
"나는 정복 사업을 그만두었습니다.\n"
"내 옛 동맹들은 [아치볼드가 바닥에 침을 뱉는다] 강령술의 위대한 성취를 버리고 이제 그저 세계를 정복하려 합니다.\n"
"그들이 성공하리라는 데에는 거의 의심이 없습니다.\n"
"그렇게 되면 그대들과 그 주인들에게 좋은 결과는 없을 겁니다.[아치볼드가 이제 그대들을 더 자세히 바라본다] 하지만 어쩌면 성공하지 못할지도 모르겠군요.\n"
"그대들에게서 운명의 냄새가 납니다. 위대한 일을 할 운명인 것처럼 말이지요.\n"
"어쩌면 그들을 막을 수도 있겠군요.\n"
"하지만 현명한 사람이라면 여전히 그대들이 실패하는 쪽에 걸 겁니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=252|field=0"
msgid ""
"Welcome back, allies.\n"
"My advisors are eager to speak with you."
msgstr ""
"돌아오신 것을 환영합니다, 동맹들이여.\n"
"제 조언자들이 여러분과 이야기하고 싶어 합니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=253|field=0"
msgid ""
"Excuse me, but visitors are not allowed here in Fort Riverstride.\n"
"I'm afraid I have to ask you to leave.\n"
"Any attempt to go further into the fort will be treated as hostile action, and will be dealt with as such."
msgstr ""
"실례하지만 리버스트라이드 요새에는 방문객이 들어올 수 없습니다.\n"
"떠나 달라고 요청할 수밖에 없군요.\n"
"요새 안쪽으로 더 들어가려는 시도는 적대 행위로 간주하고 그에 맞게 대응하겠습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=254|field=0"
msgid ""
"This Watchtower preserves the borders of Deyja.\n"
"Visitors are not allowed in here, so you will have to leave.\n"
"If you attempt to enter further into the tower, you will be killed without hesitation."
msgstr ""
"이 감시탑은 데이자의 국경을 지키고 있습니다.\n"
"방문객은 들어올 수 없으니 떠나야 합니다.\n"
"탑 안쪽으로 더 들어가려 하면 주저 없이 처형하겠습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=255|field=0"
msgid ""
"Halt!\n"
"You have no business past this point.\n"
"Only those who have proved their purity may enter the holy sanctum. "
msgstr ""
"멈추시오!\n"
"이 너머에는 용무가 없을 것이오.\n"
"자신의 순수함을 증명한 자만이 신성한 성소에 들어갈 수 있소. "

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=256|field=0"
msgid ""
"What have we here?\n"
"Did you honestly think you could tread safely amongst the power of the shadows?\n"
"It would not be safe for you, and you are not allowed past this point."
msgstr ""
"이게 누구지?\n"
"그림자의 힘 한가운데를 안전하게 거닐 수 있다고 정말 생각했나?\n"
"너희에게 안전한 곳이 아니며, 이 지점을 통과하는 것도 허락되지 않는다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=257|field=0"
msgid ""
"Halt!\n"
"You do not have authorization to proceed this way.\n"
"If you are looking for Queen Catherine's throne room, it is in the center of the castle behind the main staircase."
msgstr ""
"멈추시오!\n"
"이 길로 갈 권한이 없습니다.\n"
"캐서린 여왕의 왕좌실을 찾는다면 성 중앙의 주계단 뒤에 있습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=258|field=0"
msgid ""
"Halt!\n"
"Visitors aren't permitted in this section of the castle.\n"
"If you are looking for King Parson's throne room, take the lift down and follow the left corridor."
msgstr ""
"멈추시오!\n"
"방문객은 성의 이 구역에 들어갈 수 없습니다.\n"
"파슨 왕의 왕좌실을 찾는다면 승강기를 타고 내려가 왼쪽 복도를 따라가십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=259|field=0"
msgid ""
"Halt!\n"
"Access to these areas is denied on orders from Gavin Magnus himself.\n"
"If you are looking for his throne room, go north from the entrance as far as you can, then go west as far as you can, and his throne room is to the north."
msgstr ""
"멈추시오!\n"
"개빈 매그너스의 명령에 따라 이 구역의 출입은 금지되어 있습니다.\n"
"그의 왕좌실을 찾는다면 입구에서 갈 수 있는 만큼 북쪽으로 간 뒤, 갈 수 있는 만큼 서쪽으로 가십시오. 왕좌실은 그곳에서 북쪽에 있습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=25|field=0"
msgid ""
"And so I have made haste to Ravenshore. Already I grow weary of life among "
"the prey animals. You had best be quick about the business of this alliance!"
msgstr ""
"그래서 급히 레이븐쇼어로 왔소. 벌써 먹잇감 짐승들 사이에서 사는 데 지쳐 가는군. 이 동맹의 일을 서두르는 게 좋을 것이오!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=260|field=0"
msgid ""
"Halt!\n"
"You don't have permission to proceed through this area.\n"
"If you are looking for the throne room, you must go north from the entrance to the main room.\n"
"Then follow the small west passage to the waiting ship.\n"
"Use the ship's rudder to maneuver downstream and then exit the ship and proceed in the doorway."
msgstr ""
"멈추시오!\n"
"이 구역을 통과할 허가가 없습니다.\n"
"왕좌실을 찾는다면 입구에서 북쪽으로 가서 중앙 방으로 들어가야 합니다.\n"
"그다음 서쪽의 좁은 통로를 따라 대기 중인 배로 가십시오.\n"
"배의 키를 사용해 하류로 움직인 뒤 배에서 내려 출입구로 들어가십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=261|field=0"
msgid ""
"Greetings!\n"
"My name is Eric Swarrel-- I run the information desk here in the School of Sorcery."
msgstr ""
"안녕하시오!\n"
"내 이름은 에릭 스워럴이며, 이 마법 학교의 안내소를 맡고 있소."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=262|field=0"
msgid ""
"Thanks for rescuing me!\n"
"Please take me back to Erathia as soon as you can."
msgstr ""
"구해 주셔서 감사합니다!\n"
"가능한 한 빨리 에라시아로 데려가 주십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=263|field=0"
msgid ""
"Excellent decision to assist King Parson.\n"
"Just get me to Queen Catherine, and I'll handle the rest."
msgstr ""
"파슨 왕을 돕기로 한 것은 훌륭한 결정입니다.\n"
"저를 캐서린 여왕께 데려가기만 하십시오. 나머지는 제가 처리하겠습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=264|field=0"
msgid ""
"Halt!\n"
"Lord Markham doesn't want visitors wandering around his house.\n"
"If you came to speak with him, he's in his chamber directly north from the entrance."
msgstr ""
"멈추시오!\n"
"마크햄 경은 방문객들이 저택을 돌아다니는 것을 원치 않습니다.\n"
"그와 이야기하러 왔다면 입구에서 곧장 북쪽에 있는 방에 있습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=265|field=0"
msgid ""
"My lords, I have been dispatched by the ambassadors from Erathia and Avlee to inform you of Judge Grey's untimely death.\n"
"We believe it was a heart attack, and there is no reason to suspect foul play.\n"
"However, they wish to speak to you at once, and urge you to return to your castle.\n"
"They have declared a truce until a successor can be found for Judge Grey."
msgstr ""
"영주님들, 에라시아와 아블리 대사들이 그레이 판사의 갑작스러운 죽음을 알리기 위해 저를 보냈습니다.\n"
"심장 마비로 보이며, 타살을 의심할 이유는 없습니다.\n"
"하지만 대사들은 즉시 영주님들과 이야기하기를 바라며 성으로 돌아오시길 촉구했습니다.\n"
"그레이 판사의 후임자가 정해질 때까지 휴전을 선언했습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=266|field=0"
msgid ""
"Oh, the new lords of Harmondale!\n"
"Just the persons I needed to see! "
msgstr ""
"아, 하몬데일의 새 영주님들이시군요!\n"
"마침 꼭 만나고 싶던 분들입니다! "

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=267|field=0"
msgid ""
"Thanks for returning the Lantern of Light.\n"
"Ceremonies can continue normally at the temple!"
msgstr ""
"빛의 등불을 돌려주셔서 감사합니다.\n"
"이제 신전의 의식을 정상적으로 계속할 수 있습니다!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=268|field=0"
msgid "Ah, the Lords of Harmondale. Perhaps you can be of assistance to me?"
msgstr "아, 하몬데일의 영주님들이군요. 혹시 저를 도와주실 수 있습니까?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=269|field=0"
msgid "My thanks for returning Haldar's remains!"
msgstr "할다르의 유해를 돌려주셔서 감사합니다!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=26|field=0"
msgid ""
"It has been a long time since I have traveled. I forget how beautiful parts "
"of this land can be. I look forward to resolving the current crisis--the "
"very least reason being that I can then take a long deserved sabbatical."
msgstr ""
"오랫동안 여행을 하지 않았습니다. 이 땅의 곳곳이 얼마나 아름다운지 잊고 있었군요. 현재의 위기를 해결할 날이 기대됩니다. 그러고 나면 "
"오랫동안 미뤄 온 휴가를 떠날 수 있다는 건 그 이유 중 가장 사소한 것에 불과하니까요."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=270|field=0"
msgid "Lords of Harmondale, I need your help!"
msgstr "하몬데일의 영주님들, 도움이 필요합니다!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=271|field=0"
msgid "Thanks for returning my signet ring and restoring my business!"
msgstr "제 인장 반지를 되찾아 사업을 회복시켜 주셔서 감사합니다!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=272|field=0"
msgid ""
"Greetings, you must be the Lords of Harmondale.\n"
"I am a collector of the finest historical items, perhaps you can deliver something to me?"
msgstr ""
"안녕하시오. 하몬데일의 영주님들이 틀림없군요.\n"
"저는 뛰어난 역사적 유물을 수집하는 사람인데, 혹시 제게 물건 하나를 가져다주시겠습니까?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=273|field=0"
msgid ""
"Thank you for returning the Parson's Quill sent by Lord Markham.\n"
"You help has made my collection complete!"
msgstr ""
"마크햄 경이 보낸 파슨의 깃펜을 돌려주셔서 감사합니다.\n"
"도움 덕분에 제 수집품이 완성되었습니다!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=274|field=0"
msgid ""
"Greetings!\n"
"You're the new Lords of Harmondale, if I'm not mistaken.\n"
"Do you have a moment to assist me?"
msgstr ""
"안녕하시오!\n"
"내가 틀리지 않았다면 하몬데일의 새 영주님들이군요.\n"
"잠시 저를 도와주시겠습니까?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=275|field=0"
msgid ""
"Thank you so much for returning the Faerie Pipes to me!\n"
"I would have never been able to brave the Hall under the Hill myself."
msgstr ""
"요정의 피리를 돌려주셔서 정말 감사합니다!\n"
"저 혼자서는 언덕 아래의 회관에 감히 들어갈 수 없었을 겁니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=276|field=0"
msgid ""
"My…'lords,' I have a message for you from Niles Stantley, an associate of Mr. Malwick, whom I'm sure you've already met.\n"
"I'd advise you to read this message and act on it with all due speed… Mr. Stantley does so admire punctuality."
msgstr ""
"저…'영주님들', 틀림없이 이미 만났을 말윅 씨의 동료 나일스 스탠틀리가 보낸 전언이 있습니다.\n"
"이 전언을 읽고 최대한 신속히 행동하시길 권합니다… 스탠틀리 씨는 시간을 잘 지키는 사람을 무척 좋아하거든요."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=277|field=0"
msgid ""
"Greetings, my friends.\n"
"I've come to collect on the deal you made with my associate, Mr. Malwick.\n"
"I trust you remember him from Emerald Isle?"
msgstr ""
"안녕하시오, 친구들.\n"
"내 동료 말윅 씨와 맺은 거래의 대가를 받으러 왔소.\n"
"에메랄드 섬에서 그를 만난 것을 기억하겠지요?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=278|field=0"
msgid ""
"Hello, my lords.\n"
"Do you have a moment to assist an old dwarf in need?"
msgstr ""
"안녕하시오, 영주님들.\n"
"도움이 필요한 늙은 드워프에게 잠시 시간을 내주시겠습니까?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=279|field=0"
msgid "Thank you for helping us by getting rid of those nasty Troglodytes!"
msgstr "그 끔찍한 트로글로다이트들을 없애 주셔서 감사합니다!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=27|field=0"
msgid ""
"It is good to see you again, friends. Thanks to you, things go well at "
"Balthazar Lair. Already my herd has made great progress towards restoring "
"our homes and shops. Perhaps you have visited the restored city?"
msgstr ""
"다시 만나 반갑습니다, 친구들이여. 당신들 덕분에 발타자르 소굴은 잘되어 가고 있습니다. 우리 무리는 벌써 집과 상점을 복구하는 데 큰 "
"진전을 이루었습니다. 복구된 도시를 방문해 보셨습니까?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=280|field=0"
msgid "Good day, my lords."
msgstr "좋은 하루입니다, 영주님들."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=281|field=0"
msgid ""
"Good work on those griffins, my lords.\n"
"It is always a pleasure to see you."
msgstr ""
"그리핀들을 잘 처리하셨습니다, 영주님들.\n"
"여러분을 뵙는 것은 언제나 기쁩니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=282|field=0"
msgid ""
"I have nothing to say to you.\n"
"Go away."
msgstr ""
"당신에게 할 말은 없소.\n"
"가시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=283|field=0"
msgid ""
"Your lack of punctuality has cost yourselves and your town grievously.\n"
"I think you may find your bank account somewhat… pinched.\n"
"Consider this an important lesson learned.\n"
"Good day."
msgstr ""
"시간을 지키지 않은 탓에 당신들과 마을이 심각한 대가를 치렀소.\n"
"은행 계좌가 상당히… 쪼들리게 된 것을 알게 될 거요.\n"
"중요한 교훈을 얻었다고 생각하시오.\n"
"좋은 하루 보내시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=284|field=0"
msgid "Growf!"
msgstr "그르릉!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=285|field=0"
msgid ""
"Greetings, my lords.\n"
"May I have a moment of your time?"
msgstr ""
"안녕하시오, 영주님들.\n"
"잠시 시간을 내주시겠습니까?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=286|field=0"
msgid ""
"Well met, lords.\n"
"Do you have a moment to share?"
msgstr ""
"잘 오셨습니다, 영주님들.\n"
"잠시 이야기할 수 있겠습니까?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=287|field=0"
msgid ""
"Thanks for getting me out of that cage.\n"
"I thought I had managed to escape when I was able to steal a key from the guard, but it didn't open my cage!\n"
"Whatever it's used for, I'm sure you'll find it more useful than I will. I need to get back to my kingdom right away; who knows what sort of horrible things have happened while I've been away.\n"
"Excuse me for my abruptness, but I want to breathe fresh air again.\n"
"You've done both Erathia and Enroth a great service, and I'm in your debt."
msgstr ""
"그 우리에서 꺼내 주셔서 감사합니다.\n"
"경비병에게서 열쇠를 훔쳤을 때 탈출할 수 있으리라 생각했지만, 내 우리의 열쇠가 아니었습니다!\n"
"어디에 쓰는지는 모르지만, 내게보다는 당신들에게 더 유용할 겁니다. 당장 내 왕국으로 돌아가야 합니다. 내가 없는 동안 무슨 끔찍한 일이 일어났을지 누가 알겠습니까.\n"
"갑자기 떠나서 미안하지만, 다시 신선한 공기를 마시고 싶습니다.\n"
"당신들은 에라시아와 엔로스 모두에 큰 공을 세웠으며, 나는 당신들에게 빚을 졌습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=288|field=0"
msgid "May I have a moment of your time?"
msgstr "잠시 시간을 내주시겠습니까?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=289|field=0"
msgid "Excellent work; my associates are quite pleased."
msgstr "훌륭한 솜씨였습니다. 제 동료들이 아주 만족하고 있습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=28|field=0"
msgid ""
"Things go well for us in our war against the Temple of the Sun. Before I "
"left, I saw the Shadowspire border made secure. Daily our troops force "
"theirs back to their main temple in Murmurwoods.Again, on behalf of the "
"Necromancers' Guild, I thank you. Now, let us get on with the business at "
"hand."
msgstr ""
"태양의 신전과의 전쟁은 우리에게 유리하게 진행되고 있습니다. 떠나기 전에 섀도스파이어 국경이 안전해진 것을 확인했습니다. 우리 병력은 "
"날마다 그들을 머머우즈의 본신전 쪽으로 밀어내고 있습니다.다시 한번 강령술사 길드를 대표해 감사드립니다. 이제 당면한 일을 처리합시다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=290|field=0"
msgid ""
"Greetings, lords.\n"
"Welcome to my humble home."
msgstr ""
"안녕하시오, 영주님들.\n"
"보잘것없는 제 집에 오신 것을 환영합니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=291|field=0"
msgid ""
"Thank you for your assistance in completing my collection.\n"
"You have my gratitude forever!"
msgstr ""
"제 수집품을 완성하도록 도와주셔서 감사합니다.\n"
"영원히 감사드리겠습니다!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=292|field=0"
msgid ""
"Good day!\n"
"Would you like to hear about the ArcoMage Championship?"
msgstr ""
"좋은 하루입니다!\n"
"아르코메이지 선수권 대회에 관해 들어 보시겠습니까?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=293|field=0"
msgid "Welcome ArcoMage Champions!"
msgstr "어서 오십시오, 아르코메이지 챔피언들이여!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=294|field=0"
msgid ""
"Greetings!\n"
"Are you here to study the arts of Sorcerey?"
msgstr ""
"안녕하시오!\n"
"마법의 기예를 배우러 오셨습니까?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=295|field=0"
msgid ""
"Welcome to Celeste!\n"
"There are many great sites to see here!"
msgstr ""
"셀레스트에 오신 것을 환영합니다!\n"
"이곳에는 볼만한 훌륭한 명소가 많습니다!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=296|field=0"
msgid ""
"Yer in the Pit now!\n"
"Wish you were dead yet?"
msgstr ""
"이제 구덩이에 들어왔군!\n"
"벌써 죽고 싶어졌나?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=297|field=0"
msgid ""
"Nighon is the place to learn the ways of magic.\n"
"Have you visited all who could teach you?"
msgstr ""
"나이혼은 마법의 길을 배우기에 좋은 곳입니다.\n"
"가르침을 줄 수 있는 이들을 모두 찾아가 보셨습니까?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=298|field=0"
msgid ""
"The Barrow Downs is not a place to linger!\n"
"I may return to Stone City if it gets much worse here!"
msgstr ""
"고분 지대는 오래 머물 곳이 아닙니다!\n"
"상황이 더 나빠지면 스톤 시티로 돌아갈지도 모르겠습니다!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=299|field=0"
msgid ""
"Tatalia has the most drastic climes in Erathia.\n"
"From the snow topped mountains to the swamps to the south."
msgstr ""
"타탈리아는 에라시아에서 기후가 가장 극단적인 곳입니다.\n"
"눈 덮인 산에서 남쪽의 늪지까지 모두 있지요."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=29|field=0"
msgid ""
"Greetings. I am Masul, Herdmaster of Balthazar Lair. On behalf of my herd, I"
" thank you for saving us. I was sure that we were destined to perish. Now it"
" seems we will survive. I look forward to rebuilding our lair."
msgstr ""
"안녕하시오. 나는 발타자르 소굴의 무리장 마술이오. 우리 무리를 구해 준 데 대해 감사드리오. 우리는 파멸할 운명이라고 확신했지만, "
"이제는 살아남을 수 있을 듯하오. 소굴을 재건할 날이 기대되는군."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=2|field=0"
msgid ""
"Greetings Journeyman!\n"
"I have been speaking with Brekish Onefang about the predicament that we find ourselves in. The Clan Leader may know of a way to get off these islands and return to Ravenshore"
msgstr ""
"안녕하시오, 숙련자여!\n"
"우리가 처한 곤경에 대해 브레키시 원팽과 이야기하고 있었습니다. 부족장이라면 이 섬들을 빠져나가 레이븐쇼어로 돌아갈 방법을 알고 있을지도 모릅니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=300|field=0"
msgid ""
"Greetings!\n"
"Hope the day finds you well!"
msgstr ""
"안녕하시오!\n"
"오늘 하루가 평안하길 바랍니다!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=301|field=0"
msgid ""
"Visitors to Stone City.\n"
"Its been a while since we had travelers such as yourselves!\n"
"Welcome!"
msgstr ""
"스톤 시티를 찾은 방문객들이군요.\n"
"당신들 같은 여행자가 온 것은 오랜만입니다!\n"
"환영합니다!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=302|field=0"
msgid ""
"You won Lord Markham's contest?\n"
"Good luck…last people who tried to clean this place up went into Castle Harmondale and never came out."
msgstr ""
"마크햄 경의 대회에서 우승했다고요?\n"
"행운을 빕니다…전에 이곳을 정리하려던 사람들은 하몬데일 성에 들어간 뒤 다시 나오지 못했습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=303|field=0"
msgid ""
"Welcome to Pierpont.\n"
"Be sure not to travel into the forest to the northeast.\n"
"Several people have disappeared in that region!"
msgstr ""
"피어폰트에 오신 것을 환영합니다.\n"
"북동쪽 숲으로는 들어가지 마십시오.\n"
"그 지역에서 여러 사람이 실종되었습니다!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=304|field=0"
msgid ""
"Erathia is sure a better place now that Catherine is ruling from Castle Gryphonheart.\n"
"Don’t you think?"
msgstr ""
"캐서린이 그리폰하트 성에서 통치한 뒤로 에라시아는 확실히 더 나은 곳이 되었습니다.\n"
"그렇지 않습니까?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=305|field=0"
msgid ""
"Deyja is the place to learn the ways of magic.\n"
"Have you visited all who could teach you?"
msgstr ""
"데이자는 마법의 길을 배우기에 좋은 곳입니다.\n"
"가르침을 줄 수 있는 이들을 모두 찾아가 보셨습니까?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=306|field=0"
msgid ""
"Greetings!\n"
"My name is Qillain, and I can make weapons from ore.\n"
"If you find ore, just bring me the chunk, and I'll make a weapon of equivalent quality to the ore used.\n"
"I will use the best ore first, and I take from only one person at a time."
msgstr ""
"안녕하시오!\n"
"제 이름은 킬레인이고, 광석으로 무기를 만들 수 있습니다.\n"
"광석을 발견하면 덩어리를 가져오십시오. 사용한 광석의 품질에 맞는 무기를 만들어 드리겠습니다.\n"
"가장 좋은 광석부터 사용하며, 한 번에 한 사람의 광석만 받습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=307|field=0"
msgid ""
"Welcome!\n"
"My name is Robert, and I can make armor from ore.\n"
"If you find ore, just bring me the chunk, and I'll make a armor of equivalent quality to the ore used.\n"
"I will use the best ore first, and I take from only one person at a time."
msgstr ""
"어서 오세요!\n"
"제 이름은 로버트이고, 광석으로 갑옷을 만들 수 있습니다.\n"
"광석을 발견하면 덩어리를 가져오십시오. 사용한 광석의 품질에 맞는 갑옷을 만들어 드리겠습니다.\n"
"가장 좋은 광석부터 사용하며, 한 번에 한 사람의 광석만 받습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=308|field=0"
msgid ""
"Greetings!\n"
"My name is Cloud,\n"
"and I can make items from ore-- you know, rings, cloaks, boots, and the like.\n"
"If you find ore, just bring me the chunk, and I'll make an item of equivalent quality to the ore used.\n"
"I will use the best ore first, and I take from only one person at a time."
msgstr ""
"안녕하시오!\n"
"제 이름은 클라우드이며,\n"
"광석으로 반지, 망토, 장화 같은 물건을 만들 수 있습니다.\n"
"광석을 발견하면 덩어리를 가져오십시오. 사용한 광석의 품질에 맞는 물건을 만들어 드리겠습니다.\n"
"가장 좋은 광석부터 사용하며, 한 번에 한 사람의 광석만 받습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=309|field=0"
msgid ""
"Hold there!\n"
"You seemed to have forgotten the Necromancer Tax.\n"
"This tax (1000 gold) ensures that the roads stay clear of zombies and costs, and it would be in your best interest to pay."
msgstr ""
"거기 멈추시오!\n"
"강령술사 세금을 잊은 모양이군요.\n"
"이 세금(1000골드)은 도로에 좀비와 각종 골칫거리가 생기지 않도록 관리하는 데 쓰이니, 당신을 위해서라도 내는 편이 좋을 겁니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=30|field=0"
msgid ""
"Wha…who is it? Who is it! You may think my injuries make me easy prey "
"raiders! But know my axe is sharp, and…and…hey…You're not the raiders! Who "
"are you?"
msgstr ""
"뭐…누구냐? 누구야! 내가 다쳤다고 만만한 먹잇감으로 보지 마라, 약탈자들아! 내 도끼는 날카롭고, 그리고…그리고…어이…당신들은 약탈자가"
" 아니군! 누구요?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=310|field=0"
msgid ""
"Need to make a little extra money?\n"
"I buy crates of Tularean Wood and I sell crates of Arrowheads at the best prices around."
msgstr ""
"돈을 조금 더 벌고 싶습니까?\n"
"툴라리안 목재 상자를 사고 화살촉 상자를 이 근방에서 가장 좋은 가격에 팝니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=311|field=0"
msgid ""
"Perhaps we can do some business together? I buy crates of Arrowheads and I "
"sell crates of Griffin Feathers at the best prices around."
msgstr "함께 거래해 보는 건 어떻습니까? 화살촉 상자를 사고 그리핀 깃털 상자를 이 근방에서 가장 좋은 가격에 팝니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=312|field=0"
msgid ""
"Looking to make some extra coin?\n"
"I buy crates of Griffin Feathers and I sell crates of Tularean Wood at the best prices around."
msgstr ""
"돈을 조금 더 벌고 싶습니까?\n"
"그리핀 깃털 상자를 사고 툴라리안 목재 상자를 이 근방에서 가장 좋은 가격에 팝니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=313|field=0"
msgid ""
"Greetings!\n"
"I buy crates of Enrothian Wine and I sell crates of Sand at the best prices around.\n"
"Are you interested in making a little money?"
msgstr ""
"안녕하시오!\n"
"엔로스산 와인 상자를 사고 모래 상자를 이 근방에서 가장 좋은 가격에 팝니다.\n"
"돈을 조금 벌어 볼 생각이 있습니까?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=314|field=0"
msgid ""
"Care to trade for some extra gold?\n"
"I buy crates of Sand and I sell crates of Glass Bottles at the best prices around."
msgstr ""
"금을 조금 더 벌도록 거래해 보시겠습니까?\n"
"모래 상자를 사고 유리병 상자를 이 근방에서 가장 좋은 가격에 팝니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=315|field=0"
msgid ""
"Greetings!\n"
"I buy crates of Glass Bottles and I sell crates of Enrothian Wine at the best prices around.\n"
"Are you interested in making a little money?"
msgstr ""
"안녕하시오!\n"
"유리병 상자를 사고 엔로스산 와인 상자를 이 근방에서 가장 좋은 가격에 팝니다.\n"
"돈을 조금 벌어 볼 생각이 있습니까?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=316|field=0"
msgid ""
"::You receive a telepathic message:: My…Lords.\n"
"My name is Archibald Ironfist.\n"
"You've probably heard of me--it is I who, up until recently, was the ruler of the Pit.\n"
"With my retirement, I find myself no longer concerned with the affairs of state.\n"
"I know that we were adversaries, but I am forced to ask for your help.\n"
"In return, I think I can help you.I see that you're on your way to do battle with the devils, and I want to make sure it goes well.\n"
"With the aid of equipment I have found in my new laboratory, I have discovered that my brother Roland, husband to Queen Catherine of Erathia, remains imprisoned by the devils in their foul, ah, dwelling.Please rescue him!\n"
"Not even I can bear to think of my brother in those conditions!\n"
"To help you along, I offer this weapon.\n"
"It was...found by my loyal servant sergeant Piridak, amongst my advisor's personal belongings.\n"
"I hope it helps."
msgstr ""
"::텔레파시 메시지를 받았습니다:: 영주님들…\n"
"내 이름은 아치볼드 아이언피스트요.\n"
"아마 내 이야기를 들었겠지. 얼마 전까지 구덩이의 통치자였던 사람이 바로 나요.\n"
"은퇴한 지금은 더 이상 국정에 관심을 두지 않고 있소.\n"
"우리가 적대했던 사이라는 것은 알지만, 어쩔 수 없이 도움을 청해야겠소.\n"
"그 대가로 나도 당신들을 도울 수 있을 것 같소.당신들이 데빌들과 싸우러 가는 길이라는 걸 알고 있고, 일이 잘 풀리게 하고 싶소.\n"
"새 연구실에서 발견한 장비를 이용해, 내 동생이자 에라시아의 캐서린 여왕의 남편인 롤랜드가 여전히 데빌들의 추악한, 음, 거처에 갇혀 있다는 사실을 알아냈소.그를 구해 주시오!\n"
"나조차도 내 동생이 그런 처지에 놓였다고 생각하면 견딜 수 없소!\n"
"도움을 주기 위해 이 무기를 보내겠소.\n"
"내 충직한 하인 피리닥 병장이 내 조언자의 개인 소지품에서…발견한 물건이오.\n"
"도움이 되길 바라오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=317|field=0"
msgid ""
"::You receive a telepathic message:: My friends.\n"
"I know you are working with my old advisors, but I must ask for your help one more time.With the aid of equipment I have found in my new laboratory, I have discovered that my brother Roland, husband to Queen Catherine of Erathia, remains imprisoned by the devils in their foul, ah, dwelling.\n"
"I overheard that you're on your way to do battle with them (this equipment really is wonderful), and I want to make sure it goes well.\n"
"My brother has stolen the key to their leader's chambers, and has hidden it in the beastly cage they're keeping him in.\n"
"Please rescue him!\n"
"Not even I can bear to think of my brother in those conditions!\n"
"To help you along, I offer this weapon.\n"
"It was...found by my loyal servant sergeant Piridak, amongst my advisor's personal belongings.\n"
"I hope it helps."
msgstr ""
"::텔레파시 메시지를 받았습니다:: 친구들이여.\n"
"당신들이 내 옛 조언자들과 함께 일한다는 것은 알지만, 한 번만 더 도움을 청해야겠소.새 연구실에서 발견한 장비를 이용해, 내 동생이자 에라시아의 캐서린 여왕의 남편인 롤랜드가 여전히 데빌들의 추악한, 음, 거처에 갇혀 있다는 사실을 알아냈소.\n"
"당신들이 그들과 싸우러 가는 길이라는 말을 엿들었고(이 장비는 정말 놀랍군), 일이 잘 풀리게 하고 싶소.\n"
"내 동생은 놈들의 우두머리 방 열쇠를 훔쳐, 자신을 가둔 흉측한 우리 안에 숨겨 놓았소.\n"
"그를 구해 주시오!\n"
"나조차도 내 동생이 그런 처지에 놓였다고 생각하면 견딜 수 없소!\n"
"도움을 주기 위해 이 무기를 보내겠소.\n"
"내 충직한 하인 피리닥 병장이 내 조언자의 개인 소지품에서…발견한 물건이오.\n"
"도움이 되길 바라오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=318|field=0"
msgid ""
"Halt!\n"
"Visitors aren't permitted in this section of Stone City.\n"
"If you are looking for King Hothfarr's throne room, it is to the east of here."
msgstr ""
"멈추시오!\n"
"방문객은 스톤 시티의 이 구역에 들어갈 수 없습니다.\n"
"호스파르 왕의 왕좌실을 찾는다면 이곳 동쪽에 있습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=319|field=0"
msgid ""
"Good day, my lords.\n"
"How do you fare?"
msgstr ""
"좋은 하루입니다, 영주님들.\n"
"어떻게 지내십니까?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=31|field=0"
msgid ""
"Hail to you. I am Sandro. Thant and I are the high guildmasters of the "
"Necromancers' Guild. With our fortunes diminished in Erathia and Enroth, it "
"could be argued that we speak for the guild worldwide.We have heard that you"
" are envoys from Bastian Loudrin. What is his need of us?"
msgstr ""
"반갑소. 나는 산드로요. 탄트와 나는 강령술사 길드의 수석 길드장이오. 에라시아와 엔로스에서 우리의 세력이 약해졌으니, 우리가 전 세계의"
" 길드를 대표한다고 해도 틀린 말은 아니오.바스티안 라우드린의 사절들이라고 들었소. 그가 우리에게 원하는 게 무엇이오?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=320|field=0"
msgid ""
"Ah, the contestants!\n"
"I hope you haven't come to try to give Harmondale back to me!\n"
"If you look at the contract you signed, it explicitly states that our deal is irrevocable on page nine, subparagraph iii, section c.\n"
"The deal really is cut and dried.\n"
"Buy the ticket--take the ride! ::Yawns:: Now, is there anything else you wished to speak about?"
msgstr ""
"아, 대회 참가자들이군!\n"
"하몬데일을 내게 돌려주려고 온 것은 아니길 바라오!\n"
"그대들이 서명한 계약서를 보면 9쪽 제3항 c절에 우리 거래는 철회할 수 없다고 명확히 쓰여 있소.\n"
"이 거래는 정말 명백하오.\n"
"표를 샀으면 끝까지 타야지! ::하품:: 이제 다른 이야기할 것이 있소?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=321|field=0"
msgid "MMExt Placeholder"
msgstr "MMExt Placeholder"

