"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=322|field=0"
msgid "MMExt Placeholder"
msgstr "MMExt Placeholder"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=323|field=0"
msgid ""
"Hey! Hey, you! Halt, I must speak with you for a spell. It’s a matter of an utmost importance. Though even ‘utmost’ can’t convey just how important the matter is. \n"
"*The woman glances you over with a firm frown forming on her brow* \n"
"How are you doing, by the way? Any sudden pains? Feeling strangely empty inside? Nothing? Well, that’s a relief, I have to say. Though I was pretty sure I had the hang of it by now. Third time’s the charm, aye?"
msgstr ""
"이봐요! 이봐, 당신! 멈추시오. 잠시 할 말이 있소. 대단히 중요한 일이오. 하지만 '대단히'라는 말조차 얼마나 중요한 일인지 전하지 못하겠군요. \n"
"*여자가 눈썹을 단단히 찌푸린 채 당신들을 훑어본다* \n"
"그런데 상태는 어떻습니까? 갑자기 아픈 곳은 없고? 속이 이상하게 텅 빈 느낌은? 아무것도 없습니까? 솔직히 다행이군요. 이제는 요령을 익혔다고 꽤 확신했거든요. 세 번째에는 성공한다는 말도 있잖소?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=324|field=0"
msgid ""
"Oh my, I'm so relieved to see you here! Something possibly terrible is "
"afoot! Yes, I know, you've saved the world three times, but that means "
"there's nobody else who can match you in skill and cunning, and boy, do we "
"need skill and cunning! Possibly. Almost for certain, really."
msgstr ""
"아, 여기서 만나니 정말 안심이군요! 어쩌면 끔찍한 일이 벌어지고 있습니다! 네, 세상을 세 번 구했다는 건 압니다. 하지만 그건 "
"당신들의 실력과 재치에 맞설 사람이 없다는 뜻이고, 세상에, 지금 우리에게 필요한 게 바로 실력과 재치예요! 아마도요. 사실 거의 "
"확실합니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=325|field=0"
msgid ""
"Pew pew pew! It looked easier than dealing with pesky goblins. But am I glad the Devil Queen is down! *Verdant shivers*. Disgusting thing. How did it smell? I don’t get full sensory experiences when using the spectator spells. \n"
"It’s nice we get to see the slow rebuilding of the village of Sweet Water now. To have a place with such a name evoke fear in the people that hear it, it doesn’t sit well with me. \n"
"And since we’re talking about things that don’t sit well with me, same can be said about you being knighted by a little boy you’ve had to fetch from the circus. I will never understand politics. Ever. In my eyes – you’re the world’s true royalty, and my chronicle will be sure to reflect that! Objectively, of course.\n"
"Oh, and this little thing is for you as well. So you don’t think I’m being lazy over here letting you do all the work."
msgstr ""
"퓽퓽퓽! 성가신 고블린들을 상대하는 것보다 쉬워 보였소. 그래도 데빌 여왕이 쓰러져 정말 다행이군요! *버던트가 몸을 떤다*. 역겨운 것이었소. 냄새는 어땠습니까? 관전 주문을 쓰면 모든 감각을 온전히 느낄 수는 없거든요. \n"
"이제 스위트 워터 마을이 천천히 재건되는 모습을 볼 수 있어 좋군요. 그렇게 달콤한 이름을 가진 장소가 듣는 사람들에게 공포를 불러일으킨다는 건 마음에 들지 않았습니다. \n"
"마음에 들지 않는 이야기가 나온 김에, 서커스에서 데려와야 했던 어린 소년에게 기사 작위를 받은 것도 마찬가지예요. 정치는 영원히 이해하지 못할 겁니다. 내 눈에는 당신들이야말로 세상의 진정한 왕족이며, 내 연대기에도 반드시 그렇게 기록할 거예요! 물론 객관적으로요.\n"
"아, 그리고 이 작은 것도 당신들에게 드리죠. 내가 여기서 빈둥거리며 모든 일을 당신들에게 떠넘겼다고 생각하지 않도록 말입니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=326|field=0"
msgid ""
"You’ve done it! I am… amazed. *Verdant is visibly trying to keep her composure, though it’s fair to assume she’d try at least poke your face to get a touch of heroism.* It can’t have been easy, I shudder at the mere thought of diving deep underwater with suits of this era… That sounds absolutely insane.\n"
"Really? Not that terrifying? Guess that’s why you’re the heroes and I’m the hero-remover. Hehe.\n"
"The consortium doesn’t know yet about the things that have transpired here. Thank goodness they’re usually pretty confused about what’s going on and where. But with your abilities, soon there will be nothing to know about. Or at least nothing to know about in fury. Thank you, on my behalf, and on the behalf of the people of Antagrich. \n"
"What did Katherine do in the meanwhile, huh? Aside of bossing you around and stirring trouble with that Elven King. You should be the one patting her on shoulder and telling her good job on the paperwork.\n"
"Here, I’ve made something for you. I hope you find it useful."
msgstr ""
"해냈군요! 나는…놀랐습니다. *버던트는 애써 침착함을 유지하려 하지만, 영웅심을 조금이라도 만져 보겠다며 적어도 당신들의 얼굴을 찔러 보려 할 것 같다.* 쉽지 않았을 텐데요. 이 시대의 장비를 입고 깊은 물속으로 잠수한다는 생각만 해도 몸이 떨려요…정말 미친 짓처럼 들립니다.\n"
"정말요? 그렇게 무섭지는 않았다고? 역시 당신들은 영웅이고 나는 영웅 제거자인 이유가 있군요. 헤헤.\n"
"컨소시엄은 아직 이곳에서 일어난 일을 모릅니다. 다행히 그들은 보통 어디서 무슨 일이 벌어지는지 꽤 혼란스러워하거든요. 하지만 당신들의 능력이라면 곧 알아야 할 일 자체가 사라질 겁니다. 적어도 분노하며 알아야 할 일은 없겠지요. 나와 안타개릭 사람들을 대신해 감사드립니다. \n"
"그동안 캐서린은 뭘 했답니까? 당신들에게 명령하고 그 엘프 왕과 문제를 일으킨 것 말고요. 오히려 당신들이 그녀의 어깨를 두드리며 서류 작업을 잘했다고 칭찬해야 할 겁니다.\n"
"자, 당신들을 위해 뭔가 만들었습니다. 유용하게 쓰길 바랍니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=327|field=0"
msgid ""
"Hey! Congratulations! That was a true show of power. Though I have to say, I felt a little sad watching Escaton die. There was something affable about the fella, something tragic to his story, don’t you think? \n"
"But I am glad to see our Elemental Lord friends back in their happy little dimensions. They’re kind of like your friendly neighborhood wild animals, breaks my heart to see them suffer. Don’t scowl at me, I absolutely love animals so it’s definitely a compliment!\n"
"Only shame the crystal is gone. I was meaning to chip some off it for jewelry purposes, but I didn’t get around to it in time. Oh well, maybe in the next iteration, right?\n"
"I’ve made a little something for you. Infused with love and adoration!"
msgstr ""
"이봐요! 축하합니다! 정말 압도적인 힘을 보여 주었군요. 하지만 에스카톤이 죽는 모습을 보니 조금 슬펐다는 건 말해야겠어요. 그 친구에게는 어딘가 호감 가는 면이 있었고, 사연에도 비극적인 점이 있었지 않습니까? \n"
"그래도 원소 군주 친구들이 행복하고 작은 자기 차원으로 돌아간 모습을 보니 기쁩니다. 그들은 친근한 동네 야생동물 같은 존재라 고통받는 모습을 보면 마음이 아프거든요. 그렇게 노려보지 마시오. 나는 동물을 정말 좋아하니 분명 칭찬입니다!\n"
"수정이 사라진 것만은 아쉽군요. 장신구를 만들려고 조금 떼어 두려 했는데 제때 하지 못했어요. 뭐, 다음 반복에서는 할 수 있겠지요?\n"
"당신들을 위해 작은 것을 하나 만들었습니다. 사랑과 찬미를 듬뿍 담았소!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=328|field=0"
msgid "Hey, how's the expedition going? "
msgstr "이봐요, 원정은 어떻게 되어 갑니까? "

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=329|field=0"
msgid ""
"Hey! Got my letter? I must speak with you. It’s a matter of an utmost importance. Though even ‘utmost’ can’t convey just how important the matter is. \n"
"*The woman glances you over with a firm frown forming on her brow* \n"
"How are you doing, by the way? Any sudden pains? Feeling strangely empty inside? Nothing? Well, that’s a relief, I have to say. Though I was pretty sure I had the hang of it by now. Third time’s the charm, aye?"
msgstr ""
"이봐요! 내 편지를 받았습니까? 할 말이 있소. 대단히 중요한 일이오. 하지만 '대단히'라는 말조차 얼마나 중요한 일인지 전하지 못하겠군요. \n"
"*여자가 눈썹을 단단히 찌푸린 채 당신들을 훑어본다* \n"
"그런데 상태는 어떻습니까? 갑자기 아픈 곳은 없고? 속이 이상하게 텅 빈 느낌은? 아무것도 없습니까? 솔직히 다행이군요. 이제는 요령을 익혔다고 꽤 확신했거든요. 세 번째에는 성공한다는 말도 있잖소?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=32|field=0"
msgid ""
"Hah! The only advantage that the Sun Temple had against us is no more. With "
"the Nightshade Brazier back in our possession, we no longer need worry about"
" the daytime defense of Shadowspire. We can march our undead to their very "
"doors. We will destroy their temple and wipe them from the face of Jadame! "
"Now that the tide of battle has turned in our favor, we of the Necromancers'"
" Guild can more generously consider the request made by our friend, Bastian "
"Loudrin. Thant can take over here while I am away sitting on your alliance "
"council."
msgstr ""
"하! 태양의 신전이 우리에게 갖고 있던 유일한 우위도 이제 사라졌군. 나이트셰이드 화로를 되찾았으니 더는 낮 동안 섀도스파이어를 방어할 "
"걱정이 없소. 언데드 군대를 그들의 문 앞까지 진군시킬 수 있소. 그들의 신전을 파괴하고 제이덤에서 흔적조차 지워 버릴 것이오! 이제 "
"전세가 우리에게 유리하게 돌아섰으니 강령술사 길드는 친구 바스티안 라우드린의 요청을 더 너그럽게 검토할 수 있소. 내가 동맹 의회에 "
"참석하는 동안 탄트가 이곳을 맡을 것이오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=330|field=0"
msgid ""
"Hey, you are here. Well, you need this letter to jump on path of previous "
"heroes... You're a bunch of happy kids saved by a nice warlock fellow, spent"
" your lives training, now all grown up and ready to roll. No need for a "
"heavy roleplay, just don't be jerks. Go around, slap some goblins, squash a "
"spider or two, poke a devil. Umm... I mean, an apprentice wizard, yes. No "
"devils anywhere, forget the devils. I don't think I should be telling you "
"things about your future. Well, their future. But also your future now. You "
"know what I mean."
msgstr ""
"이봐요, 왔군요. 전대 영웅들의 길로 뛰어들려면 이 편지가 필요합니다…당신들은 친절한 흑마법사에게 구원받고 평생 훈련하며 살아온 행복한 "
"아이들이며, 이제 다 자라 출발할 준비를 마쳤소. 지나치게 심각한 역할극은 필요 없고, 그저 못된 짓만 하지 마시오. 돌아다니며 고블린을"
" 몇 대 때리고, 거미 한두 마리를 뭉개고, 악마를 찔러 보시오. 음…그러니까 견습 마법사를 말한 겁니다, 그래요. 악마는 어디에도 "
"없으니 악마 이야기는 잊으시오. 당신들의 미래를 말해 주면 안 될 것 같군요. 아니, 그들의 미래요. 하지만 이제는 당신들의 미래이기도 "
"하군요. 무슨 말인지 알겠지요."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=331|field=0"
msgid ""
"*Verdant appears behind you suddenly.* Boo! Well, well, you've traveled "
"through time! Look around, can you believe this town, these people, they're "
"all centuries older than you? Or have yet to be born and built? How does it "
"feel to think about it for the first time? Hah. Here, I've got something for"
" you - it's a Connector Gem."
msgstr ""
"*버던트가 갑자기 당신들 뒤에 나타난다.* 짠! 이것 보시오, 시간 여행을 했군요! 주변을 둘러보시오. 이 마을과 사람들은 모두 "
"당신들보다 수백 년이나 오래되었다는 게 믿어집니까? 아니면 아직 태어나지도, 지어지지도 않았을 수도 있고요. 처음으로 그 사실을 생각하니"
" 기분이 어떻습니까? 하. 자, 당신들에게 줄 것이 있습니다. 연결 보석입니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=33|field=0"
msgid ""
"Who are you? I don't recognize you, but I'm sure that whatever your "
"business, it will add to my troubles."
msgstr "누구요? 낯선 얼굴이군. 하지만 무슨 용건이든 내 골칫거리를 더 늘릴 게 분명하오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=34|field=0"
msgid ""
"So, Sandro has asked you to strike a blow against the Sun Temple! Though I "
"hate the guild. I would be willing to help you. Half a serving of revenge is"
" better than none."
msgstr ""
"그렇군, 산드로가 태양의 신전을 공격해 달라고 했소! 나는 길드가 증오스럽지만, 당신들을 돕겠소. 복수는 절반만 해도 아예 못 하는 "
"것보다는 나으니까."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=35|field=0"
msgid ""
"Ah, you are sent by his high holiness…Oskar Tyre thinks to activate his "
"agent. Though I would wish him no good, I will do as he asks. Yes, I have "
"knowledge of the guild's Skeleton Transformer and believe I can destroy it. "
"Very well, let us do this thing against the Necromancers' Guild. I will at "
"least be able to strike against one of my enemies!"
msgstr ""
"아, 지고하신 성하께서 보낸 이들이군…오스카 타이어가 자신의 요원을 움직이려는 모양이오. 그가 잘되기를 바라지는 않지만, 요구에는 "
"따르겠소. 그래, 나는 길드의 해골 변환기에 대해 알고 있고 그것을 파괴할 수 있다고 생각하오. 좋소, 강령술사 길드에 맞서 이 일을 "
"합시다. 적어도 내 원수 중 하나는 공격할 수 있겠군!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=36|field=0"
msgid ""
"Hah! So both Sandro and Oskar Tyre seek to use me against the other. I have "
"thought of the possibility of this occurring. I believe that if I were to "
"strike against one, it would become impossible for me to strike the other.So"
" I guess we have a choice--help the guild or the temple. Which? I don't "
"know, as my hatred for both is equal. I suppose I'll have to do with a half "
"measure of revenge."
msgstr ""
"하! 산드로와 오스카 타이어가 모두 나를 이용해 상대를 공격하려 하는군. 이런 일이 생길 가능성은 생각해 두었소. 한쪽을 공격하면 다른 "
"쪽은 공격할 수 없게 될 것 같소.그러니 길드를 도울지 신전을 도울지 선택해야겠군. 어느 쪽이냐고? 모르겠소. 둘 다 똑같이 증오하니까."
" 결국 절반짜리 복수에 만족해야 할 것 같군."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=37|field=0"
msgid ""
"So you are sent by Bastian Loudrin? Well, then. What would he have us hear?"
msgstr "바스티안 라우드린이 보냈다고? 그렇군. 그가 우리에게 무엇을 전하려 하는 것이오?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=38|field=0"
msgid ""
"Hail, heroes of Jadame! I'm glad you’ve returned. I want to make it clear "
"that the merchant guild has made this guildhouse permanently open to you. "
"Now that the crisis is over, the other council members have returned home. "
"Though they are gone, good will prevails between us. The beginning of a new "
"era of peace? We will see. Certainly it is a time of prosperity! Our "
"caravans are already back in operation."
msgstr ""
"제이덤의 영웅들이여, 만세! 돌아와 주어 기쁘오. 상인 길드는 이 길드회관을 영원히 당신들에게 개방하기로 했다는 것을 분명히 말해 "
"두겠소. 위기가 끝나 다른 의원들은 고향으로 돌아갔소. 그들은 떠났지만 우리 사이의 우호는 계속될 것이오. 새로운 평화의 시대가 시작되는"
" 걸까? 두고 봐야겠지. 분명한 것은 번영의 시대라는 점이오! 우리 대상단도 벌써 다시 움직이고 있소."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=39|field=0"
msgid ""
"Ah well, very good to see you. Quite a lot of trouble is behind us, no? What"
" brings the \"\"Heroes of Jadame\"\" to my camp?"
msgstr ""
"아, 다시 만나니 정말 반갑소. 큰 문제들은 대부분 지나간 것 같군, 그렇지 않소? '제이덤의 영웅들'께서 내 야영지에는 무슨 일로 "
"오셨소?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=3|field=0"
msgid ""
"Welcome to Dagger Wound Island, Journeyman of Alvar.\n"
"I am Brekish Onefang, Clan Leader.\n"
"I wish I was greeting you during better times.The mountain of fire has caused serious damage to my village and its people.\n"
"Many buildings have been damaged, and the bridges that connect the smaller islands to the main island have been destroyed!\n"
"Many people are missing or stranded on these smaller islands!\n"
"We must help them!"
msgstr ""
"대거 운드 섬에 온 것을 환영하오, 알바르의 숙련자여.\n"
"나는 부족장 브레키시 원팽이오.\n"
"더 나은 때에 그대를 맞이했으면 좋았을 텐데. 불의 산이 우리 마을과 주민들에게 심각한 피해를 입혔소.\n"
"많은 건물이 파손되었고, 작은 섬들과 본섬을 잇던 다리들도 무너졌소!\n"
"많은 이들이 실종되거나 작은 섬들에 고립되어 있소!\n"
"우리가 그들을 도와야 하오!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=40|field=0"
msgid ""
"Together we have done a great deed. I look forward to telling my heir the "
"tale. How can I help you, heroes?"
msgstr "우리는 함께 위대한 일을 해냈소. 언젠가 후계자에게 이 이야기를 들려줄 날이 기대되는군. 영웅들이여, 무엇을 도와드리겠소?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=41|field=0"
msgid ""
"The Light has shined upon us indeed. Our temple is always open to the "
"\"\"Heroes of Jadame.\"\" How may I help you?"
msgstr "빛이 참으로 우리를 비추었군요. 우리 신전은 언제나 '제이덤의 영웅들'에게 열려 있습니다. 무엇을 도와드릴까요?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=42|field=0"
msgid ""
"How good of you to grace us with your presence. Heroes of Jadame. Saviors of"
" Balthazar Lair. Both fitting titles for you who have done so much for me "
"herd and for all of Jadame!"
msgstr ""
"몸소 찾아 주시다니 영광이오. 제이덤의 영웅들, 발타자르 소굴의 구원자들. 우리 무리와 제이덤 전체를 위해 그토록 많은 일을 한 "
"당신들에게 두 칭호 모두 잘 어울리오!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=43|field=0"
msgid ""
"Hail! In the name of the guild, I welcome you. Know that we consider you our"
" friends, Heroes of Jadame. What would you have of us today?"
msgstr "만세! 길드를 대표해 환영하오. 제이덤의 영웅들이여, 우리는 당신들을 친구로 여기고 있소. 오늘은 우리에게 무엇을 바라시오?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=44|field=0"
msgid ""
"If you're looking for my master, Xanthor, he is not here. Can I help you?"
msgstr "내 주인 잔토르를 찾는 거라면 그는 이곳에 없소. 내가 도와드릴까요?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=45|field=0"
msgid ""
"Hmph. So you are the heroes of the alliance. Not much to look at, I must "
"say. Still, I suppose you have survived much to see this day. I only hope "
"you are up to the task I think fate has for you. If not, we are all surely "
"doomed!"
msgstr ""
"흥. 그대들이 동맹의 영웅들이군. 겉보기엔 별것 없어 보이는군. 그래도 오늘까지 살아남았으니 많은 일을 겪었겠지. 운명이 그대들에게 맡길"
" 일을 감당할 수 있기만 바라겠소. 그렇지 못하면 우리 모두 틀림없이 파멸할 테니까!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=46|field=0"
msgid ""
"There. It is built. Take this Conflux Key. As I have explained, it will "
"allow you to use the crystal in the town square as a gateway--much as you've"
" used the elemental gateways to reach the elemental planes. The crystal "
"gateway will take you to the place between the planes.On this \"\"Plane "
"Between Planes\"\" you must find the source of the cataclysm. What it is, I "
"don't know, but whatever it is, it is there. Go now! The fate of the land, "
"I'm afraid, lies on your shoulders. Be worthy of the task!"
msgstr ""
"됐소. 완성했소. 이 컨플럭스 열쇠를 받으시오. 설명했듯이, 이것을 사용하면 마을 광장의 수정을 관문으로 쓸 수 있소. 원소 차원으로 "
"향할 때 사용했던 원소 관문과 비슷하오. 수정 관문은 그대들을 차원 사이의 장소로 데려갈 것이오.이 '차원 사이의 차원'에서 대재앙의 "
"근원을 찾아야 하오. 그것이 무엇인지는 모르지만, 무엇이든 그곳에 있소. 어서 가시오! 유감스럽게도 이 땅의 운명이 그대들의 어깨에 "
"달렸소. 그 임무에 걸맞은 모습을 보이시오!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=47|field=0"
msgid ""
"You have conducted yourselves greatly. I must say I had my doubts about your"
" abilities, but no longer. You are truly worthy of the praise that all "
"lavish upon you."
msgstr "그대들은 훌륭히 행동했소. 솔직히 능력을 의심했지만 이제는 아니오. 사람들이 쏟아붓는 찬사를 받을 자격이 충분하오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=48|field=0"
msgid ""
"I sense some small presence in this chamber. Greater than gnats, but so much"
" less than myself. Where is it….Ah, there it is. What have we here? Some of "
"the beings of Jadame? Yes. Destroy them? Surely within my rights…but, no. It"
" has been a slow millennia. Perhaps they will provide some diversion.Speak "
"then, lower ones! What would you have of Escaton the Destroyer of Worlds?"
msgstr ""
"이 방에서 아주 작은 존재가 느껴지는군. 각다귀보다는 크지만 나에 비하면 한없이 하찮아. 어디 있지….아, 저기 있군. 이게 뭐지? "
"제이덤의 존재들인가? 그래. 파괴해 버릴까? 당연히 내 권리 안의 일이지만…아니, 그러지 않겠다. 지난 수천 년은 지루했으니, 저들이 "
"약간의 유희를 제공할지도 모르지.말해 보아라, 하등한 것들아! 세계의 파괴자 에스카톤에게 무엇을 바라느냐?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=49|field=0"
msgid ""
"Greetings.\n"
"You seek instruction?"
msgstr ""
"안녕하시오.\n"
"가르침을 구하러 왔소?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=4|field=0"
msgid ""
"You must tell the Merchants of Alvar of the Regnan raid on Dagger Wound Island!\n"
"They must send help!"
msgstr ""
"대거 운드 섬이 레그나의 습격을 받았다고 알바르 상인들에게 알려야 합니다!\n"
"그들이 지원을 보내야 합니다!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=50|field=0"
msgid "Who is there? Am I finally to be released?"
msgstr "누구냐? 드디어 나를 풀어 주러 온 것이냐?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=51|field=0"
msgid ""
"Help me! I have been able to live thus far, but for how much longer can I?"
msgstr "도와주십시오! 지금까지는 살아남았지만, 얼마나 더 버틸 수 있을지 모르겠습니다!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=52|field=0"
msgid ""
"Ah, mortals…good. You are not of my tormentors. Release me from this place! "
"I will not harm you."
msgstr "아, 필멸자들이군…좋다. 너희는 나를 괴롭힌 자들이 아니구나. 이곳에서 나를 풀어 다오! 너희를 해치지 않겠다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=53|field=0"
msgid ""
"Free me quickly! I have survived so far, but it is only a matter of time "
"before I am extinguished!"
msgstr "어서 나를 풀어 다오! 지금까지는 버텼지만, 내가 소멸하는 것은 시간문제다!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=54|field=0"
msgid ""
"Greetings. I am Sahil Ittalle, the historian of the Alvarian Merchant Guild."
" How can I help you today?"
msgstr "안녕하시오. 나는 알바르 상인 길드의 역사가 사힐 이탈레요. 오늘은 무엇을 도와드리겠소?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=55|field=0"
msgid ""
"Ah, you must be the alliance council's heroes. Well met. Catherine and I are"
" here to help. What can I do for you?"
msgstr "아, 동맹 의회에서 보낸 영웅들이겠군. 반갑소. 캐서린과 나는 당신들을 돕기 위해 왔소. 무엇을 도와드릴까요?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=56|field=0"
msgid ""
"It was a harrowing journey to reach your shores, I assure you! But the "
"events of the cataclysm force all to extreme duties. I'm sure you "
"understand. But down to issues. How can I help you?"
msgstr ""
"당신들의 해안에 도착하기까지 참으로 험난한 여정이었소! 하지만 대재앙은 모두에게 극단적인 의무를 강요하지. 이해하리라 믿소. 그럼 "
"본론으로 들어갑시다. 무엇을 도와드릴까요?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=57|field=0"
msgid ""
"Greetings! I am Asael Fromago, the world's preeminent connoisseur of fine "
"cheeses. Oh, some might say that Elkanah Juusto of Edenbrook holds the "
"title, but he is a dilettante--a mere dabbler!"
msgstr ""
"안녕하시오! 나는 세계 최고의 고급 치즈 감정가 아사엘 프로마고요. 에덴브룩의 엘카나 주스토가 그 칭호를 지녔다고 말하는 이들도 있지만,"
" 그는 아마추어요. 그저 겉핥기만 하는 자지!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=58|field=0"
msgid "Hail, adventurer!"
msgstr "모험가여, 반갑소!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=59|field=0"
msgid "Yeah? What do you want?"
msgstr "그래? 무슨 일이야?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=5|field=0"
msgid ""
"What?\n"
"I don't have time to talk now!\n"
"I need to pack some things and leave!"
msgstr ""
"뭐요?\n"
"지금은 이야기할 시간이 없소!\n"
"짐을 챙겨 떠나야 하오!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=60|field=0"
msgid "How are you today?"
msgstr "오늘은 어떻게 지내십니까?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=61|field=0"
msgid "Yes? What is it?"
msgstr "네? 무슨 일이죠?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=62|field=0"
msgid "Greetings. How may I help you?"
msgstr "안녕하세요. 무엇을 도와드릴까요?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=63|field=0"
msgid ""
"Who are you? Clearly you are not of this realm. And how have you survived? I"
" am amazed you have not been destroyed by the madness that has taken over my"
" fellow earth dwellers!"
msgstr ""
"누구요? 분명 이 세계의 존재는 아니군. 그런데 어떻게 살아남았소? 내 동료 대지 주민들을 사로잡은 광기에 파괴되지 않은 것이 놀랍소!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=64|field=0"
msgid ""
"Greetings. Though I have not yet succumbed to the madness, be aware! I feel "
"its tug on my mind. I don't know how long I can hold out."
msgstr ""
"안녕하시오. 아직 광기에 굴복하지는 않았지만 조심하시오! 광기가 내 정신을 잡아당기는 것이 느껴지오. 얼마나 더 버틸 수 있을지 "
"모르겠소."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=65|field=0"
msgid ""
"The madness pulls at me, but still I maintain my sanity. If you have "
"business with me, speak quickly. Even now I feel a compulsion to attack you!"
msgstr ""
"광기가 나를 끌어당기지만 아직은 이성을 유지하고 있소. 용건이 있다면 빨리 말하시오. 지금도 그대들을 공격하라는 충동이 느껴지오!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=66|field=0"
msgid ""
"Fear not, plane-travelers. For reasons I do not understand, the madness that"
" affects my brethren does not affect me. How can I help you?"
msgstr ""
"두려워하지 마시오, 차원 여행자들이여. 이유는 모르겠지만 내 동족에게 영향을 주는 광기가 나에게는 통하지 않소. 무엇을 도와드릴까요?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=67|field=0"
msgid ""
"Madness reigns these watery realms, but it does not rule me. Somehow I am "
"not affected. How can I help you?"
msgstr "광기가 이 물의 영역을 지배하지만, 나까지 지배하지는 못하오. 어째서인지 나는 영향을 받지 않소. 무엇을 도와드릴까요?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=68|field=0"
msgid ""
"T-the madness p-pulls at my very soul. Each day is a st-struggle to maintain"
" sanity. I w-will h-help you while I c-can, but be prepared to fl-flee!"
msgstr ""
"과-광기가 내 영혼을 끌-끌어당기오. 매일 이성을 지키기 위한 싸-싸움이오. 할 수 있는 동안은 도-도와드리겠지만, 도-도망칠 준비는 해"
" 두시오!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=69|field=0"
msgid ""
"Welcome to my sanctuary. I have proofed this chamber against the maddening "
"magic which affects my fellow citizens. You are safe as long as you stay "
"here. How may I help you?"
msgstr ""
"내 성소에 온 것을 환영하오. 이 방은 다른 주민들에게 영향을 주는 광기의 마법을 막도록 방비했소. 이곳에 머무는 동안은 안전하오. "
"무엇을 도와드릴까요?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=6|field=0"
msgid ""
"Aren't you with the Merchant Caravan from Alvar?\n"
"I need your help!"
msgstr ""
"알바르에서 온 상단과 함께 온 분 아닙니까?\n"
"도와주십시오!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=70|field=0"
msgid ""
"I don't know what has befallen us, but it is awful! All my friends and "
"family are affected by violent madness. Somehow I am not affected. But how "
"can I help you?"
msgstr ""
"우리에게 무슨 일이 생긴 건지는 모르지만 끔찍하오! 내 친구와 가족 모두가 폭력적인 광기에 사로잡혔소. 어째서인지 나만은 영향을 받지 "
"않았소. 그런데 내가 무엇을 도와드릴 수 있겠소?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=71|field=0"
msgid "So, I understand you're out for adventure. I'd be glad to join you!"
msgstr "모험을 찾아다닌다고 들었소. 기꺼이 함께하겠소!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=72|field=0"
msgid ""
"It is so boring around here! I mean, why did I spend all that time training "
"if I'm not going to use my skills? Say, perhaps you could take me with you. "
"Clearly you're headed someplace exciting!"
msgstr ""
"이곳은 너무 지루해! 능력을 쓰지도 않을 거라면 왜 그토록 오래 훈련했겠어? 이봐, 나를 데려가는 건 어때? 당신들은 분명 흥미진진한 "
"곳으로 가는 것 같으니까!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=73|field=0"
msgid ""
"I know the elder Dragons would never approve, but I don't care! I want "
"adventure, and you're the best chance I'll see. Can I go with you?"
msgstr ""
"장로 드래곤들이 절대 허락하지 않으리라는 건 알지만 상관없소! 나는 모험을 원하고, 당신들이야말로 내가 모험을 떠날 최고의 기회요. 함께"
" 가도 되겠소?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=74|field=0"
msgid ""
"Would you believe the Necromancers' Guild cast me out? I, Karanya Memoria? "
"Fah! They were just jealous of my great potential. Not that this has stopped"
" me from seeking dark knowledge--I do so now by my own path.Say, perhaps we "
"could join forces!"
msgstr ""
"강령술사 길드가 나, 카라냐 메모리아를 내쫓았다는 게 믿어지시오? 흥! 그들은 내 위대한 잠재력을 질투했을 뿐이오. 그렇다고 어둠의 "
"지식을 추구하는 일을 멈춘 것은 아니오. 이제는 나만의 길로 탐구하고 있소.이봐, 우리 힘을 합치는 건 어떻소!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=75|field=0"
msgid ""
"Greetings, travelers! Ah, how I envy your lives of adventure. You know, I "
"too know the call of the open road. I myself once sought new experiences--"
"strange lands, strange people, and whatnot. Sadly, those days are over for "
"me."
msgstr ""
"안녕하시오, 여행자들이여! 아, 모험으로 가득한 삶이 참 부럽군. 나도 한때는 열린 길의 부름을 따랐소. 새로운 경험과 낯선 땅, 낯선 "
"사람 같은 것을 찾아다녔지. 안타깝게도 그런 시절은 이제 끝났소."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=76|field=0"
msgid ""
"Greetings, and well met! I am Jasp Thelbourne--an Elf of daring deeds. This "
"is no idle boast. You may have heard of the Idol of Seven Skunks? It was I "
"who recovered it from the Temple of Eep for the Alvarian Merchant Guild."
msgstr ""
"안녕하시오, 반갑소! 나는 대담한 위업을 이룬 엘프 재스프 셀본이오. 허풍이 아니오. 일곱 스컹크의 우상에 대해 들어 보았소? 알바르 "
"상인 길드를 위해 윕의 신전에서 그것을 되찾은 사람이 바로 나요."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=77|field=0"
msgid ""
"I grow weary of the endless demands placed on my by my so-called "
"\"\"master,\"\" the accursed Thant. He would have me stay here in "
"Shadowspire as a guard. A \"\"guard,\"\" feh! I am meant for greater things."
" An adventure like yours is what I seek. Will you have me in your "
"fellowship?"
msgstr ""
"소위 '주인'이라는 저주받을 탄트가 끝없이 명령하는 데 지쳤소. 그는 나를 섀도스파이어에 남겨 경비를 서게 하려 하지. '경비'라니, "
"흥! 나는 더 위대한 일을 위해 태어났소. 당신들 같은 모험을 찾고 있소. 나를 동료로 받아 주겠소?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=78|field=0"
msgid ""
"Greetings. I am Nathaniel Roberts. Without false modesty, I can say I am a "
"mighty master of dark magic. It is your good fortune I have grown bored of "
"Shadowspire and seek a company of adventurers such as yourselves to ally "
"myself with. If you are agreeable, I will allow you to accompany me."
msgstr ""
"안녕하시오. 나는 너새니얼 로버츠요. 거짓 겸손 없이 말하자면, 나는 강력한 어둠 마법의 대가요. 내가 섀도스파이어에 싫증을 느껴 당신들"
" 같은 모험가 무리와 손잡으려 한다는 건 그대들에게 행운이지. 동의한다면 내가 그대들과 동행해 주겠소."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=79|field=0"
msgid ""
"So, a party of \"\"adventurers\"\"…hmmm. I suppose most dragons would just "
"attack them outright, but then again I, Flamdring, have never been \"\"most "
"dragons,\"\" no. Join them? Yes, perhaps I will. Perhaps I will."
msgstr ""
"그래, '모험가' 무리라…흐음. 대부분의 드래곤이라면 당장 공격했겠지만, 나 플램드링은 결코 '대부분의 드래곤'이 아니었지. 합류한다고?"
" 그래, 어쩌면 그러는 것도 좋겠군. 그래, 그렇게 하지."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=7|field=0"
msgid ""
"It's the end of the world!\n"
"The Mountain of Fire will consume us all!"
msgstr ""
"세상이 끝장날 거야!\n"
"불의 산이 우리 모두를 집어삼킬 거라고!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=80|field=0"
msgid ""
"How are you? I am Hevatia Deverbero, a member in full standing of the "
"Necromancers' Guild."
msgstr "어떻게 지내시오? 나는 강령술사 길드의 정회원 헤바티아 데베르베로요."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=81|field=0"
msgid ""
"Greetings, and may the Light shine on you. What can a humble priest of the "
"Sun do for you today?"
msgstr "안녕하시오. 빛이 그대들을 비추기를. 태양을 섬기는 보잘것없는 사제가 오늘 무엇을 도와드릴까요?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=82|field=0"
msgid "Yes? Well, don't stand there tongue tied! I'm a busy man!"
msgstr "네? 거기서 말문이 막힌 채 서 있지 마시오! 나는 바쁜 사람이오!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=83|field=0"
msgid ""
"Hello, and good hunting to you. I am Sethrc Thistlebone, a warrior of this "
"village, such as it is."
msgstr "안녕하시오. 사냥에 행운이 있기를. 나는 보잘것없는 이 마을의 전사 세스릭 시슬본이오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=84|field=0"
msgid ""
"Greetings. Welcome to my home. I am Rionel, axe warrior of Balthazar Lair."
msgstr "안녕하시오. 내 집에 온 것을 환영하오. 나는 발타자르 소굴의 도끼 전사 리오넬이오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=85|field=0"
msgid ""
"Greeting! I am Adric Stellare, a former lieutenant of the Alvar Guard. I "
"grew tired of the regimented lifestyle. Now I seek adventure."
msgstr "안녕하시오! 나는 알바르 경비대의 전직 부관 애드릭 스텔라레요. 규율에 얽매인 생활에 지쳤소. 이제 모험을 찾고 있소."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=86|field=0"
msgid ""
"I am Infaustus, elder vampire and adventurer. I will talk with you if you "
"are brief. I am busy making preparations to leave. I go to seek my fortune "
"across the lands of Jadame."
msgstr ""
"나는 장로 뱀파이어이자 모험가인 인파우스투스요. 짧게 말한다면 대화해 주겠소. 떠날 준비로 바쁘오. 제이덤 전역을 돌아다니며 부와 명예를"
" 찾을 생각이오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=87|field=0"
msgid ""
"Very impressive performance. Reaching me was not easy. Perhaps you are the "
"adventurers I seek. You see, I wish to explore the world, and these days, "
"even a Dragon would be smart not to travel alone."
msgstr ""
"아주 인상적인 솜씨였소. 내게 도달하는 것은 쉽지 않았을 텐데. 어쩌면 그대들이 내가 찾던 모험가들일지도 모르겠군. 나는 세상을 탐험하고"
" 싶소. 요즘 같은 때에는 드래곤이라도 혼자 여행하지 않는 편이 현명하니까."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=88|field=0"
msgid ""
"Hail, adventurers! I am Tempus, hunt leader and a knight of some renown in "
"my native Erathia. What can I do for you?"
msgstr "모험가들이여, 반갑소! 나는 사냥대장이자 고향 에라시아에서 제법 이름난 기사 템푸스요. 무엇을 도와드릴까요?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=89|field=0"
msgid ""
"Greetings! I am the mighty Thorne Understone. I know we have not met before"
"--I never forget a face--but perhaps you recognize my name from ballads. You"
" know, several have been written about me."
msgstr ""
"안녕하시오! 나는 위대한 손 언더스톤이오. 전에 만난 적은 없소. 나는 얼굴을 절대 잊지 않으니까. 하지만 노래를 통해 내 이름은 들어 "
"봤을지도 모르겠군. 나에 관한 노래가 여러 곡 쓰였거든."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=8|field=0"
msgid "What are you doing here? Get my letter to Fellmoon!"
msgstr "여기서 뭐 하는 거요? 내 편지를 펠문에게 전하시오!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=90|field=0"
msgid ""
"Hail! I am Ulbrecht, a hero of the Vori campaigns. Be welcome in my home."
msgstr "만세! 나는 보리 원정의 영웅 울브레히트요. 내 집에 온 것을 환영하오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=91|field=0"
msgid ""
"I wake after a sleep of thirty-four years, and already I have company! I see"
" you have traveled far. Perhaps you can tell me what has transpired while I "
"slumbered."
msgstr ""
"서른네 해 동안 잠들었다 깨어났는데 벌써 손님이 왔군! 먼 길을 여행한 것 같소. 내가 잠든 동안 무슨 일이 있었는지 말해 줄 수 "
"있겠소?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=92|field=0"
msgid ""
"I am Duroth the Eternal. By besting the guards you have earned the right of "
"speaking to me. What do you want?"
msgstr "나는 영원한 듀로스다. 경비병들을 꺾었으니 나와 이야기할 권리를 얻었다. 무엇을 원하는가?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=93|field=0"
msgid ""
"Greetings! I am Weldrick Falconeye, Dragon training specialist. What can I "
"do for you today?"
msgstr "안녕하시오! 나는 드래곤 훈련 전문가 웰드릭 팰컨아이요. 오늘은 무엇을 도와드릴까요?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=94|field=0"
msgid "Greetings."
msgstr "안녕하시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=95|field=0"
msgid "Sethrik Fist at your service. Fine coffins made to order."
msgstr "세스릭 피스트가 모시겠소. 주문 제작하는 최고급 관이 있소."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=96|field=0"
msgid ""
"The call of madness it burns…burns! My mind…ahrgg! Wait! A moment of "
"clarity…quickly! State your business! I can hold out for but a moment."
msgstr "광기의 부름이 타오른다…타올라! 내 정신이…아아악! 잠깐! 정신이 맑아졌다…어서! 용건을 말해라! 잠시밖에 버틸 수 없다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=97|field=0"
msgid "Hail, adventurer!"
msgstr "모험가여, 반갑소!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=98|field=0"
msgid "Ahoy, matey!"
msgstr "어이, 선원!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=99|field=0"
msgid ""
"What do you want? My research requires great concentration--a concentration "
"you are breaking with you're intrusion!"
msgstr "무슨 용건이오? 내 연구에는 엄청난 집중력이 필요하오. 그런데 당신이 침입해서 그 집중을 깨뜨리고 있소!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet1.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=9|field=0"
msgid ""
"Welcome aboard!\n"
"May you have smooth, swift seas!"
msgstr ""
"승선을 환영합니다!\n"
"바다가 잔잔하고 항해가 순조롭기를!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=100|field=1"
msgid "What do you want?"
msgstr "무슨 용건이오?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=101|field=1"
msgid "Ah, the new recruits again! What can I do for you?"
msgstr "아, 신입들이 또 왔군! 무엇을 도와줄까?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=102|field=1"
msgid "How are you? What can a simple fisherwoman do for you today?"
msgstr "어떻게 지내세요? 오늘은 평범한 어부 여인이 무엇을 도와드릴까요?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=103|field=1"
msgid ""
"Hello?\n"
"Ah, someone else who seeks a way off this accursed island!\n"
"My name is Simon Templar!\n"
"I found my way into this temple as I was told it was the way out!\n"
"Let's travel together!"
msgstr ""
"여보세요?\n"
"아, 이 저주받은 섬을 빠져나갈 길을 찾는 사람이 또 있군요!\n"
"제 이름은 사이먼 템플러입니다!\n"
"이 신전이 탈출구라는 말을 듣고 들어왔습니다!\n"
"함께 갑시다!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=104|field=1"
msgid "Greetings, do you seek guidance from the Light?"
msgstr "안녕하시오. 빛의 인도를 구하러 왔습니까?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=105|field=1"
msgid ""
"Nooo!\n"
"What…where am I? You rescued me?\n"
"My thanks!!"
msgstr ""
"으아아!\n"
"뭐지…여기가 어디죠? 당신이 저를 구해 주셨습니까?\n"
"감사합니다!!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=106|field=1"
msgid ""
"Welcome!\n"
"I can make many wondrous things from the various ores that are indigenous to Jadame."
msgstr ""
"어서 오세요!\n"
"제이덤에서 나는 여러 광석으로 온갖 놀라운 물건을 만들 수 있습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=107|field=1"
msgid "Halt! These areas are off limits to guests! Guild members only!"
msgstr "멈추시오! 이 구역은 방문객 출입 금지입니다! 길드 회원만 들어갈 수 있습니다!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=108|field=1"
msgid "You may not enter here, puny ones! Stand back or become our prey!"
msgstr "하찮은 것들아, 이곳에는 들어올 수 없다! 물러서지 않으면 우리의 먹잇감이 될 것이다!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=109|field=1"
msgid ""
"Halt! Only members of our knightly brotherhood may pass this point. Others "
"who attempt to pass will face our wrath!"
msgstr "멈추시오! 우리 기사단의 형제들만 이 지점을 통과할 수 있소. 억지로 지나가려는 자는 우리의 분노를 마주할 것이오!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=10|field=1"
msgid "Yes?"
msgstr "네?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=110|field=1"
msgid "Stop! You may not enter the storeroom!"
msgstr "멈추시오! 창고에는 들어갈 수 없습니다!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=111|field=1"
msgid "Hello, again."
msgstr "또 오셨군요."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=112|field=1"
msgid ""
"You are back? Have you need of advice? Or are you finding the task at hand "
"too difficult?"
msgstr "돌아왔군요? 조언이 필요합니까? 아니면 맡은 일이 너무 어렵습니까?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=113|field=1"
msgid "Greetings, and may the Balance always tilt in your favor."
msgstr "안녕하시오. 균형이 언제나 그대에게 유리하게 기울기를."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=114|field=1"
msgid ""
"Halt! Only guild members and their guests can pass this point. Further, any "
"guild members with you must be at least, conscious. You have old Leland with"
" you, but he's in no condition to oversee you."
msgstr ""
"멈추시오! 길드 회원과 그 손님만 이곳을 통과할 수 있소. 게다가 동행한 길드 회원은 적어도 의식이 있어야 하오. 늙은 릴런드가 함께 "
"있기는 하지만, 지금 상태로는 당신들을 감독할 수 없소."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=115|field=1"
msgid "Help me!"
msgstr "도와주세요!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=116|field=1"
msgid "Nice to see you again, how are you doing on the hunt?"
msgstr "다시 만나 반갑습니다. 사냥은 잘되어 갑니까?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=117|field=1"
msgid "Have you collected everything on the list yet?"
msgstr "목록에 있는 물건을 모두 모았습니까?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=118|field=1"
msgid "What would you like to know?"
msgstr "무엇이 알고 싶습니까?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=119|field=1"
msgid "Hello again, how are you doing?"
msgstr "또 오셨군요. 잘 지내고 계십니까?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=11|field=1"
msgid "Have you done as I've asked of you?"
msgstr "내가 부탁한 일을 해냈소?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=120|field=1"
msgid ""
"Still out here?\n"
"Town's back a ways to the south."
msgstr ""
"아직도 여기 계시오?\n"
"마을은 남쪽으로 좀 돌아가야 하오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=121|field=1"
msgid "Ah, you've returned, no doubt to listen to my proposal."
msgstr "아, 돌아오셨군요. 틀림없이 제 제안을 들으러 오셨겠지요."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=122|field=1"
msgid ""
"Did you need something, stranger?\n"
"<whisper> Get away from me, are you trying to get caught on purpose?!"
msgstr ""
"무슨 일이 필요합니까, 낯선 분?\n"
"<whisper> 내게서 떨어져요. 일부러 들키려는 겁니까?!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=123|field=1"
msgid "Hello again… friend."
msgstr "또 오셨군요… 친구."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=124|field=1"
msgid "I don't believe we have anything to talk about."
msgstr "우리가 나눌 이야기는 없는 것 같군요."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=125|field=1"
msgid "Greetings again, friends."
msgstr "다시 만나 반갑습니다, 친구들."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=126|field=1"
msgid ""
"Hello, I'm Carolyn.\n"
"I handle the guild memberships for the Fire and Air Guilds here on the island."
msgstr ""
"안녕하세요, 저는 캐럴린입니다.\n"
"이 섬의 불과 공기 길드 가입 업무를 맡고 있습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=127|field=1"
msgid ""
"I'm Roger and I sell guild memberships for the Body and Spirit Guilds on "
"Emerald Island."
msgstr "나는 로저요. 에메랄드 섬에서 육체와 영혼 길드 회원권을 팔고 있소."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=128|field=1"
msgid "Aye, good to see you again, mates!"
msgstr "그래, 다시 보니 반갑군, 친구들!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=129|field=1"
msgid "Hello again, what can I do for you?"
msgstr "또 오셨군요. 무엇을 도와드릴까요?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=12|field=1"
msgid "What is it now?"
msgstr "이번엔 또 무슨 일이오?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=130|field=1"
msgid "Hi again, did you need something?"
msgstr "또 오셨군요. 무슨 일이 있습니까?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=131|field=1"
msgid ""
"Yes?\n"
"What do you want?"
msgstr ""
"네?\n"
"무슨 용건이오?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=132|field=1"
msgid ""
"Halt!\n"
"You do not have authorization to proceed.\n"
"We request that you refrain from disturbing the students while they work."
msgstr ""
"멈추시오!\n"
"당신에게는 이곳을 통과할 권한이 없습니다.\n"
"학생들이 작업하는 동안 방해하지 말아 주십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=133|field=1"
msgid ""
"Welcome to Emerald Island.\n"
"I will be your guide during your stay here.\n"
"From time to time I will appear to tell you about something you're about to see to help you understand your New World.\n"
"If you tire of my messages (I won't be offended if you do), just click on my portrait to talk to me then click on 'Tour Off' to silence me."
msgstr ""
"에메랄드 섬에 오신 것을 환영합니다.\n"
"머무시는 동안 제가 안내를 맡겠습니다.\n"
"때때로 제가 나타나 곧 보게 될 것들을 설명하여 새로운 세계를 이해하도록 도와드리겠습니다.\n"
"제 안내가 지겨워져도 상심하지 않으니, 제 초상화를 눌러 말을 건 뒤 '안내 끄기'를 선택하면 안내를 중단할 수 있습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=134|field=1"
msgid ""
"The shop you are near is the Blacksmith shop.\n"
"The blacksmith only sells weapons, but this one sells many different kinds of weapons, and some of them have magical properties.\n"
"You can also sell weapons here, but you won't get a good deal until you have a higher merchant skill.\n"
"To enter, just click on the front door."
msgstr ""
"가까이에 있는 상점은 대장간입니다.\n"
"대장장이는 무기만 팔지만, 이곳에서는 여러 종류의 무기를 판매하며 일부는 마법 속성도 지니고 있습니다.\n"
"무기를 이곳에 팔 수도 있지만, 상술 기술이 높아지기 전에는 좋은 값을 받기 어렵습니다.\n"
"들어가려면 정문을 누르기만 하십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=135|field=1"
msgid ""
"The door to the west leads to the local Tavern.\n"
"The tavern is a safe place to sleep at night, and to buy food so you can sleep outdoors.\n"
"You can often meet interesting people in taverns, or catch the local gossip if you're looking for something to do.\n"
"To enter the tavern, just click on the front door."
msgstr ""
"서쪽 문은 현지 선술집으로 이어집니다.\n"
"선술집은 밤에 안전하게 잠을 자고, 야외에서 숙영할 때 필요한 식량을 살 수 있는 곳입니다.\n"
"선술집에서는 흥미로운 사람을 만나거나, 할 일을 찾고 있다면 현지 소문을 들을 수도 있습니다.\n"
"들어가려면 정문을 누르기만 하십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=136|field=1"
msgid ""
"This shop is the armor shop.\n"
"The armorer only sells helms, shields, and armor, but will buy nearly anything you can wear, if you don't want to make a separate stop at the magic shop.\n"
"Remember that a character needs skill in leather, chain or plate armor to be able to wear that kind of armor, or shield skill to use a shield."
msgstr ""
"이곳은 갑옷 상점입니다.\n"
"갑옷 상인은 투구, 방패, 갑옷만 팔지만, 마법 상점에 따로 들르고 싶지 않다면 착용 가능한 물건 대부분을 사 줍니다.\n"
"가죽, 사슬, 판금 갑옷을 착용하려면 해당 갑옷 기술이 필요하며, 방패를 사용하려면 방패 기술이 필요하다는 점을 기억하십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=137|field=1"
msgid ""
"This building is Carolyn Weather's private residence.\n"
"Carolyn makes a living by brokering magic guild memberships to aspiring wizards and other spell casters.\n"
"She will be happy to sell membership in the local Air and Fire guilds for a small fee.\n"
"You don't have to buy membership in a guild if you don't want to, but remember that you must be a guild member to buy spells and learn skills at a magic guild."
msgstr ""
"이 건물은 캐럴린 웨더스의 개인 주택입니다.\n"
"캐럴린은 마법사가 되려는 이들과 주문 시전자들에게 마법 길드 회원권을 중개하며 생계를 꾸립니다.\n"
"적은 비용으로 현지 공기와 불 길드의 회원권을 기꺼이 판매할 것입니다.\n"
"원하지 않는다면 길드에 가입할 필요는 없지만, 마법 길드에서 주문을 사고 기술을 배우려면 반드시 길드 회원이어야 합니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=138|field=1"
msgid ""
"This building is another private residence.\n"
"Roger, the owner of the house, sells membership in the Spirit and Body magic guilds here.\n"
"The price is low, but you must pay if you intend to take advantage of the guild services, including spell purchases and skill teaching.\n"
"By the way, if you're getting tired of my messages, you can stop them by clicking on my portrait to talk to me then clicking on the 'Tour Off' topic."
msgstr ""
"이 건물도 개인 주택입니다.\n"
"집주인 로저는 이곳에서 영혼과 육체 마법 길드 회원권을 판매합니다.\n"
"가격은 저렴하지만, 주문 구매와 기술 교육을 포함한 길드 서비스를 이용하려면 비용을 내야 합니다.\n"
"그런데 제 안내가 지겨워졌다면, 제 초상화를 눌러 말을 건 뒤 '안내 끄기' 항목을 선택하여 중단할 수 있습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=139|field=1"
msgid ""
"This door leads to the training center of Emerald Island.\n"
"If you have enough experience points (gained from killing monsters and completing quests) you can come here to increase your characters' levels.\n"
"When you gain a level, you'll also get some skill points to spend on improving your skills.\n"
"You can only spend skill points on skills that your character knows--to learn new skills, try visiting the businesses around town and see if they offer lessons in anything you're interested in."
msgstr ""
"이 문은 에메랄드 섬의 훈련소로 이어집니다.\n"
"몬스터를 처치하고 퀘스트를 완료해 충분한 경험치를 얻었다면 이곳에서 캐릭터의 레벨을 올릴 수 있습니다.\n"
"레벨이 오르면 기술 향상에 쓸 수 있는 기술 점수도 받습니다.\n"
"기술 점수는 캐릭터가 아는 기술에만 쓸 수 있습니다. 새 기술을 배우려면 마을의 여러 시설을 찾아가 관심 있는 분야를 가르치는지 확인하십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=13|field=1"
msgid ""
"Halt! None may pass into the inner chambers unless accompanied by a guild "
"member."
msgstr "멈추시오! 길드 회원과 동행하지 않으면 안쪽 방으로 들어갈 수 없소."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=140|field=1"
msgid ""
"This tent is where the town's healer is located.\n"
"You can pay for any healing your characters may need here--even raise them from the dead.\n"
"You can tell if your characters are injured by looking at the green bar to the left of their portrait--the lower it is, the more injured they are.\n"
"Note that it isn't necessary to get healed at the healer--any ordinary damage and all spell points will be healed merely for resting overnight."
msgstr ""
"이 천막에는 마을의 치료사가 있습니다.\n"
"이곳에서 비용을 내고 캐릭터의 부상을 치료할 수 있으며, 죽은 자를 되살릴 수도 있습니다.\n"
"캐릭터 초상화 왼쪽의 녹색 막대를 보면 부상 정도를 알 수 있습니다. 막대가 낮을수록 더 크게 다친 상태입니다.\n"
"반드시 치료사에게 치료받을 필요는 없습니다. 평범한 피해와 모든 주문 점수는 하룻밤 쉬기만 해도 회복됩니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=141|field=1"
msgid ""
"This well has a magical benefit--it bestows a powerful fire resistance spell on the drinker.\n"
"To have a character drink from the well, just select the character you want to have drink, then click on the well. There are many wells like this one in the game--you can look in your autonotes book under the \"\"Fountains\"\" tab for a list of all wells you've tried drinking from during the course of the game.The effects of this particular well last until you rest, but remember that different wells may have completely different effects."
msgstr ""
"이 우물에는 마법의 효능이 있어, 마신 사람에게 강력한 화염 저항 주문을 부여합니다.\n"
"캐릭터에게 우물물을 마시게 하려면 원하는 캐릭터를 선택한 뒤 우물을 누르십시오. 게임에는 이와 같은 우물이 많습니다. 자동 기록책의 분수 탭에서 게임 중 마셔 본 모든 우물의 목록을 확인할 수 있습니다.이 우물의 효과는 휴식할 때까지 지속되지만, 다른 우물은 전혀 다른 효과를 낼 수 있다는 점을 기억하십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=142|field=1"
msgid ""
"You are standing in front of the house in which Lord Markham has set up his temporary headquarters on Emerald Island. Lord Markham is the benefactor behind the scavenger hunt you are no doubt eager to win.\n"
"The contest judge is also inside, and he is the one you need to talk to in order to turn in hunt items you have found."
msgstr ""
"지금 서 있는 곳은 마크햄 경이 에메랄드 섬의 임시 본부로 삼은 집 앞입니다. 마크햄 경은 여러분이 틀림없이 우승하고 싶어 할 보물찾기 대회의 후원자입니다.\n"
"대회 심판도 안에 있으며, 찾아낸 대회 물품을 제출하려면 그와 이야기해야 합니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=143|field=1"
msgid ""
"The Spirit Guild can be found through the door to the east.\n"
"You must have a membership to use the services of the Guild, which include spell purchase and skill teaching.\n"
"To become a Spirit Guild member, you must first visit Roger in his house a little way southeast of here and purchase a membership.\n"
"Also remember, a character who wishes to learn a Spirit spell must have the Spirit magic skill!"
msgstr ""
"동쪽 문 너머에 영혼 길드가 있습니다.\n"
"주문 구매와 기술 교육을 포함한 길드 서비스를 이용하려면 회원권이 필요합니다.\n"
"영혼 길드에 가입하려면 먼저 여기서 남동쪽으로 조금 떨어진 집에 있는 로저를 찾아가 회원권을 구입해야 합니다.\n"
"또한 영혼 주문을 배우려는 캐릭터는 영혼 마법 기술을 익혀야 한다는 점을 기억하십시오!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=144|field=1"
msgid ""
"The Air Guild is on the other side of this door.\n"
"You must have a membership to use the services of the Guild, which include spell purchase and skill teaching.\n"
"To become an Air Guild member, you must first visit Carolyn in her house a little way southeast of here and purchase a membership.\n"
"Also remember, a character who wishes to learn an Air spell must have the Air magic skill!"
msgstr ""
"이 문 반대편에는 공기 길드가 있습니다.\n"
"주문 구매와 기술 교육을 포함한 길드 서비스를 이용하려면 회원권이 필요합니다.\n"
"공기 길드에 가입하려면 먼저 여기서 남동쪽으로 조금 떨어진 집에 있는 캐럴린을 찾아가 회원권을 구입해야 합니다.\n"
"또한 공기 주문을 배우려는 캐릭터는 공기 마법 기술을 익혀야 한다는 점을 기억하십시오!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=145|field=1"
msgid ""
"This building is where you will find the town Alchemist.\n"
"The alchemist sells potions and potions ingredients, and is also a place where your characters may learn the Alchemy skill.\n"
"You must have alchemy skill to make even the most basic of potions, and you can do that by opening your character's inventory, picking up a potion ingredient, and right clicking it on an empty potion bottle.\n"
"You can use a similar procedure to mix two potions together.\n"
"Alchemists know that certain mixtures produce certain results, but it's a trade secret.\n"
"You'll have to figure it out for yourself.\n"
"Be warned that some mixtures are explosive!"
msgstr ""
"이 건물에는 마을의 연금술사가 있습니다.\n"
"연금술사는 물약과 물약 재료를 판매하며, 캐릭터가 연금술 기술을 배울 수도 있습니다.\n"
"가장 기본적인 물약을 만들 때도 연금술 기술이 필요합니다. 캐릭터의 소지품을 열고 물약 재료를 집어 빈 물약병 위에서 오른쪽 클릭하면 됩니다.\n"
"비슷한 방법으로 두 물약을 섞을 수도 있습니다.\n"
"연금술사들은 어떤 조합이 어떤 결과를 내는지 알고 있지만, 그것은 영업 비밀입니다.\n"
"직접 알아내야 합니다.\n"
"일부 혼합물은 폭발하니 주의하십시오!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=146|field=1"
msgid ""
"This door leads to the Body Guild.\n"
"You must have a membership to use the services of the Guild, which include spell purchase and skill teaching.\n"
"To become a Body Guild member, you must first visit Roger in his house a little way southeast of here and purchase a membership.\n"
"Also remember, a character who wishes to learn a Body spell must have the Body magic skill!"
msgstr ""
"이 문은 육체 길드로 이어집니다.\n"
"주문 구매와 기술 교육을 포함한 길드 서비스를 이용하려면 회원권이 필요합니다.\n"
"육체 길드에 가입하려면 먼저 여기서 남동쪽으로 조금 떨어진 집에 있는 로저를 찾아가 회원권을 구입해야 합니다.\n"
"또한 육체 주문을 배우려는 캐릭터는 육체 마법 기술을 익혀야 한다는 점을 기억하십시오!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=147|field=1"
msgid ""
"You have found the Magic shop.\n"
"The magic shop is every true adventurer's favorite store.\n"
"Here you can buy and sell all magic items except for magic weapons and armor."
msgstr ""
"마법 상점을 찾으셨습니다.\n"
"마법 상점은 진정한 모험가라면 누구나 좋아하는 곳입니다.\n"
"이곳에서는 마법 무기와 갑옷을 제외한 모든 마법 아이템을 사고팔 수 있습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=148|field=1"
msgid ""
"This building is where you may find the Fire Guild.\n"
"You must have a membership to use the services of the Guild, which include spell purchase and skill teaching.\n"
"To become a Fire Guild member, you must first visit Carolyn in her house a little way southeast of here and purchase a membership.\n"
"Also remember, a character who wishes to learn a Fire spell must have the Fire magic skill!"
msgstr ""
"이 건물에는 불 길드가 있습니다.\n"
"주문 구매와 기술 교육을 포함한 길드 서비스를 이용하려면 회원권이 필요합니다.\n"
"불 길드에 가입하려면 먼저 여기서 남동쪽으로 조금 떨어진 집에 있는 캐럴린을 찾아가 회원권을 구입해야 합니다.\n"
"또한 불 주문을 배우려는 캐릭터는 불 마법 기술을 익혀야 한다는 점을 기억하십시오!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=149|field=1"
msgid ""
"Be careful!\n"
"You are about to enter an area of the island that is infested with Dragonflies.\n"
"They are quite dangerous!\n"
"Lord Markham is NOT responsible if you are injured or even killed venturing into this part of the island.\n"
"You have been warned!"
msgstr ""
"조심하십시오!\n"
"이제 잠자리 떼가 들끓는 섬 지역으로 들어가려 하고 있습니다.\n"
"놈들은 상당히 위험합니다!\n"
"마크햄 경은 이곳에 들어갔다가 다치거나 목숨을 잃더라도 책임지지 않습니다.\n"
"분명히 경고했습니다!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=14|field=1"
msgid "Welcome back to the Guildhouse of the Merchants of Alvar."
msgstr "알바르 상인회관에 다시 오신 것을 환영합니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=150|field=1"
msgid ""
"Um…It isn't wise to enter this cave.\n"
"A terrible dragon lives within, and few who enter leave alive.\n"
"If you really want to enter, just click on the back wall of the cave…"
msgstr ""
"음…이 동굴에는 들어가지 않는 편이 좋습니다.\n"
"안에는 무시무시한 드래곤이 살며, 들어간 사람 중 살아서 나온 이는 거의 없습니다.\n"
"정말 들어가고 싶다면 동굴 뒤쪽 벽을 누르십시오…"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=151|field=1"
msgid ""
"This is the entrance to the old Temple of the Moon.\n"
"It is infested with small vermin that can give a nasty bite, but it's not too dangerous.\n"
"It's possible there are items for the scavenger hunt within, so you should consider searching here at some point.\n"
"To enter, just click on the back wall of this cave."
msgstr ""
"이곳은 오래된 달의 신전 입구입니다.\n"
"안에는 심하게 물어뜯는 작은 해충들이 들끓지만, 그리 위험한 곳은 아닙니다.\n"
"보물찾기 대회 물품이 있을 수도 있으니 언젠가는 수색해 보는 편이 좋습니다.\n"
"들어가려면 이 동굴 뒤쪽 벽을 누르기만 하십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=152|field=1"
msgid ""
"Welcome back.\n"
"Is your visit for business, or conversation?\n"
"I’m happy to supply either."
msgstr ""
"다시 오셨군요.\n"
"사업 때문에 오셨습니까, 아니면 대화를 나누러 오셨습니까?\n"
"어느 쪽이든 기꺼이 응하겠습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=153|field=1"
msgid ""
"[spits] Hello, Thief killer.\n"
"What do you want?"
msgstr ""
"[침을 뱉으며] 안녕하신가, 도둑 살해자.\n"
"무슨 용건이지?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=154|field=1"
msgid "Greetings Rogues, how may I be of service?"
msgstr "안녕하시오, 로그들이여. 무엇을 도와드릴까요?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=155|field=1"
msgid ""
"Ah, welcome my friends.\n"
"How are you doing today?\n"
"You really should try my tea this time."
msgstr ""
"아, 어서 오십시오, 친구들.\n"
"오늘은 어떠십니까?\n"
"이번에는 정말 제 차를 맛보셔야 합니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=156|field=1"
msgid ""
"Ah, welcome my friends.\n"
"I hope you are doing well.\n"
"How about a spot of tea today?"
msgstr ""
"아, 어서 오십시오, 친구들.\n"
"잘 지내고 계시길 바랍니다.\n"
"오늘은 차 한잔 어떻습니까?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=157|field=1"
msgid ""
"Hello again, fellow Assassins.\n"
"My tea and company are always yours."
msgstr ""
"또 오셨군요, 암살자 동료들이여.\n"
"제 차와 말벗은 언제든 여러분을 위해 준비되어 있습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=158|field=1"
msgid ""
"Well met, my friends.\n"
"How goes the struggle against the forces of evil?"
msgstr ""
"잘 오셨습니다, 친구들.\n"
"악의 세력과 벌이는 싸움은 어떻게 되어 갑니까?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=159|field=1"
msgid ""
"Why do we dally?\n"
"Even now that monster could be laying waste to the countryside!\n"
"Tally Ho!"
msgstr ""
"왜 꾸물거리는 거요?\n"
"바로 지금도 그 괴물이 온 나라를 쑥대밭으로 만들고 있을지 모르오!\n"
"자, 출발합시다!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=15|field=1"
msgid "Good day."
msgstr "좋은 하루 보내시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=160|field=1"
msgid ""
"Why do we delay rescuing Alice?\n"
"Who knows what plans the fiend has for this innocent girl?\n"
"Let us replace talk with action and rescue the poor girl at once!"
msgstr ""
"왜 앨리스를 구하러 가는 일을 미루는 거요?\n"
"그 악당이 이 순진한 소녀에게 무슨 짓을 꾸미는지 누가 알겠소?\n"
"말은 그만하고 당장 불쌍한 소녀를 구하러 갑시다!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=161|field=1"
msgid ""
"Salutations Heroes!\n"
"I am certain thou hast much to accomplish before we dally about."
msgstr ""
"안녕하시오, 영웅들이여!\n"
"그대들은 한가로이 지체하기 전에 해야 할 일이 많을 것이오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=162|field=1"
msgid "I just want to go home."
msgstr "그저 집에 가고 싶어요."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=163|field=1"
msgid "Now what do you want?"
msgstr "이번엔 또 뭘 원하는 거요?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=164|field=1"
msgid ""
"A pleasure to see you again.\n"
"How may I assist you?"
msgstr ""
"다시 뵙게 되어 기쁩니다.\n"
"무엇을 도와드릴까요?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=165|field=1"
msgid ""
"Villains!\n"
"Welcome!\n"
"Too rarely do my villainous friends pay me visits."
msgstr ""
"악당들이여!\n"
"어서 오시오!\n"
"내 악당 친구들은 너무 드물게 찾아오는군."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=166|field=1"
msgid "Hello again, do you need anything?"
msgstr "또 오셨군요. 필요한 것이 있습니까?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=167|field=1"
msgid ""
"Greetings again, Masters.\n"
"How can Bartholomew aid you?"
msgstr ""
"다시 만나 뵙게 되어 반갑습니다, 달인들이여.\n"
"바솔로뮤가 어떻게 도와드릴까요?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=168|field=1"
msgid ""
"Hello, my pupils.\n"
"I see you have found the proper tomb."
msgstr ""
"안녕하구나, 제자들아.\n"
"제대로 된 무덤을 찾아냈군."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=169|field=1"
msgid ""
"Hello again.\n"
"Tell me what it is you desire."
msgstr ""
"또 오셨군요.\n"
"원하는 것이 무엇인지 말해 보십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=16|field=1"
msgid "You are back. How goes it with you?"
msgstr "돌아왔군요. 그동안 잘 지냈습니까?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=170|field=1"
msgid ""
"Now that you've achieved the exaulted status of Ninja, I have nothing further to give you.\n"
"I hope my teachings take you far."
msgstr ""
"이제 닌자라는 숭고한 지위에 올랐으니, 더는 내가 줄 것이 없소.\n"
"내 가르침이 그대를 멀리 이끌어 주길 바라오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=171|field=1"
msgid ""
"We meet again.\n"
"Need something?"
msgstr ""
"또 만났군요.\n"
"필요한 것이 있습니까?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=172|field=1"
msgid ""
"Welcome my friends!\n"
"That's a fine weapon you have there, but don't think for a moment you'll best me in this year's Tourney--I'm still the Master!"
msgstr ""
"어서 오시오, 친구들!\n"
"훌륭한 무기를 지녔지만, 올해 대회에서 나를 이길 수 있다고는 잠시도 생각하지 마시오. 여전히 내가 달인이니까!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=173|field=1"
msgid "You have a reason... [Snick wheezes] for troubling me, I hope?"
msgstr "나를 귀찮게 하는 데에는… [스닉이 쌕쌕거린다] 이유가 있겠지?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=174|field=1"
msgid ""
"Students…[Mr. Snick rasps the word, then smiles] no longer.\n"
"I am proud to have helped you on your way.\n"
"Use your new weapon…[wheeze] wisely."
msgstr ""
"학생들…[스닉 씨가 쉰 목소리로 그 말을 내뱉고 미소 짓는다] 이제는 아니군.\n"
"그대들이 나아가는 길에 도움을 주었다니 자랑스럽소.\n"
"새 무기를…[쌕쌕거림] 현명하게 사용하시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=175|field=1"
msgid ""
"Hail, and well met!\n"
"[Leda grins and shakes her head] I love saying that!\n"
"So.\n"
"What can I do for you today?"
msgstr ""
"만세, 잘 만났소!\n"
"[레다가 씩 웃으며 고개를 젓는다] 이 말은 언제 해도 좋다니까!\n"
"그래.\n"
"오늘은 무엇을 도와줄까?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=176|field=1"
msgid ""
"Hail, champions!\n"
"Your courage and skill has all the tongues in the Kingdom wagging!\n"
"I am very proud of you!"
msgstr ""
"만세, 챔피언들이여!\n"
"그대들의 용기와 솜씨가 왕국의 모든 사람 입에 오르내리고 있소!\n"
"정말 자랑스럽소!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=177|field=1"
msgid "Back for more teaching, kid?"
msgstr "또 가르침을 받으러 왔나, 꼬마?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=178|field=1"
msgid ""
"[Frederick rises hastily to his feet] None shall pass! [he blinks and rubs his eyes] Oh.\n"
"It's you.\n"
"Sorry, I thought you were someone else.\n"
"How goes the villainy?"
msgstr ""
"[프레더릭이 황급히 자리에서 일어난다] 아무도 지나갈 수 없다! [그가 눈을 깜박이고 비빈다] 아.\n"
"자네들이었군.\n"
"미안하네, 다른 사람인 줄 알았어.\n"
"악행은 잘되어 가나?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=179|field=1"
msgid ""
"The Lords of Harmondale return!\n"
"I am honored.\n"
"What is your pleasure, my lords?"
msgstr ""
"하몬데일의 영주들이 돌아오셨군요!\n"
"영광입니다.\n"
"무엇을 원하십니까, 영주님들?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=17|field=1"
msgid "Leave me be. I morn the death of Vilebite, my son."
msgstr "날 내버려 두시오. 아들 바일바이트의 죽음을 애도하고 있소."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=180|field=1"
msgid ""
"Your good works have served the forest well.\n"
"And, I can see, the experience has served you well in turn.\n"
"May you continue to reap the rewards of your good deeds, my friends!"
msgstr ""
"여러분의 선행은 숲에 큰 도움이 되었습니다.\n"
"그리고 보아하니, 그 경험은 여러분에게도 도움이 되었군요.\n"
"앞으로도 선행의 보답을 거두시기를 바랍니다, 친구들!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=181|field=1"
msgid ""
"Time!\n"
"Everyone wastin' my time! [Ebednezer mutters something incoherent under his breath for awhile] You're still here?"
msgstr ""
"시간!\n"
"모두 내 시간을 낭비하고 있어! [에베드니저가 한동안 알아들을 수 없는 말을 중얼거린다] 아직도 거기 있나?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=182|field=1"
msgid ""
"Bounty Hunters.\n"
"[Ebednezer smiles slowly and evilly]\n"
"Now THERE'S a job!\n"
"Yes sir.\n"
"Get things done righteo quick, I'll say. Heh."
msgstr ""
"현상금 사냥꾼들이라.\n"
"[에베드니저가 천천히 사악하게 미소 짓는다]\n"
"그거야말로 제대로 된 직업이지!\n"
"그래, 그렇고말고.\n"
"일을 아주 빠릿빠릿하게 처리하니까. 흐흐."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=183|field=1"
msgid ""
"Mortals!\n"
"You have found a way in, but can you remember the way out?\n"
"[the king laughs] Twisty the way, and treacherous the path!\n"
"Stay, instead, and feast with us!\n"
"The centuries pass like lazy Sunday afternoons!"
msgstr ""
"필멸자들이여!\n"
"들어오는 길은 찾았지만, 나가는 길도 기억할 수 있겠느냐?\n"
"[왕이 웃는다] 길은 뒤틀리고, 통로는 위험하지!\n"
"차라리 머물러 우리와 잔치를 벌여라!\n"
"수백 년도 나른한 일요일 오후처럼 흘러갈 것이다!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=184|field=1"
msgid ""
"Are you the same Walkers I just talked to?\n"
"You all look alike to me.\n"
"But the talking is good just same.\n"
"Do you have time?\n"
"Let.\n"
"Me.\n"
"Name.\n"
"My.\n"
"Ancestors.\n"
"[The tree sighs happily, and begins]\n"
"Leaf-point.\n"
"Who.\n"
"Spawned. Spotted Bark.\n"
"Who.\n"
"Spawned.\n"
"Three Branches.\n"
"Who spawned...[Blah, blah blah]"
msgstr ""
"방금 이야기한 걷는 자들과 같은 자들인가?\n"
"너희는 모두 똑같이 생겼구나.\n"
"하지만 이야기는 그래도 좋다.\n"
"시간이 있느냐?\n"
"내.\n"
"조상들의.\n"
"이름을.\n"
"들려.\n"
"주마.\n"
"[나무가 행복하게 한숨 쉬고 이야기를 시작한다]\n"
"뾰족잎.\n"
"그가.\n"
"점박이껍질을 낳았고.\n"
"그가.\n"
"세갈래가지를.\n"
"낳았으며.\n"
"그가 낳은 것은…[어쩌고저쩌고]"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=185|field=1"
msgid ""
"Are you the same Walkers I just talked to?\n"
"You all look alike to me.\n"
"But the talking is good just same.\n"
"Do you have time?\n"
"Let.\n"
"Me.\n"
"Name.\n"
"My.\n"
"Ancestors.\n"
"[The tree sighs happily, and begins]\n"
"Leaf-point.\n"
"Who.\n"
"Spawned. Spotted Bark.\n"
"Who.\n"
"Spawned.\n"
"Three Branches.\n"
"Who spawned...[Blah, blah blah]"
msgstr ""
"방금 이야기한 걷는 자들과 같은 자들인가?\n"
"너희는 모두 똑같이 생겼구나.\n"
"하지만 이야기는 그래도 좋다.\n"
"시간이 있느냐?\n"
"내.\n"
"조상들의.\n"
"이름을.\n"
"들려.\n"
"주마.\n"
"[나무가 행복하게 한숨 쉬고 이야기를 시작한다]\n"
"뾰족잎.\n"
"그가.\n"
"점박이껍질을 낳았고.\n"
"그가.\n"
"세갈래가지를.\n"
"낳았으며.\n"
"그가 낳은 것은…[어쩌고저쩌고]"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=186|field=1"
msgid ""
"Ohhhhh…It's the Walkers from the South.\n"
"I remember you!\n"
"You returned the Heart.\n"
"The trees are very happy, and promise not to kill any more walkers.\n"
"Come and talk to me any time."
msgstr ""
"오오오…남쪽에서 온 걷는 자들이구나.\n"
"너희를 기억한다!\n"
"심장을 돌려주었지.\n"
"나무들이 아주 기뻐하며, 앞으로는 걷는 자를 죽이지 않겠다고 약속했다.\n"
"언제든 와서 이야기하거라."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=187|field=1"
msgid ""
"[High Priest Devine smiles and inclines her head] Sunlight Reveal, my lords.\n"
"How may I help you?"
msgstr ""
"[대사제 디바인이 미소 지으며 고개를 숙인다] 태양빛이 드러내기를, 영주님들.\n"
"무엇을 도와드릴까요?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=188|field=1"
msgid ""
"Sunlight Reveal, my fellow Priests.\n"
"I am always delighted to see you!"
msgstr ""
"태양빛이 드러내기를, 사제 동료들이여.\n"
"여러분을 보는 것은 언제나 기쁩니다!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=189|field=1"
msgid ""
"[High Priest Falk bows and clasps his hands together] Shadow Conceal, Lords.\n"
"How may I be of service?"
msgstr ""
"[대사제 포크가 절하며 두 손을 모은다] 그림자가 감추기를, 영주님들.\n"
"무엇을 도와드릴까요?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=18|field=1"
msgid "Come in…you are always welcome here."
msgstr "들어오세요…당신은 언제든 환영입니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=190|field=1"
msgid ""
"Shadow Conceal, Brethren.\n"
"My time is always yours."
msgstr ""
"그림자가 감추기를, 형제들이여.\n"
"제 시간은 언제든 여러분의 것입니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=191|field=1"
msgid ""
"[Thomas Grey offers a peculiar half smile and folds his arms] I am still at "
"your service, my lords!"
msgstr "[토머스 그레이가 묘한 반웃음을 지으며 팔짱을 낀다] 여전히 영주님들을 섬기고 있습니다!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=192|field=1"
msgid "I am honored to be graced with your presence, my lords."
msgstr "영주님들께서 찾아 주시니 영광입니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=193|field=1"
msgid ""
"Why do you insist on bothering me?\n"
"[The Lich's eyes flare a hellish red for a moment] "
msgstr ""
"왜 자꾸 나를 귀찮게 하는 거냐?\n"
"[리치의 눈이 잠시 지옥의 붉은빛으로 번뜩인다] "

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=194|field=1"
msgid ""
"Why do you insist on bothering me?\n"
"[The Lich's eyes flare a hellish red for a moment] "
msgstr ""
"왜 자꾸 나를 귀찮게 하는 거냐?\n"
"[리치의 눈이 잠시 지옥의 붉은빛으로 번뜩인다] "

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=195|field=1"
msgid ""
"Fortune be your friend, lords.\n"
"Do you seek my advice today?"
msgstr ""
"행운이 함께하기를, 영주님들.\n"
"오늘은 제 조언을 구하십니까?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=196|field=1"
msgid ""
"Fortune be your friend, lords.\n"
"Do you seek my advice today?"
msgstr ""
"행운이 함께하기를, 영주님들.\n"
"오늘은 제 조언을 구하십니까?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=197|field=1"
msgid ""
"A delight and a pleasure, lords.\n"
"Have you come for business or conversation?"
msgstr ""
"기쁘고 즐거운 일이군요, 영주님들.\n"
"사업 때문에 오셨습니까, 아니면 대화를 나누러 오셨습니까?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=198|field=1"
msgid ""
"A delight and a pleasure, lords.\n"
"Have you come for business or conversation?"
msgstr ""
"기쁘고 즐거운 일이군요, 영주님들.\n"
"사업 때문에 오셨습니까, 아니면 대화를 나누러 오셨습니까?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=199|field=1"
msgid "I am yours to command, master."
msgstr "명령만 내리십시오, 주인님."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=19|field=1"
msgid "You disturb me again? This had best be important."
msgstr "또 나를 방해하는 겁니까? 아주 중요한 일이길 바라오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=1|field=1"
msgid ""
"Have you spoken with Dadeross?\n"
"What are we to do now?"
msgstr ""
"다데로스와 이야기해 보셨습니까?\n"
"이제 우리는 어떻게 해야 합니까?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=200|field=1"
msgid ""
"There's still goblins in the castle, my lords.\n"
"I hope you don't mind if I wait here while you convince them to leave.\n"
"One way or the other."
msgstr ""
"성 안에는 아직도 고블린들이 있습니다, 영주님들.\n"
"그들을 떠나도록 설득하시는 동안 제가 여기서 기다려도 괜찮으시겠지요.\n"
"어떤 방식으로든 말입니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=201|field=1"
msgid "You rang, my lords?"
msgstr "부르셨습니까, 영주님들?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=202|field=1"
msgid ""
"Back again?\n"
"Don't have much time for [heh!] Contestants.\n"
"State your case and move on.\n"
"My court is busy."
msgstr ""
"또 오셨소?\n"
"[흥!] 대회 참가자들과 낭비할 시간은 별로 없소.\n"
"용건만 말하고 물러가시오.\n"
"내 궁정은 바쁘오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=203|field=1"
msgid ""
"Welcome, Harmondale!\n"
"Stone city is at your disposal."
msgstr ""
"어서 오시오, 하몬데일!\n"
"스톤 시티는 그대들의 뜻에 따르겠소."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=204|field=1"
msgid ""
"Thanks for rescuing me.\n"
"I am at your service."
msgstr ""
"구해 주셔서 감사합니다.\n"
"당신을 섬기겠습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=205|field=1"
msgid ""
"Thanks for rescuing me.\n"
"I owe you my life."
msgstr ""
"구해 주셔서 감사합니다.\n"
"당신에게 목숨을 빚졌습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=206|field=1"
msgid ""
"Yes, Lords?\n"
"What would you like to discuss?"
msgstr ""
"네, 영주님들?\n"
"무엇을 논의하고 싶으십니까?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=207|field=1"
msgid "Avlee is listening, my Lords."
msgstr "아블리가 귀 기울이고 있습니다, 영주님들."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=208|field=1"
msgid ""
"I am very busy.\n"
"This had better not be a social visit."
msgstr ""
"나는 매우 바쁘오.\n"
"사교 방문이 아니길 바라오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=209|field=1"
msgid ""
"I am very busy.\n"
"This had better not be a social visit."
msgstr ""
"나는 매우 바쁘오.\n"
"사교 방문이 아니길 바라오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=20|field=1"
msgid "What do you want?"
msgstr "무슨 용건이오?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=210|field=1"
msgid ""
"Harmondale again, hmmm?\n"
"Make it quick--my patience is already wearing thin."
msgstr ""
"하몬데일이 또 왔군, 흠?\n"
"서두르시오. 벌써 인내심이 바닥나고 있으니."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=211|field=1"
msgid ""
"Harmondale again, hmmm?\n"
"Make it quick--my patience is already wearing thin."
msgstr ""
"하몬데일이 또 왔군, 흠?\n"
"서두르시오. 벌써 인내심이 바닥나고 있으니."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=212|field=1"
msgid ""
"My lords, I have an urgent message from the Erathian Ambassador for you.\n"
"I am told it has details of an important event that is happening RIGHT NOW, and that you should read it immediately.\n"
"Here is the letter."
msgstr ""
"영주님들, 에라시아 대사가 보낸 긴급 서신을 가져왔습니다.\n"
"바로 지금 벌어지고 있는 중대한 사건의 자세한 내용이 담겼으니 즉시 읽으셔야 한다고 합니다.\n"
"여기 편지입니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=213|field=1"
msgid ""
"Welcome back, my lords.\n"
"Erathia and Avlee are at each other's throats again.\n"
"Feeling the heat yet?"
msgstr ""
"돌아오셨군요, 영주님들.\n"
"에라시아와 아블리가 또 서로 목을 물어뜯고 있습니다.\n"
"벌써 열기가 느껴지십니까?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=214|field=1"
msgid ""
"My lords, it is always a pleasure to see you.\n"
"I must once again urge you to consider our uh, I mean Judge Fairweather for the important post of Arbiter.\n"
"Take your time making the decision, but do be quick about it, eh?Remember, all you have to do is visit Judge Fairweather in Bracada and choose him for the job; then take him to the Arbiter's house here in Harmondale.\n"
"I am sure he will put a swift end to this nasty war."
msgstr ""
"영주님들을 뵙는 것은 언제나 기쁩니다.\n"
"다시 한번 우리, 아니 페어웨더 판사를 중요한 중재자 자리에 고려해 주시길 부탁드립니다.\n"
"천천히 결정하시되, 서둘러 주십시오. 알겠지요?페어웨더 판사는 브라카다에 있습니다. 그를 찾아가 그 자리에 선택한다고 말한 뒤, 하몬데일의 중재자 관저로 데려오기만 하면 됩니다.\n"
"그라면 이 끔찍한 전쟁을 신속히 끝낼 수 있을 것입니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=215|field=1"
msgid ""
"My lords.\n"
"[Ambassador Scale wrings his hands and smiles in a most unsettling fashion]\n"
"You are still trying to make a decision, I see.\n"
"You must understand your choice is VERY important to us.\n"
"Perhaps you need directions?\n"
"Judge Sleen is in Deyja, which is the country northwest of Erathia.\n"
"You must do is visit him and tell him you're choosing him for the job; then take him to the Arbiter's house here in Harmondale.\n"
"He will take care of everything from there."
msgstr ""
"영주님들.\n"
"[스케일 대사가 손을 비비며 몹시 불안한 미소를 짓는다]\n"
"아직도 결정을 내리려 애쓰고 계시는군요.\n"
"그 선택이 우리에게 매우 중요하다는 점을 이해하셔야 합니다.\n"
"혹시 길 안내가 필요하십니까?\n"
"슬린 판사는 에라시아 북서쪽에 있는 데이자에 있습니다.\n"
"그를 찾아가 그 자리에 선택한다고 말한 뒤, 하몬데일의 중재자 관저로 데려오기만 하면 됩니다.\n"
"그 뒤는 그가 모두 처리할 것입니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=216|field=1"
msgid ""
"Still considering your choice, I see.\n"
"Let me remind you of what's at stake:\n"
"[The Ambassador holds up a finger]The length of the war--The longer it lasts, the better off we'll all be.\n"
"Erathia and Avlee will be weaker, and unable to interfere in our affairs.You will be allying with us.\n"
"There are things we can teach you...Most importantly, YOU WILL CHOOSE THE PATH OF DARKNESS.\n"
"This choice cannot be withdrawn."
msgstr ""
"아직도 선택을 고민하고 계시는군요.\n"
"무엇이 걸려 있는지 상기시켜 드리겠습니다.\n"
"[대사가 손가락 하나를 세운다]전쟁의 기간입니다. 전쟁이 오래갈수록 우리 모두에게 유리합니다.\n"
"에라시아와 아블리는 약해져 우리 일에 간섭하지 못할 것입니다.당신들은 우리와 동맹을 맺게 됩니다.\n"
"우리가 가르쳐 줄 수 있는 것들이 있습니다…무엇보다도, 당신들은 어둠의 길을 선택하게 됩니다.\n"
"이 선택은 되돌릴 수 없습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=217|field=1"
msgid ""
"We need to go to Judge Grey's old house in Harmondale.\n"
"Only then can I start my new job and begin to \"\"sort out this mess\"\".\n"
"[Heh!]"
msgstr ""
"하몬데일에 있는 그레이 판사의 옛집으로 가야 합니다.\n"
"그래야만 새 직무를 시작하고 이 혼란을 정리할 수 있습니다.\n"
"[흐흐!]"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=218|field=1"
msgid ""
"I am happy to see you again, my lords.\n"
"Deyja is very pleased with the way things have turned out.\n"
"Is there anything I can do for you?"
msgstr ""
"다시 뵙게 되어 기쁩니다, 영주님들.\n"
"데이자는 일이 이렇게 풀린 것을 매우 기뻐합니다.\n"
"무엇을 도와드릴까요?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=219|field=1"
msgid ""
"No decision yet?\n"
"Why do you waver in the face of what is clearly the moral choice?\n"
"Think about it:Choosing me puts an end to the war quickly.\n"
"Many people will have you to thank for saving their lives.You will be allying with Bracada, and rejecting Deyja.\n"
"All the Light has to offer will be yours to learn.Most importantly, you will be CHOOSING THE PATH OF LIGHT.\n"
"This choice is permanent, and cannot be withdrawn."
msgstr ""
"아직도 결정하지 못했습니까?\n"
"명백히 도덕적인 선택 앞에서 왜 망설이는 겁니까?\n"
"생각해 보십시오. 나를 선택하면 전쟁은 빠르게 끝납니다.\n"
"많은 이가 목숨을 구해 준 당신들에게 감사할 것입니다.당신들은 브라카다와 동맹을 맺고 데이자를 거부하게 됩니다.\n"
"빛이 제공하는 모든 것을 배울 수 있습니다.무엇보다도, 당신들은 빛의 길을 선택하게 됩니다.\n"
"이 선택은 영구적이며 되돌릴 수 없습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=21|field=1"
msgid "How may I help you?"
msgstr "무엇을 도와드릴까요?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=220|field=1"
msgid ""
"We need to go to Judge Grey's old house in Harmondale.\n"
"Only then can I start my new job and put this horrible war to an end."
msgstr ""
"하몬데일에 있는 그레이 판사의 옛집으로 가야 합니다.\n"
"그래야만 새 직무를 시작하고 이 끔찍한 전쟁을 끝낼 수 있습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=221|field=1"
msgid ""
"I am happy to see you again, my lords.\n"
"Bracada is very pleased with the way things have turned out.\n"
"Is there anything I can do for you?"
msgstr ""
"다시 뵙게 되어 기쁩니다, 영주님들.\n"
"브라카다는 일이 이렇게 풀린 것을 매우 기뻐합니다.\n"
"무엇을 도와드릴까요?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=222|field=1"
msgid ""
"Always good to see you, my friends.\n"
"Do you feel up to completing my little test?"
msgstr ""
"언제나 다시 만나 반갑습니다, 친구들.\n"
"제 작은 시험을 끝낼 준비가 되었습니까?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=223|field=1"
msgid ""
"Welcome back, my friends.\n"
"My advisors are anxious to speak with you."
msgstr ""
"돌아오신 것을 환영합니다, 친구들.\n"
"제 조언자들이 여러분과 이야기하고 싶어 합니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=224|field=1"
msgid ""
"I am very lucky to have friends such as you.\n"
"We've come far, and only have a little further to go.\n"
"My most unusual advisors have great plans…plans that require the aid of you, my steadfast allies.\n"
"I'm confident you're up to it."
msgstr ""
"여러분 같은 친구가 있어 나는 정말 행운이오.\n"
"우리는 먼 길을 왔고, 이제 조금만 더 가면 됩니다.\n"
"내 비범한 조언자들에게 원대한 계획이 있소…나의 굳건한 동맹인 여러분의 도움이 필요한 계획이지.\n"
"여러분이라면 충분히 해낼 것이라 믿소."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=225|field=1"
msgid ""
"Hello again, Lords.\n"
"You haven't completed the King's test yet.\n"
"I will not deal with you until you have finished his test.\n"
"Return to me when you are done."
msgstr ""
"또 오셨군요, 영주님들.\n"
"아직 왕의 시험을 끝내지 못하셨습니다.\n"
"시험을 마치기 전에는 상대하지 않겠습니다.\n"
"끝낸 뒤 다시 오십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=226|field=1"
msgid "Always a pleasure to see you, Lords."
msgstr "영주님들을 뵙는 것은 언제나 기쁩니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=227|field=1"
msgid "Always a pleasure to see you, Lords."
msgstr "영주님들을 뵙는 것은 언제나 기쁩니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=228|field=1"
msgid ""
"[Sigh] Why have you returned?\n"
"I want nothing to do with you."
msgstr ""
"[한숨] 왜 돌아온 거요?\n"
"당신들과는 아무 상관도 하고 싶지 않소."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=229|field=1"
msgid ""
"It's good to see you again, lords.\n"
"I hope all is well with you and your realm."
msgstr ""
"다시 만나 반갑습니다, 영주님들.\n"
"여러분과 영지가 모두 평안하기를 바랍니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=22|field=1"
msgid ""
"You just caught me. I'm almost ready to leave for Ravenshore, but how may I "
"help you?"
msgstr "마침 잘 오셨군요. 레이븐쇼어로 떠날 준비가 거의 끝났지만, 무엇을 도와드릴까요?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=230|field=1"
msgid ""
"It's good to see you again, lords.\n"
"I hope all is well with you and your realm."
msgstr ""
"다시 만나 반갑습니다, 영주님들.\n"
"여러분과 영지가 모두 평안하기를 바랍니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=231|field=1"
msgid "I have nothing to say to you!"
msgstr "당신들에게 할 말은 없소!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=232|field=1"
msgid ""
"Ah, welcome back my lords.\n"
"I hope all is well."
msgstr ""
"아, 다시 오셨군요, 영주님들.\n"
"모든 일이 잘되고 있기를 바랍니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=233|field=1"
msgid ""
"Ah, welcome back my lords.\n"
"I hope all is well."
msgstr ""
"아, 다시 오셨군요, 영주님들.\n"
"모든 일이 잘되고 있기를 바랍니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=234|field=1"
msgid ""
"Our guards missed you again?\n"
"I'll have to talk to them about that."
msgstr ""
"우리 경비병들이 또 당신들을 놓쳤습니까?\n"
"그 문제로 한마디 해야겠군요."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=235|field=1"
msgid ""
"I'm happy you're still alive and working for the Light.\n"
"Come and see me when you've finished my friend's tasks."
msgstr ""
"아직 살아서 빛을 위해 일하고 있다니 기쁘군요.\n"
"내 친구들의 임무를 마치면 찾아오십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=236|field=1"
msgid "I'm glad you're back, friends."
msgstr "돌아와서 기쁩니다, 친구들."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=237|field=1"
msgid ""
"Although there are many things we could do for one another, you must first pass Lord Ironfist's test.\n"
"[Kastore snorts derisively] Because if you can't even pass THAT sorry test, what good are you to me, let alone yourselves?"
msgstr ""
"우리가 서로 도울 수 있는 일은 많지만, 먼저 아이언피스트 경의 시험을 통과해야 하오.\n"
"[캐스토어가 비웃듯 코웃음 친다] 그 보잘것없는 시험조차 통과하지 못한다면 나에게는커녕 당신들 자신에게 무슨 쓸모가 있겠소?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=238|field=1"
msgid ""
"[Kastore smiles] Welcome back, allies.\n"
"I trust you are well?"
msgstr ""
"[캐스토어가 미소 짓는다] 돌아오셨군요, 동맹들이여.\n"
"잘 지내고 계십니까?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=239|field=1"
msgid ""
"[Kastore smiles] Welcome back, allies.\n"
"I trust you are well?"
msgstr ""
"[캐스토어가 미소 짓는다] 돌아오셨군요, 동맹들이여.\n"
"잘 지내고 계십니까?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=23|field=1"
msgid "How are you?"
msgstr "어떻게 지내십니까?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=240|field=1"
msgid ""
"What now?!? Wasn't it hard enough to get here the first time?\n"
"Do you think we have anything at all to say to each other?\n"
"Begone!"
msgstr ""
"이번엔 또 뭐요?!? 처음 오는 것만으로도 충분히 힘들지 않았소?\n"
"우리가 서로 나눌 말이 하나라도 있다고 생각하오?\n"
"썩 꺼지시오!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=241|field=1"
msgid "Glad to have you back, allies."
msgstr "돌아와서 기쁘군요, 동맹들이여."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=242|field=1"
msgid "Glad to have you back, allies."
msgstr "돌아와서 기쁘군요, 동맹들이여."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=243|field=1"
msgid ""
"I have nothing to say to you, cowards!\n"
"One day, you and your entire town will be working in the mines for us!"
msgstr ""
"당신들에게 할 말은 없소, 겁쟁이들!\n"
"언젠가는 당신들과 온 마을이 우리를 위해 광산에서 일하게 될 거요!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=244|field=1"
msgid ""
"Welcome, allies.\n"
"Always good to have you back."
msgstr ""
"어서 오시오, 동맹들이여.\n"
"다시 오니 언제나 반갑군요."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=245|field=1"
msgid ""
"Welcome, allies.\n"
"Always good to have you back."
msgstr ""
"어서 오시오, 동맹들이여.\n"
"다시 오니 언제나 반갑군요."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=246|field=1"
msgid ""
"Honestly, didn't you people get the hint when all our minions were attacking you?\n"
"We don't want you down here!\n"
"And it doesn't do you any good blowing up our zombies--we just reanimate them!"
msgstr ""
"솔직히 우리 부하들이 모두 공격했을 때 눈치채지 못했소?\n"
"우리는 당신들이 여기 내려오는 걸 원치 않소!\n"
"우리 좀비들을 날려 버려도 소용없소. 다시 되살리면 그만이니까!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=247|field=1"
msgid ""
"Glad you're still on our side!\n"
"Come and see me when you're done with my associates' missions."
msgstr ""
"아직 우리 편이라 다행이군요!\n"
"내 동료들의 임무를 끝내면 찾아오십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=248|field=1"
msgid "Welcome, friends."
msgstr "어서 오시오, 친구들."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=249|field=1"
msgid ""
"How goes your preparations for the test?\n"
"You can take it anytime you want…just walk on down to the Breeding Pit and jump in.\n"
"[Archibald smiles, his face half hidden in shadow] It's always open."
msgstr ""
"시험 준비는 어떻게 되어 갑니까?\n"
"원할 때 언제든 시험을 치를 수 있습니다…번식 구덩이로 내려가 뛰어들기만 하십시오.\n"
"[아치볼드가 얼굴 절반을 그림자에 가린 채 미소 짓는다] 언제나 열려 있습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=24|field=1"
msgid "Welcome!"
msgstr "어서 오세요!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=250|field=1"
msgid ""
"Good to see you again, my friends.\n"
"You are welcome to visit anytime."
msgstr ""
"다시 만나 반갑습니다, 친구들.\n"
"언제든 찾아오셔도 좋습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=251|field=1"
msgid ""
"Back for more target practice?\n"
"You know, if you wait long enough, my people will regenerate.\n"
"Bigger challenge then."
msgstr ""
"표적 연습을 더 하러 왔습니까?\n"
"충분히 기다리면 내 부하들이 재생할 겁니다.\n"
"그러면 더 어려운 상대가 되겠지요."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=252|field=1"
msgid ""
"Welcome back, allies.\n"
"My advisors are eager to speak with you."
msgstr ""
"돌아오신 것을 환영합니다, 동맹들이여.\n"
"제 조언자들이 여러분과 이야기하고 싶어 합니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=253|field=1"
msgid ""
"Excuse me, but visitors are not allowed here in Fort Riverstride.\n"
"I'm afraid I have to ask you to leave.\n"
"Any attempt to go further into the fort will be treated as hostile action, and will be dealt with as such."
msgstr ""
"실례하지만 리버스트라이드 요새에는 방문객이 들어올 수 없습니다.\n"
"떠나 달라고 요청할 수밖에 없군요.\n"
"요새 안쪽으로 더 들어가려는 시도는 적대 행위로 간주하고 그에 맞게 대응하겠습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=254|field=1"
msgid ""
"This Watchtower preserves the borders of Deyja.\n"
"Visitors are not allowed in here, so you will have to leave.\n"
"If you attempt to enter further into the tower, you will be killed without hesitation."
msgstr ""
"이 감시탑은 데이자의 국경을 지키고 있습니다.\n"
"방문객은 들어올 수 없으니 떠나야 합니다.\n"
"탑 안쪽으로 더 들어가려 하면 주저 없이 처형하겠습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=255|field=1"
msgid ""
"Halt!\n"
"You have no business past this point.\n"
"Only those who have proved their purity may enter the holy sanctum. "
msgstr ""
"멈추시오!\n"
"이 너머에는 용무가 없을 것이오.\n"
"자신의 순수함을 증명한 자만이 신성한 성소에 들어갈 수 있소. "

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=256|field=1"
msgid ""
"What have we here?\n"
"Did you honestly think you could tread safely amongst the power of the shadows?\n"
"It would not be safe for you, and you are not allowed past this point."
msgstr ""
"이게 누구지?\n"
"그림자의 힘 한가운데를 안전하게 거닐 수 있다고 정말 생각했나?\n"
"너희에게 안전한 곳이 아니며, 이 지점을 통과하는 것도 허락되지 않는다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=257|field=1"
msgid ""
"Halt!\n"
"You do not have authorization to proceed this way.\n"
"If you are looking for Queen Catherine's throne room, it is in the center of the castle behind the main staircase."
msgstr ""
"멈추시오!\n"
"이 길로 갈 권한이 없습니다.\n"
"캐서린 여왕의 왕좌실을 찾는다면 성 중앙의 주계단 뒤에 있습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=258|field=1"
msgid ""
"Halt!\n"
"Visitors aren't permitted in this section of the castle.\n"
"If you are looking for King Parson's throne room, take the lift down and follow the left corridor."
msgstr ""
"멈추시오!\n"
"방문객은 성의 이 구역에 들어갈 수 없습니다.\n"
"파슨 왕의 왕좌실을 찾는다면 승강기를 타고 내려가 왼쪽 복도를 따라가십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=259|field=1"
msgid ""
"Halt!\n"
"Access to these areas is denied on orders from Gavin Magnus himself.\n"
"If you are looking for his throne room, go north from the entrance as far as you can, then go west as far as you can, and his throne room is to the north."
msgstr ""
"멈추시오!\n"
"개빈 매그너스의 명령에 따라 이 구역의 출입은 금지되어 있습니다.\n"
"그의 왕좌실을 찾는다면 입구에서 갈 수 있는 만큼 북쪽으로 간 뒤, 갈 수 있는 만큼 서쪽으로 가십시오. 왕좌실은 그곳에서 북쪽에 있습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=25|field=1"
msgid "Well, what is it?"
msgstr "그래, 무슨 일이오?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=260|field=1"
msgid ""
"Halt!\n"
"You don't have permission to proceed through this area.\n"
"If you are looking for the throne room, you must go north from the entrance to the main room.\n"
"Then follow the small west passage to the waiting ship.\n"
"Use the ship's rudder to maneuver downstream and then exit the ship and proceed in the doorway."
msgstr ""
"멈추시오!\n"
"이 구역을 통과할 허가가 없습니다.\n"
"왕좌실을 찾는다면 입구에서 북쪽으로 가서 중앙 방으로 들어가야 합니다.\n"
"그다음 서쪽의 좁은 통로를 따라 대기 중인 배로 가십시오.\n"
"배의 키를 사용해 하류로 움직인 뒤 배에서 내려 출입구로 들어가십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=261|field=1"
msgid "Hello again, what can I do for you?"
msgstr "또 오셨군요. 무엇을 도와드릴까요?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=262|field=1"
msgid ""
"Are we almost back to Erathia?\n"
"I have information for Queen Catherine that cannot wait."
msgstr ""
"에라시아에 거의 다 왔습니까?\n"
"캐서린 여왕께 지체할 수 없는 정보를 전해야 합니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=263|field=1"
msgid ""
"Excellent decision to assist King Parson.\n"
"Just get me to Queen Catherine, and I'll handle the rest."
msgstr ""
"파슨 왕을 돕기로 한 것은 훌륭한 결정입니다.\n"
"저를 캐서린 여왕께 데려가기만 하십시오. 나머지는 제가 처리하겠습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=264|field=1"
msgid ""
"Halt!\n"
"Lord Markham doesn't want visitors wandering around his house.\n"
"If you came to speak with him, he's in his chamber directly north from the entrance."
msgstr ""
"멈추시오!\n"
"마크햄 경은 방문객들이 저택을 돌아다니는 것을 원치 않습니다.\n"
"그와 이야기하러 왔다면 입구에서 곧장 북쪽에 있는 방에 있습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=265|field=1"
msgid ""
"My lords, I have been dispatched by the ambassadors from Erathia and Avlee to inform you of Judge Grey's untimely death.\n"
"We believe it was a heart attack, and there is no reason to suspect foul play.\n"
"However, they wish to speak to you at once, and urge you to return to your castle.\n"
"They have declared a truce until a successor can be found for Judge Grey."
msgstr ""
"영주님들, 에라시아와 아블리 대사들이 그레이 판사의 갑작스러운 죽음을 알리기 위해 저를 보냈습니다.\n"
"심장 마비로 보이며, 타살을 의심할 이유는 없습니다.\n"
"하지만 대사들은 즉시 영주님들과 이야기하기를 바라며 성으로 돌아오시길 촉구했습니다.\n"
"그레이 판사의 후임자가 정해질 때까지 휴전을 선언했습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=266|field=1"
msgid ""
"Oh, the new lords of Harmondale!\n"
"Just the persons I needed to see! "
msgstr ""
"아, 하몬데일의 새 영주님들이시군요!\n"
"마침 꼭 만나고 싶던 분들입니다! "

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=267|field=1"
msgid ""
"Thanks for returning the Lantern of Light.\n"
"Ceremonies can continue normally at the temple!"
msgstr ""
"빛의 등불을 돌려주셔서 감사합니다.\n"
"이제 신전의 의식을 정상적으로 계속할 수 있습니다!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=268|field=1"
msgid "Ah, the Lords of Harmondale. Perhaps you can be of assistance to me?"
msgstr "아, 하몬데일의 영주님들이군요. 혹시 저를 도와주실 수 있습니까?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=269|field=1"
msgid "My thanks for returning Haldar's remains!"
msgstr "할다르의 유해를 돌려주셔서 감사합니다!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=26|field=1"
msgid "Yes?"
msgstr "네?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=270|field=1"
msgid "Lords of Harmondale, I need your help!"
msgstr "하몬데일의 영주님들, 도움이 필요합니다!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=271|field=1"
msgid "Thanks for returning my signet ring and restoring my business!"
msgstr "제 인장 반지를 되찾아 사업을 회복시켜 주셔서 감사합니다!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=272|field=1"
msgid ""
"Greetings, you must be the Lords of Harmondale.\n"
"I am a collector of the finest historical items, perhaps you can deliver something to me?"
msgstr ""
"안녕하시오. 하몬데일의 영주님들이 틀림없군요.\n"
"저는 뛰어난 역사적 유물을 수집하는 사람인데, 혹시 제게 물건 하나를 가져다주시겠습니까?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=273|field=1"
msgid ""
"Thank you for returning the Parson's Quill sent by Lord Markham.\n"
"You help has made my collection complete!"
msgstr ""
"마크햄 경이 보낸 파슨의 깃펜을 돌려주셔서 감사합니다.\n"
"도움 덕분에 제 수집품이 완성되었습니다!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=274|field=1"
msgid "Hello again, Lords."
msgstr "또 오셨군요, 영주님들."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=275|field=1"
msgid ""
"Thank you so much for returning the Faerie Pipes to me!\n"
"I would have never been able to brave the Hall under the Hill myself."
msgstr ""
"요정의 피리를 돌려주셔서 정말 감사합니다!\n"
"저 혼자서는 언덕 아래의 회관에 감히 들어갈 수 없었을 겁니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=276|field=1"
msgid ""
"I bring you news from Harmondale.\n"
"It seems members of the Mercenary Guild have found it quite the easy pickings, and have begun looting the city and the castle there."
msgstr ""
"하몬데일에서 온 소식을 전하겠습니다.\n"
"용병 길드의 일원들이 이곳을 만만한 먹잇감으로 보고 도시와 성을 약탈하기 시작한 모양입니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=277|field=1"
msgid ""
"Hello again.\n"
"I hope, for your sake, you're complying with my request."
msgstr ""
"또 오셨군요.\n"
"당신을 위해서라도 내 요구를 따르고 있기를 바랍니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=278|field=1"
msgid "Please assist us; Stone City would be in your debt."
msgstr "우리를 도와주십시오. 스톤 시티가 당신들에게 빚을 질 것입니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=279|field=1"
msgid "Thank you for helping us by getting rid of those nasty Troglodytes!"
msgstr "그 끔찍한 트로글로다이트들을 없애 주셔서 감사합니다!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=27|field=1"
msgid "Greetings, friends."
msgstr "안녕하시오, 친구들이여."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=280|field=1"
msgid "Good day, my lords."
msgstr "좋은 하루입니다, 영주님들."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=281|field=1"
msgid ""
"Good work on those griffins, my lords.\n"
"It is always a pleasure to see you."
msgstr ""
"그리핀들을 잘 처리하셨습니다, 영주님들.\n"
"여러분을 뵙는 것은 언제나 기쁩니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=282|field=1"
msgid ""
"I have nothing to say to you.\n"
"Go away."
msgstr ""
"당신에게 할 말은 없소.\n"
"가시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=283|field=1"
msgid ""
"Your lack of punctuality has cost yourselves and your town grievously.\n"
"I think you may find your bank account somewhat… pinched.\n"
"Consider this an important lesson learned.\n"
"Good day."
msgstr ""
"시간을 지키지 않은 탓에 당신들과 마을이 심각한 대가를 치렀소.\n"
"은행 계좌가 상당히… 쪼들리게 된 것을 알게 될 거요.\n"
"중요한 교훈을 얻었다고 생각하시오.\n"
"좋은 하루 보내시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=284|field=1"
msgid "Growf!"
msgstr "그르릉!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=285|field=1"
msgid "Good to see you again, my lords."
msgstr "다시 만나 반갑습니다, 영주님들."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=286|field=1"
msgid "A pleasure to see you again, lords."
msgstr "다시 만나 뵙게 되어 기쁩니다, 영주님들."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=287|field=1"
msgid ""
"How wonderful to see you again.\n"
"Thanks for helping me escape the Kreegan.\n"
"If you should find yourselves in Enroth, come by and visit Castle Ironfist."
msgstr ""
"다시 만나니 정말 반갑습니다.\n"
"크리건에게서 탈출하도록 도와주셔서 감사합니다.\n"
"혹시 엔로스에 오게 된다면 아이언피스트 성에 들러 주십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=288|field=1"
msgid "May I have a moment of your time?"
msgstr "잠시 시간을 내주시겠습니까?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=289|field=1"
msgid "Excellent work; my associates are quite pleased."
msgstr "훌륭한 솜씨였습니다. 제 동료들이 아주 만족하고 있습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=28|field=1"
msgid "Hello, guild friends."
msgstr "안녕하세요, 길드 동료 여러분."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=290|field=1"
msgid ""
"Greetings again, lords.\n"
"May your stay here be a pleasant one."
msgstr ""
"다시 만나 반갑습니다, 영주님들.\n"
"이곳에서 즐겁게 머무르시길 바랍니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=291|field=1"
msgid ""
"Thank you for your assistance in completing my collection.\n"
"You have my gratitude forever!"
msgstr ""
"제 수집품을 완성하도록 도와주셔서 감사합니다.\n"
"영원히 감사드리겠습니다!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=292|field=1"
msgid ""
"Good day!\n"
"Would you like to hear about the ArcoMage Championship?"
msgstr ""
"좋은 하루입니다!\n"
"아르코메이지 선수권 대회에 관해 들어 보시겠습니까?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=293|field=1"
msgid "Welcome ArcoMage Champions!"
msgstr "어서 오십시오, 아르코메이지 챔피언들이여!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=294|field=1"
msgid ""
"Greetings!\n"
"Are you here to study the arts of Sorcerey?"
msgstr ""
"안녕하시오!\n"
"마법의 기예를 배우러 오셨습니까?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=295|field=1"
msgid ""
"Welcome to Celeste!\n"
"There are many great sites to see here!"
msgstr ""
"셀레스트에 오신 것을 환영합니다!\n"
"이곳에는 볼만한 훌륭한 명소가 많습니다!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=296|field=1"
msgid ""
"Yer in the Pit now!\n"
"Wish you were dead yet?"
msgstr ""
"이제 구덩이에 들어왔군!\n"
"벌써 죽고 싶어졌나?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=297|field=1"
msgid ""
"Nighon is the place to learn the ways of magic.\n"
"Have you visited all who could teach you?"
msgstr ""
"나이혼은 마법의 길을 배우기에 좋은 곳입니다.\n"
"가르침을 줄 수 있는 이들을 모두 찾아가 보셨습니까?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=298|field=1"
msgid ""
"The Barrow Downs is not a place to linger!\n"
"I may return to Stone City if it gets much worse here!"
msgstr ""
"고분 지대는 오래 머물 곳이 아닙니다!\n"
"상황이 더 나빠지면 스톤 시티로 돌아갈지도 모르겠습니다!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=299|field=1"
msgid ""
"Tatalia has the most drastic climes in Erathia.\n"
"From the snow topped mountains to the swamps to the south."
msgstr ""
"타탈리아는 에라시아에서 기후가 가장 극단적인 곳입니다.\n"
"눈 덮인 산에서 남쪽의 늪지까지 모두 있지요."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=29|field=1"
msgid "How may I serve the saviors of my herd?"
msgstr "우리 무리를 구해 준 분들을 어떻게 섬기면 되겠습니까?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=2|field=1"
msgid ""
"Have you found a way off the islands?\n"
"Are the waters safe for us to sail back to Ravenshore?"
msgstr ""
"섬을 빠져나갈 방법을 찾으셨습니까?\n"
"레이븐쇼어로 돌아갈 만큼 바다가 안전합니까?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=300|field=1"
msgid ""
"Greetings!\n"
"Hope the day finds you well!"
msgstr ""
"안녕하시오!\n"
"오늘 하루가 평안하길 바랍니다!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=301|field=1"
msgid ""
"Visitors to Stone City.\n"
"Its been a while since we had travelers such as yourselves!\n"
"Welcome!"
msgstr ""
"스톤 시티를 찾은 방문객들이군요.\n"
"당신들 같은 여행자가 온 것은 오랜만입니다!\n"
"환영합니다!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=302|field=1"
msgid ""
"You won Lord Markham's contest?\n"
"Good luck…last people who tried to clean this place up went into Castle Harmondale and never came out."
msgstr ""
"마크햄 경의 대회에서 우승했다고요?\n"
"행운을 빕니다…전에 이곳을 정리하려던 사람들은 하몬데일 성에 들어간 뒤 다시 나오지 못했습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=303|field=1"
msgid ""
"Welcome to Pierpont!\n"
"Be sure not to travel into the forest to the northeast.\n"
"Several people have disappeared in that region!"
msgstr ""
"피어폰트에 오신 것을 환영합니다!\n"
"북동쪽 숲으로는 들어가지 마십시오.\n"
"그 지역에서 여러 사람이 실종되었습니다!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=304|field=1"
msgid ""
"Erathia is sure a better place now that Catherine is ruling from Castle Gryphonheart.\n"
"Don’t you think?"
msgstr ""
"캐서린이 그리폰하트 성에서 통치한 뒤로 에라시아는 확실히 더 나은 곳이 되었습니다.\n"
"그렇지 않습니까?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=305|field=1"
msgid ""
"Deyja is the place to learn the ways of magic.\n"
"Have you visited all who could teach you?"
msgstr ""
"데이자는 마법의 길을 배우기에 좋은 곳입니다.\n"
"가르침을 줄 수 있는 이들을 모두 찾아가 보셨습니까?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=306|field=1"
msgid ""
"Greetings!\n"
"My name is Qillain, and I can make weapons from ore.\n"
"If you find ore, just bring me the chunk, and I'll make a weapon of equivalent quality to the ore used.\n"
"I will use the best ore first, and I take from only one person at a time."
msgstr ""
"안녕하시오!\n"
"제 이름은 킬레인이고, 광석으로 무기를 만들 수 있습니다.\n"
"광석을 발견하면 덩어리를 가져오십시오. 사용한 광석의 품질에 맞는 무기를 만들어 드리겠습니다.\n"
"가장 좋은 광석부터 사용하며, 한 번에 한 사람의 광석만 받습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=307|field=1"
msgid ""
"Welcome!\n"
"My name is Robert, and I can make armor from ore.\n"
"If you find ore, just bring me the chunk, and I'll make a armor of equivalent quality to the ore used.\n"
"I will use the best ore first, and I take from only one person at a time."
msgstr ""
"어서 오세요!\n"
"제 이름은 로버트이고, 광석으로 갑옷을 만들 수 있습니다.\n"
"광석을 발견하면 덩어리를 가져오십시오. 사용한 광석의 품질에 맞는 갑옷을 만들어 드리겠습니다.\n"
"가장 좋은 광석부터 사용하며, 한 번에 한 사람의 광석만 받습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=308|field=1"
msgid ""
"Greetings!\n"
"My name is Cloud,\n"
"and I can make items from ore-- you know, rings, cloaks, boots, and the like.\n"
"If you find ore, just bring me the chunk, and I'll make an item of equivalent quality to the ore used.\n"
"I will use the best ore first, and I take from only one person at a time."
msgstr ""
"안녕하시오!\n"
"제 이름은 클라우드이며,\n"
"광석으로 반지, 망토, 장화 같은 물건을 만들 수 있습니다.\n"
"광석을 발견하면 덩어리를 가져오십시오. 사용한 광석의 품질에 맞는 물건을 만들어 드리겠습니다.\n"
"가장 좋은 광석부터 사용하며, 한 번에 한 사람의 광석만 받습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=309|field=1"
msgid ""
"Hold there!\n"
"You seemed to have forgotten the Necromancer Tax.\n"
"This tax (1000 gold) ensures that the roads stay clear of zombies and costs, and it would be in your best interest to pay."
msgstr ""
"거기 멈추시오!\n"
"강령술사 세금을 잊은 모양이군요.\n"
"이 세금(1000골드)은 도로에 좀비와 각종 골칫거리가 생기지 않도록 관리하는 데 쓰이니, 당신을 위해서라도 내는 편이 좋을 겁니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=30|field=1"
msgid "Hello, again."
msgstr "또 오셨군요."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=310|field=1"
msgid ""
"Do you have any Tularean Wood?\n"
"I buy crates of Tularean Wood and I sell crates of Arrowheads at the best prices around."
msgstr ""
"툴라리안 목재가 있습니까?\n"
"툴라리안 목재 상자를 사고 화살촉 상자를 이 근방에서 가장 좋은 가격에 팝니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=311|field=1"
msgid ""
"Do you have any Arrowheads? I buy crates of Arrowheads and I sell crates of "
"Griffin Feathers at the best prices around."
msgstr "화살촉이 있습니까? 화살촉 상자를 사고 그리핀 깃털 상자를 이 근방에서 가장 좋은 가격에 팝니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=312|field=1"
msgid ""
"Do you have any Griffin Feathers?\n"
"I buy crates of Griffin Feathers and I sell crates of Tularean Wood at the best prices around."
msgstr ""
"그리핀 깃털이 있습니까?\n"
"그리핀 깃털 상자를 사고 툴라리안 목재 상자를 이 근방에서 가장 좋은 가격에 팝니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=313|field=1"
msgid ""
"Did you bring any bottles of Enrothian Wine?\n"
"I buy crates of Enrothian Wine and I sell crates of Sand at the best prices around."
msgstr ""
"엔로스산 와인 병을 가져오셨습니까?\n"
"엔로스산 와인 상자를 사고 모래 상자를 이 근방에서 가장 좋은 가격에 팝니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=314|field=1"
msgid ""
"Greetings!\n"
"I buy crates of Sand and I sell crates of Glass Bottles at the best prices around. "
msgstr ""
"안녕하시오!\n"
"모래 상자를 사고 유리병 상자를 이 근방에서 가장 좋은 가격에 팝니다. "

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=315|field=1"
msgid ""
"Do you have any Glass Bottles?\n"
"I buy crates of Glass Bottles and I sell crates of Enrothian Wine at the best prices around."
msgstr ""
"유리병이 있습니까?\n"
"유리병 상자를 사고 엔로스산 와인 상자를 이 근방에서 가장 좋은 가격에 팝니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=316|field=1"
msgid ""
"::You receive a telepathic message:: My…Lords.\n"
"My name is Archibald Ironfist.\n"
"You've probably heard of me--it is I who, up until recently, was the ruler of the Pit.\n"
"With my retirement, I find myself no longer concerned with the affairs of state.\n"
"I know that we were adversaries, but I am forced to ask for your help.\n"
"In return, I think I can help you.I see that you're on your way to do battle with the devils, and I want to make sure it goes well.\n"
"With the aid of equipment I have found in my new laboratory, I have discovered that my brother Roland, husband to Queen Catherine of Erathia, remains imprisoned by the devils in their foul, ah, dwelling.Please rescue him!\n"
"Not even I can bear to think of my brother in those conditions!\n"
"To help you along, I offer this weapon.\n"
"It was...found by my loyal servant sergeant Piridak, amongst my advisor's personal belongings.\n"
"I hope it helps."
msgstr ""
"::텔레파시 메시지를 받았습니다:: 영주님들…\n"
"내 이름은 아치볼드 아이언피스트요.\n"
"아마 내 이야기를 들었겠지. 얼마 전까지 구덩이의 통치자였던 사람이 바로 나요.\n"
"은퇴한 지금은 더 이상 국정에 관심을 두지 않고 있소.\n"
"우리가 적대했던 사이라는 것은 알지만, 어쩔 수 없이 도움을 청해야겠소.\n"
"그 대가로 나도 당신들을 도울 수 있을 것 같소.당신들이 데빌들과 싸우러 가는 길이라는 걸 알고 있고, 일이 잘 풀리게 하고 싶소.\n"
"새 연구실에서 발견한 장비를 이용해, 내 동생이자 에라시아의 캐서린 여왕의 남편인 롤랜드가 여전히 데빌들의 추악한, 음, 거처에 갇혀 있다는 사실을 알아냈소.그를 구해 주시오!\n"
"나조차도 내 동생이 그런 처지에 놓였다고 생각하면 견딜 수 없소!\n"
"도움을 주기 위해 이 무기를 보내겠소.\n"
"내 충직한 하인 피리닥 병장이 내 조언자의 개인 소지품에서…발견한 물건이오.\n"
"도움이 되길 바라오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=317|field=1"
msgid ""
"::You receive a telepathic message:: My friends.\n"
"I know you are working with my old advisors, but I must ask for your help one more time.With the aid of equipment I have found in my new laboratory, I have discovered that my brother Roland, husband to Queen Catherine of Erathia, remains imprisoned by the devils in their foul, ah, dwelling.\n"
"I overheard that you're on your way to do battle with them (this equipment really is wonderful), and I want to make sure it goes well.\n"
"My brother has stolen the key to their leader's chambers, and has hidden it in the beastly cage they're keeping him in.\n"
"Please rescue him!\n"
"Not even I can bear to think of my brother in those conditions!\n"
"To help you along, I offer this weapon.\n"
"It was...found by my loyal servant sergeant Piridak, amongst my advisor's personal belongings.\n"
"I hope it helps."
msgstr ""
"::텔레파시 메시지를 받았습니다:: 친구들이여.\n"
"당신들이 내 옛 조언자들과 함께 일한다는 것은 알지만, 한 번만 더 도움을 청해야겠소.새 연구실에서 발견한 장비를 이용해, 내 동생이자 에라시아의 캐서린 여왕의 남편인 롤랜드가 여전히 데빌들의 추악한, 음, 거처에 갇혀 있다는 사실을 알아냈소.\n"
"당신들이 그들과 싸우러 가는 길이라는 말을 엿들었고(이 장비는 정말 놀랍군), 일이 잘 풀리게 하고 싶소.\n"
"내 동생은 놈들의 우두머리 방 열쇠를 훔쳐, 자신을 가둔 흉측한 우리 안에 숨겨 놓았소.\n"
"그를 구해 주시오!\n"
"나조차도 내 동생이 그런 처지에 놓였다고 생각하면 견딜 수 없소!\n"
"도움을 주기 위해 이 무기를 보내겠소.\n"
"내 충직한 하인 피리닥 병장이 내 조언자의 개인 소지품에서…발견한 물건이오.\n"
"도움이 되길 바라오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=318|field=1"
msgid ""
"Halt!\n"
"You have already been warned once!\n"
"Visitors aren't permitted in this section of Stone City.\n"
"If you are looking for King Hothfarr's throne room, it is to the east of here."
msgstr ""
"멈추시오!\n"
"이미 한 번 경고했습니다!\n"
"방문객은 스톤 시티의 이 구역에 들어갈 수 없습니다.\n"
"호스파르 왕의 왕좌실을 찾는다면 이곳 동쪽에 있습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=319|field=1"
msgid ""
"Good day, my lords.\n"
"How do you fare?"
msgstr ""
"좋은 하루입니다, 영주님들.\n"
"어떻게 지내십니까?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=31|field=1"
msgid "What is it? Be quick! We are very busy."
msgstr "무슨 일이오? 빨리 말하시오! 우리는 아주 바쁘오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=320|field=1"
msgid ""
"Hmmph.\n"
"You don't actually expect me to act as though you really were a noble, do you?\n"
"Once a peasant, always a peasant, that's what my mother used to say.\n"
"Really, could you use the servant's entrance next time you stop by?\n"
"It really is embarrassing to have you dusty, mud spattered peasants coming in through the front door.\n"
"What will the neighbors think?"
msgstr ""
"흥.\n"
"내가 당신을 진짜 귀족처럼 대할 거라고 기대하는 건 아니겠지요?\n"
"한번 농민은 영원한 농민이라고, 어머니께서 늘 말씀하셨습니다.\n"
"정말이지, 다음에 들를 때는 하인용 입구를 이용해 주시겠습니까?\n"
"먼지와 진흙투성이 농민들이 정문으로 들어오는 모습을 보이는 건 정말 창피합니다.\n"
"이웃들이 어떻게 생각하겠습니까?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=321|field=1"
