#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=323|field=1"
msgid ""
"Hey! Halt, I must speak with you for a spell. It’s a matter of an utmost "
"importance."
msgstr "이봐요! 멈추시오. 잠시 할 말이 있소. 대단히 중요한 일이오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=324|field=1"
msgid "Hey, how's the expedition going? "
msgstr "이봐요, 원정은 어떻게 되어 갑니까? "

