msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=33|field=1"
msgid "What do you want?"
msgstr "무슨 용건이오?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=34|field=1"
msgid ""
"So, do we move against the Sun Temple? Shall we get for Sandro his "
"Nightshade Brazier?"
msgstr "그럼 태양의 신전을 공격하는 겁니까? 산드로에게 나이트셰이드 화로를 가져다줄까요?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=35|field=1"
msgid ""
"Are you now ready to destroy the guild's Skeleton Transformer? I will join "
"you and we can be about the task!"
msgstr "이제 길드의 해골 변환기를 파괴할 준비가 되었습니까? 나도 합류해서 함께 해치우겠소!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=36|field=1"
msgid ""
"So, have you decided to steal the Nightshade Brazier from the Temple, or to "
"destroy the guild's Skeleton Transformer? Either way…I will join you. But "
"let us do it. I would slack my thirst for revenge."
msgstr ""
"태양의 신전에서 나이트셰이드 화로를 훔칠지, 길드의 해골 변환기를 파괴할지 결정했습니까? 어느 쪽이든…나도 합류하겠소. 하지만 어서 "
"행동합시다. 복수의 갈증을 풀고 싶소."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=37|field=1"
msgid "The Light upon you. What need you of our temple?"
msgstr "빛이 그대와 함께하기를. 우리 신전에 무슨 용무가 있습니까?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=38|field=1"
msgid "Hail, Heroes of Jadame!"
msgstr "제이덤의 영웅들이여, 만세!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=39|field=1"
msgid "Hello again."
msgstr "또 오셨군요."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=3|field=1"
msgid ""
"Have the Portals been fixed?\n"
"My stranded people are able to return to the safety of the village here on the main island?"
msgstr ""
"차원문은 수리되었습니까?\n"
"고립된 우리 사람들이 이 본섬 마을의 안전한 곳으로 돌아올 수 있습니까?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=40|field=1"
msgid "Welcome. My cave is open to you."
msgstr "어서 오시오. 내 동굴은 당신들에게 열려 있소."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=41|field=1"
msgid "Yes, friends?"
msgstr "무슨 일이오, 친구들?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=42|field=1"
msgid "Hail, Saviors of Balthazar Lair!"
msgstr "발타자르 소굴의 구원자들이여, 만세!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=43|field=1"
msgid "Greetings, heroes."
msgstr "안녕하시오, 영웅들이여."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=44|field=1"
msgid "Can I help you?"
msgstr "도와드릴까요?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=45|field=1"
msgid ""
"You are back? Have you need of advice? Or are you finding the task at hand "
"too difficult?"
msgstr "돌아왔군요? 조언이 필요합니까? 아니면 맡은 일이 너무 어렵습니까?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=46|field=1"
msgid ""
"You must go through the crystal gateway! It leads to the plane between "
"planes. The cause of the cataclysm lies through it--seek out the source!"
msgstr ""
"수정 관문을 통과해야 합니다! 그곳은 차원 사이의 차원으로 이어집니다. 대재앙의 원인은 그 너머에 있으니, 근원을 찾아내십시오!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=47|field=1"
msgid "How can I help you, friends?"
msgstr "무엇을 도와드릴까요, 친구들?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=48|field=1"
msgid ""
"Ah the gnatlings are returned. I must consider why I allow them their "
"continued existence. But this I will do some other time.Speak then, while "
"you still may, puny ones."
msgstr ""
"아, 날벌레들이 돌아왔군. 왜 아직도 살려 두고 있는지 생각해 봐야겠어. 하지만 그건 다음에 하지. 자, 아직 목숨이 붙어 있을 때 "
"말해라, 하찮은 것들아."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=49|field=1"
msgid ""
"Good day.\n"
"You seek to gain knowledge?"
msgstr ""
"좋은 하루입니다.\n"
"지식을 얻으러 오셨습니까?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=4|field=1"
msgid ""
"We are in debt to you!\n"
"Not only did you save my stranded people, but you also returned to stop the Regnan assault upon my island!"
msgstr ""
"우리는 당신에게 큰 빚을 졌습니다!\n"
"고립된 우리 사람들을 구해 주었을 뿐 아니라, 돌아와 레그나의 섬 침공까지 막아 주셨군요!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=50|field=1"
msgid "Are you here to free me?"
msgstr "나를 풀어 주러 왔습니까?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=51|field=1"
msgid "Will you now release me from my torment?"
msgstr "이제 나를 이 고통에서 해방해 주겠습니까?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=52|field=1"
msgid "Release me from this cell, mortals!"
msgstr "필멸자들이여, 이 감옥에서 나를 풀어 다오!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=53|field=1"
msgid "My fires dampen. Release me!"
msgstr "내 불길이 사그라진다. 나를 풀어 다오!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=54|field=1"
msgid "Yes? Can I help you?"
msgstr "네? 도와드릴까요?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=55|field=1"
msgid "Greetings!"
msgstr "안녕하시오!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=56|field=1"
msgid "Yes?"
msgstr "네?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=57|field=1"
msgid "Greetings! How may Asael Fromago, master of cheeses, serve you?"
msgstr "안녕하시오! 치즈의 대가 아사엘 프로마고가 무엇을 도와드릴까요?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=58|field=1"
msgid "Hail, adventurer!"
msgstr "모험가여, 반갑소!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=59|field=1"
msgid "Yeah? What do you want?"
msgstr "그래? 무슨 일이야?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=5|field=1"
msgid "Be quick with your business. I must prepare to escape these islands!"
msgstr "용건을 서두르시오. 이 섬들을 탈출할 준비를 해야 하오!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=60|field=1"
msgid "How are you today?"
msgstr "오늘은 어떻게 지내십니까?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=61|field=1"
msgid "Yes? What is it?"
msgstr "네? 무슨 일이죠?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=62|field=1"
msgid "Greetings. How may I help you?"
msgstr "안녕하세요. 무엇을 도와드릴까요?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=63|field=1"
msgid "Good to see you again."
msgstr "다시 만나 반갑습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=64|field=1"
msgid ""
"Hello again. You are still safe in my presence. The madness has not "
"overtaken me."
msgstr "또 오셨군요. 아직은 제 곁에 있어도 안전합니다. 광기가 저를 덮치지 않았으니까요."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=65|field=1"
msgid ""
"I am still in my own mind, but for how long I don't know. What do you want?"
msgstr "아직은 제정신이지만, 얼마나 더 버틸지는 모르겠소. 무슨 용건이오?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=66|field=1"
msgid "Yes?"
msgstr "네?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=67|field=1"
msgid "How can I help you?"
msgstr "무엇을 도와드릴까요?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=68|field=1"
msgid "I s-still maintain my-myself. W-what is it y-you want?"
msgstr "아-아직은 제-제정신을 유-유지하고 있소. 무-무엇을 원하는 거요?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=69|field=1"
msgid "How can I help you?"
msgstr "무엇을 도와드릴까요?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=6|field=1"
msgid "The mountain of fire will surely destroy us!"
msgstr "불의 산이 분명 우리를 파멸시킬 거요!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=70|field=1"
msgid "Hello again."
msgstr "또 오셨군요."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=71|field=1"
msgid "Welcome back! Have you decided to take me with you in your travels?"
msgstr "다시 오신 것을 환영합니다! 여행에 저를 데려가기로 결정하셨습니까?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=72|field=1"
msgid "So, have you come back to take me on your adventure?"
msgstr "그럼, 모험에 저를 데려가려고 돌아오신 겁니까?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=73|field=1"
msgid "So, can I come with you now? Can I?"
msgstr "그럼 이제 저도 함께 가도 됩니까? 정말요?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=74|field=1"
msgid "Hello."
msgstr "안녕하세요."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=75|field=1"
msgid "Good to see you again!"
msgstr "다시 만나 반갑습니다!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=76|field=1"
msgid "Hello, again. How can Jasp Thelbourne, renowned adventurer do for you?"
msgstr "또 오셨군요. 명망 높은 모험가 재스프 셀본이 무엇을 도와드릴까요?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=77|field=1"
msgid ""
"Well, I'm still here, but I make preparations to leave as soon as an "
"opportunity presents itself. Have you reconsidered? Will you take me now?"
msgstr "음, 아직 여기 있긴 하지만 기회가 생기는 즉시 떠날 준비를 하고 있소. 다시 생각해 보셨습니까? 이제 나를 데려가시겠소?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=78|field=1"
msgid ""
"So, you have reconsidered my offer. Will you now agree to become my "
"followers?"
msgstr "내 제안을 다시 생각해 보았군. 이제 우리 추종자가 되겠는가?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=79|field=1"
msgid ""
"Ah the adventurers return. Again the question arises: To join them or no? "
"Yes, perhaps so…"
msgstr "아, 모험가들이 돌아왔군. 다시 그 질문이 떠오르는군. 함께할 것인가, 말 것인가? 그래, 어쩌면…"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=7|field=1"
msgid ""
"It's the end of the world!\n"
"The Mountain of Fire will consume us all!"
msgstr ""
"세상이 끝장날 거야!\n"
"불의 산이 우리 모두를 집어삼킬 거라고!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=80|field=1"
msgid "Hello, again."
msgstr "또 오셨군요."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=81|field=1"
msgid "Hello again. May the Light shine on you."
msgstr "또 오셨군요. 빛이 당신을 비추기를."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=82|field=1"
msgid "What do you want?"
msgstr "무슨 용건이오?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=83|field=1"
msgid "Hello, and good hunting!"
msgstr "안녕하시오, 사냥에 행운이 있기를!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=84|field=1"
msgid "Welcome to my home."
msgstr "내 집에 온 것을 환영하오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=85|field=1"
msgid "Greetings!"
msgstr "안녕하시오!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=86|field=1"
msgid "Yes?"
msgstr "네?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=87|field=1"
msgid "Yes?"
msgstr "네?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=88|field=1"
msgid "Hail!"
msgstr "만세!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=89|field=1"
msgid ""
"Hello again. What can the mighty Thorne do for you? Maybe I could sign my "
"name on your shield as a keepsake. A lot of my fans seem to like that sort "
"of thing."
msgstr ""
"또 오셨군요. 강대한 손이 무엇을 해드릴까요? 기념으로 방패에 내 서명이라도 해드릴까요? 내 팬들은 그런 걸 꽤 좋아하는 모양이더군요."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=8|field=1"
msgid "What are you doing here? Get my letter to Fellmoon!"
msgstr "여기서 뭐 하는 거요? 내 편지를 펠문에게 전하시오!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=90|field=1"
msgid "It is good to see you again."
msgstr "다시 만나니 반갑군요."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=91|field=1"
msgid "Greetings."
msgstr "안녕하시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=92|field=1"
msgid "What brings you again to Duroth the Eternal?"
msgstr "영원한 듀로스를 또 찾아온 이유가 무엇이오?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=93|field=1"
msgid "Hello again…need any Dragons trained?"
msgstr "또 오셨군요…훈련시킬 드래곤이라도 있습니까?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCGreet2.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt|table=NPCGreet|id=94|field=1"
msgid "Hello, again."
msgstr "또 오셨군요."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt
