"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=1499|field=<default>"
msgid "Diseased!"
msgstr "질병에 걸렸다!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=149|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"All Arcomage games here start with each player having a Tower of 50 and a Wall of 50.\n"
"The object is to get to either a Tower of 100, one of the resources to 300, or to destroy your opponent's Tower."
msgstr ""
"이곳의 모든 아르코메이지 경기는 각 플레이어가 탑 50, 성벽 50으로 시작합니다.\n"
"목표는 탑을 100까지 올리거나, 자원 하나를 300까지 모으거나, 상대의 탑을 파괴하는 것입니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=14|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"My brother, Isthric the Tongue, went to check on the tobersk plants on one of the lesser islands.\n"
"He has not returned!\n"
"I am afraid that he is one of those stranded by the cataclysm. He may even be hurt!\n"
"If you were to fix the Portals of Stone, he would surely be able to return, and we could get help to those who need it!\n"
"Find him for me!"
msgstr ""
"내 형제인 혀의 이스트릭이 작은 섬 중 하나에 있는 토버스크 식물을 살펴보러 갔습니다.\n"
"아직 돌아오지 않았습니다!\n"
"대재앙 때문에 고립된 이들 중 하나일까 두렵습니다. 어쩌면 다쳤을지도 모릅니다!\n"
"돌의 관문을 고쳐준다면 분명 돌아올 수 있을 것이고, 도움이 필요한 이들에게도 손길을 보낼 수 있을 것입니다!\n"
"그를 찾아주십시오!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=1500|field=<default>"
msgid "Nothing Here"
msgstr "아무것도 없다"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=1501|field=<default>"
msgid "Poisoned!"
msgstr "중독되었다!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
