msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2374|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Good %05!\n"
"I'm %01.\n"
"Pleased to meet you!"
msgstr ""
"좋은 %05입니다!\n"
"나는 %01입니다.\n"
"만나서 반갑습니다!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2375|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Oh, Hullo %02.\n"
"Nice %05, isn't it?"
msgstr ""
"오, 안녕하세요, %02.\n"
"좋은 %05이지요?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2376|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Hey, I already said I didn't want to be seen with you.\n"
"Get lost!"
msgstr ""
"이봐요, 당신과 함께 있는 모습을 보이고 싶지 않다고 이미 말했잖아요.\n"
"꺼져요!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2377|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Always glad to be of service, %06.\n"
"Do you have %04 for me?"
msgstr ""
"언제나 기꺼이 도와드리죠, %06.\n"
"내게 줄 %04이 있습니까?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2378|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Please don't kill me!\n"
"I've told you everything you asked for!"
msgstr ""
"제발 죽이지 마세요!\n"
"물어본 건 전부 말했잖아요!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2379|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"I only talk to real people, not unknowns like yourselves.\n"
"I'm busy now, so go away."
msgstr ""
"나는 진짜 사람하고만 이야기합니다. 당신들 같은 무명인과는 안 해요.\n"
"바쁘니 가세요."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=237|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"I can't go with you. Your party is too full. But you know? Things here are "
"wrapping up and I have little to do. I'll travel to the Adventurer's Inn and"
" seek my fortune there. Maybe we'll meet up there."
msgstr ""
"함께 갈 수 없겠군. 일행이 꽉 찼어. 하지만 이곳 일도 거의 마무리됐고 할 일도 별로 없어. 모험가의 여관으로 가서 새로운 기회를 "
"찾아보지. 어쩌면 거기서 다시 만날 수 있을 거야."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2380|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Oh No!\n"
"Please don't hurt me, %06 %02! I'll tell you anything!"
msgstr ""
"아, 안 돼!\n"
"해치지 마세요, %06 %02! 뭐든 말할게요!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2381|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"The infamous %06 %02!\n"
"I heard you've been murdering people right and left.\n"
"That's great!\n"
"What can I do for you?"
msgstr ""
"악명 높은 %06 %02!\n"
"여기저기 사람을 죽이고 다닌다는 이야기를 들었습니다.\n"
"훌륭하군요!\n"
"무엇을 도와드릴까요?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2382|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"%07 %02!\n"
"What an honor!\n"
"Everyone is talking about how you %08!\n"
"What can I do for you?"
msgstr ""
"%07 %02!\n"
"영광입니다!\n"
"모두가 당신이 %08했다고 이야기하고 있습니다!\n"
"무엇을 도와드릴까요?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2383|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Oh No!\n"
"%06 %02!\n"
"I didn't do it!\n"
"It was the other guy!\n"
"I wasn't there!\n"
"I'll tell you anything--anything, just don't hurt me!"
msgstr ""
"아, 안 돼!\n"
"%06 %02!\n"
"내가 한 게 아닙니다!\n"
"다른 사람이 했어요!\n"
"난 거기 없었습니다!\n"
"뭐든 말할게요. 뭐든지요. 제발 해치지만 마세요!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2384|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Oh…you people.\n"
"I can't even bear to think of things people are saying about you!\n"
"Go away and leave me alone!"
msgstr ""
"아… 당신들이군요.\n"
"사람들이 당신들에 대해 무슨 말을 하는지 생각하기도 싫습니다!\n"
"가서 나를 내버려두세요!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2385|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Oooh…I'm talking to %06 never do wrong!\n"
"Such an honor."
msgstr ""
"오오… 절대로 잘못하지 않는 %06과 이야기하고 있군요!\n"
"정말 영광입니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2386|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Although I have not heard many bad things about you, %02, I haven't heard many good stories either.\n"
"I just don't trust you."
msgstr ""
"%02, 당신에 대해 나쁜 이야기를 많이 듣지는 못했지만 좋은 이야기도 거의 듣지 못했습니다.\n"
"그저 믿을 수가 없군요."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2387|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"%02, eh?\n"
"I hear you might be a sheriff in disguise.\n"
"I don't talk to sheriffs. Or guards…. or King's men.\n"
"Maybe if you did a few crimes I could trust you. "
msgstr ""
"%02라고요?\n"
"보안관이 변장했다는 소문을 들었습니다.\n"
"난 보안관과 이야기하지 않아요. 경비병이나… 왕의 부하와도요.\n"
"범죄를 몇 번 저지르면 믿을 수 있을지도 모르죠. "

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2388|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"I've heard so many bad things about you.\n"
"Why won't you leave me alone?\n"
"I want no trouble from you!"
msgstr ""
"당신에 대한 나쁜 이야기를 너무 많이 들었습니다.\n"
"왜 나를 내버려두지 않는 거죠?\n"
"문제에 휘말리고 싶지 않습니다!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2389|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Maybe I didn't tell you before:\n"
"I don't like you.\n"
"I don't see why the high and mighty would want to talk to a lowlife like me anyway, so go away!"
msgstr ""
"전에 말하지 않았을지도 모르지만,\n"
"난 당신이 싫습니다.\n"
"높고 잘난 분들이 나 같은 밑바닥 인생과 왜 이야기하려는지도 모르겠으니 가세요!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=238|field=<default>"
msgid "Will you take Sethrc Thistlebone the Troll into your party?"
msgstr "트롤 세스릭 시슬본을 일행에 합류시키겠습니까?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2390|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"I'm simply not impressed.\n"
"Your reputation is but %11.\n"
"I won't talk to you unless it improves."
msgstr ""
"전혀 인상적이지 않군요.\n"
"당신의 평판은 고작 %11입니다.\n"
"더 좋아지기 전에는 이야기하지 않겠습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2391|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Your reputation is just too pure for me.\n"
"I don't like it.\n"
"It's not right.\n"
"Maybe if I heard some more bad gossip about you we could talk.\n"
"Until then…"
msgstr ""
"당신의 평판은 내게 너무 깨끗합니다.\n"
"마음에 들지 않아요.\n"
"옳지 않습니다.\n"
"당신에 대한 나쁜 소문을 좀 더 들으면 이야기할 수 있을지도 모르죠.\n"
"그때까지는…"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2392|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Oh, all right.\n"
"But I really don't want to be seen with you.\n"
"Let's not make this a habit."
msgstr ""
"아, 알겠습니다.\n"
"하지만 정말 당신과 함께 있는 모습을 보이고 싶지는 않아요.\n"
"이런 일이 습관이 되게 하지는 맙시다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2393|field=<default>"
msgid "n/a"
msgstr "해당 없음"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2394|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Thank you, %06.\n"
"Now, what did you want?"
msgstr ""
"감사합니다, %06.\n"
"그래서 무엇을 원했습니까?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2395|field=<default>"
msgid "n/a"
msgstr "해당 없음"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2396|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"<gulp> I get it. Yes, %06.\n"
"What do you want of me?"
msgstr ""
"<꿀꺽> 알겠습니다. 예, %06.\n"
"내게 무엇을 원합니까?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2397|field=<default>"
msgid "n/a"
msgstr "해당 없음"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2399|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"%02, eh?\n"
"I'll remember that."
msgstr ""
"%02라고요?\n"
"기억해두겠습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=239|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Hmm…you're party is too full, but still I wish to help you. I will go to the"
" Adventure's Inn. If you need a strong clubber, you will find me there."
msgstr ""
"흠… 일행이 너무 꽉 찼군. 그래도 너희를 돕고 싶다. 모험가의 여관으로 가겠다. 강한 몽둥이잡이가 필요하면 거기서 나를 찾아라."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=23|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Bring the portal crystal to Fredrick Talimere. He will know what it does."
msgstr "관문 수정을 프레드릭 탈리미어에게 가져가십시오. 그라면 용도를 알 것입니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2400|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"%02 again.\n"
"What do you want?"
msgstr ""
"또 %02군요.\n"
"무엇을 원합니까?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2401|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"My patience is at its end.\n"
"Go away and stop bothering me."
msgstr ""
"인내심도 이제 바닥났습니다.\n"
"가서 더는 귀찮게 하지 마십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2402|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"More!\n"
"More gold!\n"
"Yes!\n"
"Give me %04 more!"
msgstr ""
"더!\n"
"금을 더 내놓으십시오!\n"
"그래요!\n"
"%04만큼 더 주십시오!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2403|field=<default>"
msgid "Ooooh, %06, no need to threaten me again, I'll talk."
msgstr "으으, %06, 다시 협박할 필요는 없습니다. 말하겠습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2404|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"I will not talk to nobodies.\n"
"Leave me."
msgstr ""
"이름도 없는 자들과는 이야기하지 않습니다.\n"
"가십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2405|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Monsters!\n"
"I have heard of your crimes.\n"
"I would slay you if I could."
msgstr ""
"괴물들!\n"
"당신들의 죄악을 들었습니다.\n"
"할 수만 있다면 당장 베어버릴 텐데."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2406|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Your infamy precedes you, %02.\n"
"Anything to serve one so wicked as you, %06."
msgstr ""
"악명이 자자하군요, %02.\n"
"당신처럼 사악한 분을 섬길 수 있다면 무엇이든 하겠습니다, %06."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2407|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"%07 %02.\n"
"I am gratified to know you.\n"
"What is mine is yours."
msgstr ""
"%07 %02.\n"
"알게 되어 영광입니다.\n"
"제 것은 모두 당신의 것입니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2408|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Hissssss….Please, don't slay me.\n"
"I am a worm, not worth your trouble.\n"
"I grovel at your feet, mighty %10."
msgstr ""
"쉬이이익….제발 죽이지 마십시오.\n"
"저는 벌레 같은 자라 당신이 손쓸 가치도 없습니다.\n"
"위대하신 %10이시여, 발아래 엎드리겠습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2409|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"I don't speak with evil humans.\n"
"Go away before I become…violent."
msgstr ""
"사악한 인간과는 말하지 않습니다.\n"
"제가…폭력적으로 변하기 전에 가십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=240|field=<default>"
msgid "Do you care to travel with Rionel the Minotaur?"
msgstr "미노타우로스 리오넬과 함께 여행하겠습니까?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2410|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Oh, hooray.\n"
"It's the good guys.\n"
"You're lucky I'm in a good mood right now.\n"
"Leave me before it changes."
msgstr ""
"아, 신나는군요.\n"
"착한 분들이 오셨네.\n"
"지금 제가 기분이 좋아서 다행인 줄 아십시오.\n"
"마음이 바뀌기 전에 가십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2411|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Most humans are evil…and a simple lack of criminal reputation isn't enough to make me trust you.\n"
"Leave me."
msgstr ""
"대부분의 인간은 사악합니다…범죄자로 알려지지 않았다는 것만으로는 당신을 믿을 수 없습니다.\n"
"가십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2412|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"%02. I smell traces of an awful goodness seeping from your pores.\n"
"I can't stand it!\n"
"Go and commit some acts of unspeakable evil.\n"
"Maybe then I'll talk to\n"
"you."
msgstr ""
"%02. 몸에서 끔찍한 선의 냄새가 새어 나오는군요.\n"
"견딜 수 없습니다!\n"
"가서 차마 입에 담을 수 없는 악행을 좀 저지르십시오.\n"
"그러면 그때는 당신과 이야기할지도\n"
"모르지요."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2413|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Back again, %02?\n"
"I thought you were smarter than that.\n"
"I can smell the evil on you.\n"
"It makes me hungry!"
msgstr ""
"또 왔습니까, %02?\n"
"그보다는 영리한 줄 알았습니다.\n"
"당신에게서 악의 냄새가 납니다.\n"
"배가 고파지는군요!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2414|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"My mood grows sour as I contemplate your lack of evil.\n"
"I have nothing to say to you."
msgstr ""
"당신에게 악의가 부족하다는 생각을 하니 기분이 상하는군요.\n"
"할 말 없습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2415|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"The stories I hear about you are %11, but that isn't good enough.\n"
"Be on your way."
msgstr ""
"당신에 관해 들리는 이야기는 %11 수준이지만, 그 정도로는 부족합니다.\n"
"가십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2416|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"I can sense goodness upon you, %02.\n"
"Bring yourself down to %11, and then return to me."
msgstr ""
"당신에게서 선함이 느껴지는군요, %02.\n"
"평판을 %11까지 떨어뜨린 뒤 다시 오십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2417|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Your groveling has touched my heart.\n"
"I will talk to you for a moment."
msgstr ""
"당신이 비는 모습을 보니 마음이 움직이는군요.\n"
"잠시 이야기해 드리겠습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2418|field=<default>"
msgid "n/a"
msgstr "n/a"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2419|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Yes, good.\n"
"What do you want?"
msgstr ""
"좋습니다.\n"
"무엇을 원합니까?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=241|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"I can't go with you now. Your party is full. I will still make myself "
"available to you. If you need me, I'll be at the Adventurer's Inn."
msgstr "지금은 함께 갈 수 없군. 일행이 가득 찼다. 그래도 필요하면 언제든 합류하겠다. 모험가의 여관에서 기다리겠다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2420|field=<default>"
msgid "n/a"
msgstr "n/a"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2421|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Please, don't slay me!\n"
"I will tell you what you want to know!"
msgstr ""
"제발 죽이지 마십시오!\n"
"원하는 것은 무엇이든 말하겠습니다!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2422|field=<default>"
msgid "n/a"
msgstr "n/a"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2424|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Hi.\n"
"Name's %01."
msgstr ""
"안녕하세요.\n"
"이름은 %01입니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2425|field=<default>"
msgid "How're you doin', %02?"
msgstr "잘 지내십니까, %02?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2426|field=<default>"
msgid "n/a"
msgstr "n/a"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2427|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Price is the same every time, %06.\n"
"%04 gold!"
msgstr ""
"값은 언제나 같습니다, %06.\n"
"금화 %04닢입니다!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2428|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Hey, uh, we're still friends, right?\n"
"What do you need?"
msgstr ""
"저기, 음, 우리 아직 친구 맞지요?\n"
"무엇이 필요합니까?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2429|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Go away kid, ya bother me.\n"
"Come back when you're not as wet behind the ears."
msgstr ""
"가라, 꼬맹아. 귀찮게 하지 마.\n"
"풋내기 티를 벗고 다시 와."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=242|field=<default>"
msgid "Will you take Adric Stellare the Dark Elf into your party?"
msgstr "다크 엘프 애드릭 스텔라레를 일행에 합류시키겠습니까?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2430|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"It's <gulp>…%06 %02 and %09 band of merry pranksters!\n"
"You are so well known around here!\n"
"A real…honor, my %10."
msgstr ""
"<꿀꺽>…%06 %02와 %09의 유쾌한 장난꾼 무리로군요!\n"
"이 근방에서 정말 유명하십니다!\n"
"실로…영광입니다, %10."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2431|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Ah, the notorious %06 %02.\n"
"Anything for you, %02!"
msgstr ""
"아, 악명 높은 %06 %02.\n"
"무엇이든 말씀하십시오, %02!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2432|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Your exploits are known far and wide, %06 %02.\n"
"%01 at your service, my %10."
msgstr ""
"당신의 활약은 널리 알려졌습니다, %06 %02.\n"
"%01가 모시겠습니다, %10."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2433|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"%07 %02!\n"
"So good to see you in person!\n"
"Which is surprising, since you are so famous and powerful and good, while I am so weak and pitiful.\n"
"Not worth your time, no, not at all. Aheh-heh…Heh."
msgstr ""
"%07 %02!\n"
"직접 뵙게 되어 정말 반갑습니다!\n"
"당신은 그토록 유명하고 강하며 선한데, 저는 이토록 약하고 보잘것없으니 놀라운 일이지요.\n"
"당신의 시간을 들일 가치도 없습니다. 하하…하."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2434|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"You've a %11 reputation, %06.\n"
"I don't want anything to do with you."
msgstr ""
"평판이 %11이군요, %06.\n"
"당신과는 엮이고 싶지 않습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2435|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"<sneer> Stinkin' goody two-shoes.\n"
"They say you %08.\n"
"Well isn't that just wonderful?\n"
"You people make me sick.\n"
"Go your way before I do something you'll regret!"
msgstr ""
"<비웃으며> 지독한 모범생 같으니.\n"
"당신들이 %08했다고 들었습니다.\n"
"참으로 훌륭하시군요?\n"
"당신들 같은 자들은 구역질 납니다.\n"
"후회할 일을 당하기 전에 가십시오!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2436|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Nothing I've heard about you makes me want to speak with you, %02.\n"
"I'm not saying you are bad people;\n"
"I'm just saying that you might not be good.\n"
"Perhaps if you improved your reputation…"
msgstr ""
"당신에 관해 들은 어떤 이야기도 대화를 나누고 싶게 만들지는 않는군요, %02.\n"
"나쁜 사람들이라는 뜻은 아닙니다.\n"
"그저 선한 사람인지 확신할 수 없다는 뜻이지요.\n"
"평판을 좀 더 좋게 만든다면…"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2437|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"<squinting>\n"
"Hmm.\n"
"I've heard that you have a bad reputation.\n"
"That's a good start, but not quite enough.\n"
"Your reputation is going to have to get a lot worse before I trust you!"
msgstr ""
"<눈을 가늘게 뜨며>\n"
"흠.\n"
"평판이 나쁘다고 들었습니다.\n"
"좋은 출발이지만 아직 부족합니다.\n"
"당신을 믿으려면 평판이 훨씬 더 나빠져야 합니다!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2438|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"There's a lot of talk about you people and none of it is good.\n"
"I can't be seen with you.\n"
"Let's go our separate ways, shall we?"
msgstr ""
"당신들에 관한 말이 많은데 좋은 이야기는 하나도 없습니다.\n"
"함께 있는 모습을 보일 수는 없군요.\n"
"각자 갈 길을 가는 게 어떻겠습니까?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2439|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Oh, back again, huh?\n"
"Have you been deputized yet?\n"
"Favored by the King?\n"
"Well, I'll tell you--Mayors and Kings may welcome your type, but I sure don't.\n"
"Watch your back."
msgstr ""
"아, 또 왔습니까?\n"
"보안관이라도 됐습니까?\n"
"왕의 총애라도 받았고요?\n"
"시장이나 왕은 당신 같은 자를 반길지 몰라도, 나는 아닙니다.\n"
"뒤통수를 조심하십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=243|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Yes, I will gladly join you. Unfortunately, your party is too full. Tell you"
" what. I'll go to the Adventurer's Inn. If you want to travel with me, "
"you'll find me there."
msgstr ""
"그래, 기꺼이 합류하겠다. 하지만 일행이 너무 꽉 찼군. 이렇게 하지. 모험가의 여관으로 가겠다. 함께 여행하고 싶다면 그곳에서 나를 "
"찾아라."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2440|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Ah, %02.\n"
"Until the rumors and gossip about you grow more positive, I don't want to talk to you. "
msgstr ""
"아, %02.\n"
"당신에 관한 소문과 평판이 더 좋아지기 전까지는 말하고 싶지 않습니다. "

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2441|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Look, all my friends are uncertain about trusting you.\n"
"Until you do something to earn our faith, something illegal, I just can't be seen with you.\n"
"It makes me look bad."
msgstr ""
"내 친구들은 모두 당신을 믿어도 될지 의심하고 있습니다.\n"
"우리의 신뢰를 얻을 만한 일, 이를테면 불법적인 일을 하기 전까지는 함께 있는 모습을 보일 수 없습니다.\n"
"내 체면이 깎이니까요."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2442|field=<default>"
msgid "n/a"
msgstr "n/a"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2443|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"I gave at the Guild.\n"
"I'm not interested. I'm broke.\n"
"It's not my problem.\n"
"Get a job.\n"
"I don't care…Don't you get it?\n"
"Go away, I don't want to talk to you!"
msgstr ""
"길드에서 이미 기부했습니다.\n"
"관심 없습니다. 돈도 없습니다.\n"
"내 문제가 아닙니다.\n"
"일자리나 구하십시오.\n"
"관심 없다니까요…모르겠습니까?\n"
"가십시오, 말하고 싶지 않습니다!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2444|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"A pleasure doing business with you, %06.\n"
"What can I do for you?"
msgstr ""
"거래해서 즐거웠습니다, %06.\n"
"무엇을 도와드릴까요?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2445|field=<default>"
msgid "n/a"
msgstr "n/a"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2446|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Ok, ok!\n"
"Whatever you say, boss."
msgstr ""
"알겠습니다, 알겠습니다!\n"
"말씀대로 하겠습니다, 대장."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2447|field=<default>"
msgid "n/a"
msgstr "n/a"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2449|field=<default>"
msgid "<bowing> %01, at your service."
msgstr "<고개 숙이며> %01, 모시겠습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=244|field=<default>"
msgid "Will you take the Vampire Infaustus into your party?"
msgstr "흡혈귀 인파우스투스를 일행에 합류시키겠습니까?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2450|field=<default>"
msgid "Always a pleasure, %06 %02."
msgstr "언제나 반갑습니다, %06 %02."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2451|field=<default>"
msgid "n/a"
msgstr "n/a"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2452|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Ahh, yes.\n"
"< %01 rubs %03 hands together> More important business and discussion, I suppose.\n"
"The price, as always, is %04."
msgstr ""
"아, 그렇군요.\n"
"<%01가 %03 손을 비빈다> 또 중요한 용무와 이야기가 있나 보군요.\n"
"값은 언제나처럼 %04입니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2453|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Oh, dear!\n"
"What more do you want?"
msgstr ""
"아이고!\n"
"또 무엇을 원합니까?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2454|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"My merchandise is both rare and high quality.\n"
"So are my customers.\n"
"Since you are low quality customers, it would seem we are unable to conduct business."
msgstr ""
"내 상품은 희귀하고 품질도 뛰어납니다.\n"
"손님도 마찬가지여야 하지요.\n"
"당신들은 수준 낮은 손님이니 거래할 수 없겠군요."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2455|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Oh, my, %02!\n"
"Please don't rob me!\n"
"I have nothing of value!\n"
"All I own is debt!\n"
"Have mercy, my %10!"
msgstr ""
"아, %02!\n"
"제발 강도질하지 마십시오!\n"
"값나가는 것은 아무것도 없습니다!\n"
"가진 것이라곤 빚뿐입니다!\n"
"자비를 베푸십시오, %10!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2456|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"%07 %02!\n"
"That was really something when you slaughtered everyone in that small village!\n"
"Had it coming, if you ask me.\n"
"That was you…wasn't it?\n"
"Well, anyway, what can I do for you?"
msgstr ""
"%07 %02!\n"
"그 작은 마을 사람들을 모조리 학살했을 때는 정말 대단했습니다!\n"
"내 생각에도 당해도 싼 자들이었지요.\n"
"그게 당신들이었지요…아닙니까?\n"
"어쨌든, 무엇을 도와드릴까요?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2457|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"I heard about how you %08.\n"
"It is an honor and a pleasure.\n"
"Anything for you, my %10."
msgstr ""
"당신들이 %08했다는 이야기를 들었습니다.\n"
"영광이고 기쁨입니다.\n"
"무엇이든 말씀하십시오, %10."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2458|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Please, please, don't kill me, your worship! <sob>\n"
"I am a wretch, not worth tiring your sword arm.\n"
"If you leave me alone, I will die on my own soon anyway!\n"
"Have mercy, mighty %10!\n"
"Have mercy!"
msgstr ""
"제발, 제발 죽이지 마십시오, 높으신 분! <흐느끼며>\n"
"저는 비참한 자라 칼을 휘두를 가치도 없습니다.\n"
"내버려두셔도 머지않아 알아서 죽을 것입니다!\n"
"자비를 베푸십시오, 위대하신 %10!\n"
"자비를!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2459|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"%02...\n"
"I've heard things about you, none of them good.\n"
"Please remove yourself from my presence.\n"
"Immediately."
msgstr ""
"%02...\n"
"당신들에 관한 이야기를 들었는데 좋은 것은 하나도 없었습니다.\n"
"제 앞에서 사라져 주십시오.\n"
"당장."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=245|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"I would go with you, but your party is too full. I prefer to travel with "
"fewer people. I go now to the Adventurer's Inn. There I will find my "
"companions."
msgstr ""
"함께 가고 싶지만 일행이 너무 꽉 찼군. 나는 적은 인원과 여행하는 편을 좋아한다. 이제 모험가의 여관으로 가겠다. 그곳에서 동료를 찾을"
" 것이다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2460|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Psssst!\n"
"Hey, you wanna buy a <squints> wait a minute…never mind."
msgstr ""
"쉿!\n"
"이봐요, 혹시 <눈을 가늘게 뜨며> 잠깐…아무것도 아닙니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2461|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"I only deal with people I know and trust.\n"
"Since I haven't heard anything good about you, I have\n"
"no reason to trust you.\n"
"Good day."
msgstr ""
"나는 알고 믿는 사람과만 거래합니다.\n"
"당신에 관해 좋은 이야기를 들은 적이 없으니\n"
"믿을 이유도 없습니다.\n"
"좋은 하루 보내십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2462|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"%10 %02.\n"
"I've heard of you.\n"
"They say your reputation is %11.\n"
"That says a lot, but I need to hear more before I feel I can safely deal with you.\n"
"Come back to me after you have proven yourself some more."
msgstr ""
"%10 %02.\n"
"당신들 이야기를 들었습니다.\n"
"평판이 %11이라고 하더군요.\n"
"그것만으로도 많은 것을 알 수 있지만, 안심하고 거래하려면 더 들어야 합니다.\n"
"자신을 더 증명한 뒤 돌아오십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2463|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"I do not speak to ruffians!\n"
"Your reputation is %11, well below my standards."
msgstr ""
"불한당과는 이야기하지 않습니다!\n"
"당신의 평판은 %11로, 내 기준에 한참 못 미칩니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2464|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Are you talking to me?\n"
"Go bother someone else.\n"
"I have nothing for you."
msgstr ""
"나한테 말하는 겁니까?\n"
"다른 사람이나 귀찮게 하십시오.\n"
"당신에게 줄 것은 없습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2465|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Persons of quality are not telling me that you are a person of quality.\n"
"Since I only deal with people whose reputations are %12 or better, we have nothing further to talk about."
msgstr ""
"품위 있는 사람들은 당신이 품위 있다고 말하지 않더군요.\n"
"나는 평판이 %12 이상인 사람과만 거래하니 더 이야기할 것이 없습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2466|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"I just can't trust you.\n"
"Maybe if your reputation were to fall to %11, or worse we could talk.\n"
"<bowing> Until then %10."
msgstr ""
"도저히 믿을 수 없습니다.\n"
"평판이 %11 이하로 떨어진다면 이야기할 수 있을지도 모르지요.\n"
"<고개 숙이며> 그때까지는 안녕히, %10."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2467|field=<default>"
msgid "n/a"
msgstr "n/a"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2468|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"What about me makes you think I care about you or your problems?\n"
"Begone, or I shall set the town guard on you."
msgstr ""
"내가 당신이나 당신 문제에 관심이 있다고 생각한 근거가 무엇입니까?\n"
"꺼지십시오. 아니면 경비대를 부르겠습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2469|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Thank you!\n"
"Please, tell me what it is you are seeking."
msgstr ""
"고맙습니다!\n"
"무엇을 찾는지 말씀해 주십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=246|field=<default>"
msgid "Do you ask Brimstone the Dragon to join you?"
msgstr "드래곤 브림스톤에게 합류를 요청하겠습니까?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2470|field=<default>"
msgid "n/a"
msgstr "n/a"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2471|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"I see.\n"
"No need for violence.\n"
"What is it you need?"
msgstr ""
"알겠습니다.\n"
"폭력을 쓸 필요는 없습니다.\n"
"무엇이 필요합니까?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2472|field=<default>"
msgid "n/a"
msgstr "n/a"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2474|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"I am %01.\n"
"What do you want?"
msgstr ""
"나는 %01입니다.\n"
"무엇을 원합니까?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2475|field=<default>"
msgid "<sigh> Back so soon?"
msgstr "<한숨> 벌써 또 왔습니까?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2476|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"I told you already--I don't have time for you.\n"
"Maybe tomorrow."
msgstr ""
"이미 말했듯 당신에게 쓸 시간은 없습니다.\n"
"내일 다시 오십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2477|field=<default>"
msgid "n/a"
msgstr "n/a"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2478|field=<default>"
msgid "Grrrr…someday…All right, what is it?"
msgstr "으르렁…언젠가는…좋습니다, 무엇입니까?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2479|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"You may have heard of me.\n"
"Some call me…%02.\n"
"Being famous, I only associate with other famous and important people.\n"
"You are neither.\n"
"Begone."
msgstr ""
"내 이름을 들어봤을지도 모르겠군요.\n"
"어떤 이들은 나를…%02라 부릅니다.\n"
"유명인인 나는 유명하고 중요한 사람들과만 어울립니다.\n"
"당신들은 둘 다 아니군요.\n"
"가십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=247|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Ah, but your party is too full. Still, you are clearly the ones I seek. I "
"will go to the Adventurer's Inn. Join with me there when you have room."
msgstr ""
"아, 일행이 너무 꽉 찼군. 그래도 내가 찾던 이들이 바로 너희라는 건 분명하다. 모험가의 여관으로 가겠다. 자리가 생기면 그곳에서 나와"
" 합류해라."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2480|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"I never thought that I might one day come face to face with one as evil as you, %02.\n"
"This is not a happy day.\n"
"What are your demands?"
msgstr ""
"당신처럼 사악한 자와 언젠가 얼굴을 마주하게 될 줄은 몰랐습니다, %02.\n"
"오늘은 불길한 날이군요.\n"
"무엇을 요구합니까?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2481|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"A delight to finally meet the mighty %06 %02 in the flesh.\n"
"The denizens of the netherworld can't stop praising your exploits, and they eagerly await your inevitable arrival…Until then, how may I serve you, my %10?"
msgstr ""
"위대하신 %06 %02를 직접 만나게 되어 기쁩니다.\n"
"저승의 주민들도 당신의 활약을 칭송하며 필연적으로 오실 날을 손꼽아 기다립니다…그때까지 무엇을 도와드릴까요, %10?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2482|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"To know you is to love you, honorable %06 %02!\n"
"You are the ones who %08.\n"
"You have but to ask and from me you will receive!"
msgstr ""
"존경하는 %06 %02, 당신을 알게 되면 사랑할 수밖에 없습니다!\n"
"당신들은 %08한 분들이지요.\n"
"말씀만 하시면 무엇이든 드리겠습니다!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2483|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Wait!\n"
"Please don't attack me!\n"
"I'll stop the experiments,\n"
"I swear!\n"
"No more evil sorcery for me..I'm done with that, you can count on me, %10 %02."
msgstr ""
"잠깐!\n"
"제발 공격하지 마십시오!\n"
"실험은 그만두겠습니다,\n"
"맹세합니다!\n"
"사악한 마법은 이제 끝입니다..다시는 하지 않겠습니다, 믿어주십시오, %10 %02."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2484|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Bah!\n"
"I haven't time enough for the likes of you!\n"
"I will only speak to people of good repute--people who's reputation is %12…or better."
msgstr ""
"흥!\n"
"당신 같은 자에게 쓸 시간은 없습니다!\n"
"나는 평판 좋은 사람, 즉 평판이 %12…이상인 사람과만 이야기합니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2485|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"May the dark gods save us from the righteous!\n"
"Is there no end to you people?\n"
"Get away from me before I put a hex on you!"
msgstr ""
"어둠의 신들이 정의로운 자들에게서 우리를 구하시길!\n"
"당신들은 끝도 없이 나타나는군요?\n"
"내가 저주를 걸기 전에 꺼지십시오!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2486|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"I am afraid I cannot associate with people whose charm and reputation do not approach my own.\n"
"It would taint my aura.\n"
"Sorry."
msgstr ""
"매력과 평판이 나와 비슷한 수준에 이르지 못한 사람과는 어울릴 수 없습니다.\n"
"내 기운이 더럽혀질 테니까요.\n"
"미안합니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2487|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"%02, I am %01.\n"
"I am constrained by pacts and promises I have made from dealing over much with the innocent.\n"
"I only tell you this because I heard that your reputation is %11.\n"
"That's bad, but not bad enough.\n"
"Return after performing a few more despicable acts.\n"
"Then we will talk."
msgstr ""
"%02, 나는 %01입니다.\n"
"무고한 자들과 지나치게 거래하지 않겠다는 계약과 약속에 묶여 있습니다.\n"
"당신의 평판이 %11이라고 들었기에 말해주는 겁니다.\n"
"나쁘기는 하지만 충분히 나쁘지는 않습니다.\n"
"비열한 짓을 몇 번 더 하고 돌아오십시오.\n"
"그러면 이야기하지요."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2488|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"I grow wrathful thinking about all the negative things the wind whispers about you.\n"
"Your reputation is %11!\n"
"Not very nice.\n"
"Now begone, before my wrath turns to action!"
msgstr ""
"바람이 전하는 당신에 관한 나쁜 이야기를 떠올리니 분노가 치밉니다.\n"
"평판이 %11이라니!\n"
"그다지 좋지 않군요.\n"
"내 분노가 행동으로 바뀌기 전에 꺼지십시오!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2489|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Wasn't I rude enough the last time we spoke?\n"
"I detest you!\n"
"Your angelic faces turn my stomach!\n"
"Your innocence nauseates me! Leave!"
msgstr ""
"지난번에 내가 충분히 무례하지 않았습니까?\n"
"당신들이 혐오스럽습니다!\n"
"천사 같은 얼굴만 봐도 속이 뒤집힙니다!\n"
"그 순진함에 구역질이 납니다! 가십시오!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=248|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Many our the Shadowspire Guild thanks for recovering the Lost Book of Khel! "
"Perhaps I can join you in your travels to provide my own personal "
"assistance?"
msgstr ""
"잃어버린 켈의 책을 되찾아 준 데 대해 섀도스파이어 길드 모두가 감사드립니다! 제가 직접 도움을 드릴 수 있도록 함께 여행해도 될까요?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2490|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"%02.\n"
"Your reputation suffers.\n"
"Prolonged association with the likes of you imperils the purity of my aura.\n"
"I don't want to speak with you."
msgstr ""
"%02.\n"
"당신의 평판은 형편없군요.\n"
"당신 같은 자와 오래 어울리면 내 기운의 순수함이 위태로워집니다.\n"
"말하고 싶지 않습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2491|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Your aura lacks the mottled purple and yellow spots I must see before I am allowed to speak with you.\n"
"You must do more evil, %02, before we can safely talk."
msgstr ""
"당신의 기운에는 내가 대화해도 좋다는 허락을 받는 데 필요한 보랏빛과 노란 얼룩이 없습니다.\n"
"안전하게 이야기하려면 더 많은 악행을 저질러야 합니다, %02."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2492|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"<sigh> Very well.\n"
"But this is it for today!\n"
"I don't have time for you."
msgstr ""
"<한숨> 좋습니다.\n"
"하지만 오늘은 이게 마지막입니다!\n"
"당신에게 쓸 시간은 없습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2493|field=<default>"
msgid "n/a"
msgstr "n/a"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2494|field=<default>"
msgid "n/a"
msgstr "n/a"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2495|field=<default>"
msgid "Money alone will not sway me, scoundrel!"
msgstr "돈만으로 나를 흔들 수는 없습니다, 악당!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2496|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Hmmm.\n"
"You have a point.\n"
"What do you want?"
msgstr ""
"흠.\n"
"일리가 있군요.\n"
"무엇을 원합니까?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2497|field=<default>"
msgid "n/a"
msgstr "n/a"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2499|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"%02.\n"
"Charmed, I'm sure."
msgstr ""
"%02.\n"
"만나서 반갑습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=249|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"I would like to join you in your travels to provide my own personal assistance but I see that your group is full.\n"
"You can find me in the Adventurer's Inn if you need me."
msgstr ""
"직접 도움을 드리기 위해 함께 여행하고 싶지만 일행이 가득 찼군요.\n"
"필요하다면 모험가의 여관에서 저를 찾으실 수 있습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=24|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"The Merchant Council had sent our greatest warrior, Cauri Blackthorne, to consult with the Sun Temple priests about the disasters that have struck all of Jadame.Cauri left for the Temple of the Sun in Murmurwoods shortly after rumors of the cataclysms were heard here in Alvar.\n"
"She was to return after consulting the priests.\n"
"We are very concerned that she has not returned.As for your promotion, only Cauri can accurately test your skills and assess your worthiness for promotion.\n"
"If you find her, provide her with any assistance she may need and return here with news of her status and location."
msgstr ""
"상인 평의회는 제이덤 전역을 덮친 재난에 관해 태양의 신전 사제들과 상의하도록 우리의 가장 위대한 전사 카우리 블랙손을 보냈습니다.카우리는 이곳 알바르에 대재앙의 소문이 들려온 직후 머머우즈의 태양의 신전으로 떠났습니다.\n"
"사제들과 상의한 뒤 돌아올 예정이었습니다.\n"
"그녀가 돌아오지 않아 매우 걱정하고 있습니다.승급에 관해서라면, 오직 카우리만이 당신의 능력을 정확히 시험하고 승급 자격을 판단할 수 있습니다.\n"
"그녀를 찾으면 필요한 도움을 제공하고, 상태와 소재에 관한 소식을 가지고 이곳으로 돌아오십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2500|field=<default>"
msgid "What is it, %02?"
msgstr "무슨 일입니까, %02?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2501|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"No.\n"
"I won't let you waste any more of my time.\n"
"Perhaps tomorrow."
msgstr ""
"안 됩니다.\n"
"더는 내 시간을 낭비하게 두지 않겠습니다.\n"
"내일 다시 오십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2502|field=<default>"
msgid "n/a"
msgstr "n/a"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2503|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Now what?\n"
"Have you returned to slay me?\n"
"I will surely call out your name before you strike me down!\n"
"Someone will come to save me!"
msgstr ""
"이번에는 또 뭡니까?\n"
"나를 죽이러 돌아왔습니까?\n"
"당신이 나를 베기 전에 반드시 이름을 외치겠습니다!\n"
"누군가 구하러 올 겁니다!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2504|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"I haven't time for simple folk such as yourselves!\n"
"Perhaps when you have become more sophisticated…"
msgstr ""
"당신들 같은 평범한 자들에게 쓸 시간은 없습니다!\n"
"좀 더 세련된 사람이 된 뒤에 오십시오…"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2505|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Oh dear, the infamous %06 %02 and accomplices…I suppose begging for my life isn't enough.\n"
"What do you want of me?"
msgstr ""
"아이고, 악명 높은 %06 %02와 그 공범들이군요…목숨을 구걸하는 것만으로는 부족하겠지요.\n"
"내게 무엇을 원합니까?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2506|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"My %10, everyone with an open mind in the Kingdom follows your deliciously outrageous behavior.\n"
"Such a wonderful history your deeds will make.\n"
"How may I serve you?"
msgstr ""
"%10, 왕국에서 열린 마음을 가진 자들은 모두 당신의 터무니없이 대담한 행보를 지켜보고 있습니다.\n"
"당신의 업적은 훌륭한 역사로 남겠군요.\n"
"무엇을 도와드릴까요?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2507|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Your deeds are known far and wide, my %10.\n"
"I will gladly serve you."
msgstr ""
"당신의 업적은 널리 알려졌습니다, %10.\n"
"기꺼이 섬기겠습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2508|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"I know you're thinking you should strike me down like the dog I am, %10, but"
" surely a saint like yourself can find it in your heart to overlook past "
"indiscretions… Can't you?"
msgstr ""
"저 같은 개를 베어버릴 생각이겠지만, %10, 당신 같은 성인이라면 마음속에서 지난 잘못을 눈감아줄 자비를 찾을 수 있지 "
"않겠습니까…그렇지요?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2509|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"People have been talking about how you like to commit crimes, %02.\n"
"I don't like how that sounds, so I don't want to talk to you."
msgstr ""
"당신들이 범죄를 즐긴다는 소문이 돌고 있습니다, %02.\n"
"마음에 들지 않는 이야기라 말하고 싶지 않습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=250|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"It was very noble of you to seek a cure for the knight, Blazen Stormlance.\n"
"I would like to join you in your quest! Will you have me?"
msgstr ""
"기사 블레이즌 스톰랜스를 치료할 방법을 찾아 나선 것은 정말 고귀한 일이었습니다.\n"
"저도 여러분의 여정에 합류하고 싶습니다! 받아 주시겠습니까?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2510|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"I doubt you would approve of my researches into the darker magics, just as I would not approve of your intolerant ways.\n"
"I have nothing further to say to you."
msgstr ""
"내가 어둠의 마법을 연구하는 것을 당신들이 용납하지 않듯, 나도 당신들의 편협한 방식을 용납하지 않습니다.\n"
"더 할 말 없습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2511|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"The court of public opinion about you is divided, %02.\n"
"Some say you are good people, others are not so sure. I, for one, will wait for more good rumors about you before I will speak with you."
msgstr ""
"당신들에 대한 세간의 평가는 엇갈립니다, %02.\n"
"좋은 사람들이라는 이도 있고 확신하지 못하는 이도 있습니다. 나는 당신에 관한 좋은 소문이 더 들릴 때까지 말하지 않겠습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2512|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Look--I'm bad company.\n"
"Evil, pure and simple, through and through.\n"
"How would it look to all my friends to be caught associating with people who lack the kind of %12 reputation we have?\n"
"That's right--simply dreadful."
msgstr ""
"이봐요, 나는 질 나쁜 자입니다.\n"
"처음부터 끝까지 순수한 악 그 자체지요.\n"
"우리처럼 평판이 %12인 사람들과 어울리면서, 그런 평판조차 없는 자들과 함께 있는 모습을 친구들에게 보이면 어떻게 보이겠습니까?\n"
"맞습니다. 끔찍하겠지요."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2513|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"The talk about you and your friends is that you are not decent folk, %02.\n"
"I, for one, will have nothing to do with you."
msgstr ""
"당신과 친구들이 점잖은 이들이 아니라는 말이 돌고 있습니다, %02.\n"
"나는 당신들과 엮이지 않겠습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2514|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"It is a pleasure withholding information from righteous do-gooders like you!\n"
"Beg me to reconsider and I might condescend to speak with you."
msgstr ""
"당신들 같은 정의로운 참견꾼에게 정보를 숨기는 건 즐거운 일입니다!\n"
"마음을 바꿔달라고 빌면, 어쩌면 선심 써서 이야기해 줄지도 모르지요."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2515|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"<sigh>\n"
"Though your reputation is at least %11, I promised my mother that I wouldn't talk to people whose reputation wasn't at least %12.\n"
"Sorry."
msgstr ""
"<한숨>\n"
"당신의 평판이 적어도 %11이기는 하지만, 어머니께 평판이 최소 %12인 사람하고만 말하겠다고 약속했습니다.\n"
"미안합니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2516|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Your reputation is only %12!\n"
"I can't be seen with you.\n"
"Everyone I know would laugh at me!\n"
"I only associate with people whose reputation is %11 or worse."
msgstr ""
"당신의 평판은 겨우 %12입니다!\n"
"당신과 함께 있는 모습을 보일 수 없습니다.\n"
"아는 사람들이 모두 비웃을 겁니다!\n"
"나는 평판이 %11 이하인 사람과만 어울립니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2517|field=<default>"
msgid "Fine, but make it quick."
msgstr "좋습니다. 하지만 빨리 말하십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2518|field=<default>"
msgid "n/a"
msgstr "n/a"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2519|field=<default>"
msgid "n/a"
msgstr "n/a"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=251|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"I wish I could join with you now, but your party is too full. I will wait "
"for you in the Adventurer's Inn. Until then, good luck!"
msgstr "지금 합류하고 싶지만 일행이 너무 꽉 찼군요. 모험가의 여관에서 기다리겠습니다. 그때까지 행운을 빕니다!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2520|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Money means little.\n"
"Knowledge is power to me."
msgstr ""
"돈은 별 의미가 없습니다.\n"
"내게는 지식이 힘입니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2521|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Understood %06.\n"
"I want to live.\n"
"What do you need?"
msgstr ""
"알겠습니다, %06.\n"
"살고 싶습니다.\n"
"무엇이 필요합니까?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2522|field=<default>"
msgid "n/a"
msgstr "n/a"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2524|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Hello there!\n"
"A mighty fine %05, if you ask me!\n"
"I'm %01."
msgstr ""
"안녕하세요!\n"
"정말 훌륭한 %05이군요!\n"
"나는 %01입니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2525|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Good to see you again!\n"
"Hahahaha!\n"
"Uhm…What did you say your name was?"
msgstr ""
"다시 만나 반갑습니다!\n"
"하하하하!\n"
"음…이름이 뭐라고 하셨지요?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2526|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"My generosity ends here.\n"
"I've already helped you today and I am sick of seeing you.\n"
"Leave me."
msgstr ""
"내 호의는 여기까지입니다.\n"
"오늘 이미 도와드렸고 이제는 얼굴 보기도 지겹습니다.\n"
"가십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2527|field=<default>"
msgid "<looking both ways> %04, then, and lets make this quick!"
msgstr "<주위를 살피며> 그럼 %04입니다. 빨리 끝내지요!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2528|field=<default>"
msgid "n/a"
msgstr "n/a"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2529|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"<yawns>\n"
"Not interested.\n"
"Go away--I'm waiting for someone important to speak to."
msgstr ""
"<하품하며>\n"
"관심 없습니다.\n"
"가십시오. 중요한 사람과 이야기하려고 기다리는 중입니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=252|field=<default>"
msgid "Do you take Tempus the Knight into your party?"
msgstr "기사 템푸스를 일행에 합류시키겠습니까?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2530|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"%02!\n"
"Villain! How dare you speak to me?"
msgstr ""
"%02!\n"
"악당! 감히 내게 말을 겁니까?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2531|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Infamous %06, It is an honor to know you and a pleasure to serve you.\n"
"What do you desire?"
msgstr ""
"악명 높은 %06, 당신을 알게 되어 영광이고 섬길 수 있어 기쁩니다.\n"
"무엇을 원하십니까?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2532|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Ah, the famous and honorable %06 %02!\n"
"<bowing> Whatsoever you desire that is in my power to give, I freely grant."
msgstr ""
"아, 유명하고 존경받는 %06 %02!\n"
"<고개 숙이며> 내 능력으로 줄 수 있는 것이라면 무엇이든 기꺼이 드리겠습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2533|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"%02.\n"
"<spits on the ground>"
msgstr ""
"%02.\n"
"<땅에 침을 뱉는다>"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2534|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"O Ho!\n"
"%13! Er, %13.\n"
"I think.\n"
"Whatever.\n"
"There's gossip about you--all of it bad.\n"
"Get thee hence, lest I spit thee on the point of my sword!"
msgstr ""
"오호!\n"
"%13! 아니, %13.\n"
"아마도요.\n"
"뭐든 상관없습니다.\n"
"당신들에 관한 소문은 온통 나쁜 것뿐입니다.\n"
"내 칼끝에 꿰이기 싫다면 당장 사라지십시오!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2535|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"%13, eh? <loosening %03 sword> Better take to your heels…I don't much care "
"for you law-abiding types."
msgstr "%13입니까? <%03 검을 느슨하게 뽑으며> 달아나는 게 좋을 겁니다…나는 법을 잘 지키는 부류를 별로 좋아하지 않습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2536|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Hello!\n"
"I'm %01!\n"
"I've heard of you, %13, and while you haven't done anything too terribly wrong, or at least that I've heard, you haven't done much good, either.\n"
"So get out there and do some good deeds!\n"
"Maybe then I'll talk to you."
msgstr ""
"안녕하세요!\n"
"나는 %01입니다!\n"
"당신들 이야기를 들었습니다, %13. 크게 잘못한 일은 없지만, 적어도 내가 듣기로는 좋은 일도 별로 하지 않았더군요.\n"
"그러니 나가서 선행을 좀 하십시오!\n"
"그러면 이야기할지도 모르지요."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2537|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"%13, it is good to meet you at last.\n"
"Your reputation is %11.\n"
"Could be worse.\n"
"Matter of fact, it makes me think you are some kind of wimp!\n"
"Yeah, until I hear worse, I don't want to be seen with you.\n"
"Get out of my sight!"
msgstr ""
"%13, 마침내 만나 반갑습니다.\n"
"평판이 %11이군요.\n"
"더 나쁠 수도 있겠지요.\n"
"솔직히 말해 겁쟁이처럼 보입니다!\n"
"더 나쁜 소문을 듣기 전까지는 당신과 함께 있는 모습을 보이고 싶지 않습니다.\n"
"내 눈앞에서 사라지십시오!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2538|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Back again, %13?\n"
"Is this some sort of challenge?\n"
"Have you come to insult me?\n"
"Friend %13, I warn you--you're walking a narrow bridge with me, and the chasm is very deep…very deep indeed!"
msgstr ""
"또 왔습니까, %13?\n"
"이건 도전입니까?\n"
"나를 모욕하러 왔습니까?\n"
"친애하는 %13, 경고하는데 지금 나와의 좁은 다리 위를 걷고 있습니다. 아래 골짜기는 아주 깊지요…정말 깊습니다!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2539|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"I am this far--this far from hacking your saintly head from your shoulders!\n"
"Leave me while you still can."
msgstr ""
"당신의 성스러운 머리를 어깨에서 베어버리기 직전입니다!\n"
"할 수 있을 때 떠나십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=253|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"I cannot travel go with you. Your party is much too large for my "
"preferences. I like to work with a smaller, more mobile group. Tell you "
"what. I will go to the Adventurer's Inn. Join me there once you get rid of "
"some of your dead weight."
msgstr ""
"함께 갈 수 없겠군. 일행 규모가 내 취향에는 너무 크다. 나는 작고 기동성 있는 집단과 일하는 편을 좋아하지. 이렇게 하자. 모험가의 "
"여관으로 가겠다. 쓸모없는 짐을 좀 덜어낸 뒤 그곳에서 나와 합류해라."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2540|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"%13!\n"
"Maybe someday I will have something to say to you!\n"
"Maybe.\n"
"But not until your reputation improves."
msgstr ""
"%13!\n"
"언젠가는 당신에게 할 말이 생길지도 모르지요!\n"
"언젠가는요.\n"
"하지만 평판이 좋아지기 전에는 아닙니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2541|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"%13!\n"
"You've returned!\n"
"Returned with a reputation of %11…Hmmm.\n"
"Looks wimpy to me.\n"
"Do something to impress me, 'cause I don't associate with the weak, or the helpless.\n"
"Until then, take off, eh?"
msgstr ""
"%13!\n"
"돌아왔군요!\n"
"평판은 %11이고…흠.\n"
"나약해 보이는군요.\n"
"약하거나 무력한 자와는 어울리지 않으니 나를 감탄시킬 일을 해보십시오.\n"
"그때까지는 꺼지십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2542|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"I suppose I could speak to you for a few minutes.\n"
"Hurry up."
msgstr ""
"몇 분 정도는 이야기할 수 있겠군요.\n"
"서두르십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2543|field=<default>"
msgid "n/a"
msgstr "n/a"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2544|field=<default>"
msgid "Yes, now what is it you need, %13?"
msgstr "좋습니다. 이제 무엇이 필요합니까, %13?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2545|field=<default>"
msgid "n/a"
msgstr "n/a"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2546|field=<default>"
msgid "n/a"
msgstr "n/a"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2547|field=<default>"
msgid "<drawing %03 sword> I don't take kindly to threats…"
msgstr "<%03 검을 뽑으며> 협박은 달갑지 않습니다…"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2549|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Peace, %06.\n"
"My name is %14 %01."
msgstr ""
"평안하길, %06.\n"
"내 이름은 %14 %01입니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=254|field=<default>"
msgid "Will your travel with Thorne Understone the Troll?"
msgstr "트롤 손 언더스톤과 함께 여행하겠습니까?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2550|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"A glorious %05, %02.\n"
"How may I help you?"
msgstr ""
"영광스러운 %05입니다, %02.\n"
"무엇을 도와드릴까요?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2551|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Though your need is obviously great, It would be a disservice to others to attend solely to your needs.\n"
"Perhaps some other time."
msgstr ""
"당신의 필요가 절실한 것은 분명하지만, 오직 당신에게만 신경 쓰는 것은 다른 이들에게 해가 됩니다.\n"
"다음 기회에 오십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2552|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Have you returned for more spiritual advice? The donation is still %04."
msgstr "더 많은 영적 조언을 받으러 돌아왔습니까? 헌금은 여전히 %04입니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2553|field=<default>"
msgid "n/a"
msgstr "n/a"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2554|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"I have important matters to attend to, child.\n"
"Someday you'll be important too, but you aren't yet, so go now, in peace."
msgstr ""
"아이야, 나는 중요한 일을 처리해야 합니다.\n"
"언젠가는 너도 중요한 사람이 되겠지만 지금은 아니니 평안히 가거라."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2555|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"It is the Devil himself before me!\n"
"I do not fear you, nor will I help you!"
msgstr ""
"내 앞에 악마가 직접 나타났군!\n"
"나는 너를 두려워하지도, 돕지도 않겠다!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2556|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"My Master…your work in the name of darkness is unparalleled.\n"
"Your evil is superior to mine.\n"
"To serve you is my one and only desire."
msgstr ""
"주인님…어둠의 이름으로 행한 당신의 업적은 비길 데가 없습니다.\n"
"당신의 악은 나보다 우월합니다.\n"
"당신을 섬기는 것이 나의 유일한 소망입니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2557|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Praise the Light!\n"
"A gift from Heaven to be in the presence of the sweet and honorable %10 %06! "
msgstr ""
"빛을 찬양하라!\n"
"다정하고 존경스러운 %10 %06의 곁에 있다니 하늘이 내린 선물이군요! "

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2558|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"The higher you climb, the farther you will fall…And you have climbed oh so high!\n"
"Rest assured, sainted one, that I will not be there to catch you when you fall!"
msgstr ""
"높이 오를수록 더 깊이 떨어지는 법…당신은 정말 높이도 올랐군요!\n"
"안심하십시오, 성자여. 당신이 떨어질 때 내가 받아주는 일은 없을 테니!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2559|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"I have heard that you stopped walking in the Light.\n"
"Return to me when you have found your way."
msgstr ""
"당신이 빛의 길에서 벗어났다고 들었습니다.\n"
"길을 다시 찾으면 돌아오십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=255|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Great. Listen. I have some business I need to attend to before I can go with"
" you. We'll meet at the Adventurer's Inn. I will join you there."
msgstr "좋아. 그런데 함께 가기 전에 처리할 일이 좀 있어. 모험가의 여관에서 만나자. 거기서 합류하겠다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2560|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Begone, fool!\n"
"I will not speak to cowards unwilling to travel the shadowed path."
msgstr ""
"꺼져라, 바보!\n"
"그림자 드리운 길을 걷지 못하는 겁쟁이와는 말하지 않겠다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2561|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"You haven't an aura of evil or good strong enough for my spells to detect.\n"
"Until I know one way or the other, I must decline to speak with you."
msgstr ""
"내 주문으로 감지할 만큼 강한 악이나 선의 기운이 없습니다.\n"
"어느 쪽인지 알기 전까지는 대화를 거절하겠습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2562|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"%02, your reputation is %11, indicating to me that there is hope you will join the darkness yet!\n"
"Still, there are traces of goodness in your soul that are troublesome.\n"
"Eliminate them and return.\n"
"Then we can talk."
msgstr ""
"%02, 당신의 평판은 %11이니 아직 어둠에 합류할 희망이 있군요!\n"
"하지만 영혼에 남은 선의 흔적이 거슬립니다.\n"
"그것을 없애고 돌아오십시오.\n"
"그러면 이야기하지요."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2563|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Still dealing in shadows?\n"
"I know you can do better, %02.\n"
"Go in peace, and return once you have renounced your evil ways."
msgstr ""
"아직도 그림자 속에서 거래하고 있습니까?\n"
"더 잘할 수 있다는 걸 압니다, %02.\n"
"평안히 가고, 악한 길을 버린 뒤 돌아오십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2564|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"You try my patience, craven one.\n"
"I am tempted to experiment with the powers the netherworld has granted me…"
msgstr ""
"비겁한 자여, 내 인내심을 시험하는군요.\n"
"저승이 내게 부여한 힘을 시험해 보고 싶은 마음이 듭니다…"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2565|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"My dear %02.\n"
"You must tend to your soul before I can attend to your needs.\n"
"Go, and return only when your feet are more firmly on the righteous path."
msgstr ""
"친애하는 %02.\n"
"당신의 필요를 돌보기 전에 영혼부터 돌봐야 합니다.\n"
"가십시오. 정의로운 길에 더 굳게 발을 디딘 뒤에만 돌아오십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2566|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"%02, your personal darkness is shot through with streaks of light.\n"
"I won't have it!\n"
"I refuse to deal with the uncommitted, the uncertain, and the weak!\n"
"Return to me after you have proven your evil and stained your soul!"
msgstr ""
"%02, 당신의 내면의 어둠에 빛줄기가 섞여 있습니다.\n"
"용납할 수 없습니다!\n"
"뜻이 약하고 망설이며 나약한 자와는 거래하지 않습니다!\n"
"악을 증명하고 영혼을 더럽힌 뒤 돌아오십시오!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2567|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"How could I not respond to such a piteous cry for help?\n"
"What do you require, %15?"
msgstr ""
"그토록 가엾은 도움의 외침에 어찌 응하지 않을 수 있겠습니까?\n"
"무엇이 필요합니까, %15?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2568|field=<default>"
msgid "n/a"
msgstr "n/a"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2569|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"I see now that you are not a malicious defiler of all I hold dear, but rather a misguided soul that has lost %09 way.\n"
"How may I help you, child?"
msgstr ""
"이제 보니 당신은 내가 소중히 여기는 모든 것을 악의적으로 더럽히는 자가 아니라, %09 길을 잃은 방황하는 영혼이군요.\n"
"무엇을 도와줄까요, 아이야?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=256|field=<default>"
msgid "Will you take Ulbrecht the Minotaur into your party?"
msgstr "미노타우로스 울브레히트를 일행에 합류시키겠습니까?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2570|field=<default>"
msgid "n/a"
msgstr "n/a"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2571|field=<default>"
msgid "n/a"
msgstr "n/a"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2572|field=<default>"
msgid "I will not bow to threats."
msgstr "협박에 굴복하지 않겠습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2574|field=<default>"
msgid "<sigh> Yes?"
msgstr "<한숨> 무슨 일입니까?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2575|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Ah, yes, %02.\n"
"Can I help you?"
msgstr ""
"아, 그렇군요, %02.\n"
"도와드릴까요?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2576|field=<default>"
msgid "n/a"
msgstr "n/a"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2577|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"I'm afraid I will require a second payment, %06.\n"
"%04 now, or the conversation ends here."
msgstr ""
"두 번째 대가를 받아야겠습니다, %06.\n"
"지금 %04을 내십시오. 아니면 대화는 여기서 끝입니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2578|field=<default>"
msgid "n/a"
msgstr "n/a"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2579|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Sorry, I'm looking for famous Heroes, not unknown peasants.\n"
"Be off with you now."
msgstr ""
"미안하지만, 나는 이름 없는 농민이 아니라 유명한 영웅을 찾고 있습니다.\n"
"이제 가십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=257|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"I would go with you now, but your party is too full. I will make "
"preparations then travel to the Adventurer's Inn. Meet me there when you "
"have room for me. Until then, good luck!"
msgstr ""
"지금 함께 가고 싶지만 일행이 너무 꽉 찼군. 준비를 마친 뒤 모험가의 여관으로 가겠다. 자리가 생기면 그곳에서 만나자. 그때까지 행운을"
" 빈다!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2580|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Oh, the notorious %02.\n"
"Yes, I've heard of you, and I'm not impressed.\n"
"I hope you are brought to justice soon!"
msgstr ""
"아, 악명 높은 %02.\n"
"그래요, 들었습니다. 하지만 감명받지는 않았습니다.\n"
"곧 정의의 심판을 받길 바랍니다!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2581|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"By the Word, your deeds are an inspiration to us all!\n"
"Keep up the good work--with your help, the Kingdom will surely fall soon!"
msgstr ""
"말씀에 맹세코, 당신의 행적은 우리 모두에게 영감을 줍니다!\n"
"계속 그렇게 하십시오. 당신의 도움이라면 왕국도 곧 무너지겠군요!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2582|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"An honor, great %10.\n"
"How may I serve you?"
msgstr ""
"영광입니다, 위대하신 %10.\n"
"무엇을 도와드릴까요?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2583|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Oh, saints preserve us, it's the %10 of Heaven, come to do justice! <smirks>"
" Let me worship you, your Highness…"
msgstr "성인들이여 지켜주소서, 하늘의 %10께서 정의를 행하러 오셨군요! <비웃으며> 전하를 경배하게 해주십시오…"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2584|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"My sources tell me that you may have committed a number of crimes.\n"
"You must clear those problems up before I can speak with you."
msgstr ""
"내 정보원에 따르면 당신이 여러 범죄를 저질렀을지도 모른다고 합니다.\n"
"그 문제를 해결하기 전에는 이야기할 수 없습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2585|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Sorry, %06 but it doesn't matter to me if you %08.\n"
"As a matter of fact, I consider your holier-than-thou attitude quite insulting…%06."
msgstr ""
"미안합니다, %06. 당신들이 %08했다는 건 내게 중요하지 않습니다.\n"
"사실 그 잘난 체하는 태도가 꽤 모욕적이군요…%06."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2586|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"A smart official only associates with people of quality reputation.\n"
"Your reputation is only %11.\n"
"Not good enough for me.\n"
"Sorry."
msgstr ""
"영리한 관리는 평판 좋은 사람과만 어울립니다.\n"
"당신의 평판은 겨우 %11입니다.\n"
"내게는 부족합니다.\n"
"미안합니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2587|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"%02.\n"
"I understand you may be something less than a good citizen, and perhaps something more than a common criminal…There are always uses for such as you--if not for me than for my…associates.\n"
"But I need more proof!\n"
"Commit some more crimes--then we can talk.\n"
"And don't tell anyone we spoke about this--I'll deny our little conversation if accused."
msgstr ""
"%02.\n"
"당신이 선량한 시민보다는 못하고 평범한 범죄자보다는 나을지도 모른다고 들었습니다…당신 같은 자는 언제나 쓸모가 있지요. 내게 아니라면 내…동료들에게라도요.\n"
"하지만 더 확실한 증거가 필요합니다!\n"
"범죄를 더 저지르십시오. 그러면 이야기하지요.\n"
"그리고 이 대화는 누구에게도 말하지 마십시오. 추궁받으면 부인할 테니까요."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2588|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"%02? The record is still quite clear:\n"
"Your reputation is %11.\n"
"Our conversation must end here."
msgstr ""
"%02? 기록은 여전히 명확합니다.\n"
"당신의 평판은 %11입니다.\n"
"우리 대화는 여기서 끝입니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2589|field=<default>"
msgid "<sigh> Back again?!?"
msgstr "<한숨> 또 왔습니까?!?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=258|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Thanks again for your help!\n"
"May I join you?"
msgstr ""
"다시 한번 도와줘서 고마워!\n"
"나도 합류해도 될까?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2590|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"I will only associate with people who won't embarrass me!\n"
"You will.\n"
"Maybe if people start telling me your reputation is %12.\n"
"Until then…"
msgstr ""
"나는 내 체면을 깎지 않을 사람과만 어울립니다!\n"
"당신은 분명 체면을 깎겠군요.\n"
"사람들이 당신의 평판이 %12이라고 말하기 시작한다면 모를까.\n"
"그때까지는…"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2591|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"I retain doubts about your commitment to a life on the shady side.\n"
"I must hear that your reputation is %12 or less!\n"
"Otherwise I can have nothing to do with you!"
msgstr ""
"당신이 정말 음지의 삶에 헌신했는지 의심스럽습니다.\n"
"평판이 %12 이하라는 말을 들어야 합니다!\n"
"그렇지 않으면 당신과 엮일 수 없습니다!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2592|field=<default>"
msgid "n/a"
msgstr "n/a"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2593|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Beg all you like.\n"
"I still won't help you."
msgstr ""
"아무리 빌어도 소용없습니다.\n"
"돕지 않겠습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2594|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Thank you.\n"
"How may I be of service?"
msgstr ""
"고맙습니다.\n"
"무엇을 도와드릴까요?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2595|field=<default>"
msgid "n/a"
msgstr "n/a"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2596|field=<default>"
msgid "n/a"
msgstr "n/a"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2597|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"A threat?\n"
"You had best be gone before I set the watch on you!"
msgstr ""
"협박입니까?\n"
"순찰대를 부르기 전에 사라지는 게 좋을 겁니다!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2599|field=<default>"
msgid "What is it?"
msgstr "무슨 일입니까?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=259|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"I would like to join you in your adventures but your group is already full!\n"
"I will await you in the Adventurer's Inn."
msgstr ""
"여러분의 모험에 합류하고 싶지만 일행이 이미 가득 찼군요!\n"
"모험가의 여관에서 기다리겠습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=25|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Have you found Cauri?\n"
"We really need to know what happened to her!\n"
"Without her, we are all diminished!"
msgstr ""
"카우리를 찾았습니까?\n"
"그녀에게 무슨 일이 있었는지 꼭 알아야 합니다!\n"
"그녀가 없다면 우리 모두의 힘이 약해집니다!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2600|field=<default>"
msgid "Back again, %02?"
msgstr "또 왔습니까, %02?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2601|field=<default>"
msgid "n/a"
msgstr "n/a"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2602|field=<default>"
msgid "%04 is still the price."
msgstr "값은 여전히 %04입니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2603|field=<default>"
msgid "n/a"
msgstr "n/a"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2604|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"%02?\n"
"Never heard of you.\n"
"Now go away and stop wasting my time."
msgstr ""
"%02?\n"
"처음 듣는 이름이군요.\n"
"이제 가서 내 시간을 그만 낭비하십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2605|field=<default>"
msgid "<drawing %03 sword> %02! Prepare to die!"
msgstr "<%03 검을 뽑으며> %02! 죽을 준비를 해라!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2606|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"%10 %02.<pulling a flask from inside %03 jerkin> A toast to those who do "
"what they want when they want!"
msgstr "%10 %02.<%03 웃옷 안에서 병을 꺼내며> 하고 싶을 때 하고 싶은 일을 하는 자들을 위하여!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2607|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"%10 %02.\n"
"An honor."
msgstr ""
"%10 %02.\n"
"영광입니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2608|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"<drawing %03 sword> %02!\n"
"In the name of Zenofex, prepare to die!"
msgstr ""
"<%03 검을 뽑으며> %02!\n"
"제노펙스의 이름으로, 죽을 준비를 해라!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2609|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"I heard you may have been less than lawful, recently.\n"
"If it could be proven, I would arrest you right now. "
msgstr ""
"최근 법을 어겼을지도 모른다고 들었습니다.\n"
"증명만 된다면 지금 당장 체포했을 겁니다. "

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=260|field=<default>"
msgid "Do you take Artorius Veritas the Vampire into your party?"
msgstr "흡혈귀 아르토리우스 베리타스를 일행에 합류시키겠습니까?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2610|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Word is you %08.\n"
"That makes me sick!\n"
"If you aren't away from me soon, I'll do a lot more than just arrest you!"
msgstr ""
"당신들이 %08했다는 소문이 있습니다.\n"
"구역질 나는군요!\n"
"빨리 내 앞에서 사라지지 않으면 체포만으로 끝내지 않겠습니다!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2611|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"I have been instructed to talk only with persons of sound reputation.\n"
"Yours is %11, while I must demand %12.\n"
"Be on your way."
msgstr ""
"평판이 온전한 사람과만 이야기하라는 지시를 받았습니다.\n"
"당신의 평판은 %11이지만, 요구되는 수준은 %12입니다.\n"
"가십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2612|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"I have been ordered to speak only with persons of, ah, the right kind of reputation.\n"
"Yours is merely %11.\n"
"Be on your way."
msgstr ""
"적절한 종류의 평판을 지닌 사람과만 이야기하라는 명령을 받았습니다.\n"
"당신의 평판은 고작 %11입니다.\n"
"가십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2613|field=<default>"
msgid "I still think I should arrest you."
msgstr "여전히 당신을 체포해야 한다고 생각합니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2614|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"I can't believe you're back.\n"
"My sword hand is starting to itch…"
msgstr ""
"또 돌아오다니 믿을 수 없군요.\n"
"검을 쥔 손이 근질거리기 시작합니다…"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2615|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"I can't talk to you.\n"
"I know your reputation is only %11. It must be better.\n"
"Orders.\n"
"Sorry."
msgstr ""
"당신과는 이야기할 수 없습니다.\n"
"평판이 겨우 %11이라는 걸 압니다. 더 좋아야 합니다.\n"
"명령입니다.\n"
"미안합니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2616|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"I can't talk to you.\n"
"I know your reputation is only %11. It must be worse.\n"
"Orders.\n"
"Sorry."
msgstr ""
"당신과는 이야기할 수 없습니다.\n"
"평판이 겨우 %11이라는 걸 압니다. 더 나빠야 합니다.\n"
"명령입니다.\n"
"미안합니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2617|field=<default>"
msgid "n/a"
msgstr "n/a"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2618|field=<default>"
msgid "<kicking at you> Get away from me!"
msgstr "<당신을 걷어차며> 내게서 떨어져!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2619|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Thanks.\n"
"What is it you wanted?"
msgstr ""
"고맙습니다.\n"
"무엇을 원하셨습니까?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=261|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"I can't go with you, your party is too full. I will go to the Adventurer's "
"Inn. Join me there."
msgstr "함께 갈 수 없겠군. 일행이 너무 꽉 찼어. 모험가의 여관으로 갈 테니 거기서 만나자."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2620|field=<default>"
msgid "n/a"
msgstr "n/a"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2621|field=<default>"
msgid "n/a"
msgstr "n/a"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2622|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"HA!\n"
"<drawing %03 sword> Threaten me, will you?"
msgstr ""
"하!\n"
"<%03 검을 뽑으며> 감히 나를 협박하겠다고?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2624|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Hello friend! <making a curious gesture with thumb and nose> Baaaa! The end "
"of the world draws nigh!"
msgstr "안녕, 친구! <엄지와 코로 기묘한 손짓을 하며> 메에에! 세상의 종말이 다가온다!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2625|field=<default>"
msgid "Ah, %16. The Signs are dark indeed, aren't they?"
msgstr "아, %16. 징조가 참으로 어둡지 않습니까?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2626|field=<default>"
msgid "n/a"
msgstr "n/a"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2627|field=<default>"
msgid "n/a"
msgstr "n/a"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2628|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"No need to threaten me a second time--I'll cooperate.\n"
"After all, Baa will rule the Kingdom in the end.\n"
"Nothing you or I can say or do will change that."
msgstr ""
"두 번 협박할 필요는 없습니다. 협조하겠습니다.\n"
"어차피 결국 바아가 왕국을 지배할 테니까요.\n"
"당신이나 내가 무슨 말을 하거나 무엇을 해도 달라지는 것은 없습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2629|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Hmmm?\n"
"What? Here, go away, I don't have time for the little people--that means you!\n"
"You aren't famous enough."
msgstr ""
"흠?\n"
"뭐요? 자, 가십시오. 하찮은 자에게 쓸 시간은 없습니다. 바로 당신 말입니다!\n"
"당신은 충분히 유명하지 않습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=262|field=<default>"
msgid "Do you take the Dragon, Duroth the Eternal into your party?"
msgstr "드래곤 영원한 듀로스를 일행에 합류시키겠습니까?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2630|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"%02!\n"
"<shrieking> Please don't kill me! I'll tell you anything!"
msgstr ""
"%02!\n"
"<비명을 지르며> 제발 죽이지 마십시오! 무엇이든 말하겠습니다!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2631|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"<smiling>\n"
"The end of the world nears--with a little help from you and me, %10 %02.\n"
"Is there anything I can do for you?"
msgstr ""
"<미소 지으며>\n"
"세상의 종말이 다가옵니다. 당신과 내가 조금만 돕는다면 말이지요, %10 %02.\n"
"무엇을 도와드릴까요?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2632|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Wonderful %10 %02!\n"
"You have come to save the world!\n"
"Praise be!\n"
"I only hope you aren't too late."
msgstr ""
"훌륭하신 %10 %02!\n"
"세상을 구하러 오셨군요!\n"
"찬양하라!\n"
"너무 늦지 않았기만을 바랍니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2633|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Too bad you're on the losing side, %02!\n"
"But listen, I'll tell you anything you want--the Temple of Baa will reign soon no matter what you do!\n"
"Just please don't kill me. "
msgstr ""
"패배할 편을 골랐다니 안됐군요, %02!\n"
"하지만 들어보십시오. 원하는 건 무엇이든 말하겠습니다. 당신이 무엇을 하든 곧 바아의 신전이 지배할 테니까요!\n"
"그러니 제발 죽이지만 마십시오. "

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2634|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Oh, my!\n"
"Everyone is saying terrible things about you and your friends, %02.\n"
"I'm afraid I can't speak with you."
msgstr ""
"아이고!\n"
"모두가 당신과 친구들에 관해 끔찍한 이야기를 하고 있습니다, %02.\n"
"유감이지만 이야기할 수 없습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2635|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Baaaa! <grinning nastily> Baaa! The herd calls, friend.\n"
"Why not go and do some good deeds or something?\n"
"G'won!\n"
"Git!"
msgstr ""
"메에에! <심술궂게 웃으며> 메에에! 무리가 부릅니다, 친구여.\n"
"가서 선행이나 좀 하지 그러십니까?\n"
"자, 어서!\n"
"가시오!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2636|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"I absolutely, categorically refuse to speak with persons whose reputation is"
" less than %12."
msgstr "평판이 %12 미만인 사람과는 절대, 단호히 이야기하지 않겠습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2637|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Baaa, friend %02!\n"
"I've heard that you might be just the kind of people we are looking for.\n"
"But I'm not sure.\n"
"You need to get a reputation for doing those things our cult requires…I'm sure you get the idea!"
msgstr ""
"메에에, 친구 %02!\n"
"당신들이 우리가 찾는 바로 그런 사람일지도 모른다고 들었습니다.\n"
"하지만 확신은 없습니다.\n"
"우리 교단이 요구하는 일을 한다는 평판을 얻어야 합니다…무슨 뜻인지 알겠지요!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2638|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"<whispering> I'm still not allowed to speak with you, %02!\n"
"Now please go, before I'm seen with you!"
msgstr ""
"<속삭이며> 아직 당신과 말해선 안 됩니다, %02!\n"
"함께 있는 모습을 들키기 전에 가십시오!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2639|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Are you soft in the head?\n"
"I said go away!\n"
"I don't need any good deeds done today."
msgstr ""
"머리가 어떻게 된 겁니까?\n"
"가라고 했습니다!\n"
"오늘은 선행을 해줄 사람이 필요 없습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=263|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"I will join you, but not now. I have to see to some matters which will take "
"me some days to deal with. After I'm done I will go to the Adventurer's Inn."
" Meet me there."
msgstr ""
"합류하겠다. 하지만 지금은 아니다. 며칠은 걸릴 일을 처리해야 한다. 일이 끝나면 모험가의 여관으로 가겠다. 그곳에서 만나자."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2640|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Everyone in my secret cult tells me that you aren't nice enough to be with.\n"
"So go get nicer and I'll start talking to you."
msgstr ""
"내 비밀 교단의 모두가 당신은 우리와 어울릴 만큼 착하지 않다고 말합니다.\n"
"그러니 좀 더 착해진 뒤 돌아오면 이야기하겠습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2641|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Your reputation isn't appropriate for my organization, %02, therefore I can't be seen talking to you.\n"
"Come back when your reputation has…improved."
msgstr ""
"당신의 평판은 우리 조직에 어울리지 않습니다, %02. 그래서 이야기하는 모습을 보일 수 없습니다.\n"
"평판이…나아지면 돌아오십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2642|field=<default>"
msgid "n/a"
msgstr "n/a"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2643|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"I already told you I don't really care for you.\n"
"Bother someone else."
msgstr ""
"당신이 별로라고 이미 말했습니다.\n"
"다른 사람이나 귀찮게 하십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2644|field=<default>"
msgid "n/a"
msgstr "n/a"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2645|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"My devotion to Baa is greater than any amount of money.\n"
"I will never accept your bribe, never!"
msgstr ""
"바아를 향한 내 헌신은 어떤 돈보다 큽니다.\n"
"당신의 뇌물은 절대 받지 않겠습니다, 절대로!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2646|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Ok, Ok!\n"
"Please, don't kill me.\n"
"I'm not supposed to die yet."
msgstr ""
"알겠습니다, 알겠습니다!\n"
"제발 죽이지 마십시오.\n"
"나는 아직 죽을 때가 아닙니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2647|field=<default>"
msgid "n/a"
msgstr "n/a"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2649|field=<default>"
msgid "Hello! My name is %01, and I am pleased to meet you, %02."
msgstr "안녕하세요! 내 이름은 %01입니다. 만나서 반갑습니다, %02."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=264|field=<default>"
msgid "Do you agree to travel with Nathaniel Roberts the Necromancer?"
msgstr "강령술사 너새니얼 로버츠와 함께 여행하겠습니까?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2650|field=<default>"
msgid "A fine %05, %02, is it not?"
msgstr "훌륭한 %05이군요, %02. 그렇지 않습니까?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2651|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"I'm no longer in a good mood.\n"
"Go trouble someone else."
msgstr ""
"이제는 기분이 좋지 않습니다.\n"
"다른 사람이나 귀찮게 하십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2652|field=<default>"
msgid "n/a"
msgstr "n/a"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2653|field=<default>"
msgid "n/a"
msgstr "n/a"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2654|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Don't bother me, simpleton!\n"
"I reserve my time solely for known, capable Heroes--not for unknown, incompetent, peasants."
msgstr ""
"귀찮게 하지 마라, 멍청이!\n"
"나는 이름 있고 유능한 영웅에게만 시간을 씁니다. 이름도 없고 무능한 농민에게는 아닙니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2655|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"<eyes widening> %02? Villain!\n"
"The world would be a better place without you!"
msgstr ""
"<눈을 크게 뜨며> %02? 악당!\n"
"당신들이 없다면 세상은 더 나은 곳이 될 겁니다!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2656|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"<bowing deeply> %10 %02! Your evil is known throughout the land!\n"
"Consider me your most ardent supporter."
msgstr ""
"<깊이 고개 숙이며> %10 %02! 당신의 악행은 온 세상에 알려졌습니다!\n"
"나를 가장 열렬한 지지자로 여겨주십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2657|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"An honor to know you, %02.\n"
"I am at your service."
msgstr ""
"알게 되어 영광입니다, %02.\n"
"기꺼이 돕겠습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2658|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"%02.\n"
"Your shining goodness is giving me a headache. <rubbing %03 temples>\n"
"I think I'm going to have to slay you to cure it."
msgstr ""
"%02.\n"
"당신의 눈부신 선함 때문에 머리가 아픕니다. <%03 관자놀이를 문지르며>\n"
"두통을 없애려면 당신을 죽여야겠군요."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2659|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"There is a rumor going 'round saying that you are a criminal.\n"
"I'm afraid I don't associate with criminals."
msgstr ""
"당신이 범죄자라는 소문이 돌고 있습니다.\n"
"유감이지만 나는 범죄자와 어울리지 않습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=265|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Fah! You are more a mob than an adventuring party. I'm looking for a smaller"
" group. I will seek them at the Adventurer's Inn. If you want to journey "
"with me…well, perhaps you'll find me there."
msgstr ""
"흥! 이건 모험가 일행이 아니라 군중이군. 나는 더 작은 집단을 찾고 있다. 모험가의 여관에서 찾아보지. 나와 함께 여행하고 싶다면… "
"아마 그곳에서 찾을 수 있을 것이다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2660|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Everyone says your reputation is %11.\n"
"I hate that.\n"
"But, because you amuse me, I'll let you live awhile longer--as long as you go pester someone else."
msgstr ""
"모두가 당신의 평판이 %11이라고 말합니다.\n"
"정말 싫군요.\n"
"하지만 재미있으니 조금 더 살게 해드리겠습니다. 다른 사람을 귀찮게 한다는 조건으로요."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2661|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"My name is %01.\n"
"It would be a violation of my sacred oaths to speak with people whose reputation is less than %12.\n"
"Therefore, I must bid you good day."
msgstr ""
"내 이름은 %01입니다.\n"
"평판이 %12 미만인 사람과 이야기하는 것은 신성한 맹세를 어기는 일입니다.\n"
"그러니 이만 작별을 고하겠습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2662|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"%02.\n"
"As a Champion of evil, it pleases me to hear that your reputation is %11, but you just aren't evil enough for me!\n"
"Get worse!\n"
"I'm talking atrocities!\n"
"Cause a calamity or do something dastardly, then we can talk."
msgstr ""
"%02.\n"
"악의 투사로서 당신의 평판이 %11이라는 소식은 기쁘지만, 내 기준에는 충분히 사악하지 않습니다!\n"
"더 나빠지십시오!\n"
"잔혹한 짓을 말하는 겁니다!\n"
"재앙을 일으키거나 비열한 짓을 한 뒤 돌아오면 이야기하지요."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2663|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"%02, your reputation is %11.\n"
"My instincts tell me to slay you on the spot, but in the interests of charity, I'll give you a chance to redeem yourself by letting you live.\n"
"For now."
msgstr ""
"%02, 당신의 평판은 %11입니다.\n"
"본능은 당장 베어버리라고 하지만, 자비를 베풀어 살아서 속죄할 기회를 주겠습니다.\n"
"지금은 말이지요."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2664|field=<default>"
msgid "You've returned to try my patience, I see."
msgstr "내 인내심을 시험하러 돌아왔군요."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2665|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Hmm.\n"
"%02.\n"
"I have sworn an oath to avoid those of ill repute.\n"
"Your reputation is %11, which is beneath me.\n"
"Perhaps if it improves..."
msgstr ""
"흠.\n"
"%02.\n"
"악명 높은 자를 피하겠다고 맹세했습니다.\n"
"당신의 평판은 %11로, 내 수준에 못 미칩니다.\n"
"좀 더 좋아진다면..."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2666|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"%02, your evil wavers.\n"
"More.\n"
"More I say!\n"
"You need to be at least %12 for me to want to talk to you, so get to work!"
msgstr ""
"%02, 당신의 악이 흔들리고 있습니다.\n"
"더.\n"
"더 필요합니다!\n"
"내가 이야기하고 싶다면 적어도 %12는 되어야 하니 어서 움직이십시오!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2667|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Hmmm.\n"
"All right.\n"
"But only because my mood is good."
msgstr ""
"흠.\n"
"좋습니다.\n"
"다만 오늘 기분이 좋기 때문입니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2668|field=<default>"
msgid "n/a"
msgstr "n/a"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2669|field=<default>"
msgid "n/a"
msgstr "n/a"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=266|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"I will gladly join you. My desire for revenge has been a thirst long in need"
" of slaking. You have provided me with the cup. Let us go and fill it!Dyson "
"Leland offers to join your party. Do you accept?"
msgstr ""
"기꺼이 합류하겠습니다. 복수에 대한 갈증을 오랫동안 풀지 못했는데, 여러분이 마실 잔을 마련해 주셨군요. 함께 가서 그 잔을 "
"채웁시다!다이슨 릴런드가 일행에 합류하겠다고 제안합니다. 받아들이겠습니까?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2670|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"I think not.\n"
"No amount of money could change my opinion of you."
msgstr ""
"그럴 생각 없습니다.\n"
"아무리 많은 돈이라도 당신에 대한 내 생각을 바꿀 수는 없습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2671|field=<default>"
msgid "n/a"
msgstr "n/a"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2672|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"You would challenge me?\n"
"I am ready for the likes of you!"
msgstr ""
"나에게 도전하겠다고?\n"
"당신 같은 자를 상대할 준비는 되어 있다!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2674|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"%02.\n"
"I am pleased to make your acquaintance."
msgstr ""
"%02.\n"
"알게 되어 반갑습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2675|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"%02.\n"
"I hope you aren't going to waste my time…"
msgstr ""
"%02.\n"
"내 시간을 낭비하러 온 것은 아니길 바랍니다…"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2676|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Your audience is over.\n"
"Be off with you and trouble me no further today."
msgstr ""
"알현은 끝났습니다.\n"
"가서 오늘은 더 이상 나를 괴롭히지 마십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2677|field=<default>"
msgid "n/a"
msgstr "n/a"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2678|field=<default>"
msgid "n/a"
msgstr "n/a"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2679|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"I am looking to speak with Heroes, not children.\n"
"If you want my time, go do something heroic."
msgstr ""
"나는 아이가 아니라 영웅과 이야기하고 싶습니다.\n"
"내 시간을 원한다면 영웅다운 일을 하고 오십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=267|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Your group is too full for me to join, but here is my plan…I will make my "
"escape from the guild and meet you at the Adventurer's Inn. It may take me "
"some time to get there, as I must travel with caution.Meet me there when you"
" can. My revenge has waited for over a year. It can wait a few more weeks. "
"Wish me luck!"
msgstr ""
"일행이 너무 꽉 차 지금은 합류할 수 없지만 계획이 있습니다… 길드에서 탈출해 모험가의 여관에서 만나겠습니다. 조심해서 이동해야 하니 "
"도착까지 시간이 걸릴 수도 있습니다.가능할 때 그곳에서 만나 주십시오. 복수는 이미 1년 넘게 기다렸습니다. 몇 주쯤 더 기다릴 수 "
"있습니다. 행운을 빌어 주십시오!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2680|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Hmmm.\n"
"The infamous and wicked %02. I am surprised that one of the Heroes of the land has not yet slain you.\n"
"I shall be sure to help raise the bounty on your heads."
msgstr ""
"흠.\n"
"악명 높고 사악한 %02. 이 땅의 영웅 중 누구도 아직 당신을 죽이지 않았다니 놀랍군요.\n"
"당신의 현상금이 더 오르도록 힘쓰겠습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2681|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"A pleasure to know the intriguing and adventurous %10 %02.\n"
"When I first heard about your wickedness, I was very impressed!"
msgstr ""
"흥미롭고 모험심 넘치는 %10 %02를 알게 되어 기쁩니다.\n"
"당신의 악행을 처음 들었을 때 크게 감탄했습니다!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2682|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Ah! An honor and a privilege to see you, %02.\n"
"My considerable resources are at your disposal."
msgstr ""
"아! 당신을 뵙게 되어 영광이고 특권입니다, %02.\n"
"내가 가진 상당한 자원을 마음껏 사용하십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2683|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Clearly, you are the enemy, O Champion of righteousness! Your speedy death "
"would please me."
msgstr "분명 당신은 적입니다, 정의의 투사여! 당신이 빨리 죽는다면 기쁘겠군요."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2684|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"My sources tell me that you have committed a number of crimes.\n"
"They say you may even have KILLED.\n"
"I am afraid that with that record, I cannot help you."
msgstr ""
"내 정보원들은 당신이 여러 범죄를 저질렀다고 말합니다.\n"
"심지어 살인까지 했을지도 모른다고 합니다.\n"
"그런 전과가 있다면 도울 수 없습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2685|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Not everyone appreciates how you %08.\n"
"I am one of those people.\n"
"I doubt we have much to say to one another."
msgstr ""
"당신들이 %08한 것을 모두가 높이 평가하는 것은 아닙니다.\n"
"나도 그중 하나입니다.\n"
"서로 할 말이 많지 않을 것 같군요."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2686|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"I will not sully my excellent reputation by conversing with one whose "
"reputation is merely %11."
msgstr "평판이 겨우 %11인 자와 대화해 내 훌륭한 명성을 더럽히지 않겠습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2687|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"I can see you might be the type of person I commonly associate with, %02, but the rumors of your behavior vary.\n"
"I must hear more before I will tolerate your presence.\n"
"Perhaps you could dominate and bully some peasants…"
msgstr ""
"당신이 내가 흔히 어울리는 부류일 수도 있겠군요, %02. 하지만 행동에 관한 소문이 엇갈립니다.\n"
"당신을 받아들이려면 더 많은 이야기를 들어야 합니다.\n"
"농민 몇 명을 억누르고 괴롭혀 보는 건 어떻습니까…"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2688|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"It is unseemly for me to be seen talking to criminals like yourselves.\n"
"Now get out of my sight!"
msgstr ""
"당신들 같은 범죄자와 이야기하는 모습을 보이는 것은 체면에 맞지 않습니다.\n"
"이제 내 눈앞에서 사라지십시오!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2689|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"I still do not quite care for you %02.\n"
"Your reputation amongst the common folk is %11, which is a bad business in my book."
msgstr ""
"아직 당신이 마음에 들지 않습니다, %02.\n"
"평민들 사이에서 평판이 %11이라니, 내 기준에는 좋지 않은 일입니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=268|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"I will be forever in your debt.\n"
"Not only did you rescue me from the lair of Zanthora, but you helped my daughter be promoted by Sir Charles Quixote.\n"
"I would like to join you in your travels!"
msgstr ""
"이 은혜는 평생 잊지 않겠습니다.\n"
"잔토라의 소굴에서 저를 구해 주셨을 뿐 아니라, 제 딸이 찰스 퀵소트 경에게 승급받도록 도와주셨습니다.\n"
"저도 함께 여행하고 싶습니다!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2690|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"My friends all tell me your reputation is %11, %02.\n"
"That's not good enough!\n"
"Perhaps a good deed or two would make your presence more acceptable to civilized society."
msgstr ""
"친구들이 모두 당신의 평판이 %11이라고 말합니다, %02.\n"
"그 정도로는 부족합니다!\n"
"선행을 한두 번 하면 문명사회가 당신을 좀 더 받아들일지도 모르지요."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2691|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"I cannot believe you would enter my presence with a reputation of merely %11!\n"
"The insult is dire indeed, %10.\n"
"Leave, and return when your reputation is %12!"
msgstr ""
"고작 %11의 평판으로 감히 내 앞에 나타나다니 믿을 수 없군요!\n"
"지독한 모욕입니다, %10.\n"
"가십시오. 평판이 %12가 되면 돌아오십시오!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2692|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Today I will grant your wish. I will speak with you.\n"
"Briefly."
msgstr ""
"오늘은 소원을 들어드리지요. 이야기하겠습니다.\n"
"잠깐만."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2693|field=<default>"
msgid "n/a"
msgstr "n/a"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2694|field=<default>"
msgid "n/a"
msgstr "n/a"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2695|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Your paltry wealth isn't enough to even tempt me.\n"
"I will not be bribed."
msgstr ""
"그 보잘것없는 재산으로는 나를 유혹할 수도 없습니다.\n"
"뇌물은 받지 않겠습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2696|field=<default>"
msgid "n/a"
msgstr "n/a"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2697|field=<default>"
msgid "I will not bow to your threats!"
msgstr "협박에 굴복하지 않겠다!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2698|field=<default>"
msgid "Jars. Yessss. You have helped us greatly."
msgstr "항아리. 그래애애. 당신들은 우리에게 큰 도움을 주었습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2699|field=<default>"
msgid "Join guild"
msgstr "길드 가입"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=269|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Unfortunately, there is not enough room in your group for me to join you now.\n"
"I can be found in the Adventurer's Inn if you need me."
msgstr ""
"안타깝게도 지금은 일행에 제가 들어갈 자리가 없습니다.\n"
"필요하다면 모험가의 여관에서 저를 찾으실 수 있습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=26|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Thank you for your assistance with the Basilisk Curse.\n"
"Usually I am prepared to handle the vile lizards, but this time there were just too many of them.The Temple of the Sun asked me to check on a few pilgrims that were looking for the Druid Circle of Stone in this area.\n"
"When I found the first statue, I realized what had happened to the pilgrims.\n"
"I myself did not know of the increase in the number of Basilisks in this area.\n"
"They seem to be agitated by something.\n"
"I was going to investigate the Druid Circle of Stone when the Basilisks attacked me."
msgstr ""
"바실리스크의 저주를 해결하는 데 도와주어 고맙습니다.\n"
"평소라면 그 사악한 도마뱀들을 상대할 준비가 되어 있지만, 이번에는 수가 너무 많았습니다.태양의 신전은 이 지역의 드루이드 돌기둥 원을 찾던 순례자 몇 명의 안부를 확인해 달라고 부탁했습니다.\n"
"첫 번째 석상을 발견했을 때 순례자들에게 무슨 일이 있었는지 깨달았습니다.\n"
"나 역시 이 지역에서 바실리스크 수가 늘어난 줄은 몰랐습니다.\n"
"무언가가 그들을 흥분시킨 듯합니다.\n"
"드루이드 돌기둥 원을 조사하려던 순간 바실리스크들이 나를 공격했습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2700|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Well, sorcerers among you seeking for power of dark arts? Pay 10000 bill and"
" step into our chambers."
msgstr "흠, 그대들 중 어둠의 마법을 갈망하는 마법사가 있나? 10000을 내고 우리 방으로 들어오라."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2701|field=<default>"
msgid "We will not allow any rambler to sneak here. Pay and study or scram!"
msgstr "아무 떠돌이나 몰래 들어오게 둘 수는 없다. 돈을 내고 배우든가, 꺼져라!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2702|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Perfect! Now i call all sorcerers among you necromancers, don't pretend to "
"be good anymore."
msgstr "완벽하군! 이제 그대들 중 모든 마법사를 강령술사라 부르겠다. 더는 선한 척하지 마라."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2703|field=<default>"
msgid "Welcome, necromancers."
msgstr "어서 오라, 강령술사들이여."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2704|field=<default>"
msgid ", "
msgstr ", "

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2705|field=<default>"
msgid "("
msgstr "("

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2706|field=<default>"
msgid ")"
msgstr ")"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2707|field=<default>"
msgid "Well, this is %s."
msgstr "흠, 여기는 %s입니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2708|field=<default>"
msgid "Done!"
msgstr "완료!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2709|field=<default>"
msgid "Anya Charo"
msgstr "아냐 차로"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=270|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"You have to get the plans to him before he attacks Riverstride.\n"
"If you don't, they won't lead his forces into all the traps we've prepared for them.\n"
"So hurry up and deliver those plans!\n"
"I'm counting on you!"
msgstr ""
"그가 리버스트라이드를 공격하기 전에 반드시 계획서를 전달해야 해.\n"
"그러지 않으면 우리가 준비한 함정으로 그의 군대를 유인할 수 없어.\n"
"그러니 서둘러 계획서를 전달해!\n"
"너희를 믿고 있어!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2710|field=<default>"
msgid "Wan Ruchos"
msgstr "완 루초스"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2711|field=<default>"
msgid "Noah Charo"
msgstr "노아 차로"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2712|field=<default>"
msgid "Chan Os Wy"
msgstr "찬 오스 와이"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2713|field=<default>"
msgid "R.C. Wosch"
msgstr "R.C. 워시"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=271|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"You told the king the plans were fake?!?\n"
"[The Queen puts her hand on her head, jaw agape] I have never seen such incompetence in all my life!\n"
"Astounding!\n"
"Get out of my sight!\n"
"Just go!"
msgstr ""
"그 계획서가 가짜라고 왕에게 말했단 말이야?!?\n"
"[여왕이 입을 벌린 채 머리에 손을 얹는다] 평생 이렇게 무능한 자들은 처음 보는군!\n"
"기가 막혀!\n"
"내 눈앞에서 사라져!\n"
"그냥 가버려!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=272|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"[The Queen raises her eyebrows with interest as you tell her how you infiltrated her fort, stole secret plans, and killed many of her guards while in the service of a foreign king] I wish I could truthfully say this is the most shocking treason I have ever witnessed, but unfortunately, it's not.\n"
"Nonetheless...Guards!\n"
"Off with their heads!"
msgstr ""
"[여왕은 당신이 외국 왕을 섬기며 자신의 요새에 잠입해 비밀 계획서를 훔치고 수많은 경비병을 죽였다는 이야기를 듣고 흥미롭다는 듯 눈썹을 치켜올린다] 이것이 내가 목격한 가장 충격적인 반역이라고 솔직히 말할 수 있으면 좋겠지만, 안타깝게도 그렇지는 않군.\n"
"그래도… 경비병!\n"
"저들의 목을 쳐라!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=273|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Well, time ran out for poor Loren.\n"
"He was executed for espionage by Avlee on schedule.\n"
"Don't bother with the rescue.\n"
"He's gone."
msgstr ""
"불쌍한 로렌에게 주어진 시간이 끝났군.\n"
"그는 예정대로 애블리에서 간첩죄로 처형되었다.\n"
"구출하려 애쓸 필요 없다.\n"
"이미 죽었다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=274|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"King Parson is beyond the date when he could have used those false papers.\n"
"Don't bother taking them to him--it doesn't matter anymore."
msgstr ""
"파슨 왕이 그 가짜 문서를 활용할 수 있는 시한이 지났다.\n"
"그에게 가져갈 필요 없다. 이제는 아무 소용도 없어."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=275|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Welcome.\n"
"I understand you've been appointed Lords of Harmondale by that idiot Markham.\n"
"You know, I WILL restore Avlee's rule over Harmondale--the only question is whether you are with me, or against me.\n"
"If you're with me, I will ensure that you retain your post.\n"
"Against me, and I will have done with you once my armies occupy your lands.\n"
"[King Parson smiles affably] So, of course you're with me!\n"
"You just need to prove it.\n"
"Like a famous leader once said:\n"
"Trust, but verify!\n"
"Words to live by.\n"
"What I want right now is the plans to Fort Riverstride.\n"
"It's a huge fort that stands between your lands and Erathia proper.\n"
"You can't miss the thing.\n"
"Sneak in there and get me those plans.\n"
"If you can do this, I will be in your debt.\n"
"Not only that, there's a substantial gold reward as well.\n"
"If the plans are to be any use to me at all, though, I need them delivered to me within a month."
msgstr ""
"환영한다.\n"
"그 멍청이 마크햄이 너희를 하몬데일의 영주로 임명했다는 말을 들었다.\n"
"잘 들어라. 나는 반드시 하몬데일에 대한 애블리의 지배를 회복할 것이다. 중요한 건 너희가 내 편인지 적인지뿐이다.\n"
"내 편이라면 너희의 지위를 보장하겠다.\n"
"적이라면 내 군대가 너희 땅을 점령하는 즉시 너희를 처리하겠다.\n"
"[파슨 왕이 상냥하게 미소 짓는다] 그러니 당연히 내 편이겠지!\n"
"그 사실을 증명하기만 하면 된다.\n"
"어느 유명한 지도자가 이런 말을 했지.\n"
"믿되, 검증하라!\n"
"명심할 만한 말이다.\n"
"지금 내가 원하는 것은 리버스트라이드 요새의 계획서다.\n"
"너희 땅과 에라시아 본토 사이에 있는 거대한 요새지.\n"
"못 찾을 리가 없다.\n"
"그곳에 잠입해 계획서를 가져와라.\n"
"성공한다면 내가 너희에게 빚을 지게 될 것이다.\n"
"게다가 상당한 금화 보상도 주겠다.\n"
"다만 계획서가 쓸모 있으려면 한 달 안에 내게 전달해야 한다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=276|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"[The King smiles broadly as you hand him the plans]\n"
"Thank you!\n"
"These will be VERY useful.\n"
"My factor will deposit 5,000 gold pieces in your bank account for services rendered.\n"
"When we finally win this round against Erathia, I will not forget you."
msgstr ""
"[왕은 당신이 계획서를 건네자 활짝 웃는다]\n"
"고맙다!\n"
"아주 유용하게 쓰일 것이다.\n"
"수고의 대가로 내 대리인이 너희 은행 계좌에 금화 5,000개를 입금할 것이다.\n"
"이번 전쟁에서 에라시아를 이기고 나면 너희를 잊지 않겠다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=277|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"I really do need those plans soon.\n"
"If you take too long, I'll have to prepare my attack without the plans."
msgstr ""
"그 계획서가 정말 곧 필요하다.\n"
"너무 늦으면 계획서 없이 공격을 준비해야 한다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=278|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"[The King smiles broadly as you hand him the false plans.\n"
"Sucker! ]\n"
"Thank you!\n"
"These will be VERY useful.\n"
"When we finally win this round against Erathia, I will not forget you."
msgstr ""
"[왕은 당신이 가짜 계획서를 건네자 활짝 웃는다.\n"
"멍청한 놈!]\n"
"고맙다!\n"
"아주 유용하게 쓰일 것이다.\n"
"이번 전쟁에서 에라시아를 이기고 나면 너희를 잊지 않겠다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=279|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"What do you mean, these plans are false?\n"
"So you admit to plotting against me?\n"
"[The King throws up his hands in disgust] Guards!\n"
"Take these traitors to the courtyard and execute them!"
msgstr ""
"이 계획서가 가짜라니 무슨 소리냐?\n"
"그렇다면 나를 해칠 음모를 꾸몄다고 인정하는 것이냐?\n"
"[왕이 역겨운 듯 두 손을 내젓는다] 경비병!\n"
"이 반역자들을 안뜰로 끌고 가 처형해라!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=27|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"::Cauri looks over the Dark Elf(s) in your party::To rescue me, you must have researched my path, and investigated the places I had been.\n"
"This demonstrates the intelligence needed to succeed in dealing with the world and business.To get to where I was attacked, you must have the skills needed to fight the Basilisks and other threats, demonstrating your prowess as a warrior.\n"
"Skill in battle is needed when proper negotiations break down.To ask me for promotion demonstrates desire, and without desire success will always escape your grasp.You have all of the traits necessary to hold the title of Patriarch.\n"
"I will notify to Council upon my return.\n"
"It would be my pleasure to travel with you again.\n"
"You can find me in the Inn in Ravenshore."
msgstr ""
"::카우리가 일행의 다크 엘프들을 살펴본다::나를 구하려면 내가 지나온 길을 조사하고, 내가 들렀던 장소들을 살펴보았어야 합니다.\n"
"이는 세상과 사업을 상대하며 성공하는 데 필요한 지혜를 보여줍니다.내가 공격받은 곳까지 오려면 바실리스크와 다른 위협에 맞설 능력이 필요했을 테니, 전사로서의 기량도 증명했습니다.\n"
"제대로 된 협상이 무너졌을 때는 전투 능력이 필요합니다.내게 승급을 요청했다는 것은 열망이 있다는 뜻이며, 열망 없이는 성공이 언제나 손아귀에서 빠져나갈 것입니다.당신은 족장의 칭호를 지닐 자질을 모두 갖추었습니다.\n"
"돌아가면 평의회에 알리겠습니다.\n"
"다시 당신과 함께 여행할 수 있다면 기쁘겠습니다.\n"
"레이븐쇼어의 여관에서 나를 찾을 수 있습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=280|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"The wily queen moves against me, eh?\n"
"[The King frowns in thought, then brightens] I have an idea!\n"
"I know someone who looks just like that spy she wants you to rescue.\n"
"Bring my man with you and deliver him to the Queen.\n"
"She's never met him, and won't know the difference.\n"
"His 'inside information' will encourage her to make mistakes.\n"
"[The King takes a moment to summon the imposter]\n"
"Be careful not to tip your hand.\n"
"It wouldn't do for her to discover our little plan."
msgstr ""
"교활한 여왕이 나를 노린다 이거군?\n"
"[왕은 생각에 잠겨 얼굴을 찌푸리다가 이내 표정이 밝아진다] 좋은 생각이 났다!\n"
"그녀가 구출하라고 한 첩자와 똑같이 생긴 사람을 알고 있다.\n"
"내 사람을 데려가 여왕에게 넘겨라.\n"
"그녀는 진짜를 만난 적이 없으니 차이를 알아채지 못할 것이다.\n"
"그의 '내부 정보'는 여왕이 실수를 저지르게 만들겠지.\n"
"[왕은 잠시 시간을 내 가짜 첩자를 부른다]\n"
"속셈을 들키지 않도록 조심해라.\n"
"그녀가 우리의 작은 계획을 알아내면 곤란하니까."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=281|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"The imposter has infiltrated her military and diplomatic advisors' ranks, and will cause plenty of damage before he's discovered, I'm sure.\n"
"Thank you for your help! My factor will deposit 5000 gold into your account at the bank."
msgstr ""
"그 가짜 첩자는 여왕의 군사 및 외교 고문단에 침투했으며, 발각되기 전까지 큰 피해를 줄 것이다.\n"
"도와줘서 고맙다! 내 대리인이 은행 계좌에 금화 5,000개를 입금할 것이다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=282|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"It's important to get the imposter to the Queen before Mr. Steel's scheduled execution.\n"
"After all, you can't rescue Mr. Steel if everyone knows I've executed him.\n"
"And she'll become suspicious if I stay the execution.\n"
"I've never stayed one before."
msgstr ""
"스틸 씨의 예정된 처형일 전에 가짜 첩자를 여왕에게 데려가는 것이 중요하다.\n"
"내가 이미 스틸 씨를 처형했다는 사실을 모두가 안다면 그를 구출할 수는 없으니까.\n"
"그렇다고 처형을 미루면 여왕이 의심할 것이다.\n"
"나는 한 번도 처형을 미룬 적이 없거든."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=283|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"You told Queen Catherine about the imposter?!? I can't believe my ears!\n"
"Why did you do it?\n"
"Why?\n"
"[The King stands and points at the door] Get out!"
msgstr ""
"가짜 첩자에 대해 캐서린 여왕에게 말했단 말이냐?!? 내 귀를 믿을 수가 없군!\n"
"왜 그랬지?\n"
"대체 왜?\n"
"[왕이 일어서서 문을 가리킨다] 나가라!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=284|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"[The king is silent while you detail your crimes against Avlee, then smiles and spreads his hands once you've finished] Well!\n"
"I suppose that story speaks for itself, doesn't it?\n"
"Guards!\n"
"Take these traitors to the courtyard and execute them!"
msgstr ""
"[왕은 당신이 애블리를 상대로 저지른 범죄를 나열하는 동안 말없이 듣다가, 이야기가 끝나자 미소 지으며 두 손을 펼친다] 그래!\n"
"그 이야기가 모든 것을 말해 주는군, 안 그런가?\n"
"경비병!\n"
"이 반역자들을 안뜰로 끌고 가 처형해라!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=285|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"The time where I could have used those plans is over.\n"
"Thanks for any efforts you may have put into finding them, but I no longer need the plans."
msgstr ""
"그 계획서를 활용할 수 있는 시기는 지났다.\n"
"찾기 위해 애쓴 점은 고맙지만 이제 계획서는 필요 없다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=286|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"The execution date for Loren Steel has passed.\n"
"Don't bother bringing the imposter to the Queen--she'll be too suspicious for our ruse to succeed.\n"
"He'll be leaving you now."
msgstr ""
"로렌 스틸의 처형일이 지났다.\n"
"가짜 첩자를 여왕에게 데려갈 필요 없다. 이제는 여왕이 너무 의심해 계략이 통하지 않을 것이다.\n"
"그자는 지금 일행을 떠날 것이다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=287|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"My loyal subjects!\n"
"You were the ones who took the Trumpet!\n"
"Good work.\n"
"We thought it lost forever.\n"
"Once again, my purser will deposit gold in your account.\n"
"5,000 gold, to be exact."
msgstr ""
"충성스러운 신하들이여!\n"
"트럼펫을 차지한 자들이 바로 너희였군!\n"
"잘했다.\n"
"영원히 잃어버린 줄 알았다.\n"
"이번에도 내 회계관이 너희 계좌에 금화를 입금할 것이다.\n"
"정확히 금화 5,000개다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=288|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Ah, the Trumpet!\n"
"You captured it!\n"
"We weren't sure how things turned out when news of the human raid reached us.\n"
"Thank you again, my friends.\n"
"My factor will deposit 5,000 gold in your account for your services."
msgstr ""
"아, 트럼펫!\n"
"그것을 손에 넣었군!\n"
"인간들의 습격 소식이 전해졌을 때 결과를 알 수 없었다.\n"
"다시 한번 고맙다, 친구들이여.\n"
"내 대리인이 수고의 대가로 너희 계좌에 금화 5,000개를 입금할 것이다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=289|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"If there is one piece of advice I could give you, it would be to fix your castle.\n"
"I don't know how you're going to find the gold and workers to do it, as only wealthy nobles and kings can afford such large scale projects.\n"
"I suppose it's the old chicken and egg question...you must appear noble to gain wealth and respect, but you must have wealth and respect in order to appear noble.\n"
"In any event, if you expect to be lords of Harmondale for more than a few months, you need to find a way to prove you're not just lucky peasants.\n"
"You must prove that you're fit to rule."
msgstr ""
"한 가지 조언을 하자면 성을 수리하라는 것이다.\n"
"금과 일꾼을 어떻게 구할지는 모르겠다. 그런 대규모 공사는 부유한 귀족이나 왕만 감당할 수 있으니까.\n"
"닭이 먼저냐 달걀이 먼저냐 하는 오래된 문제와 같군… 부와 존경을 얻으려면 귀족다운 모습을 보여야 하지만, 귀족다운 모습을 보이려면 먼저 부와 존경이 필요하다.\n"
"어쨌든 몇 달 이상 하몬데일의 영주로 남고 싶다면 그저 운 좋은 농민이 아니라는 점을 증명해야 한다.\n"
"통치할 자격이 있음을 보여라."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=28|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"I need to investigate the Circle of Stone further for the Temple of the Sun.\n"
"Hopefully not all of the pilgrims met the fate of these. Hopefully there are survivors!Something has agitated the creatures in this area, and I think the source can be found in the Circle."
msgstr ""
"태양의 신전을 위해 돌기둥 원을 더 조사해야 합니다.\n"
"순례자 모두가 이들과 같은 운명을 맞지는 않았기를 바랍니다. 생존자가 있기를 바랍니다!무언가가 이 지역의 생물들을 흥분시켰고, 그 원인이 돌기둥 원에 있다고 생각합니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=290|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Once again, the Human kingdom of Erathia and the Elvish kingdom of Harmondale are fighting.\n"
"As the local Judge, it has fallen to me to patch up their differences and bring the two sides to the negotiating table.\n"
"The two sides are so evenly matched that either could prevail.\n"
"[The judge leans closer to you, lowering his voice] And I'll tell you something else--I don't much care anymore who wins.\n"
"They are like children fighting over a toy.\n"
"Neither really wants Harmondale--they just want to deny it to the other.\n"
"So, you're on your own.\n"
"Whatever actions you take now in support of one side or another could really make a difference.\n"
"Just remember that they couldn't possibly care less what happens to you or who rules in Harmondale.\n"
"Protect yourselves and your people first.\n"
"We didn't have this conversation."
msgstr ""
"또다시 인간 왕국 에라시아와 엘프 왕국 애블리가 전쟁을 벌이고 있다.\n"
"지역의 판관인 내가 양측의 갈등을 봉합하고 협상 테이블로 이끌 책임을 맡았다.\n"
"두 진영의 힘이 너무 비슷해 어느 쪽이 이겨도 이상하지 않다.\n"
"[판관이 몸을 가까이 기울이며 목소리를 낮춘다] 솔직히 말하자면 이제 누가 이기든 별로 관심도 없다.\n"
"장난감을 두고 다투는 아이들과 같아.\n"
"어느 쪽도 하몬데일을 진정으로 원하는 게 아니다. 그저 상대가 차지하지 못하게 하려는 것뿐이지.\n"
"그러니 이제 너희 스스로 판단해야 한다.\n"
"어느 한쪽을 돕기 위해 취하는 행동이 실제로 큰 차이를 만들 수 있다.\n"
"다만 그들은 너희에게 무슨 일이 생기든, 누가 하몬데일을 다스리든 전혀 신경 쓰지 않는다는 점을 기억해라.\n"
"무엇보다 너희 자신과 백성을 먼저 지켜라.\n"
"우리는 이런 대화를 나눈 적이 없다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=291|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"You were wise to return the Trumpet to me.\n"
"Now I can use it to help shore up the weak side in this conflict and promote peace.\n"
"Thank you."
msgstr ""
"트럼펫을 내게 돌려준 것은 현명한 선택이었다.\n"
"이제 그것을 이용해 이 분쟁에서 약한 쪽을 보강하고 평화를 촉진할 수 있다.\n"
"고맙다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=292|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"A wise decision.\n"
"You won't regret this--believe me.\n"
"I knew you were going to make this decision, and my bags are already packed and ready to go.\n"
"All you need to do now is get me to my new home, and I'll take care of the rest."
msgstr ""
"현명한 결정이군.\n"
"후회하지 않을 것이다. 믿어도 좋다.\n"
"네가 이런 결정을 내릴 줄 알고 있었기에 짐도 이미 다 싸 두었다.\n"
"이제 나를 새 거처로 데려가기만 하면 나머지는 내가 알아서 하겠다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=293|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Your first order of business is to talk to Lord Ironfist and complete his 'mission.'\n"
"Once your ability and loyalty are proven, you will be allowed to help in more…interesting… ways."
msgstr ""
"먼저 아이언피스트 경과 이야기해 그의 '임무'를 완수해라.\n"
"능력과 충성심을 증명하면 더… 흥미로운… 일에 참여할 수 있을 것이다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=294|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Each of the advisors to Lord Ironfist has a task for you, complete each one.\n"
"Talk to Kastore, Dark Shade, and Maaximus for more information.\n"
"The completion of these tasks is vital for our future."
msgstr ""
"아이언피스트 경의 고문들은 각자 너희에게 맡길 일이 있다. 모두 완수해라.\n"
"자세한 내용은 캐스토어, 다크 셰이드, 막시무스와 이야기해라.\n"
"이 임무들을 완수하는 것은 우리의 미래에 매우 중요하다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=295|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Tolberti has a mission of great importance.\n"
"Everything we've staked so far rests on its completion.\n"
"Prepare well for his task or you will certainly fail."
msgstr ""
"톨베르티에게 대단히 중요한 임무가 있다.\n"
"지금까지 우리가 걸어 온 모든 것이 그 임무의 성공에 달려 있다.\n"
"철저히 준비하지 않으면 반드시 실패할 것이다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=296|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Xenofex and the rest of the Kreegan must be put down; go to their 'hive' in "
"the Land of the Giants and put a stop to Xenofex and his minions once and "
"for all."
msgstr ""
"제노펙스와 나머지 크리건을 반드시 제거해야 한다. 거인의 땅에 있는 그들의 '하이브'로 가서 제노펙스와 부하들을 영원히 끝장내라."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=297|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"You will need to visit the craft that brought Kastore and his men to Erathia to continue.\n"
"Go west of Avlee, and make sure to be properly outfitted."
msgstr ""
"계속 진행하려면 캐스토어와 그의 부하들을 에라시아로 데려온 비행선을 찾아가야 한다.\n"
"애블리 서쪽으로 가되 장비를 제대로 갖춰라."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=298|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Bring the Oscillation Overthruster back to Kastore with all possible speed!\n"
"Every moment you dally allows a chance for failure!"
msgstr ""
"가능한 한 빨리 진동 오버스러스터를 캐스토어에게 가져가라!\n"
"지체하는 매 순간 실패할 가능성이 커진다!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=299|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Great!\n"
"You've done the right thing!\n"
"Though the path of light can be hard to walk at times, the ultimate rewards are well worth it.\n"
"I'm already prepared for the trip.\n"
"All you need to do now is get me to my new home, and I'll take care of the rest."
msgstr ""
"훌륭해!\n"
"옳은 선택을 했어!\n"
"빛의 길은 때때로 걷기 힘들지만 마지막에 얻는 보상은 그만한 가치가 있지.\n"
"나는 이미 떠날 준비를 마쳤어.\n"
"이제 나를 새 거처로 데려가기만 하면 나머지는 내가 알아서 할게."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=29|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"You know…I have a power stone that will activate the portal to the abandoned"
" temple. And you have one that will allow us to reach the island where that "
"portal is!If we joined forces, we could reach the temple with ease. What say"
" you?Fredrick Talimere offers to join your party."
msgstr ""
"있잖습니까…내게는 버려진 신전으로 통하는 관문을 작동시킬 동력석이 있습니다. 그리고 당신에게는 그 관문이 있는 섬으로 갈 수 있게 해주는"
" 돌이 있군요!힘을 합치면 손쉽게 신전에 도달할 수 있을 것입니다. 어떻습니까?프레드릭 탈리미어가 일행에 합류하겠다고 제안합니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=2|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Dadeross led us here to trade with the Lizardman Clan of Onefang for their tobersk fruit.\n"
"He has gone to talk with Brekish Onefang, the village leader.\n"
"Perhaps you should look for him?"
msgstr ""
"다데로스는 원팽 리자드맨 부족과 토버스크 열매를 거래하기 위해 우리를 이곳으로 이끌었습니다.\n"
"그는 마을의 지도자인 브레키시 원팽과 이야기하러 갔습니다.\n"
"그를 찾아보는 게 어떻겠습니까?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=300|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"So you seek to further your skills with the staff? Excellent! The staff can "
"work offensively and defensively, and make you more difficult to hit. My "
"teachings will raise you to Expert level, but first you must have a skill "
"level of 4 with the staff and of course there is my small fee of 2000 gold."
msgstr ""
"지팡이 기술을 더욱 갈고닦고 싶다고? 훌륭하군! 지팡이는 공격과 방어 모두에 활용할 수 있고, 적의 공격을 피하기도 쉬워진다. 내 "
"가르침을 받으면 전문가 등급에 오를 수 있지만, 먼저 지팡이 기술이 4 이상이어야 하며 물론 소정의 수업료 금화 2,000개도 필요하다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=301|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"You wish to continue on the path of mastery of the staff? If you prove an apt pupil and have already achieved an Expert skill level of 7 with the staff, I will gladly instruct you to Master level for 5000 gold.\n"
"With the skills I will teach you will have a chance to stun your opponent!"
msgstr ""
"지팡이 숙련의 길을 계속 걷고 싶다고? 자질을 증명하고 지팡이 전문가 기술이 7 이상이라면, 금화 5,000개에 기꺼이 달인 등급까지 가르쳐 주지.\n"
"내가 가르치는 기술을 익히면 상대를 기절시킬 기회를 얻게 될 것이다!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=302|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"To achieve Grand Mastery of the staff, you must deal with me! Before I can instruct you, you must have reached a Master Skill level of 10 with the staff, and pay my price of 8000 gold.\n"
"If you meet my qualifications, I will teach you to wield the staff dealing out addition damage equal to the level of your skill."
msgstr ""
"지팡이의 그랜드마스터가 되려면 나를 찾아야 한다! 가르침을 받으려면 먼저 지팡이 달인 기술이 10 이상이어야 하고, 수업료로 금화 8,000개를 내야 한다.\n"
"조건을 충족하면 기술 수준만큼 추가 피해를 주도록 지팡이를 다루는 법을 가르쳐 주겠다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=303|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"So the sword is your weapon of choice, and you would like to have the skill to slay more effectively? Then I can help you!\n"
"My instruction will teach you to use your blade more quickly than before. If you have 2000 gold and have reached a skill level of 4 with the sword, I will instruct you to Expert level."
msgstr ""
"검을 주 무기로 택했고, 더 효율적으로 적을 베는 기술을 배우고 싶다고? 그렇다면 내가 도와주지!\n"
"내 가르침을 받으면 전보다 더 빠르게 검을 휘두를 수 있다. 검 기술이 4 이상이고 금화 2,000개가 있다면 전문가 등급까지 가르쳐 주겠다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=304|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Bah!\n"
"Even the strongest plate armor can be sliced like a melon by someone who can wield a sword with Mastery!\n"
"With an Expert sword level of 7 and 5000 gold this I can teach you!\n"
" With the skills I teach, you can carry another weapon in your left hand, making you twice as deadly."
msgstr ""
"흥!\n"
"아무리 튼튼한 판금 갑옷이라도 검의 달인 앞에서는 멜론처럼 잘려 나가지!\n"
"검 전문가 기술이 7 이상이고 금화 5,000개가 있다면 내가 가르쳐 주마!\n"
" 내가 가르치는 기술을 익히면 왼손에도 무기를 들 수 있어, 두 배로 치명적인 전사가 될 것이다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=305|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Even the cheapest steel can save the life of a warrior who has achieved Grand Mastery of the sword. With Grand Mastery you will be more difficult to hit.\n"
"If you have reached a Master skill of 10 with the sword and can pay my fee of 8000, I will teach you all the techniques of a Grand Master Swordsman."
msgstr ""
"아무리 값싼 강철검이라도 검의 그랜드마스터가 쥐면 전사의 목숨을 구할 수 있다. 그랜드마스터가 되면 적의 공격도 더 잘 피하게 되지.\n"
"검 달인 기술이 10 이상이고 수업료 금화 8,000개를 낼 수 있다면, 그랜드마스터 검사에게 필요한 모든 기술을 가르쳐 주겠다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=306|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"I have a dagger and I bet I can kill you before you draw yours! Speed can "
"kill and the dagger is the fastest weapon! With what I can teach you, you "
"can carry another weapon in your off hand. Two are better than one. The "
"Expert skills of the dagger can be yours if you have a dagger skill level of"
" 4 and can pay my modest fee of 2000 gold."
msgstr ""
"내게는 단검이 하나 있지. 네가 단검을 뽑기도 전에 널 죽일 수 있다고 장담한다! 속도는 목숨을 앗아가고, 단검은 가장 빠른 무기다! "
"내가 가르치는 기술을 익히면 다른 손에도 무기를 들 수 있다. 하나보다는 둘이 낫지. 단검 기술이 4 이상이고 소정의 수업료 금화 "
"2,000개를 낼 수 있다면 단검 전문가가 될 수 있다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=307|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Ha!\n"
"The fastest survive! As a Master of the dagger I have and will survive! My teachings can greatly increase your chance of causing critical damage! If you have an Expert skill level of 7 and 5000 gold I can lead you to Mastery!"
msgstr ""
"하!\n"
"가장 빠른 자만 살아남는다! 나는 단검의 달인이기에 지금껏 살아남았고 앞으로도 살아남을 것이다! 내 가르침을 받으면 치명타를 입힐 확률이 크게 높아진다! 단검 전문가 기술이 7 이상이고 금화 5,000개가 있다면 달인의 경지로 이끌어 주지!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=308|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"The quickest dagger--the one that is never seen--is the ultimate weapon.\n"
"You can rapidly attack your foe before he has a chance to strike you once.\n"
"With Grand Mastery of the dagger, this can be yours.\n"
"You must have a Master skill level of 10 and 8000 gold to receive my instruction."
msgstr ""
"가장 빠른 단검, 즉 눈에 보이지도 않는 단검이야말로 궁극의 무기다.\n"
"적이 한 번 공격할 틈도 주지 않고 재빨리 베어 버릴 수 있지.\n"
"단검의 그랜드마스터가 되면 그 경지에 이를 수 있다.\n"
"내 가르침을 받으려면 단검 달인 기술이 10 이상이어야 하고 금화 8,000개를 내야 한다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=309|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Speed kills, especially when that speed is driving an axe. With my "
"instruction you can have this Expert ability. You will strike more quickly "
"than before, demolishing your foes! You must first have a skill level of 4 "
"with the axe and pay my price of 2000 gold."
msgstr ""
"속도는 목숨을 앗아간다. 특히 그 속도가 도끼에 실렸다면 더욱 그렇지. 내 가르침을 받으면 도끼 전문가의 능력을 얻을 수 있다. 전보다 "
"훨씬 빠르게 도끼를 휘둘러 적을 박살 내게 될 것이다! 먼저 도끼 기술이 4 이상이어야 하고 수업료로 금화 2,000개를 내야 한다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=30|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Cauri returned and informed us of this assistance you provided her.\n"
"She also notified us of your promotion.\n"
"Congratulations, may your profits bring you much joy!"
msgstr ""
"카우리가 돌아와 당신이 자신에게 베푼 도움을 알려주었습니다.\n"
"또한 당신의 승급 소식도 전해주었습니다.\n"
"축하합니다. 당신이 거두는 이익이 큰 기쁨을 가져다주기를!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=310|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Mastery of the axe and skilled hands can split an opponent's head like a "
"pudding. With my instruction you can have this ability! You blows will cause"
" more damage than before, devastating your opponents! But first you must "
"have an Expert skill level of 7 with the axe and pay my price of 5000 gold."
msgstr ""
"도끼를 달인의 솜씨로 다루면 상대의 머리를 푸딩처럼 쪼갤 수 있다. 내 가르침을 받으면 그 능력을 얻을 수 있지! 전보다 더 큰 피해를 "
"주어 적을 처참하게 만들 것이다! 단, 먼저 도끼 전문가 기술이 7 이상이어야 하고 금화 5,000개를 내야 한다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=311|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"As a Grand Master of the axe, your opponents' armor will mean nothing.\n"
"The effectiveness of their armor will be cut in half as you slice it from their carcasses! I can teach you this skill, but you first must have a Master skill level of 10 with the axe and pay me 8000 gold."
msgstr ""
"도끼의 그랜드마스터가 되면 적의 갑옷 따위는 아무 의미도 없어진다.\n"
"놈들의 시체에서 갑옷을 잘라 내는 동안 방어 효과도 절반으로 줄어들지! 이 기술을 가르쳐 줄 수 있지만, 먼저 도끼 달인 기술이 10 이상이어야 하고 금화 8,000개를 내야 한다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=312|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Spear expertise makes you one with your weapon.\n"
"With this skill you will cause more damage to your foes.\n"
"I can raise you to an Expert level if your skill level is 4 and you have 2000 gold."
msgstr ""
"창 전문가가 되면 무기와 한 몸이 된다.\n"
"이 기술을 익히면 적에게 더 큰 피해를 줄 수 있다.\n"
"창 기술이 4 이상이고 금화 2,000개가 있다면 전문가 등급까지 올려 주겠다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=313|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"The spear is your weapon of choice? Would you like to learn to carry a shield or another weapon in your off hand to improve your combat ability?\n"
"This Master knowledge can be yours if you have an Expert skill level of 7 with the spear and 5000 gold."
msgstr ""
"창을 주 무기로 택했나? 전투 능력을 높이기 위해 다른 손에 방패나 또 다른 무기를 드는 법을 배우고 싶은가?\n"
"창 전문가 기술이 7 이상이고 금화 5,000개가 있다면 달인의 지식을 배울 수 있다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=314|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"So you seek to further your skills with the spear? Excellent! The spear can "
"work offensively and defensively, and make you more difficult to hit. My "
"teachings will raise you to Grand Master, but first you must have a Master "
"skill level of 10 with the spear and of course there is my small fee of 8000"
" gold."
msgstr ""
"창술을 더욱 갈고닦고 싶다고? 훌륭하군! 창은 공격과 방어 모두에 활용할 수 있고, 적의 공격도 더 잘 피하게 해 준다. 내 가르침을 "
"받으면 그랜드마스터가 될 수 있지만, 먼저 창 달인 기술이 10 이상이어야 하며 물론 소정의 수업료 금화 8,000개도 필요하다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=315|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Like to keep your enemy beyond arm's reach do you?\n"
"The bow is the best way to slay your enemy before he can harm you.\n"
"With my teachings you'll reach Expert status and be able to fire your bow more quickly, thus eliminating your enemy at range.\n"
"I will teach you if your skill level with the bow is 4 and you pay the price of 2000 gold."
msgstr ""
"적을 팔이 닿지 않는 곳에 두고 싸우고 싶은가?\n"
"활은 적이 너를 해치기 전에 쓰러뜨릴 수 있는 최고의 무기다.\n"
"내 가르침을 받으면 활 전문가가 되어 더 빠르게 화살을 쏘고, 멀리서 적을 제거할 수 있다.\n"
"활 기술이 4 이상이고 금화 2,000개를 낸다면 가르쳐 주겠다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=316|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Think you are fast with the bow?\n"
"The speed you have now is nothing compared to what I can teach you.\n"
"My Master lessons can teach you to fire 2 arrows where Experts can only fire one.\n"
"This requires an Expert skill of 7 with the bow and the fee of 5000 gold."
msgstr ""
"활을 빠르게 쏜다고 생각하나?\n"
"지금의 속도는 내가 가르칠 기술에 비하면 아무것도 아니다.\n"
"달인의 가르침을 받으면 전문가가 한 발 쏠 때 두 발을 쏠 수 있다.\n"
"활 전문가 기술이 7 이상이어야 하고 수업료는 금화 5,000개다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=317|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Speed with the bow can definitely be an advantage, but that speed combined with the knowledge of how to seriously injure your foe can be the difference between life and death.\n"
"I will teach you Grand Mastery of the bow and you will increase the amount of damage that each shot does.\n"
"You must be a Master with a skill level of 10 and pay 8000 gold for this instruction."
msgstr ""
"활을 빠르게 쏘는 것은 분명 장점이지만, 그 속도에 적에게 치명상을 입히는 지식까지 더해지면 생사가 갈릴 수 있다.\n"
"활의 그랜드마스터가 되도록 가르쳐 주겠다. 그러면 화살 한 발 한 발의 피해량이 늘어난다.\n"
"활 달인 기술이 10 이상이어야 하고 수업료로 금화 8,000개를 내야 한다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=318|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"The mace is a subtle weapon.\n"
"Where blades and dagger slash the flesh, the mace can break bones and destroy organs without all the bloody mess. As an Expert with the mace you will inflict more damage, increasing combat effectiveness.\n"
"If you have achieved a skill level of 4 and pay 2000 I will instruct you."
msgstr ""
"철퇴는 섬세한 무기다.\n"
"검과 단검이 살을 가르는 동안, 철퇴는 피를 흩뿌리지 않고도 뼈를 부수고 장기를 파괴할 수 있지. 철퇴 전문가가 되면 더 큰 피해를 주어 전투 효율이 높아진다.\n"
"철퇴 기술이 4 이상이고 금화 2,000개를 낸다면 가르쳐 주겠다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=319|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Who needs subtlety when your opponent is unconscious?\n"
"Mastery of the mace will give you the chance to stun or even paralyze your enemy.\n"
"For 5000 gold and proof that you have reached an Expert skill level of 7, I will teach you Mastery of the mace."
msgstr ""
"상대가 의식을 잃었다면 섬세함이 무슨 소용이겠나?\n"
"철퇴의 달인이 되면 적을 기절시키거나 심지어 마비시킬 기회를 얻게 된다.\n"
"철퇴 전문가 기술이 7 이상임을 증명하고 금화 5,000개를 낸다면 달인의 경지로 가르쳐 주겠다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=31|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Cauri Blackthorne was here well over a week ago, maybe longer.\n"
"She had asked us many questions about the elemental incursions.\n"
"We provided her with what information we had here.\n"
"She said she would return to Alvar with the information.\n"
"Before she left, we asked her if she could do a favor for us.\n"
"We asked her if she could check on a group of pilgrims that were traveling to the old Druid Circle of Stone to the northeast of here.\n"
"She assured us that she would check in on them on her way back to Alvar."
msgstr ""
"카우리 블랙손은 일주일도 훨씬 전에 이곳에 왔습니다. 어쩌면 그보다 더 오래되었을 겁니다.\n"
"그녀는 정령들의 침입에 관해 많은 질문을 했습니다.\n"
"우리는 이곳에서 알고 있던 정보를 제공했습니다.\n"
"그녀는 그 정보를 가지고 알바르로 돌아가겠다고 했습니다.\n"
"떠나기 전, 우리는 부탁 하나를 들어줄 수 있는지 물었습니다.\n"
"이곳 북동쪽의 오래된 드루이드 돌기둥 원으로 향하던 순례자 무리의 안부를 확인해 달라고 부탁했습니다.\n"
"그녀는 알바르로 돌아가는 길에 그들을 확인하겠다고 약속했습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=320|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"A greater chance to subdue your foes means a smaller chance you will be hurt yourself.\n"
"Grand Mastery of the mace will increase your chances of stunning or even paralyzing your foes.\n"
"If you have a Master skill level of 10 and can pay me 8000 gold, I will instruct you."
msgstr ""
"적을 제압할 가능성이 커질수록 네가 다칠 가능성은 줄어든다.\n"
"철퇴의 그랜드마스터가 되면 적을 기절시키거나 마비시킬 확률이 더욱 높아진다.\n"
"철퇴 달인 기술이 10 이상이고 금화 8,000개를 낼 수 있다면 가르쳐 주겠다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=321|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Well, now that things seem to be settled with our little war with the Temple"
" of the Sun. Sandro has said that guild members may turn their attention to "
"other matters. Since arriving in Jadame, I have seen little of it save for "
"the lands of Shadowspire. Say...perhaps you could use my services!"
msgstr ""
"자, 태양의 신전과 벌이던 작은 전쟁도 이제 어느 정도 정리된 모양이군. 산드로는 길드원들이 다른 일에 관심을 돌려도 된다고 했다. "
"제이덤에 온 뒤로 섀도스파이어 밖의 땅은 거의 보지 못했지. 잠깐… 혹시 내 도움이 필요하지 않나!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=322|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"I wish I could join with you. Sadly, our war with the Temple of the Sun "
"takes up all of our time. The guild cannot spare me now."
msgstr ""
"나도 함께하고 싶군. 하지만 안타깝게도 태양의 신전과의 전쟁에 모든 시간을 쏟고 있다. 지금 길드는 나를 내보낼 여유가 없어."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=323|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Yes! I would love to join with you. Now that our holy war against the foul "
"Necromancers' Guild seems to be going well, I find I have little to do "
"around here. I will go with you if you will take me."
msgstr ""
"물론이지! 기꺼이 함께하겠다. 사악한 강령술사 길드와 벌이는 성전도 잘 풀리고 있어, 이곳에서는 할 일이 별로 없거든. 받아 준다면 함께"
" 가겠다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=324|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"The shield can be your friend.\n"
"It keeps those who wish you dead from striking at you.\n"
"With the Expert skill in shield I can teach you, you will eliminate the penalty to your weapon's recovery for carrying a shield.\n"
"This skill can be yours for 1000 gold and proof of a skill level of 4 with the shield."
msgstr ""
"방패는 훌륭한 친구가 될 수 있다.\n"
"너를 죽이려는 자들의 공격을 막아 주지.\n"
"내게 방패 전문가 기술을 배우면 방패를 들었을 때 생기는 무기 회복 속도 불이익이 사라진다.\n"
"방패 기술이 4 이상임을 증명하고 금화 1,000개를 내면 배울 수 있다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=325|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Mastery of the shield makes its defensive bonus doubly effective, making you that much harder to hit!\n"
"I will teach you Mastery of the shield if you have reached an Expert skill level of 7 and pay me 3000 gold."
msgstr ""
"방패의 달인이 되면 방어 보너스가 두 배로 적용되어, 훨씬 맞히기 어려운 상대가 된다!\n"
"방패 전문가 기술이 7 이상이고 금화 3,000개를 낸다면 달인의 경지로 가르쳐 주겠다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=326|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Under my Grand Master tutelage, you will learn to make the shield the ultimate defense.\n"
"Not only will it protect you in melee but will also give you the benefits of the Shield spell.\n"
"This skill can be yours if you have reached a Master skill level of 10 with the shield and pay me 7000 gold."
msgstr ""
"내게 그랜드마스터의 가르침을 받으면 방패를 궁극의 방어 수단으로 활용하는 법을 배우게 된다.\n"
"근접 공격을 막아 줄 뿐 아니라 방패 주문의 효과까지 얻게 되지.\n"
"방패 달인 기술이 10 이상이고 금화 7,000개를 낸다면 이 기술을 배울 수 있다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=327|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Leather armor is the lightest protection around.\n"
"It keeps those who wish you dead from harming you.\n"
"With the Expert skill in leather armor, you will eliminate the penalty to your weapon's recovery caused by wearing armor.\n"
"This skill can be yours for 1000 gold and proof of a skill level of 4 in leather."
msgstr ""
"가죽 갑옷은 가장 가벼운 방어구다.\n"
"너를 죽이려는 자들의 공격으로부터 몸을 지켜 주지.\n"
"가죽 갑옷 전문가가 되면 갑옷 착용으로 생기는 무기 회복 속도 불이익이 사라진다.\n"
"가죽 갑옷 기술이 4 이상임을 증명하고 금화 1,000개를 내면 배울 수 있다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=328|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Mastery of leather armor makes its defensive bonus doubly effective, making you that much harder to hit!\n"
"I will teach you Mastery of leather armor if you have reached an Expert skill level of 7 and pay me 3000 gold."
msgstr ""
"가죽 갑옷의 달인이 되면 방어 보너스가 두 배로 적용되어, 훨씬 맞히기 어려운 상대가 된다!\n"
"가죽 갑옷 전문가 기술이 7 이상이고 금화 3,000개를 낸다면 달인의 경지로 가르쳐 주겠다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=329|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Under my Grand Master tutelage, you will learn to make leather armor your ultimate defense.\n"
"Not only will it protect you in melee but will also protect you from the elemental spells of Earth, Air, Fire and Water.\n"
"This skill can be yours if you have reached a Master skill level of 10 with leather armor and pay me 7000 gold."
msgstr ""
"내게 그랜드마스터의 가르침을 받으면 가죽 갑옷을 궁극의 방어 수단으로 활용하는 법을 배우게 된다.\n"
"근접 공격을 막아 줄 뿐 아니라 대지, 대기, 불, 물의 원소 주문에서도 몸을 지켜 주지.\n"
"가죽 갑옷 달인 기술이 10 이상이고 금화 7,000개를 낸다면 이 기술을 배울 수 있다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=32|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"You come to me claiming to have a message from one of my caravan masters. "
"Well, where is it then? If it was so important, perhaps you should have been"
" better about not losing it along the way!"
msgstr ""
"내 대상단장 중 한 명이 보낸 전갈을 가져왔다고 주장하는군. 그런데 어디 있지? 그렇게 중요한 것이었다면 오는 길에 잃어버리지 않도록 더"
" 잘 간수했어야 하는 것 아닌가!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=330|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Chain armor is more durable than leather and offers more protection.\n"
"It keeps those who wish you dead from harming you.\n"
"With the Expert skill in chain armor, you will cut the penalty to your weapon's recovery caused by wearing armor in half.\n"
"This skill can be yours for 1000 gold and proof of a skill level of 4 in chain."
msgstr ""
"사슬 갑옷은 가죽보다 튼튼하고 더 뛰어난 보호력을 제공한다.\n"
"너를 죽이려는 자들의 공격으로부터 몸을 지켜 주지.\n"
"사슬 갑옷 전문가가 되면 갑옷 착용으로 생기는 무기 회복 속도 불이익이 절반으로 줄어든다.\n"
"사슬 갑옷 기술이 4 이상임을 증명하고 금화 1,000개를 내면 배울 수 있다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=331|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Mastery of chain armor eliminates the penalty to your weapon's recovery caused by wearing armor.\n"
"I will teach you Mastery of chain armor if you have reached an Expert skill level of 7 and pay me 3000 gold."
msgstr ""
"사슬 갑옷의 달인이 되면 갑옷 착용으로 생기는 무기 회복 속도 불이익이 완전히 사라진다.\n"
"사슬 갑옷 전문가 기술이 7 이상이고 금화 3,000개를 낸다면 달인의 경지로 가르쳐 주겠다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=332|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Under my Grand Master tutelage, you will learn to make chain armor your ultimate defense.\n"
"Under my instruction you will learn to use chain to take less damage from the physical blows that hit you.\n"
"This skill can be yours if you have reached a Master skill level of 10 with chain armor and pay me 7000 gold."
msgstr ""
"내게 그랜드마스터의 가르침을 받으면 사슬 갑옷을 궁극의 방어 수단으로 활용하는 법을 배우게 된다.\n"
"내 지도를 받으면 사슬 갑옷으로 물리 공격의 피해를 줄이는 법을 익히게 되지.\n"
"사슬 갑옷 달인 기술이 10 이상이고 금화 7,000개를 낸다면 이 기술을 배울 수 있다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
