msgid ""
"With Grand Master Spirit Magic you can learn all of the Grand Master spells for this devotion.\n"
"Higher level spells may prove more potent and of greater assistance to your party.\n"
"Grand Master Spirit Magic can be yours if you have a Master skill level of 10 in Spirit Magic and can pay the price of 8000 gold."
msgstr ""
"영혼 마법 그랜드마스터가 되면 이 계통의 그랜드마스터 주문을 모두 배울 수 있다.\n"
