#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_NPCText.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_NPCText.txt|table=NPCText|id=35|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Listen. We need those boats! Deliver my letter to Arion Hunter. Did you "
"forget? His lair is to the west, up the coast!"
msgstr "잘 듣게. 우리는 그 배들이 필요해! 내 편지를 아리온 헌터에게 전하게. 잊었나? 그의 소굴은 해안을 따라 서쪽에 있네!"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt
