#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=109|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Find and return an Anointed Potion to Languid in the Dagger Wound Islands."
msgstr "기름 부은 약초 물약을 찾아 대거 운드 제도의 랭귀드에게 가져가십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=1105|field=<default>"
msgid "Show Sulman's letter to Andover Potbello in New Sorpigal."
msgstr "뉴 소르피갈의 앤도버 팟벨로에게 설먼의 편지를 보여주십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=1106|field=<default>"
msgid "Bring Sulman's letter to Regent Wilbur Humphrey at Castle Ironfist."
msgstr "아이언피스트 성의 섭정 윌버 험프리에게 설먼의 편지를 가져가십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=1107|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Find the Combination to the vault door in Goblinwatch and return to the Town"
" Hall in New Sorpigal."
msgstr "고블린워치의 금고문 암호를 찾아 뉴 소르피갈 시청으로 돌아가십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=1108|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Get the Chime of Harmony from the Temple of Baa and return to the New "
"Sorpigal Town Hall."
msgstr "바의 신전에서 조화의 종을 되찾아 뉴 소르피갈 시청으로 돌아가십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=1110|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Find Lord Kilburn's Shield and return to Wilbur Humphrey in Castle Ironfist "
"to report."
msgstr "킬번 경의 방패를 찾아 아이언피스트 성의 윌버 험프리에게 보고하십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=1112|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Rescue a Damsel in Distress and return with her to Wilbur Humphrey in Castle"
" Ironfist."
msgstr "곤경에 처한 여인을 구출해 아이언피스트 성의 윌버 험프리에게 데려가십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=1113|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Slay Longfang Witherhide in his cave near Castle Darkmoor and return to "
"Wilbur Humphrey in Castle Ironfist."
msgstr "다크무어 성 근처 동굴에서 롱팽 위더하이드를 처치한 뒤 아이언피스트 성의 윌버 험프리에게 돌아가십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=1114|field=<default>"
msgid "Entertain Nicolai."
msgstr "니콜라이를 즐겁게 해주십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=1119|field=<default>"
msgid "Find and return Prince Nicolai to Castle Ironfist."
msgstr "니콜라이 왕자를 찾아 아이언피스트 성으로 데려오십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=111|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Bring Hiss on the Dagger Wound Islands the Idol of the Snake from the "
"Abandoned Temple."
msgstr "버려진 신전에서 뱀의 우상을 찾아 대거 운드 제도의 히스에게 가져가십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=1120|field=<default>"
msgid "Find the Third Eye and bring it to Prince Nicolai in Castle Ironfist."
msgstr "제3의 눈을 찾아 아이언피스트 성의 니콜라이 왕자에게 가져가십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=1122|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Capture the Prince of Thieves and bring him to Lord Anthony Stone at Castle "
"Stone."
msgstr "도둑의 왕자를 붙잡아 스톤 성의 앤서니 스톤 경에게 데려가십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=1129|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Hire a Stonecutter and a Carpenter, bring them to Temple Stone in Free Haven"
" to repair the Temple, and then return to Lord Anthony Stone at Castle "
"Stone."
msgstr ""
"석공과 목수를 고용해 프리 헤이븐의 스톤 신전으로 데려가 신전을 수리하게 한 뒤, 스톤 성의 앤서니 스톤 경에게 돌아가십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=1131|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Take the Sacred Chalice from the monks in their island temple east of Free "
"Haven, return it to Temple Stone in Free Haven, and then return to Lord "
"Stone at Castle Stone."
msgstr ""
"프리 헤이븐 동쪽 섬의 신전에 있는 수도사들에게서 성배를 가져와 프리 헤이븐의 스톤 신전에 돌려놓은 뒤, 스톤 성의 스톤 경에게 "
"돌아가십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=1134|field=<default>"
msgid "Find and return the Hourglass of Time to Lord Albert Newton in Mist."
msgstr "시간의 모래시계를 찾아 안개 섬의 앨버트 뉴턴 경에게 돌려주십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=1135|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Drink from the Fountain of Magic and return to Lord Albert Newton in Mist."
msgstr "마법의 샘물을 마신 뒤 안개 섬의 앨버트 뉴턴 경에게 돌아가십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=1136|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Retrieve the Crystal of Terrax and return to Lord Albert Newton in Mist."
msgstr "테락스의 수정을 되찾아 안개 섬의 앨버트 뉴턴 경에게 가져가십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=1137|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Destroy the Devil's Outpost and return to Lord Osric Temper at Castle "
"Temper."
msgstr "데빌 전초기지를 파괴한 뒤 템퍼 성의 오스릭 템퍼 경에게 돌아가십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=1138|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Get Knight's nomination from Chadwick and return to Lord Osric Temper at "
"Castle Temper."
msgstr "채드윅에게서 기사 추천서를 받아 템퍼 성의 오스릭 템퍼 경에게 돌아가십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=1139|field=<default>"
msgid "Defeat the Warlord and bring proof to Osric Temper"
msgstr "전쟁군주를 쓰러뜨리고 증거를 오스릭 템퍼에게 가져가십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=113|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Bring Thistle on the Dagger Wound Islands the basic ingredients for a potion"
" of Pure Speed."
msgstr "순수한 속도 물약의 기본 재료를 대거 운드 제도의 시슬에게 가져가십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=1140|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Fix the prices of all 9 stables in the Kingdom and return to Lady Fleise in "
"Silver Cove."
msgstr "왕국의 아홉 마구간 요금을 모두 바로잡은 뒤 실버 코브의 플라이스 부인에게 돌아가십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=1142|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Visit the Altar of the Sun in the circle of stones north of Silver Cove on "
"an equinox or solstice (HINT:  March 20th is an equinox)."
msgstr "춘분·추분 또는 하지·동짓날에 실버 코브 북쪽 돌기둥 원의 태양 제단을 방문하십시오. (힌트: 3월 20일은 춘분입니다.)"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=1143|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Visit the Altar of the Moon in the Temple of the Moon at midnight of a full "
"moon."
msgstr "보름달이 뜬 자정에 달의 신전에 있는 달의 제단을 방문하십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=1144|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"End winter for Lord Stromgard at Castle Stromgard, and return to him with "
"the good news."
msgstr "스트롬가드 성의 스트롬가드 경을 위해 겨울을 끝낸 뒤 좋은 소식을 전하십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=1145|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Retrieve the key to the Dragon Towers from Icewind Keep south of Whitecap, "
"and bring it to Lord Stromgard at Castle Stromgard."
msgstr "화이트 캡 남쪽 아이스윈드 요새에서 드래곤 탑의 열쇠를 되찾아 스트롬가드 성의 스트롬가드 경에게 가져가십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=1146|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Reset all of the Dragon Towers at each town and return to Lord Stromgard in "
"Castle Stromgard."
msgstr "각 마을의 드래곤 탑을 모두 재설정한 뒤 스트롬가드 성의 스트롬가드 경에게 돌아가십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=1148|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Kill Snergle in Snergle's Caverns and return with his axe to Avinril "
"Smythers at The Haunt tavern in the Mire of the Damned."
msgstr "저주받은 늪의 스너글 동굴에서 스너글을 처치하고 그의 도끼를 가져와 '더 혼트' 선술집의 애빈릴 스미더스에게 전달하십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=1149|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Storm the Silver Helm Outpost near Mist and return with evidence of their "
"corruption to the Constable of Mist."
msgstr "안개 섬 근처의 실버 헬름 전초기지를 습격하고 부패의 증거를 안개 섬의 치안관에게 가져가십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=1150|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Retrieve the candelabra from the Abandoned Temple for Andover Potbello in "
"New Sorpigal."
msgstr "버려진 신전에서 촛대를 되찾아 뉴 소르피갈의 앤도버 팟벨로에게 가져가십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=1152|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Retrieve the harp from the Dragoon's Caverns south of Castle Ironfist and "
"return it to Andrew Besper in Castle Ironfist."
msgstr "아이언피스트 성 남쪽 드라군 동굴에서 하프를 되찾아 아이언피스트 성의 앤드루 베스퍼에게 가져가십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=1153|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Retrieve Ethric's skull from his tomb west of Free Haven for Gabriel Cartman"
" in Free Haven."
msgstr "프리 헤이븐 서쪽 에스릭의 무덤에서 그의 두개골을 되찾아 프리 헤이븐의 가브리엘 카트먼에게 가져가십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=1154|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Kill the Queen of the Spiders in the Abandoned Temple in New Sorpigal and "
"return with her heart to Buford T. Allman in New Sorpigal."
msgstr "뉴 소르피갈의 버려진 신전에서 거미 여왕을 처치하고 심장을 뉴 소르피갈의 뷰퍼드 T. 올먼에게 가져가십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=1155|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Deface the altar in the Monolith west of Silver Cove and return to Eleanor "
"Vanderbilt in Silver Cove."
msgstr "실버 코브 서쪽 모놀리스의 제단을 훼손한 뒤 실버 코브의 엘리너 밴더빌트에게 돌아가십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=1158|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Destroy the crystal in the Temple of the Fist and return to Winston Schezar "
"in Bootleg Bay."
msgstr "주먹의 신전에 있는 수정을 파괴한 뒤 부틀렉 베이의 윈스턴 셰자르에게 돌아가십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=115|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Bring Rihansi in Alvar the basic ingredients for a potion of Pure Luck."
msgstr "순수한 행운 물약의 기본 재료를 알바르의 리한시에게 가져가십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=1160|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Rescue Emmanuel from the Temple of the Snake near Blackshire and return him "
"to Joanne Cravitz in Blackshire."
msgstr "블랙셔 근처 뱀의 신전에서 에마뉘엘을 구출해 블랙셔의 조앤 크래비츠에게 데려가십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=1161|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Find the lost artifact in the Dragoons' Keep near Castle Temper and return "
"it to Zoltan Phelps in Free Haven."
msgstr "템퍼 성 근처 드라군 요새에서 잃어버린 유물을 찾아 프리 헤이븐의 졸탄 펠프스에게 가져가십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=1162|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Rescue Sharry from the Shadow Guild Hideout and return with her to Frank "
"Fairchild in New Sorpigal."
msgstr "섀도 길드 은신처에서 셰리를 구출해 뉴 소르피갈의 프랭크 페어차일드에게 데려가십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=1163|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Rescue Angela from the Abandoned Temple and return her to Violet Dawson in "
"New Sorpigal."
msgstr "버려진 신전에서 앤절라를 구출해 뉴 소르피갈의 바이올렛 도슨에게 데려가십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=1164|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Rescue Sherell from the cannibals on the islands east of Free Haven and "
"return with her to Carlo Tormini in Free Haven."
msgstr "프리 헤이븐 동쪽 섬의 식인종들에게서 셰렐을 구출해 프리 헤이븐의 카를로 토르미니에게 데려가십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=1165|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Destroy the Werewolf's altar in the Lair of the Wolf and return to Maria "
"Trepan in Blackshire."
msgstr "늑대 소굴에 있는 늑대인간의 제단을 파괴한 뒤 블랙셔의 마리아 트레판에게 돌아가십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=1167|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Find the Pearl of Putrescence in the Lair of the Wolf and bring it to the "
"Ghost of Balthasar, also in the Lair of the Wolf."
msgstr "늑대 소굴에서 부패의 진주를 찾아 같은 곳에 있는 발타자르의 유령에게 가져가십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=1168|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Retrieve the jewelled egg from Castle Kriegspire and return it to Emil Lime "
"in Kriegspire village."
msgstr "크리그스파이어 성에서 보석 장식 알을 되찾아 크리그스파이어 마을의 에밀 라임에게 가져가십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=1169|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Unward the doors in the Hall of the Fire Lord and return to the Lord of "
"Fire, also in the Hall of the Fire Lord."
msgstr "불의 군주 전당의 문에 걸린 봉인을 해제한 뒤 같은 곳에 있는 불의 군주에게 돌아가십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=117|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Deliver fake report to the Dread Pirate Stanley in the Pirate's Rest Tavern "
"on the Island of Regna."
msgstr "가짜 보고서를 레그나 섬 파이리츠 레스트 선술집의 공포의 해적 스탠리에게 전달하십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=1186|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Find Memory Crystal Alpha in the Supreme Temple of Baa and restore it to a "
"module altar at the Oracle beneath the High Council.."
msgstr "바의 최고 신전에서 기억 수정 알파를 찾아 최고 평의회 아래 오라클의 모듈 제단에 복원하십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=1187|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Find Memory Crystal Beta in Castle Alamos and restore it to a module altar "
"at the Oracle beneath the High Council."
msgstr "알라모스 성에서 기억 수정 베타를 찾아 최고 평의회 아래 오라클의 모듈 제단에 복원하십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=1188|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Find Memory Crystal Delta in Castle Darkmoor and restore it to a module "
"altar at the Oracle beneath the High Council."
msgstr "다크무어 성에서 기억 수정 델타를 찾아 최고 평의회 아래 오라클의 모듈 제단에 복원하십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=1189|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Find Memory Crystal Epsilon in Castle Kriegspire and restore it to a module "
"altar at the Oracle beneath the High Council."
msgstr "크리그스파이어 성에서 기억 수정 엡실론을 찾아 최고 평의회 아래 오라클의 모듈 제단에 복원하십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=1190|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Retrieve the Control Cube from the Tomb of Varn in Dragonsand and return to "
"the Oracle beneath the High Council."
msgstr "드래곤샌드의 VARN 무덤에서 제어 큐브를 되찾아 최고 평의회 아래 오라클로 가져가십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=119|field=<default>"
msgid "Rescue Arion Hunter's daughter from Ogre Fortress in Alvar."
msgstr "알바르의 오우거 요새에서 아리온 헌터의 딸을 구출하십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=11|field=<default>"
msgid "Report to Bastian Loudrin, the merchant guildmaster in Alvar."
msgstr "알바르의 상인 길드장 바스티안 라우드린에게 보고하십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=121|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Bring Talion in the Ironsand Desert the basic ingredients for a potion of "
"Pure Endurance."
msgstr "순수한 체력 물약의 기본 재료를 아이언샌드 사막의 탈리온에게 가져가십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=1224|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Find a cure for Slicker Silvertongue in the Superior Temple of Baa east of "
"Castle Kriegspire and return to Wilbur Humphrey with the good news."
msgstr ""
"크리그스파이어 성 동쪽의 상급 바의 신전에서 슬리커 실버텅을 치료할 방법을 찾은 뒤, 좋은 소식을 아이언피스트 성의 윌버 험프리에게 "
"전하십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=1225|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Bring the the letter detailing Silvertongue's treason to the High Council in"
" Free Haven."
msgstr "실버텅의 반역 행위를 기록한 편지를 프리 헤이븐의 최고 평의회에 가져가십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=1228|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Find and destroy the Book of Liches in Castle Darkmoor and return to Terry "
"Ros in Darkmoor village."
msgstr "다크무어 성에서 리치의 책을 찾아 파괴한 뒤 다크무어 마을의 테리 로스에게 돌아가십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=123|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Bring Kelvin in Shadowspire the basic ingredients for a potion of Pure "
"Intellect."
msgstr "순수한 지력 물약의 기본 재료를 섀도스파이어의 켈빈에게 가져가십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=1243|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Place the statuettes in Sweet Water, Kriegspire, Dragonsand, Mire of the "
"Damned, and Bootleg Bay and return to Twillen in Blackshire."
msgstr ""
"스위트 워터, 크리그스파이어, 드래곤샌드, 저주받은 자들의 수렁, 부틀렉 베이에 조각상들을 놓은 뒤 블랙셔의 트윌렌에게 돌아가십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=1259|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Obtain Arcane Magic from Archibald in the Royal Library in Castle Ironfist"
msgstr "아이언피스트 성 왕립 도서관에 있는 아치볼드에게서 비전 마법을 얻으십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=125|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Bring Castigeir in Murmurwoods the basic ingredients for a potion of Pure "
"Personality."
msgstr "순수한 인격 물약의 기본 재료를 머머우즈의 카스티기어에게 가져가십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=127|field=<default>"
msgid "Recover the shield, Eclipse, for Lathius in Ravenshore."
msgstr "레이븐쇼어의 라시우스를 위해 방패 '일식'을 되찾으십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=129|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Kill all Ogres in the Alvar canyon area and in Ogre Fortress and return to "
"Keldon in Alvar."
msgstr "알바르 협곡과 오우거 요새의 모든 오우거를 처치한 뒤 알바르의 켈던에게 돌아가십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=132|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Bring Galvinus in Ravage Roaming the basic ingredients for a potion of Pure "
"Accuracy."
msgstr "순수한 정확도 물약의 기본 재료를 라비지 로밍의 갈비누스에게 가져가십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=135|field=<default>"
msgid "Find the Prophecies of the Snake for Pascella Tisk."
msgstr "파스셀라 티스크를 위해 뱀의 예언서를 찾으십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=137|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Find Isthric the Tongue, brother of Rohtnax.  Return to Rohtnax in the "
"village of Blood Drop on Dagger Wound Island."
msgstr "로트낵스의 형제인 혀의 이스트릭을 찾으십시오. 대거 운드 섬 블러드 드롭 마을의 로트낵스에게 돌아가십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=139|field=<default>"
msgid "Kill all Dire Wolves in Ravenshore. Return to Maddigan in Ravenshore."
msgstr "레이븐쇼어의 모든 다이어 울프를 처치한 뒤 레이븐쇼어의 매디건에게 돌아가십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=13|field=<default>"
msgid "Form an alliance among the major factions of Jadame."
msgstr "제이덤의 주요 세력들로 동맹을 결성하십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=142|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Deliver Fire Resistance Potions to the six southernmost houses of Rust.  "
"Return to Hobert in Rust."
msgstr "러스트 최남단의 집 여섯 채에 화염 저항 물약을 전달한 뒤 러스트의 호버트에게 돌아가십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=14|field=<default>"
msgid "Form an alliance with the Necromancers' Guild in Shadowspire."
msgstr "섀도스파이어의 강령술사 길드와 동맹을 맺으십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=150|field=<default>"
msgid "Find a Dragonbane Flower for Calindril in Garrote Gorge."
msgstr "가로트 협곡의 칼린드릴을 위해 드래곤베인 꽃을 찾으십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=152|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Find a Dragonbane Flower for the Balion Tearwing in the Garrote Gorge Dragon"
" Caves."
msgstr "가로트 협곡 드래곤 동굴의 발리온 티어윙을 위해 드래곤베인 꽃을 찾으십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=154|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Kill all the Dragons in the Garrote Gorge wilderness area. Return to Avalon "
"in Garrote Gorge."
msgstr "가로트 협곡 야외 지역의 모든 드래곤을 처치한 뒤 가로트 협곡의 아발론에게 돌아가십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=157|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Kill all the Dragon Hunter's in the Garrote Gorge wilderness area. Return to"
" Jerin Flame-eye in the Garrote Gorge Dragon Caves."
msgstr "가로트 협곡 야외 지역의 모든 드래곤 사냥꾼을 처치한 뒤 드래곤 동굴의 제린 플레임아이에게 돌아가십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=15|field=<default>"
msgid "Form an alliance with the Temple of the Sun in Murmurwoods."
msgstr "머머우즈의 태양의 신전과 동맹을 맺으십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=160|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Find the Legendary Drum of Victory. Return it to Zelim in Garrote Gorge."
msgstr "전설적인 승리의 북을 찾아 가로트 협곡의 젤림에게 돌려주십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=162|field=<default>"
msgid "Find Iseldir's Puzzle Box for Benefice of Shadowspire."
msgstr "섀도스파이어의 베네피스를 위해 이셀디어의 퍼즐 상자를 찾으십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=164|field=<default>"
msgid "Find a Vial of Grave Dirt. Return it to Halien in Shadowspire."
msgstr "무덤 흙이 든 병을 찾아 섀도스파이어의 할리엔에게 돌려주십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=166|field=<default>"
msgid "Find the Bone of Doom for Tantilion of Shadowspire."
msgstr "섀도스파이어의 탄틸리온을 위해 파멸의 뼈를 찾으십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=16|field=<default>"
msgid "Form an alliance with the Dragon hunters of Garrote Gorge."
msgstr "가로트 협곡의 드래곤 사냥꾼들과 동맹을 맺으십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=1712|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Mysterious woman asked you to travel in time and fulfill destinies of other "
"heroes. Well..."
msgstr "정체불명의 여인이 시간을 여행해 다른 영웅들의 운명을 완수해 달라고 했습니다. 뭐…"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=1713|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Enter The Controlled Breach, find Runaway Chaos and bring it to the Uneasy "
"Origin Matter."
msgstr "통제된 균열에 들어가 도망친 혼돈을 찾아 불안정한 기원 물질에게 가져가십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=1714|field=<default>"
msgid "Find your friends."
msgstr "친구들을 찾으십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=1715|field=<default>"
msgid "Find entrance to the main Breach structure."
msgstr "균열 본체로 들어가는 입구를 찾으십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=172|field=<default>"
msgid "Challenge the Arcomage Champion in each tavern of Jadame."
msgstr "제이덤의 각 선술집에서 아르코메이지 챔피언에게 도전하십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=173|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Win a game of Arcomage in all eleven taverns, then return to Tonk Blueswan "
"in Ravenshore."
msgstr "열한 곳의 선술집에서 모두 아르코메이지에 승리한 뒤 레이븐쇼어의 통크 블루스완에게 돌아가십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=176|field=<default>"
msgid "Find a wheel of Frelandeau Cheese. Bring it to Asael Fromago in Alvar."
msgstr "프렐랑도 치즈 한 덩이를 찾아 알바르의 아사엘 프로마고에게 가져가십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=177|field=<default>"
msgid "Find a log of Eldenbrie Cheese. Bring it to Asael Fromago in Alvar."
msgstr "엘든브리 치즈 한 덩이를 찾아 알바르의 아사엘 프로마고에게 가져가십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=178|field=<default>"
msgid "Find a ball of Dunduck Cheese. Bring it to Asael Fromago in Alvar."
msgstr "던덕 치즈 한 덩이를 찾아 알바르의 아사엘 프로마고에게 가져가십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=17|field=<default>"
msgid "Form an alliance with the Dragons of Garrote Gorge."
msgstr "가로트 협곡의 드래곤들과 동맹을 맺으십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=18|field=<default>"
msgid "Form an alliance with the Minotaurs of Ravage Roaming."
msgstr "라비지 로밍의 미노타우로스들과 동맹을 맺으십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=236|field=<default>"
msgid "Find the treasure of the Dread Pirate Stanley."
msgstr "공포의 해적 스탠리의 보물을 찾으십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=25|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Find a witness to the lake of fire's formation. Bring him back to the "
"merchant guild in Alvar."
msgstr "불의 호수가 생겨난 장면을 목격한 사람을 찾아 알바르의 상인 길드로 데려오십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=26|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Find the skeleton transformer in the Shadowspire Necromancers' Guild. "
"Destroy it and return to Oskar Tyre."
msgstr "섀도스파이어 강령술사 길드에서 해골 변환기를 찾아 파괴한 뒤 오스카 타이어에게 돌아가십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=284|field=<default>"
