"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=3|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Deliver Dadeross' Letter to Elgar Fellmoon at the Merchant House in "
"Ravenshore."
msgstr "다데로스의 편지를 레이븐쇼어 상인회관의 엘가 펠문에게 전달하십시오."

