#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=513|field=<default>"
msgid "Return a red potion to the Judge on Emerald Island."
msgstr "붉은 물약을 에메랄드 섬의 심판관에게 가져가십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=514|field=<default>"
msgid "Return a seashell to the Judge on Emerald Island."
msgstr "조개껍데기를 에메랄드 섬의 심판관에게 가져가십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=515|field=<default>"
msgid "Return a longbow to the Judge on Emerald Island."
msgstr "장궁을 에메랄드 섬의 심판관에게 가져가십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=516|field=<default>"
msgid "Return a floor tile to the Judge on Emerald Island."
msgstr "바닥 타일을 에메랄드 섬의 심판관에게 가져가십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=517|field=<default>"
msgid "Return a musical instrument to the Judge on Emerald Island."
msgstr "악기를 에메랄드 섬의 심판관에게 가져가십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=518|field=<default>"
msgid "Return a wealthy hat to the Judge on Emerald Island."
msgstr "고급 모자를 에메랄드 섬의 심판관에게 가져가십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=528|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Find the missing contestants on Emerald Island and bring back proof to Lord "
"Markham."
msgstr "에메랄드 섬에서 실종된 참가자들을 찾아 증거를 마크햄 경에게 가져가십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=52|field=<default>"
msgid "Rescue Acwalander, Lord of Water."
msgstr "물의 군주 아크왈랜더를 구출하십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=530|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Go to Lord Markham's estate in Tatalia, steal the vase there, and return it "
"to William Lasker in the Erathian Sewers."
msgstr "타탈리아의 마크햄 경 저택에 들어가 꽃병을 훔친 뒤, 에라시아 하수도의 윌리엄 래스커에게 가져가십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=531|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Go to Watchtower 6 in the Deyja Moors, and move the weight from the top of "
"the tower to the bottom of the tower.  Then return to William Lasker in the "
"Erathian Sewers."
msgstr "데이자 황무지의 제6 감시탑에서 탑 꼭대기의 추를 아래층으로 옮긴 뒤, 에라시아 하수도의 윌리엄 래스커에게 돌아가십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=533|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Go to the Celestial Court in Celeste and kill Lady Eleanor Carmine.  Return "
"with proof to Seknit Undershadow in the Deyja Moors."
msgstr "셀레스트의 천상 법정으로 가서 엘리너 카마인 부인을 처치한 뒤, 증거를 데이자 황무지의 세크닛 언더섀도에게 가져가십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=534|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Kill Wromthrax the Heartless in his cave in Tatalia, then talk to Sir "
"Charles Quixote."
msgstr "타탈리아의 동굴에 있는 무정한 웜스랙스를 처치한 뒤 찰스 키호테 경과 대화하십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=536|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Rescue Alice Hargreaves from William's Tower in the Deyja Moors then talk to"
" Sir Charles Quixote."
msgstr "데이자 황무지의 윌리엄의 탑에서 앨리스 하그리브스를 구출한 뒤 찰스 키호테 경과 대화하십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=538|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Capture Alice Hargreaves from her residence in Castle Gryphonheart and "
"return her to William's Tower in the Deyja Moors."
msgstr "그리폰하트 성의 거처에서 앨리스 하그리브스를 붙잡아 데이자 황무지의 윌리엄의 탑으로 데려가십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=539|field=<default>"
msgid "Find the lost meditation spot in the Dwarven Barrows."
msgstr "드워프 고분에서 잊힌 명상 장소를 찾으십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=540|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Go to the Temple of Baa in Avlee and kill the High Priest of Baa, then "
"return to Bartholomew Hume in Harmondale."
msgstr "아블리의 바 신전으로 가서 바의 대사제를 처치한 뒤, 하몬데일의 바솔로뮤 흄에게 돌아가십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=541|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Crack the code in the School of Sorcery in the Bracada Desert to reveal the "
"location of the Tomb of Ashwar Nog'Nogoth.  Discover the tomb's location, "
"enter it, and then return it to Stephan Sand in the Pit."
msgstr ""
"브라카다 사막의 마법 학교에서 암호를 풀어 아슈와르 노그노고스의 무덤 위치를 밝혀내십시오. 무덤에 들어간 뒤 구덩이의 스테판 샌드에게 "
"돌아가십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=542|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Retrieve the Perfect Bow from the Titans' Stronghold in Avlee and return it "
"to Lawrence Mark in Harmondale."
msgstr "아블리의 타이탄 요새에서 완벽한 활을 되찾아 하몬데일의 로렌스 마크에게 가져가십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=543|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Sabotage the lift in the Red Dwarf Mines in the Bracada Desert then return "
"to Steagal Snick in Avlee."
msgstr "브라카다 사막의 레드 드워프 광산에서 승강기를 파괴한 뒤 아블리의 스티걸 스닉에게 돌아가십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=544|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Retrieve the Perfect Bow from the Titans' Stronghold in Avlee and return it "
"to Steagal Snick in Avlee."
msgstr "아블리의 타이탄 요새에서 완벽한 활을 되찾아 아블리의 스티걸 스닉에게 가져가십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=545|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Win five arena challenges then return to Leda Rowan in the Bracada Desert."
msgstr "투기장 도전에서 다섯 번 승리한 뒤 브라카다 사막의 레다 로언에게 돌아가십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=546|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Destroy all the undead in the Haunted House in the Barrow Downs and return "
"to Frederick Org in Erathia."
msgstr "배로우 다운스의 유령의 집에서 모든 언데드를 처치한 뒤 에라시아의 프레더릭 오그에게 돌아가십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=547|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Raid the Elven Treasury at Castle Navan in the Tularean Forest and return to"
" Frederick Org in Erathia."
msgstr "툴라리안 숲의 나반 성에 있는 엘프 보물고를 약탈한 뒤 에라시아의 프레더릭 오그에게 돌아가십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=548|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Calm the trees in the Tularean Forest by speaking to the Oldest Tree then "
"return to Lysander Sweet in the Bracada Desert."
msgstr "최고령 나무와 대화하여 툴라리안 숲의 나무들을 진정시킨 뒤 브라카다 사막의 라이샌더 스위트에게 돌아가십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=549|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Solve the secret to the entrance of the Faerie Mound in Avlee and speak to "
"the Faerie King."
msgstr "아블리의 요정 언덕으로 들어가는 비밀을 풀고 요정 왕과 대화하십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=54|field=<default>"
msgid "Rescue Shalwend, Lord of Air."
msgstr "공기의 군주 샬웬드를 구출하십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=550|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Collect 10,000 gold worth of bounties from the Bounty Hunts in the town "
"halls, then return to Ebednezer Sower in the Tularean Forest."
msgstr "마을 회관의 현상금 사냥으로 총 10,000골드의 현상금을 받은 뒤 툴라리안 숲의 에브니저 소어에게 돌아가십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=551|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Find the Heart of the Forest in the Mercenary Guild in Tatalia and return it"
" to the Oldest Tree in the Tularean Forest."
msgstr "타탈리아의 용병 길드에서 숲의 심장을 찾아 툴라리안 숲의 최고령 나무에게 돌려주십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=554|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Purify the Altar of Evil in the Temple of the Moon on Evenmorn Isle then "
"return to Rebecca Devine in Celeste."
msgstr "이븐모른 섬 달의 신전에 있는 악의 제단을 정화한 뒤 셀레스트의 레베카 디바인에게 돌아가십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=555|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Find the lost pirate map in the Tidewater Caverns in Tatalia and return to "
"Daedalus Falk in the Deyja Moors."
msgstr "타탈리아의 타이드워터 동굴에서 잃어버린 해적 지도를 찾아 데이자 황무지의 다이달로스 포크에게 돌아가십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=556|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Deface the Altar of Good in the Temple of the Sun on Evenmorn Isle then "
"return to Daedalus Falk in the Deyja Moors."
msgstr "이븐모른 섬 태양의 신전에 있는 선의 제단을 훼손한 뒤 데이자 황무지의 다이달로스 포크에게 돌아가십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=557|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Collect the six golem pieces and construct a complete golem, then return to "
"Thomas Grey in the School of Sorcery."
msgstr "골렘 부품 여섯 개를 모아 완전한 골렘을 제작한 뒤 마법 학교의 토머스 그레이에게 돌아가십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=559|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Find the Book of Divine Intervention in the Breeding Zone in the Pit and "
"return it to Thomas Grey in the School of Sorcery."
msgstr "구덩이의 번식 구역에서 신성한 개입의 책을 찾아 마법 학교의 토머스 그레이에게 가져가십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=560|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Retrieve the lich jars from the Proving Grounds in Celeste and bring them "
"back to Halfgild Wynac in the Pit."
msgstr "셀레스트의 시험장에서 리치의 단지들을 되찾아 구덩이의 하프길드 위낙에게 가져가십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=561|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Visit the three stonehenge monoliths in Tatalia, the Evenmorn Islands, and "
"Avlee, then return to Anthony Green in the Tularean Forest."
msgstr "타탈리아, 이븐모른 제도, 아블리에 있는 세 곳의 스톤헨지 거석을 방문한 뒤 툴라리안 숲의 앤서니 그린에게 돌아가십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=566|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Retrieve the bones of the Dwarf King from the tunnels between Stone City and"
" Nighon and place them in their proper resting place in the Barrow Downs, "
"then return to Anthony Green in the Tularean Forest."
msgstr ""
"스톤 시티와 나이혼 사이의 터널에서 드워프 왕의 유골을 되찾아 배로우 다운스의 올바른 안식처에 안치한 뒤 툴라리안 숲의 앤서니 그린에게 "
"돌아가십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=567|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Retrieve the dragon egg from the Dragon Cave in the Land of the Giants and "
"return it to Tor Anwyn in Mount Nighon."
msgstr "거인들의 땅에 있는 드래곤 동굴에서 드래곤 알을 되찾아 나이혼 산의 토르 앤윈에게 가져가십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=587|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Clean out Castle Harmondale and return to the Butler in the tavern, On the "
"House, in Harmondale."
msgstr "하몬데일 성을 소탕한 뒤 하몬데일의 '온 더 하우스' 선술집에 있는 집사에게 돌아가십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=588|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Rescue the dwarves from the Red Dwarf Mines and return to the Dwarf King in "
"Stone City in the Barrow Downs."
msgstr "레드 드워프 광산에서 드워프들을 구출한 뒤 배로우 다운스의 스톤 시티에 있는 드워프 왕에게 돌아가십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=589|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Retrieve plans from Fort Riverstride and return them to Eldrich Parson in "
"Castle Navan in the Tularean Forest."
msgstr "리버스트라이드 요새에서 작전 계획서를 되찾아 툴라리안 숲 나반 성의 엘드리치 파슨에게 가져가십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=590|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Rescue Loren Steel from the Tularean Caves in the Tularean Forest and return"
" him to Queen Catherine."
msgstr "툴라리안 숲의 툴라리안 동굴에서 로렌 스틸을 구출해 캐서린 여왕에게 데려가십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=591|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Retrieve Gryphonheart's Trumpet from the battle in the Tularean Forest and "
"return it to whichever side you choose."
msgstr "툴라리안 숲의 전장에서 그리폰하트의 나팔을 되찾아 원하는 진영에 전달하십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=5|field=<default>"
msgid "Kill the leader of the Regnan Pirate outpost at Dagger Wound."
msgstr "대거 운드의 레그나 해적 전초기지 우두머리를 처치하십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=606|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Give false Riverstride plans to Eldrich Parson in Castle Navan in the "
"Tularean Forest."
msgstr "가짜 리버스트라이드 작전 계획서를 툴라리안 숲 나반 성의 엘드리치 파슨에게 전달하십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=607|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Return the Loren imposter to Queen Catherine in Castle Gryphonheart in "
"Erathia."
msgstr "가짜 로렌을 에라시아 그리폰하트 성의 캐서린 여왕에게 데려가십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=613|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Complete the Walls of Mist without killing a single opponent and return to "
"Gavin Magnus in Castle Lambent in Celeste."
msgstr "단 한 명의 적도 죽이지 않고 안개의 장벽을 완료한 뒤 셀레스트 램번트 성의 개빈 매그너스에게 돌아가십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=615|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Retrieve the altar piece from the Temple of Light in Celeste and the Temple "
"of Dark in the Pit and return them to Resurectra in Castle Lambent in "
"Celeste."
msgstr "셀레스트의 빛의 신전과 구덩이의 어둠의 신전에서 제단 조각을 되찾아 셀레스트 램번트 성의 리저렉트라에게 가져가십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=616|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Go to Colony Zod in the Land of the Giants and slay Xenofex then return to "
"Resurectra in Castle Lambent in Celeste."
msgstr "거인들의 땅에 있는 조드 식민지로 가서 제노펙스를 처치한 뒤 셀레스트 램번트 성의 리저렉트라에게 돌아가십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=618|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Investigate the Wine Cellar in Tatalia and return to Crag Hack in Castle "
"Lambent in Celeste."
msgstr "타탈리아의 와인 저장고를 조사한 뒤 셀레스트 램번트 성의 크랙 핵에게 돌아가십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=61|field=<default>"
msgid "Put Vilebite's ashes in the Dust village tomb then return to Overdune."
msgstr "바일바이트의 재를 더스트 마을의 무덤에 안치한 뒤 오버듄에게 돌아가십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=620|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Retrieve the Case of Soul Jars from Castle Gloaming in the Pit and return to"
" Sir Caneghem in Celeste."
msgstr "구덩이의 글로밍 성에서 영혼 단지 상자를 되찾아 셀레스트의 캐니검 경에게 가져가십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=621|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Assassinate Tolberti in his house in the Pit and return his control cube to "
"Robert the Wise in Celeste."
msgstr "구덩이에 있는 톨베르티의 집에서 그를 암살하고, 제어 큐브를 셀레스트의 현자 로버트에게 가져가십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=634|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Retrieve the altar piece from the Temple of Light in Celeste and the Temple "
"of Dark in the Pit and return them to Kastore in the Pit."
msgstr "셀레스트의 빛의 신전과 구덩이의 어둠의 신전에서 제단 조각을 되찾아 구덩이의 카스토어에게 가져가십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=635|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Go to Colony Zod in the Land of the Giants and slay Xenofex then return to "
"Kastore in the Pit."
msgstr "거인들의 땅에 있는 조드 식민지로 가서 제노펙스를 처치한 뒤 구덩이의 카스토어에게 돌아가십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=636|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Retrieve the Case of Soul Jars from the Warlocks in Thunderfist Mountain and"
" bring them to Maximus in the Pit."
msgstr "썬더피스트 산의 흑마법사들에게서 영혼 단지 상자를 되찾아 구덩이의 막시무스에게 가져가십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=637|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Destroy the magical defenses inside Clanker's Laboratory and return to Dark "
"Shade in the Pit."
msgstr "클랭커의 연구소 내부에 있는 마법 방어 장치를 파괴한 뒤 구덩이의 다크 셰이드에게 돌아가십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=639|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Assassinate Robert the Wise in his house in Celeste and return to Tolberti "
"in the Pit."
msgstr "셀레스트에 있는 현자 로버트의 집에서 그를 암살한 뒤 구덩이의 톨베르티에게 돌아가십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=640|field=<default>"
msgid "Complete the Breeding Zone and return to Archibald in the Pit."
msgstr "번식 구역을 완료한 뒤 구덩이의 아치볼드에게 돌아가십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=642|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Go to the Lincoln in the sea west of Avlee and retrieve the Oscillation "
"Overthruster and return it to Resurectra in Celeste."
msgstr "아블리 서쪽 바다의 링컨호로 가서 오실레이션 오버스러스터를 되찾아 셀레스트의 리저렉트라에게 가져가십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=643|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Go to the Lincoln in the sea west of Avlee and retrieve the Oscillation "
"Overthruster and return it to Kastore in the Pit."
msgstr "아블리 서쪽 바다의 링컨호로 가서 오실레이션 오버스러스터를 되찾아 구덩이의 카스토어에게 가져가십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=658|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Talk to the Dwarves in Stone City in the Barrow Downs to find a way to "
"repair Castle Harmondale."
msgstr "하몬데일 성을 수리할 방법을 찾기 위해 배로우 다운스의 스톤 시티에 있는 드워프들과 대화하십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=663|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Enter the Pit from the Hall of the Pit in the Deyja Moors, then talk to "
"Archibald in Castle Gloaming in the Pit."
msgstr "데이자 황무지의 구덩이 전당에서 구덩이로 들어간 뒤, 구덩이 글로밍 성의 아치볼드와 대화하십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=664|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Enter Celeste from the grand teleporter in the Bracada Desert, then talk to "
"Gavin Magnus in Castle Lambent in Celeste."
msgstr "브라카다 사막의 대형 순간이동 장치로 셀레스트에 들어간 뒤, 셀레스트 램번트 성의 개빈 매그너스와 대화하십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=665|field=<default>"
msgid "Choose a judge to succeed Judge Grey as Arbiter in Harmondale."
msgstr "그레이 판관의 뒤를 이어 하몬데일의 중재자가 될 판관을 선택하십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=667|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Retrieve the Lantern of Light from the Barrow Downs and return it to Tarin "
"Withern in Harmondale."
msgstr "배로우 다운스에서 빛의 등불을 되찾아 하몬데일의 타린 위던에게 가져가십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=668|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Retrieve Haldar's Remains from the Maze in Nighon and return them to Mazim "
"Dusk in Nighon."
msgstr "나이혼의 미궁에서 할다르의 유해를 되찾아 나이혼의 마짐 더스크에게 가져가십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=669|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Retrieve Davrik's Signet ring from the Bandit Caves in the northeast of "
"Erathia and return it to Davrik Peladium in Harmondale."
msgstr "에라시아 북동부 산적 동굴에서 다브릭의 인장 반지를 되찾아 하몬데일의 다브릭 펠라디움에게 가져가십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=670|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Take Sealed Letter to Lord Markham in Lord Markham's Manor in Tatalia for "
"collector Norbert Thrush."
msgstr "수집가 노버트 스러시를 위해 봉인된 편지를 타탈리아 마크햄 경 저택의 마크햄 경에게 전달하십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=671|field=<default>"
msgid "Return Parson's Quill to Norbert Thrush in Erathia."
msgstr "파슨의 깃펜을 에라시아의 노버트 스러시에게 돌려주십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=68|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Find the Ancient Troll Homeland and return to Volog Sandwind in the Ironsand"
" Desert."
msgstr "고대 트롤의 고향을 찾아 아이언샌드 사막의 볼로그 샌드윈드에게 돌아가십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=691|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Take the sealed letter to the Faerie King in the Hall under the Hill in "
"Avlee."
msgstr "봉인된 편지를 아블리 언덕 아래 전당의 요정 왕에게 전달하십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=692|field=<default>"
msgid "Take the Faerie Pipes to Johann Kerrid in the Tularean Forest."
msgstr "요정의 피리를 툴라리안 숲의 요한 케리드에게 가져가십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=693|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Go to the Mercenary Guild in Tatalia and talk to Niles Stantley within two "
"weeks."
msgstr "2주 안에 타탈리아의 용병 길드로 가서 나일스 스탠틀리와 대화하십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=694|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Steal the Tapestry from your associate's Castle and return it to Niles "
"Stantley in the Mercenary Guild in Tatalia."
msgstr "동료의 성에서 태피스트리를 훔쳐 타탈리아 용병 길드의 나일스 스탠틀리에게 가져가십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=698|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Kill all the Troglodytes underneath Stone City and return to Spark "
"Burnkindle in Stone City."
msgstr "스톤 시티 아래의 모든 트로글로다이트를 처치한 뒤 스톤 시티의 스파크 번킨들에게 돌아가십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=699|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Kill all the Griffins in Erathia and the Bracada Desert and return to Seth "
"Drakkson in the Deyja Moors."
msgstr "에라시아와 브라카다 사막의 모든 그리핀을 처치한 뒤 데이자 황무지의 세스 드랙슨에게 돌아가십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=706|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Find the fate of Darron's brother in the White Cliff Caves, then return to "
"Darron Temper in Harmondale."
msgstr "화이트 클리프 동굴에서 대런의 형제에게 무슨 일이 있었는지 알아낸 뒤 하몬데일의 대런 템퍼에게 돌아가십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=707|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Retrieve the Seasons' Stole from the Hall of the Pit and return it to Gary "
"Zimm in the Bracada Desert."
msgstr "구덩이 전당에서 사계절의 영대를 되찾아 브라카다 사막의 게리 짐에게 가져가십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=70|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Find Blazen Stormlance and recover the spear Ebonest. Return to Leane "
"Stormlance in Garrote Gorge and deliver Ebonest to Charles Quixote."
msgstr ""
"블레이즌 스톰랜스를 찾아 창 에보니스트를 되찾으십시오. 가로트 협곡의 리앤 스톰랜스에게 돌아간 뒤 에보니스트를 찰스 키호테에게 "
"전달하십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=712|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Retrieve the three statuettes and place them on the shrines in the Bracada "
"Desert, Tatalia, and Avlee, then return to Thom Lumbra in the Tularean "
"Forest."
msgstr "조각상 세 개를 되찾아 브라카다 사막, 타탈리아, 아블리의 성소에 각각 놓은 뒤 툴라리안 숲의 톰 럼브라에게 돌아가십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=716|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Retrieve the three paintings and return them to Ferdinand Visconti in "
"Tatalia."
msgstr "그림 세 점을 되찾아 타탈리아의 페르디난드 비스콘티에게 가져가십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=717|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Win a game of Arcomage in all thirteen taverns, then return to Gina Barnes "
"in Erathia."
msgstr "열세 곳의 선술집에서 모두 아르코메이지에 승리한 뒤 에라시아의 지나 반스에게 돌아가십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=72|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Inquire about a cure for Blazen Stormlance from Dervish Chevron in "
"Ravenshore."
msgstr "레이븐쇼어의 더비시 셰브론에게 블레이즌 스톰랜스의 치료법을 물어보십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=74|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Kill all Dragon Slayers and return the Sword of Whistlebone the Slayer to "
"Deftclaw Redreaver in Garrote Gorge."
msgstr "모든 드래곤 슬레이어를 처치하고 휘슬본 슬레이어의 검을 가로트 협곡의 데프트클로 레드리버에게 돌려주십시오."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=757|field=<default>"
msgid "Congratulations"
msgstr "축하합니다"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_QuestsTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt|table=QuestsTxt|id=76|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Find the Axe of Balthazar, in the Dark Dwarf Mines.  Have the Axe "
"authenticated by Dadeross.  Return the axe to Tessalar, heir to the "
"leadership of the Minotaur Herd."
msgstr ""
"다크 드워프 광산에서 발타자르의 도끼를 찾으십시오. 다데로스에게 도끼의 진품 여부를 확인받은 뒤 미노타우로스 무리의 후계자 테살라에게 "
"돌려주십시오."

