#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_TransTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt|table=TransTxt|id=100|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"The last of a series of watchtowers that once guarded the border of Deyja, "
"Watchtower 6 is battle scarred, but still standing tall."
msgstr ""
"한때 데이자의 국경을 지키던 감시탑 가운데 마지막으로 남은 제6 감시탑입니다. 전투의 상처를 입었지만 여전히 우뚝 서 있습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_TransTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt|table=TransTxt|id=101|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"The sharp, electric smell of magic fills the air outside the School--the "
"result of hundreds of years of magical experiments and juvenile pranks "
"happening in the same building."
msgstr ""
"마법 학교 밖 공기는 날카로운 전기 냄새로 가득합니다. 수백 년 동안 같은 건물에서 벌어진 마법 실험과 철없는 장난의 결과입니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_TransTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt|table=TransTxt|id=102|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Though recently abandoned by the Dwarves, you can still easily see the craft"
" and care they put into this mine."
msgstr "드워프들이 최근 버리고 떠났지만, 이 광산에 들인 솜씨와 정성은 여전히 쉽게 알아볼 수 있습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_TransTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt|table=TransTxt|id=103|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"The proving grounds of the Wizards, the Walls of Mist floats on the clouds "
"like a mirage of the sky.  It is an entirely magical construct."
msgstr "마법사들의 시험장인 안개의 장벽은 하늘의 신기루처럼 구름 위에 떠 있습니다. 전적으로 마법으로 만들어진 구조물입니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_TransTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt|table=TransTxt|id=104|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"The Temple of the Light is one of the most beautiful and serene places in "
"the world.  Any follower of the Light can feel their troubles slipping away "
"as they walk in these hallowed halls."
msgstr ""
"빛의 신전은 세상에서 가장 아름답고 평온한 장소 중 하나입니다. 빛의 신도라면 누구나 이 성스러운 전당을 거닐며 근심이 사라지는 것을 "
"느낄 수 있습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_TransTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt|table=TransTxt|id=105|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Traitors and prisoners of war are frequently thrown in this horrible pit as "
"object lessons in cruelty.  All Necromancers must also enter the pit and "
"escape before they can complete their apprenticeships."
msgstr ""
"반역자와 전쟁 포로들은 잔혹함의 본보기로 이 끔찍한 구덩이에 자주 던져집니다. 모든 강령술사 역시 견습 과정을 마치기 전에 이곳에 들어가"
" 탈출해야 합니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_TransTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt|table=TransTxt|id=106|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"The Temple of the Dark is still in use by the forces of evil.  Sacrifices "
"are held monthly, and foul rites are performed routinely on the front steps."
msgstr ""
"어둠의 신전은 여전히 악의 세력이 사용하고 있습니다. 매달 제물이 바쳐지고, 정문 계단에서는 끔찍한 의식이 일상적으로 벌어집니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_TransTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt|table=TransTxt|id=107|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"The sound of unholy chanting and the screams and moans of the undead can be "
"heard quite clearly from the entrance.  "
msgstr "불경한 주문과 언데드의 비명과 신음이 입구에서도 아주 또렷하게 들립니다.  "

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_TransTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt|table=TransTxt|id=108|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Overgrown and weather beaten, the Grand Temple of the Sun has seen better "
"days.  It appears someone is still taking care of the place."
msgstr "잡초가 무성하고 비바람에 닳은 태양의 대사원은 전성기가 지난 듯합니다. 그래도 누군가 이곳을 관리하고 있는 모양입니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_TransTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt|table=TransTxt|id=109|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"The Warlocks of Nighon call this extinct volcano their home.  A network of "
"natural and carved tunnels spread away from the mountain, permitting travel "
"throughout Nighon and across the sea."
msgstr ""
"나이혼의 흑마법사들은 이 사화산을 보금자리로 삼았습니다. 자연 동굴과 인공 터널망이 산에서 뻗어 나가 나이혼 전역과 바다 건너까지 "
"이어집니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_TransTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt|table=TransTxt|id=10|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Once a stately mansion, this old house has long been abandoned by the "
"original owners.  The current residents don't seem to keep the place up very"
" well."
msgstr ""
"한때 위풍당당한 저택이었지만, 원래 주인들이 떠난 뒤 오랫동안 버려져 있었습니다. 지금 사는 자들은 건물을 제대로 관리하지 않는 "
"듯합니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_TransTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt|table=TransTxt|id=110|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"A huge, magical maze stretches before you as far as the eye can see.  "
"Looking at it for long dazzles the eyes and confuses the mind."
msgstr "눈이 닿는 끝까지 거대한 마법 미궁이 펼쳐집니다. 오래 바라보면 눈이 어지럽고 정신이 혼란스러워집니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_TransTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt|table=TransTxt|id=111|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Stone City is one of the great bastions of the Dwarven race in the world.  "
"The front gate looks very secure."
msgstr "스톤 시티는 세계에서 손꼽히는 드워프 종족의 보루입니다. 정문은 매우 견고해 보입니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_TransTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt|table=TransTxt|id=112|field=<default>"
msgid "Words cannot convey the horror.  One of the pipes must be an entrance…"
msgstr "말로는 이 공포를 표현할 수 없습니다. 저 관들 중 하나가 입구인 모양입니다…"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_TransTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt|table=TransTxt|id=113|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"The Mercenary Guild is home to every swordsman who fails at banditry.  "
"Visitors are unwelcome."
msgstr "용병 길드는 산적질에 실패한 검객들이 모이는 곳입니다. 방문객은 환영받지 못합니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_TransTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt|table=TransTxt|id=114|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"These caverns have been the hideout of pirates and ne'er-do-wells for "
"centuries."
msgstr "이 동굴은 수백 년 동안 해적과 악당들의 은신처였습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_TransTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt|table=TransTxt|id=115|field=<default>"
msgid "A trail of ominous brown stains leads downstairs and into darkness…"
msgstr "불길한 갈색 얼룩이 계단 아래 어둠 속으로 이어집니다…"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_TransTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt|table=TransTxt|id=116|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"A mighty fortress housing the fantastic and murderous Titans.  No one has "
"ever entered and returned to tell the tale."
msgstr "환상적이면서도 살인적인 타이탄들이 거주하는 거대한 요새입니다. 들어갔다가 살아 돌아온 자는 아무도 없습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_TransTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt|table=TransTxt|id=117|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Once the proud center of a false religion, the Temple has fallen into "
"disrepair.  "
msgstr "한때 거짓 종교의 당당한 중심지였던 신전은 이제 황폐해졌습니다.  "

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_TransTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt|table=TransTxt|id=118|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"It doesn't look like much, but getting in isn't easy.  Careful not to stray "
"from the path."
msgstr "별것 없어 보이지만 들어가기는 쉽지 않습니다. 길에서 벗어나지 않도록 조심해야 합니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_TransTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt|table=TransTxt|id=119|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"This incredible starship is but a small sample of the wonders of the "
"Ancients."
msgstr "이 놀라운 우주선조차 고대인들이 이룬 경이의 극히 일부에 불과합니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_TransTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt|table=TransTxt|id=11|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"The entrance to this barrow is pleasing to the eye, yet at the same time "
"forbidding.  The air is very quiet near the entrance."
msgstr "이 고분의 입구는 보기 좋으면서도 동시에 위압적입니다. 입구 주변은 유난히 고요합니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_TransTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt|table=TransTxt|id=120|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"The weathered stones of this old keep shelter empty buildings in an unused "
"courtyard.  Faint sounds echo from a worn stairway that leads down below the"
" keep."
msgstr "낡은 성채의 풍화된 돌벽이 쓰이지 않는 안뜰의 빈 건물들을 감싸고 있습니다. 닳은 계단 아래에서 희미한 소리가 메아리칩니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_TransTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt|table=TransTxt|id=121|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Faint chanting can be heard from beyond the doors of this Temple.  Visitors "
"do not appear to be welcome here."
msgstr "신전의 문 너머에서 희미한 주문 소리가 들립니다. 방문객을 환영하는 곳은 아닌 듯합니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_TransTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt|table=TransTxt|id=122|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"The first fortress dedicated to magical research, its remote location "
"provided secrecy for the mages and protection for the populace in the event "
"of an accident."
msgstr ""
"마법 연구를 위해 세워진 최초의 요새입니다. 외딴 위치 덕분에 마법사들은 비밀을 지킬 수 있었고, 사고가 일어나도 주민들을 보호할 수 "
"있었습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_TransTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt|table=TransTxt|id=123|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"This pyramid seems to be made of a strange, weathered metal.  It appears to "
"be partially buried in the sand."
msgstr "이 피라미드는 풍화된 기묘한 금속으로 만들어진 듯하며, 일부가 모래에 묻혀 있습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_TransTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt|table=TransTxt|id=124|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"This strange structure commands a spectacular view of Paradise Valley.  The "
"outer walls are constructed from an unknown material."
msgstr "이 기묘한 구조물에서는 파라다이스 밸리의 장관이 한눈에 들어옵니다. 외벽은 정체불명의 재료로 만들어졌습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_TransTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt|table=TransTxt|id=125|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Strange squeaking echoes from behind the front doors.  At one time a temple "
"of Baa, a foul curse caused the old inhabitants to move away."
msgstr "정문 뒤에서 이상한 찍찍거림이 메아리칩니다. 한때 바의 신전이었지만 사악한 저주 때문에 옛 주민들은 떠나야 했습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_TransTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt|table=TransTxt|id=126|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"This large but simple structure has become the center of worship for a small"
" religious group called the Order of the Fist."
msgstr "크고 단순한 이 건물은 주먹 기사단이라는 소규모 종교 집단의 숭배 중심지가 되었습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_TransTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt|table=TransTxt|id=127|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"The temperature drops as you approach the gates to this castle.  Legend "
"holds that this castle contains the knowledge of how to transcend death as "
"undead."
msgstr "성문에 다가가자 기온이 떨어집니다. 전설에 따르면 이 성에는 언데드로서 죽음을 초월하는 방법이 담겨 있습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_TransTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt|table=TransTxt|id=128|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"This area appears to be abandoned.  However, fresh footprints lead in and "
"out from a recently repaired door.  Perhaps it isn’t so abandoned after all."
msgstr ""
"이곳은 버려진 듯합니다. 하지만 최근 수리한 문으로 드나드는 새 발자국이 있습니다. 어쩌면 완전히 버려진 곳은 아닐지도 모릅니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_TransTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt|table=TransTxt|id=129|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"The smells of death and decay seem to fill the air near this structure.  The"
" temple's original purpose has long since been forgotten by the new "
"worshippers."
msgstr "이 건물 주변의 공기는 죽음과 부패의 냄새로 가득합니다. 신전의 원래 목적은 새 신도들에게 오래전에 잊혔습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_TransTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt|table=TransTxt|id=12|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"The entrance to this barrow is pleasing to the eye, yet at the same time "
"forbidding.  The air is very quiet near the entrance."
msgstr "이 고분의 입구는 보기 좋으면서도 동시에 위압적입니다. 입구 주변은 유난히 고요합니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_TransTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt|table=TransTxt|id=130|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Kriegspire no longer rests between its lakes, the earth around the castle "
"was raised to prevent the creatures inside from escaping."
msgstr ""
"크리그스파이어는 더 이상 두 호수 사이에 있지 않습니다. 안의 생물들이 빠져나오지 못하도록 성 주변의 땅을 들어 올렸기 때문입니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_TransTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt|table=TransTxt|id=131|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Ancient runes above the entrance attempt to scare away the casual visitor.  "
"Fresh goblin tracks lead into and out of the doorway."
msgstr "입구 위의 고대 룬은 평범한 방문객을 겁주려는 듯합니다. 새 고블린 발자국이 출입구를 드나듭니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_TransTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt|table=TransTxt|id=132|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"This forgotten shrine of the Church of the Sun still stands.  For all of its"
" time in the humid jungle, the temple remains in surprisingly good "
"condition."
msgstr "태양 교회의 잊힌 성소가 아직 남아 있습니다. 습한 정글 속에서 오랜 세월을 보냈음에도 신전은 놀라울 정도로 온전합니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_TransTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt|table=TransTxt|id=133|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"These caverns once belonged to the exiled King Rocklin, but now they are "
"home to the new Dwarven King, Snergle."
msgstr "이 동굴은 한때 추방된 록클린 왕의 소유였지만, 지금은 새 드워프 왕 스너글의 보금자리입니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_TransTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt|table=TransTxt|id=134|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Originally a place of worship for the Church of the Moon, this old sanctuary"
" is now home to Cedric Drother’s group of Druids."
msgstr "원래 달 교회의 예배소였던 이 오래된 성소는 이제 세드릭 드로더가 이끄는 드루이드들의 거처입니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_TransTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt|table=TransTxt|id=135|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"The original name of these caverns has been lost in time.  Now, it is named "
"for the group of bandits that base their operations from it."
msgstr "이 동굴의 원래 이름은 세월 속에 사라졌습니다. 지금은 이곳을 근거지로 삼는 산적 집단의 이름으로 불립니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_TransTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt|table=TransTxt|id=136|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"The temperature rises steadily as you approach the doors, the smell of "
"sulfur and ash strong.  This place resembles a hideout more than a temple."
msgstr "문에 다가갈수록 기온이 계속 올라가고 유황과 재의 냄새가 짙어집니다. 신전보다는 은신처에 가까워 보입니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_TransTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt|table=TransTxt|id=137|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"This small post acts as an advance base for the Fraternal Order of Silver.  "
"From here, they are able to patrol Mist in their conquest of evil."
msgstr "이 작은 전초기지는 은 기사단의 전진 기지입니다. 이곳에서 그들은 악을 정복하기 위해 안개 섬을 순찰합니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_TransTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt|table=TransTxt|id=138|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"The focal point of all Baa worship in Enroth, the Superior Temple only "
"allows followers of Baa inside."
msgstr "엔로스의 모든 바 숭배의 중심지인 최고 신전은 바의 추종자만 안으로 들여보냅니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_TransTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt|table=TransTxt|id=139|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Home to the so-called Prince of Thieves, the Shadow Guild operates outside "
"of Anthony Stone's jurisdiction.  This Guildhall is not open to the public."
msgstr "이른바 도둑의 왕자의 본거지인 섀도 길드는 앤서니 스톤의 관할 밖에서 활동합니다. 이 길드 회관은 일반에 공개되지 않습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_TransTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt|table=TransTxt|id=13|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"The entrance to this barrow is pleasing to the eye, yet at the same time "
"forbidding.  The air is very quiet near the entrance."
msgstr "이 고분의 입구는 보기 좋으면서도 동시에 위압적입니다. 입구 주변은 유난히 고요합니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_TransTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt|table=TransTxt|id=140|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"The forest of statues scattered about seems to magnify the silence on Star "
"Island.  Certainly, the rumors of medusas living in this temple are true."
msgstr ""
"곳곳에 흩어진 조각상의 숲이 스타 아일랜드의 정적을 더욱 깊게 만듭니다. 이 신전에 메두사가 산다는 소문은 분명 사실일 것입니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_TransTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt|table=TransTxt|id=141|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"The largest dwarven mine in Enroth, Snergle has claimed it in his succession"
" to the dwarven throne."
msgstr "엔로스에서 가장 큰 드워프 광산입니다. 스너글은 드워프 왕위를 계승하며 이곳을 차지했습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_TransTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt|table=TransTxt|id=142|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"The Dragoons rebuilt and refurbished this keep to serve as their "
"headquarters.  From here, they prey on traffic to and from Free Haven."
msgstr "드라군들은 이 성채를 재건하고 개수해 본부로 삼았습니다. 이곳에서 프리 헤이븐을 오가는 통행을 습격합니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_TransTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt|table=TransTxt|id=143|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Once the residence of Archmage Terrax, Corlagon received the Estate from "
"Archibald for his services during the Succession Wars."
msgstr "한때 대마법사 테락스의 거처였던 이 영지는 왕위 계승 전쟁에서 공을 세운 코라곤에게 아치볼드가 하사했습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_TransTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt|table=TransTxt|id=144|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"The headquarters of the Fraternal Order of Silver and Sir John Silver's "
"home.  Silver Helms from this Stronghold patrol Silver Cove in search of "
"evil."
msgstr "은 기사단의 본부이자 존 실버 경의 거처입니다. 이 요새의 실버 헬름들은 악을 찾아 실버 코브를 순찰합니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_TransTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt|table=TransTxt|id=145|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"This forboding structure radiates magical power.  Druids from all over "
"Enroth make periodic pilgrimages to visit this sacred place."
msgstr "이 위압적인 구조물에서는 강력한 마력이 뿜어져 나옵니다. 엔로스 전역의 드루이드들이 이 성지를 정기적으로 순례합니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_TransTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt|table=TransTxt|id=146|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Ethric, the first Sorcerer seeking life after death, still walks about his "
"tomb, the leader of a host of undead servants.  At least, that’s how the "
"rumor goes..."
msgstr ""
"죽음 이후의 삶을 추구한 최초의 소서러 에스릭은 여전히 무덤 안을 돌아다니며 언데드 무리를 지휘한다고 합니다. 적어도 소문은 그렇습니다…"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_TransTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt|table=TransTxt|id=147|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Originally used to keep creatures from escaping the Frozen Wastelands, now "
"the keep prevents traffic to and from Castle Stromgard and town of White "
"Cap."
msgstr ""
"원래는 프로즌 웨이스트의 생물들이 빠져나오지 못하게 하던 요새였지만, 이제는 스트롬가드 성과 화이트 캡 마을 사이의 통행을 막고 "
"있습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_TransTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt|table=TransTxt|id=148|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Muted sounds of clashing metal and loud voices emanate from this imposing "
"fortress.  No one would dare assault the Warlord’s home."
msgstr ""
"철이 부딪치는 둔탁한 소리와 큰 목소리가 이 위압적인 요새에서 흘러나옵니다. 감히 전쟁군주의 거처를 공격할 자는 없을 것입니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_TransTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt|table=TransTxt|id=149|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"A foul smell wafts from the entrance to these caves.  The howl of a wolf can"
" be heard from the distance."
msgstr "동굴 입구에서 지독한 냄새가 풍깁니다. 멀리서 늑대의 울음소리가 들립니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_TransTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt|table=TransTxt|id=14|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"The door is unlocked and unguarded from the outside.  The iron on the "
"doorknob is rusting, and you can see a small hornet's nest in the corner "
"above the door."
msgstr "문은 잠겨 있지 않고 바깥에는 경비도 없습니다. 문손잡이의 철은 녹슬고 있으며, 문 위쪽 구석에는 작은 말벌집이 보입니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_TransTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt|table=TransTxt|id=150|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Fire Elementals assisted Gharik in his attempts to create powerful items "
"here.  A handful of his students continue his experiments."
msgstr "불의 정령들은 가릭이 이곳에서 강력한 물건을 만드는 일을 도왔습니다. 그의 제자 몇 명이 여전히 실험을 계속하고 있습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_TransTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt|table=TransTxt|id=151|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"This laboratory is the birthplace for countless horrid experiments.  Its "
"remote location was chosen for both safety and secrecy."
msgstr "이 연구소에서는 셀 수 없이 많은 끔찍한 실험체가 탄생했습니다. 안전과 비밀 유지를 위해 외딴 곳에 세워졌습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_TransTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt|table=TransTxt|id=152|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"These caves house a strange alliance between human warriors and dragons.  "
"The Dragon Towers were built in the towns to ward off these raiders."
msgstr "이 동굴에는 인간 전사와 드래곤의 기묘한 동맹이 살고 있습니다. 마을의 드래곤 탑은 이 약탈자들을 막기 위해 세워졌습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_TransTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt|table=TransTxt|id=153|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"The Control Center has been closed since the Silence, nearly twelve "
"centuries ago."
msgstr "제어 센터는 약 1,200년 전 침묵 이후 폐쇄된 채입니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_TransTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt|table=TransTxt|id=154|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"The back door to the mysterious abandoned temple built by the race which "
"lived on Dagger Wound before the Lizardmen--it should be safe now, right?"
msgstr "리자드맨 이전에 대거 운드에 살았던 종족이 세운 수수께끼의 버려진 신전 후문입니다. 이제는 안전하겠지요?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_TransTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt|table=TransTxt|id=155|field=<default>"
msgid "Placeholder Text"
msgstr "자리표시자 텍스트"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_TransTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt|table=TransTxt|id=156|field=<default>"
msgid "Placeholder Text"
msgstr "자리표시자 텍스트"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_TransTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt|table=TransTxt|id=157|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"A thunderous howl pierces your ears, provoking a feeling of dread. Whatever "
"produced that sound is drawing near, with each step rocking the earth "
"beneath your feet."
msgstr ""
"천둥 같은 울부짖음이 귀를 찌르며 공포를 불러일으킵니다. 소리를 낸 무언가가 가까워지고 있으며, 걸음을 내디딜 때마다 발밑의 땅이 "
"흔들립니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_TransTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt|table=TransTxt|id=158|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"As you go deeper into this vast network of tunnels, your instinct tells you "
"that many dangerous creatures dwell within. You vow to remain vigilant."
msgstr "광대한 터널망 깊숙이 들어갈수록 수많은 위험한 생물이 살고 있다는 직감이 듭니다. 경계를 늦추지 않기로 합니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_TransTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt|table=TransTxt|id=159|field=<default>"
msgid "This tunnel leads to Stone City."
msgstr "이 터널은 스톤 시티로 이어집니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_TransTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt|table=TransTxt|id=15|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"A nasty odor wafts from the entrance of this cave, propelled by an unseen "
"subterranean breeze.  It smells like decaying meat mixed with brimstone "
"and…peppermint?  Whatever.  Looks dangerous."
msgstr ""
"보이지 않는 지하의 바람을 타고 동굴 입구에서 지독한 냄새가 풍겨옵니다. 썩은 고기에 유황과…박하를 섞은 냄새인가요? 아무튼 위험해 "
"보입니다."

