#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_TransTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt|table=TransTxt|id=209|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"This cave is legendary in Trollish lore, and is a holy place. Other "
"creatures, however, might just see it as a lair to occupy and defend."
msgstr ""
"이 동굴은 트롤 전승에서 전설이자 성지로 여겨집니다. 하지만 다른 생물들에게는 차지하고 지킬 만한 보금자리로 보일 뿐일지도 모릅니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_TransTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt|table=TransTxt|id=20|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"As you go deeper into this vast network of tunnels, your instinct tells you "
"that many dangerous creatures dwell within. You vow to remain vigilant."
msgstr "광대한 터널망 깊숙이 들어갈수록 수많은 위험한 생물이 살고 있다는 직감이 듭니다. 경계를 늦추지 않기로 합니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_TransTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt|table=TransTxt|id=210|field=<default>"
msgid "Placeholder Text"
msgstr "자리표시자 텍스트"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_TransTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt|table=TransTxt|id=211|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"As with all places holy to the followers of Eep, this temple smells of damp "
"fur and cheese. A chorus of squeaks, like chanting issues from within."
msgstr ""
"이프의 신도들에게 성스러운 모든 장소가 그렇듯, 이 신전에서는 축축한 털과 치즈 냄새가 납니다. 안에서는 합창하듯 찍찍거리는 소리가 "
"들립니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_TransTxt.txt
