"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt|table=TransTxt|id=229|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"The entrance to this barrow is pleasing to the eye, yet at the same time "
"forbidding.  The air is very quiet near the entrance."
msgstr "이 고분의 입구는 보기 좋으면서도 동시에 위압적입니다. 입구 주변은 유난히 고요합니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_TransTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt|table=TransTxt|id=22|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"A thunderous howl pierces your ears, provoking a feeling of dread. Whatever "
"produced that sound is drawing near, with each step rocking the earth "
"beneath your feet."
msgstr ""
"천둥 같은 울부짖음이 귀를 찌르며 공포를 불러일으킵니다. 소리를 낸 무언가가 가까워지고 있으며, 걸음을 내디딜 때마다 발밑의 땅이 "
"흔들립니다."

