"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt|table=TransTxt|id=29|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Lady Loretta Fleise, Chancellor of the Treasury, resides in Castle Fleise."
msgstr "재무대신 로레타 플라이스 부인은 플라이스 성에 머물고 있습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_TransTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt|table=TransTxt|id=2|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"A burial mound. Though obviously centuries old, the door's inlaid and gilded"
" decorations are clean and untarnished. They must be preserved by magic."
msgstr ""
"매장 고분입니다. 수백 년은 족히 된 듯하지만, 문에 박힌 상감과 금박 장식은 깨끗하고 변색되지 않았습니다. 마법으로 보존되고 있는 "
"모양입니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_TransTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt|table=TransTxt|id=30|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Lord Eric von Stromgard, Marquis of the Northern Marches, resides in Castle "
"Stromgard."
msgstr "북부 변경백 에릭 폰 스트롬가드 경은 스트롬가드 성에 머물고 있습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_TransTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt|table=TransTxt|id=31|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"The Oracle has provided the rulers of Enroth with wisdom for as long as "
"anyone can remember."
msgstr "기억할 수 없을 만큼 오랜 세월 동안 오라클은 엔로스의 통치자들에게 지혜를 전해왔습니다."

