msgstr "북부 변경백 에릭 폰 스트롬가드 경은 스트롬가드 성에 머물고 있습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_TransTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt|table=TransTxt|id=47|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"The maelstrom energies of air magic hold together an egg of cloud mist. You "
"can hear a faint but clearly angry howling coming from the strange "
"structure."
msgstr ""
"공기 마법의 소용돌이치는 힘이 구름 안개의 알을 붙들고 있습니다. 기묘한 구조물 안에서 희미하지만 분명 화가 난 울부짖음이 들립니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_TransTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt|table=TransTxt|id=48|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Though the air temperature is quite warm, this pod of ice does not melt. The"
" elemental power of water magic swirls about it, keeping it winter cold. "
msgstr ""
"주변 공기는 꽤 따뜻하지만 이 얼음 고치는 녹지 않습니다. 물 마법의 정령력이 주변을 휘돌며 한겨울처럼 차갑게 유지하고 있습니다. "

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_TransTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt|table=TransTxt|id=49|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Forces of fire magic heat this cylinder of iron to red hot heat. The hiss of"
" steam makes you wonder if the thing is full of boiling water."
msgstr ""
"불 마법의 힘이 이 철제 원통을 시뻘겋게 달굽니다. 쉭쉭거리는 증기를 듣자 안에 끓는 물이 가득한 것은 아닌지 의문이 듭니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_TransTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt|table=TransTxt|id=4|field=<default>"
msgid "You find a passage leading downwards. Do you enter?"
msgstr "아래로 이어지는 통로를 발견했습니다. 들어가시겠습니까?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_TransTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt|table=TransTxt|id=50|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"After you rescued them, the Minotaurs of Balthazar Lair built a new entrance"
" to their city."
msgstr "구출된 뒤 발타자르 소굴의 미노타우로스들은 도시에 새로운 입구를 만들었습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_TransTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt|table=TransTxt|id=51|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"The back door to the mysterious abandoned temple built by the race which "
"lived on Dagger Wound before the Lizardmen--it should be safe now, right?"
msgstr "리자드맨 이전에 대거 운드에 살았던 종족이 세운 수수께끼의 버려진 신전 후문입니다. 이제는 안전하겠지요?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_TransTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt|table=TransTxt|id=52|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"History holds that Lizardmen temples of this period were guarded by traps "
"and not monsters. What then to make of the reptilian slithering receding "
"into the darkness?"
msgstr ""
"이 시대의 리자드맨 신전은 괴물이 아니라 함정으로 지켜졌다고 전해집니다. 그렇다면 어둠 속으로 미끄러져 사라진 파충류의 그림자는 대체 "
"무엇일까요?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_TransTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt|table=TransTxt|id=53|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"You see no solid ground in the airy realm through this gateway. In the hazy "
"distance you can see oddly shaped buildings that seem to float in the sky."
msgstr "관문 너머의 공기 차원에는 단단한 땅이 보이지 않습니다. 뿌연 저편에는 기묘한 건물들이 하늘에 떠 있는 듯합니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_TransTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt|table=TransTxt|id=54|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Looking through the gateway is like peering through a window into an "
"underwater canyon. Creatures of all sizes swim menacingly in the distance."
msgstr "관문을 들여다보는 것은 수중 협곡을 창문 너머로 바라보는 것 같습니다. 크고 작은 생물들이 멀리서 위협적으로 헤엄칩니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_TransTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt|table=TransTxt|id=55|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"The smell of freshly lumbered wood gives indication of this fort's recent "
"construction. The large stacks of supplies show that the Regnan pirates are "
"planning a lengthy stay."
msgstr ""
"갓 켠 목재 냄새로 보아 이 요새는 최근에 지어졌습니다. 산더미처럼 쌓인 보급품은 레그나 해적들이 장기 주둔을 계획하고 있음을 "
"보여줍니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_TransTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt|table=TransTxt|id=56|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Though the view is obscured by shimmering waves of heated air, through the "
"gateway you perceive a hellish landscape of endless bridgeways spanning an "
"ocean of lava."
msgstr "달아오른 공기의 아지랑이로 시야가 흐리지만, 관문 너머로 용암 바다 위에 끝없이 다리가 뻗은 지옥 같은 풍경이 보입니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_TransTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt|table=TransTxt|id=57|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Even in the freeport of Ravenshore, some goods must avoid official eyes. "
"Such usually pass through this secluded cove in the care of the wererat "
"smugglers."
msgstr ""
"자유항 레이븐쇼어에서도 관리들의 눈을 피해야 하는 물건은 있습니다. 그런 물건들은 대개 웨어랫 밀수꾼들의 손을 거쳐 이 외딴 만으로 "
"드나듭니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_TransTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt|table=TransTxt|id=58|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"The gateway leads to an earthen tunnel which extends a few paces then tees "
"off left and right. You can't say where the passages lead."
msgstr "관문은 몇 걸음 앞에서 좌우로 갈라지는 흙 터널로 이어집니다. 두 통로가 어디로 이어지는지는 알 수 없습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_TransTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt|table=TransTxt|id=59|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"By the number of wolf tracks marking the approach to this wolves' den, "
"either the wolves are extremely active or hundreds of them live in these "
"caves."
msgstr "늑대 소굴로 다가가는 길에 찍힌 발자국 수를 보니, 늑대들이 엄청나게 활발하거나 이 동굴에 수백 마리가 사는 듯합니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_TransTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt|table=TransTxt|id=5|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"The volcano has apparently pulled this ancient building from the bottom of "
"the sea. Who were it's mysterious builders?"
msgstr "화산이 바닷속에 가라앉아 있던 이 고대 건물을 끌어올린 듯합니다. 이 수수께끼의 건축물을 세운 자들은 누구였을까요?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_TransTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt|table=TransTxt|id=60|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"The Dark Elven Merchants of Alvar run a mighty trade empire spanning the "
"reach of Jadame. This is their local guildhouse in Ravenshore."
msgstr "알바르의 다크 엘프 상인들은 제이덤 전역에 걸친 거대한 무역 제국을 운영합니다. 이곳은 레이븐쇼어에 있는 그들의 지부입니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_TransTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt|table=TransTxt|id=61|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"From the conflux key come a keening pitch which resonates through the "
"crystal. A hidden depth is revealed--a passage that draws you with "
"inexplicable attraction."
msgstr ""
"컨플럭스 열쇠에서 수정 전체를 울리는 날카로운 소리가 납니다. 숨겨져 있던 깊은 곳이 드러나며, 설명할 수 없는 힘으로 당신을 끌어당기는"
" 통로가 나타납니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_TransTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt|table=TransTxt|id=62|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"The hive emits a hum which sets your teeth rattling in your jaw. The breeze "
"you feel is not the wind, but the blowback of a thousand monstrous wings."
msgstr "벌집이 내뿜는 윙윙거림에 이가 덜덜 떨립니다. 느껴지는 바람은 자연풍이 아니라 수천 마리 괴물 날개의 역풍입니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_TransTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt|table=TransTxt|id=63|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Ogre armies need carry no winches to their fort building sites. Their "
"strength of arm and back is sufficient to raise the massive beams and posts."
msgstr ""
"오우거 군대는 요새 건설 현장에 윈치를 가져갈 필요가 없습니다. 그들의 팔과 허리 힘이면 거대한 들보와 기둥도 충분히 세울 수 있습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_TransTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt|table=TransTxt|id=64|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"The Trolls of Rust have entombed their dead here for centuries--each "
"generation digging deeper catacombs beneath those dug before."
msgstr ""
"러스트의 트롤들은 수백 년 동안 이곳에 망자를 묻어왔습니다. 세대가 바뀔 때마다 이전 세대가 판 지하묘지보다 더 깊이 파 내려갔습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_TransTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt|table=TransTxt|id=65|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"What use do the Cyclopes make of this sinister vault? Whatever they do, "
"makes it smell like a butcher's shop."
msgstr "사이클롭스들은 이 불길한 저장고를 어디에 쓰는 걸까요? 무슨 일을 하든 정육점 같은 냄새가 납니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_TransTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt|table=TransTxt|id=66|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"A tunnel of solidified lava snakes downward. Can it possible provide safe "
"passage beneath the lake of fire?"
msgstr "굳어버린 용암 터널이 뱀처럼 아래로 이어집니다. 정말 불의 호수 아래를 안전하게 지나갈 수 있을까요?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_TransTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt|table=TransTxt|id=67|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Made ruin in some long forgotten war, parts of this castle are still whole. "
"The dragon hunters have made good use of these."
msgstr "오래전 잊힌 전쟁으로 폐허가 되었지만 성의 일부는 아직 온전합니다. 드래곤 사냥꾼들이 이를 유용하게 활용하고 있습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_TransTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt|table=TransTxt|id=68|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"By nature, dragons are solitary beings. Occasionally, a few will nest "
"together, but here in Garrote Gorge they have built a mighty society."
msgstr ""
"드래곤은 본래 홀로 사는 생물입니다. 가끔 몇 마리가 함께 둥지를 틀기도 하지만, 가로트 협곡의 드래곤들은 거대한 사회를 이루었습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_TransTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt|table=TransTxt|id=69|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"The stonework façade of this ancient temple has crumbled into the sand of "
"time. Still, its majesty--and mystery--remain."
msgstr "이 고대 신전의 석조 정면은 세월의 모래 속에서 무너져 내렸습니다. 그러나 장엄함과 신비는 여전히 남아 있습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_TransTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt|table=TransTxt|id=6|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"The Alvarian Dark Dwarves are recent arrivals to the area. In a short time, "
"however, they've built an extensive system of mines."
msgstr "알바르의 다크 드워프들은 최근 이 지역에 정착했습니다. 하지만 짧은 시간 만에 광대한 광산망을 건설했습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_TransTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt|table=TransTxt|id=70|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Though this temple is newly built it already possesses a timeless quality."
msgstr "새로 지어진 신전이지만 벌써부터 세월을 초월한 분위기를 풍깁니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_TransTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt|table=TransTxt|id=71|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"The dark rock of these stone monuments cannot be found nearby. The nearest "
"source is the Shadowspire Mountains a hundred leagues away."
msgstr "이 석조 기념물에 쓰인 검은 돌은 주변에서 구할 수 없습니다. 가장 가까운 산지는 백 리그나 떨어진 섀도스파이어 산맥입니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_TransTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt|table=TransTxt|id=72|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"This air vent seems to be the only entrance into the flooded Minotaur city, "
"Balthazar Lair."
msgstr "이 환기구가 침수된 미노타우로스 도시 발타자르 소굴로 들어가는 유일한 입구인 듯합니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_TransTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt|table=TransTxt|id=73|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Zog the Jackal's preference for building on high ground has provided an "
"unexpected boon in the form of protection from the raging flood waters."
msgstr "자칼 조그가 높은 지대에 건물을 짓기를 좋아한 덕분에, 뜻밖에도 거센 홍수로부터 보호받게 되었습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_TransTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt|table=TransTxt|id=74|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"The Regnans have never been known for their subtlety. This thick walled and "
"cannon studded castle is the very definition of 'forbidding.'"
msgstr ""
"레그나인들은 결코 은밀함으로 유명하지 않았습니다. 두꺼운 성벽에 대포가 빽빽이 박힌 이 성은 그야말로 '위압적'이라는 말의 정의입니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_TransTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt|table=TransTxt|id=75|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"From a distance, this moss covered and crumbling stronghold seems long "
"abandoned. Fresh boot prints in the mud and the signal mirror tell a "
"different story."
msgstr ""
"멀리서 보면 이끼가 끼고 무너져가는 이 요새는 오래전에 버려진 듯합니다. 그러나 진흙의 새 부츠 자국과 신호용 거울은 전혀 다른 이야기를"
" 들려줍니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_TransTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt|table=TransTxt|id=76|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"This strange craft seems capable of traveling both on and under the water's "
"surface. A series of cranks operated the wheel of blades which propel it."
msgstr "이 기묘한 탈것은 수면 위와 아래를 모두 이동할 수 있는 듯합니다. 여러 개의 크랭크가 추진용 날개바퀴를 움직입니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_TransTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt|table=TransTxt|id=77|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Brooding over the village below, the Necromancers' Guild exudes an "
"atmosphere of domineering evil."
msgstr "아래 마을을 내려다보는 강령술사 길드는 지배적인 악의 분위기를 내뿜습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_TransTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt|table=TransTxt|id=78|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Though renown for her beauty, Zanthora's madness drives her to live apart "
"from the company of others. In this forbidding castle she conducts her dark "
"experiments."
msgstr "잔토라는 미모로 유명하지만 광기 때문에 사람들과 떨어져 삽니다. 그녀는 이 위압적인 성에서 어두운 실험을 벌입니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_TransTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt|table=TransTxt|id=79|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"All buildings in the Plane of Air float. So why does this cloud castle seem "
"particularly incongruous? Perhaps because its great size?"
msgstr ""
"공기 차원의 모든 건물은 떠 있습니다. 그런데 이 구름 성이 유독 어울리지 않아 보이는 이유는 무엇일까요? 아마 엄청난 크기 때문일 "
"것입니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_TransTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt|table=TransTxt|id=7|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"A large dragon obviously makes his residence in these caves.  The dead "
"bodies near his home might have been adventurers seeking the dragon's "
"treasure."
msgstr "이 동굴에는 분명 거대한 드래곤이 살고 있습니다. 둥지 근처의 시체들은 드래곤의 보물을 노리던 모험가들이었을지도 모릅니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_TransTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt|table=TransTxt|id=80|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"All buildings in the Plane of Air float. So why does this cloud castle seem "
"particularly incongruous? Perhaps because its great size?"
msgstr ""
"공기 차원의 모든 건물은 떠 있습니다. 그런데 이 구름 성이 유독 어울리지 않아 보이는 이유는 무엇일까요? 아마 엄청난 크기 때문일 "
"것입니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_TransTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt|table=TransTxt|id=81|field=<default>"
msgid "Tribute Tomb"
msgstr "공물의 무덤"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_TransTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt|table=TransTxt|id=82|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Not a stick of wood or other combustibles are visible in the walls and "
"towers of this mighty keep of stone and iron."
msgstr "돌과 철로 지은 이 거대한 요새의 성벽과 탑에는 나무나 그 밖의 가연성 물질이 조금도 보이지 않습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_TransTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt|table=TransTxt|id=83|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"If there were any doubts of the Fire Elementals' hostile intentions towards "
"Jadame, they are allayed by the presence of this rallying camp. "
msgstr "불의 정령들이 제이덤을 적대한다는 데 의심이 있었다면, 이 집결 야영지를 보는 순간 모두 사라질 것입니다. "

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_TransTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt|table=TransTxt|id=84|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"The Destroyer reigns from a macabre palace. What kind of being would choose "
"to live inside the skull of a 400 foot tall giant?"
msgstr "파괴자는 섬뜩한 궁전에서 통치합니다. 키가 400피트나 되는 거인의 두개골 속에 살기를 택할 존재는 대체 어떤 자일까요?"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_TransTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt|table=TransTxt|id=85|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"The magic power of earth whirls around this cocoon-like encasement of earth "
"and rock. A cry of torment like a dying wind issues from within."
msgstr "대지 마법의 힘이 흙과 바위로 된 고치 주위를 소용돌이칩니다. 죽어가는 바람 같은 고통의 울음이 안에서 새어 나옵니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_TransTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt|table=TransTxt|id=86|field=<default>"
msgid "The front door to your new home stands before you."
msgstr "새로운 보금자리의 정문이 눈앞에 있습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_TransTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt|table=TransTxt|id=87|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"The grand entrance to Castle Gryphonheart stands before you.  A pair of tame"
" griffins can frequently be seen circling above the castle."
msgstr "그리폰하트 성의 웅장한 입구가 눈앞에 있습니다. 길들인 그리핀 한 쌍이 성 위를 도는 모습을 자주 볼 수 있습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_TransTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt|table=TransTxt|id=88|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Castle Navan is the traditional seat of Elvish power.  Centuries of plant "
"growth around the castle contribute to its sylvan character."
msgstr "나반 성은 전통적인 엘프 권력의 중심지입니다. 수백 년 동안 성 주변에 자란 식물들이 숲속 성채 같은 분위기를 더합니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_TransTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt|table=TransTxt|id=89|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Who knows why the Necromancers felt the need to build a castle deep within "
"the bowels of the earth?  Castle Gloaming is ugly, sinister, and very, very "
"secure."
msgstr ""
"강령술사들이 왜 땅속 깊은 곳에 성을 지을 필요를 느꼈는지는 알 수 없습니다. 글로밍 성은 흉측하고 불길하며, 무엇보다 대단히 "
"견고합니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_TransTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt|table=TransTxt|id=8|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"The enormous size and lavish decoration of Lord Markham's Manor provide a "
"striking contrast to the humble peasant homes and huts nearby."
msgstr "마크햄 경의 저택은 엄청난 규모와 호화로운 장식으로, 주변의 소박한 농가와 오두막과 뚜렷한 대비를 이룹니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_TransTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt|table=TransTxt|id=90|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Floating above most clouds gives Castle Lambent more sunlight per year than "
"any other location.  The elegant architecture takes full advantage of the "
"weather."
msgstr ""
"대부분의 구름보다 높이 떠 있는 램번트 성은 다른 어느 곳보다 연간 일조량이 많습니다. 우아한 건축은 이러한 환경을 최대한 활용하고 "
"있습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_TransTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt|table=TransTxt|id=91|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"The dripping of water and a strange, unidentifiable squeaking are the only "
"noises that seem to come from the entrance to this cave."
msgstr "동굴 입구에서는 물방울 떨어지는 소리와 정체를 알 수 없는 기묘한 찍찍거림만 들립니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_TransTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt|table=TransTxt|id=92|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"A large dragon obviously makes his residence in these caves.  Perhaps this "
"is where those missing adventurers are..."
msgstr "이 동굴에는 분명 거대한 드래곤이 살고 있습니다. 실종된 모험가들이 이곳에 있는 것일지도 모릅니다…"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_TransTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt|table=TransTxt|id=93|field=<default>"
msgid "The front door to your new home stands before you."
msgstr "새로운 보금자리의 정문이 눈앞에 있습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_TransTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt|table=TransTxt|id=94|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"These caves are the traditional hideout of goblins and bandits.  Whatever "
"lives there now doesn't make the place smell too good…"
msgstr "이 동굴은 전통적으로 고블린과 산적들의 은신처였습니다. 지금 무엇이 살고 있든 냄새는 썩 좋지 않습니다…"

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_TransTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt|table=TransTxt|id=95|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Foul water pours from a large drain pipe coming from the Erathian Sewer.  It"
" is said the Thieves' Guild can be found in here."
msgstr "에라시아 하수도의 커다란 배수관에서 더러운 물이 쏟아집니다. 도둑 길드가 이 안에 있다고 합니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_TransTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt|table=TransTxt|id=96|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"This mighty fort does a superb job guarding the East Bridge from invaders.  "
"It doesn't look like visitors are welcome inside the fort."
msgstr "이 거대한 요새는 동쪽 다리를 침입자에게서 훌륭하게 지켜냅니다. 방문객을 환영할 분위기는 아닙니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_TransTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt|table=TransTxt|id=97|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Fresh human or elvish footprints lead into this cave, and weeds and brush "
"have been cleared from the entrance recently."
msgstr "사람이나 엘프의 것으로 보이는 새 발자국이 동굴 안으로 이어지며, 입구의 잡초와 수풀도 최근에 치워졌습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_TransTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt|table=TransTxt|id=98|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"Faint sounds of distant explosions and mad laughter can be heard from beyond"
" the door.  There is a sharp, acidic smell in the air."
msgstr "문 너머에서 멀리 떨어진 폭발음과 미친 웃음소리가 희미하게 들립니다. 공기에는 날카롭고 시큼한 냄새가 감돕니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_TransTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt|table=TransTxt|id=99|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"A frightening spectacle of shadowy claws and twisted demonic figures beckons"
" you inside.  You can hear a woman singing in the distance, but can't quite "
"make out the words."
msgstr ""
"그림자 발톱과 뒤틀린 악마 형상으로 이루어진 무시무시한 광경이 안으로 손짓합니다. 멀리서 여인의 노랫소리가 들리지만 가사는 알아들을 수 "
"없습니다."

#. EN: source/en/mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt
#. KO: Data/Text localization/KO_TransTxt.txt
msgctxt ""
"mmmerge/Text "
"localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt|table=TransTxt|id=9|field=<default>"
msgid ""
"From the looks of the trash and decaying garbage on the ground outside, many"
" generations of bandits have used this cave to hide from the law."
msgstr "입구 바닥에 널린 쓰레기와 썩어가는 오물을 보니, 여러 세대에 걸쳐 산적들이 법망을 피해 이 동굴에 숨어든 듯합니다."
